置目录","content":"网页界面 **设置 › 关于** 会显示当前使用的数据目录和设置文件。命令行同样支持：`rvc-next webui --config-dir <folder>`，或设置环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR`（让 `rvc-next config` 等命令读写同一份设置时，用环境变量最方便）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"29":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"`settings` 参数接收与 `settings.toml` 相同结构的字典。这些值叠加在设置文件和环境变量之上，**不会写回文件**，也不能通过网页界面或 API 修改，适合宿主程序统一管理的项目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"30":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#固定设置","content":"被固定的文件夹在 **设置 › 存储** 中标注 **由嵌入 rvc-next 的应用设置**。所有设置项见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"31":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"32":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"33":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"34":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"绑定地址，默认取设置 `server.host`（`127.0.0.1`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"35":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"36":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`0` 由系统任选空闲端口；一个数字表示从这个端口开始尝试（被占用时往后找，最多 20 个）；`None` 使用设置 `server.port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"37":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`strict_port`","locale":"zh-CN"},"38":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"为 `True` 时端口被占用就直接失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"39":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`access_token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"40":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"可选的访问令牌；设置后每个 API 和 socket 请求都要携带（网页界面会要求输入一次）。绑定到非本机地址或设置 `extra_hosts` 时也不是必需的","locale":"zh-CN"},"41":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`extra_hosts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"42":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"除绑定地址外还接受的公网主机名，如内网穿透或反向代理的地址；见下方 内网穿透与反向代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"43":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`open_browser`","locale":"zh-CN"},"44":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"启动后是否打开浏览器，默认 `False`","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`log_level`","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"uvicorn 的日志级别，默认 `\"warning\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#地址端口与访问令牌","content":"`host`、`access_token` 和 `open_browser` 同样作为固定设置生效。远程访问的注意事项见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#tunnels","content":"只监听本机时，服务器只接受 `Host` 为本机名称或绑定地址的请求。内网穿透（如 Gradio 共享链接）和反向代理会转发它们自己的公网主机名，需要先允许这个名称。穿透地址往往在服务器启动、端口确定之后才知道，所以 `allow_host()` 在启动后同样可以调用，立即生效：","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#tunnels","content":"任何拿到公网地址的人都能访问服务器并使用全部功能；需要时传入 `access_token`，或在宿主程序、代理一侧自行加上身份验证。通过这些名称到达的请求即使来自本机的穿透程序，也不会被当作本机请求，不能使用 **在文件夹中显示**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀","content":"`api_prefix` 把 API、socket 和网页界面整体移到一个路径下，避免与宿主程序自己的路由冲突：","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#路径前缀","content":"网页界面不需要重新构建：它从自身脚本的地址推算出基础路径。命令行同样支持 `rvc-next webui --api-prefix /voice`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"如果宿主程序本身就是 FastAPI（或其他 ASGI）应用，也可以不另开端口，直接挂载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"宿主程序要在自己的事件循环里进入子应用的 `lifespan`（它启动 socket 事件转发），并在退出时调用 `services.close()`。`start_background=True` 启动任务调度和空闲卸载；不传时排队的任务不会运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#直接调用服务","content":"`server.services` 是服务端使用的同一组服务对象，宿主程序可以不经 HTTP 直接调用，例如列出音色、提交转换任务或修改设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#直接调用服务","content":"这些方法与 API 一一对应，返回的模型与 API 的 JSON 结构相同，详见 核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq","content":"按主题整理的常见问题。点开问题查看解答。遇到问题时，先运行 rvc-next doctor：它会检查 torch 和 CUDA、音频设备和资源，并给出修复命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"安装与启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"资源与模型下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"显存与性能","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"文件与远程访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"默认端口是 7868。被占用时服务器会自动尝试 7869、7870……（最多 20 个），日志中提示 \"Port 7868 is unavailable. Using port 7869.\"，浏览器会打开实际使用的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"想固定用某个端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"加 `--strict-port`（或设置 `server.strict_port` 为 `true`）后，端口被占用时直接失败（退出码 3），不会换端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"默认在数据目录：Windows 为 `%APPDATA%\\rvc-next`，macOS 为 `~/Library/Application Support/rvc-next`，Linux 为 `~/.local/share/rvc-next`（或 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/rvc-next`）。`rvc-next config show` 的 `data_dir` 或 Web UI **设置** › **关于** 的 **数据文件夹** 显示当前位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"用环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或 `rvc-next webui --data-dir <路径>` 换到其他位置；只想移动某一类文件，改 **设置** › **存储** 中的 **音色**、**实验**、**结果**、**资源** 文件夹。目录结构见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"数据目录可以整体移动、改名或复制（先停止 rvc-next）：用新位置启动 rvc-next，结果、上传、音色和实验都会在那里找到，已完成的训练阶段仍然算完成。文件已不在的结果显示为缺失；`rvc-next output check` 列出所有缺失的文件，加 `--prune-missing` 删除它们的记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"先停止服务器，再删除或改名数据目录中的 `settings.toml`（`rvc-next config path` 打印它的路径）。下次启动时使用全部默认值；音色库、实验和结果不受影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"只想恢复某一项，用 `rvc-next config set <键> <默认值>` 写回，默认值见 配置与环境变量。注意 `RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>` 环境变量设置的值始终优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"服务器会在约 1 秒内读到 `settings.toml` 的改动，Web UI 也会刷新。如果仍然没有变化：先看服务器日志里有没有 “Ignored a change to … settings.toml” 的警告（文件写错了）；再确认这个设置是否没有被同名环境变量覆盖（`rvc-next config show` 会标出）；端口、监听地址等少数设置需要重启服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#安装与启动","content":"可以。命令行在自己的进程里运行任务，任务记录写入同一个数据库，所以 Web UI 的 **任务** 面板和 `rvc-next jobs list` 都能看到双方的任务。需要注意两点：命令行任务不参与服务器的 GPU 排队，同时运行会争用显存；修改设置请参考上一个问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"转换至少需要 HuBERT，音高算法为 RMVPE 时还需要 RMVPE。界面上缺少资源时会显示 **需要 …** 和 **下载（大小）** 按钮，点击即可下载；也可以在 **模型** › **资源** 中下载。命令行出错时会提示具体命令（退出码 7），例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"如果你有原版 RVC，可以把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向它的 `assets` 文件夹，免去下载，见 从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"FCPE 的模型（`fcpe`，约 41 MB）是一项资源，包含在默认下载的 `inference` 分组里：不带参数的 `rvc-next assets download` 会一并下载它。只缺它时，选择 FCPE 后界面会提示下载；命令行也可以单独运行 `rvc-next assets download fcpe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"切换到 ModelScope（魔搭）或 hf-mirror 镜像：","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"**设置** › **下载** › **下载源** 选择 **ModelScope（魔搭）** 或 **hf-mirror.com**。也可以选 **自定义**，在 **自定义地址** 中填写其他镜像。","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"下载支持断点续传：中断后再次下载会从 `.part` 文件继续，失败时自动重试。**模型仓库** 可以在 `rvc-model`（默认，含示例音色）和官方仓库之间切换，两者的模型文件相同。ModelScope 上只有 rvc-model 的副本，社区底模和 Applio 的内容特征模型仍从 Hugging Face 下载；所选下载源缺少或损坏的文件会自动改从其他下载源下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#资源与模型下载","content":"文件的 SHA-256 与目录中的不一致，通常是下载不完整或文件被替换。在 **模型** › **资源** 中重新下载该资源，或运行 `rvc-next assets download <id>`。`rvc-next assets verify` 可以重新校验所有已安装的资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"先确认是否真的在用 GPU：`rvc-next doctor` 的 \"Selected\" 一行显示选中的设备。显示 CPU 的常见原因：","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"安装的是 CPU 版 PyTorch，需要换成 CUDA 版（见 安装）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"显卡不满足 GPU 规则（显存不足 4 GiB 或计算能力太低），见 硬件与性能；","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`compute.device` 被设成了 `cpu`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"确实只能用 CPU 时：音高算法改用 **pm（快速）**；先用 **预览 15 秒** 调好参数再转换整首；人声分离在 CPU 上尤其慢，能不分离就不分离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"没有索引时 **索引强度** 不起作用（界面会提示），转换仍然可以进行，只是音色特征全部来自模型本身。附加索引的方法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"在音色页面点 **附加索引**，上传或选择服务器上的 `.index` 文件（文件名不限，但版本必须与音色相符：v1 音色用 256 维索引，v2 用 768 维）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"有训练实验时点 **从实验构建**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"命令行：`rvc-next model index attach <音色> <文件>`，或 `rvc-next model index build <音色> --experiment <实验>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`trained_*.index` 不含特征向量，不能使用，请用 `added_*.index`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"`.pth` 中带有说话人信息的音色是多说话人音色，音色卡片上显示 **N 个说话人**，参数面板里会出现 **说话人** 选项。命令行用 `--speaker <id>`，`rvc-next model info <音色> --speakers` 列出说话人。可以给说话人起名字：`rvc-next model edit <音色> --speaker-name 0=Alice`。多说话人音色也可以为每个说话人附加自己的索引（`--speaker`）。实时变声同样使用所选的说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"默认在数据目录的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 id>/`，文件名为 `<原文件名>.<音色>.<格式>`，同名时不会覆盖。在 Web UI 的 **结果** 列表中可以播放、下载（**全部下载** 打包为 zip），或点 **在文件夹中显示**（仅限服务器本机的浏览器）。命令行用 `-o` 指定输出文件夹，结束时打印每个结果的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"想换默认位置，修改 **设置** › **存储** 的 **结果** 文件夹；**结果保留天数（0：一直保留）** 大于 0 时，服务器启动时会删除过期的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#转换","content":"导入的索引无法确定属于哪个音色（例如同一次导入里有多个同版本的音色，名称又对不上），Web UI 会打开 **检查导入**，每个索引只列出版本兼容的音色供你选择，也可以选 **暂不分配**，之后在 **模型** › **音色** 的 **未分配的索引** 中再分配。命令行会打印导入计划并以退出码 3 结束，用 `--pair 音色.pth=索引.index` 或 `--keep-unassigned` 重新运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"实时变声通过 PortAudio 访问声卡。Linux 上需要安装系统的 PortAudio 库：","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"然后运行 `rvc-next doctor` 查看 \"Audio devices\" 一行，或 `rvc-next live devices` 列出设备。页面显示 **此服务器暂不支持实时转换。** 表示服务器的 Python 环境里没有安装 `sounddevice`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"另外请记住：列出的是**服务器所在电脑**的设备。从另一台电脑或手机打开 Web UI 时，看不到也用不了那台设备的麦克风，见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"推理跟不上块长时就会断音。看实时页面的 **负载**：超过 80% 时会出现 **将块长增加到 … 毫秒**，点它即可。也可以手动增大 **块长**，或：","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"减小 **上下文**，关闭 **输入降噪**、**输出降噪**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"音高算法改用 pm；","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"停止同时运行的转换或训练任务（它们会和实时变声争用 GPU）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"确认实际在用 GPU（CPU 上通常需要很长的块长）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"**欠载**、**溢出** 计数持续增加也说明需要更大的块长。详见 硬件与性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"上次使用的输出设备没有连接（例如拔掉了耳机或声卡）。界面会提示 **保存的输出设备不存在，将使用系统默认设备。**，点 **使用默认输出启动** 确认，或在设备面板里选择其他设备。命令行加 `--allow-fallback`。开启 **自动重新连接丢失的设备** 时，运行中丢失的设备重新接上后会自动恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"把实时变声的输出送进一块虚拟声卡，再在其他程序里把这块声卡的录音端选为麦克风：Windows 上用 VB-CABLE（**CABLE Input** → **CABLE Output**）或 Voicemeeter（**Voicemeeter AUX Input** → **Voicemeeter Out B1**），macOS 上用 **BlackHole 2ch**，Linux 上用 PipeWire/PulseAudio 虚拟麦克风。用 **监听** 听自己。分步说明以及其他程序里需要关闭的设置见 在其他程序中使用实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"其他程序要录虚拟声卡的*录音端*（**CABLE Output**、**Voicemeeter Out B1**、**BlackHole 2ch**、**RVC-Next-Microphone**），不要选 **默认**，也不要选真实的麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"rvc-next 的 **输出** 要选*播放端*，并且实时变声处于 **运行中**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"用 Voicemeeter 时，rvc-next 播放进去的那条通道要打开 **B1**，麦克风自己那条通道的 **B1** 要关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"在 Linux 上，虚拟输出不会作为单独的设备出现在 rvc-next 的菜单里：按 在其他程序中使用实时变声 › Linux 添加 **rvc-next-virtual** 这个 ALSA 设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#实时变声","content":"另见 在其他程序中使用实时变声 末尾的排查表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"显存不足时，失败的任务不会自动重试，服务器会卸载所有没在使用的模型。可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"112":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"停止实时变声和其他任务，在顶栏 **显存** 菜单中点 **释放显存**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"113":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"在 **任务** 中点 **重试**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"114":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"仍然不足时，把 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 设为 1、训练时减小批大小、关闭 **将数据集缓存到显存**，或把 **精度** 设为 fp16（显卡支持时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"115":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"详见 硬件与性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"116":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"GPU 任务数量达到 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 时，其余任务会排队；实时变声运行时，新的 GPU 任务也会等待，以免影响实时音频。任务卡片上的 **仍然运行** 可以不等实时变声结束就开始（可能导致实时声音卡顿）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"117":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#显存与性能","content":"服务器退出时还在排队或运行的任务，下次启动时会标记为 **已中断**。任务的请求保存在数据库里，点 **重试** 即可重新运行；训练会从最近保存的检查点继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"118":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"默认情况下，**服务器文件** 可以浏览所有驱动器（Windows 的 `C:\\`、`D:\\` 等）和已挂载的卷（macOS 的 `/Volumes/*`，Linux 的 `/media/<用户>/*`、`/run/media/<用户>/*`、`/mnt/*`），以及用户主目录、数据目录和原版 RVC 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"119":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"如果看不到，通常是因为设置了 **浏览器可打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）：一旦设置，就只能浏览列出的文件夹。把需要的磁盘加进去，或清空它恢复默认：","locale":"zh-CN"},"120":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"命令行不受这个限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"121":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"绑定到所有网卡：","locale":"zh-CN"},"122":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"在另一台电脑打开 `http://<服务器 IP>:7868` 即可，不需要访问令牌。网络不完全可信时，请自己加上防火墙、VPN 或带身份验证的反向代理，或设置可选的访问令牌（`rvc-next config set server.access_token \"一个足够长的随机字符串\"`），之后浏览器会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框。详见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"123":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"令牌不会以明文显示（`config show` 只显示是否已设置）。在服务器那台电脑上停止服务器，然后设置一个新令牌或清除它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"124":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"设置令牌后，所有浏览器（包括服务器本机的浏览器）都需要输入令牌，所以忘记令牌时只能用命令行重设。浏览器会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框，输入新令牌即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"125":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"可以。在 **模型** › **音色** 的 **原版 RVC 安装** 中 **添加 RVC 安装**，原版 `assets/weights` 中的音色会直接出现在音色列表里（带 **旧版** 标记），索引按原版规则自动推荐；把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向原版的 `assets` 文件夹可以复用 HuBERT、RMVPE、底模和分离模型。详见 从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"126":{"id":"/docs/advanced-faq-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-faq#文件与远程访问","content":"音色库中的音色被移到系统回收站（系统没有回收站时，移到数据目录的 `trash/`），可以从那里找回。原版 RVC 安装中的音色只是隐藏，文件不会被改动；在音色列表中打开 **显示隐藏的**，或用 `rvc-next model list --all` 可以看到它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"127":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"page","content":"硬件与性能","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware","locale":"zh-CN"},"128":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware","content":"本页说明 RVC Next 怎样选择计算设备和精度、怎样管理显存，以及影响速度和实时延迟的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"129":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"选择设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"GPU 规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"精度","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#安装对应的-pytorch","content":"安装对应的 PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"CUDA Graph","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"AMD ROCm 与 Intel XPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"135":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"DirectML","locale":"zh-CN"},"136":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#apple-siliconmps","content":"Apple Silicon（MPS）","locale":"zh-CN"},"137":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#显存管理","content":"显存管理","locale":"zh-CN"},"138":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#模型缓存","content":"模型缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"139":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#空闲卸载","content":"空闲卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"140":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"释放显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"141":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"显存不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"142":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"GPU 任务排队","locale":"zh-CN"},"143":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"实时变声优先","locale":"zh-CN"},"144":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"实时变声的延迟与块长","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware","content":"本页说明 RVC Next 怎样选择计算设备和精度、怎样管理显存，以及影响速度和实时延迟的设置。相关设置都在 `compute` 组（Web UI 的 **设置** › **计算**），完整列表见 配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`compute.device`（**设置** › **计算** › **设备**）可以是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`auto`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"按下面的 GPU 规则选择最合适的显卡（CUDA、ROCm 或 XPU）；都没有时尝试 DirectML，再不行用 CPU。`auto` 不会选择 MPS","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`cpu`","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"只用 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`cuda:N`","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"第 N 块 NVIDIA 显卡（从 0 开始），在 ROCm 版 torch 上则是第 N 块 AMD 显卡。GPU 规则会跳过的卡也照样使用（以 fp32 运行）；编号不存在时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`xpu:N`","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"XPU 版 torch 上的第 N 块 Intel 显卡（Arc、数据中心 GPU、较新的核显）。退回规则与 `cuda:N` 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`dml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"DirectML（Windows 上的 AMD、Intel 等显卡）。不可用时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"`mps`","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#选择设备","content":"Apple Silicon 的 Metal（**实验性**）。不可用时退回 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"`auto` 沿用原版 RVC（`configs/config.py`）的规则，逐块检查 CUDA 显卡：","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"显卡","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"显存不足 4 GiB，或计算能力低于 5.3","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"不使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"166":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"计算能力 6.1（Pascal，如 GTX 10 系列），或 GTX 16xx","locale":"zh-CN"},"167":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"使用，fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"168":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"计算能力高于 6.1（RTX 20 系列及更新）","locale":"zh-CN"},"169":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"使用，fp16","locale":"zh-CN"},"170":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"其他（计算能力 5.3 到 6.1 之间）","locale":"zh-CN"},"171":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"不使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"172":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"ROCm 上的 AMD 显卡（仍是 `cuda:N`）和 Intel XPU 显卡不看计算能力：显存至少 4 GiB 就使用；ROCm 显卡以 fp16 运行，XPU 显卡在设备报告支持 fp16 时以 fp16 运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"173":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-rule","content":"有多块可用显卡时，选计算能力最高的，相同时选显存最大的。`rvc-next doctor` 和 **设置** › **计算** 下方的设备列表会列出每个设备、规则给出的精度和原因（例如 \"Pascal SM 6.1 and GTX 16xx cards run in fp32\"）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"174":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`compute.precision`（**精度**）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"175":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`auto`：按 GPU 规则；","locale":"zh-CN"},"176":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`fp32`：始终用 fp32；","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"`fp16`：在 CUDA、ROCm 和 XPU 上强制 fp16（包括规则判为 fp32 的显卡）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"DirectML、MPS 和 CPU 上始终是 fp32（DirectML 上的人声分离例外，见下）。fp16 更快、显存占用更少；如果某块卡在 fp16 下输出异常，改为 `fp32`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#精度","content":"精度还决定长音频的分块大小（与原版相同）：显存不超过 4 GiB 的 CUDA、ROCm 和 XPU 卡用最小的分块，fp16 用较大的分块，其他情况用中等分块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#安装对应的-pytorch","content":"设备是否可用取决于安装的 PyTorch：NVIDIA 显卡需要 CUDA 版的 torch，AMD 显卡需要 ROCm 版（AMD 自己发布，支持 Windows 和 Linux），Intel 显卡需要 XPU 版；只装了 CPU 版时 `auto` 会选 CPU。安装方法见 安装；`rvc-next doctor` 显示 torch 版本和它的构建目标（例如 `CUDA 13.0`、`ROCm 10.0` 或 `XPU`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"CUDA Graph 把一次推理录制下来、之后直接重放，减少 CPU 调度开销，对实时变声的小块推理帮助最大：","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"`compute.cuda_graph_offline`","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"**转换时使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"`compute.cuda_graph_live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"**实时转换使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#cuda-graph","content":"只在 NVIDIA CUDA 上起作用：ROCm 和 XPU 上这两个开关不生效，推理以普通模式运行。录制按输入的形状缓存（每个调用点最多 8 个，环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE` 可调），录制失败时自动退回普通模式。离线转换的输入长度各不相同，难以复用录制结果，所以默认关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"ROCm：torch 的 ROCm 版（Windows 和 Linux）把 AMD 显卡当作 CUDA 设备，所以它们显示为 `cuda:N`，CUDA 上能运行的功能都能在上面运行，CUDA Graph 除外。人声分离直接使用显卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"XPU：Intel 显卡显示为 `xpu:N`。转换、实时变声、训练（fp16 使用 AMP；多卡训练使用 `xccl` 后端）以及音高和特征提取都在上面运行。人声分离先在 CPU 上加载模型再移到显卡，并以 fp32 运行，因为 pymss 本身不支持 XPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#amd-rocm-与-intel-xpu","content":"多卡训练通过 `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`（ROCm 也读取它）或 XPU 上的 `ZE_AFFINITY_MASK` 选择显卡。**训练** 中的 GPU 编号指当前 torch 构建所提供的那一类设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"安装 DirectML 支持：`pip install \"rvc-next[directml]\"`（安装 `torch-directml` 和 `onnxruntime-directml`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"196":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"RMVPE 在 DirectML 上使用 ONNX 版本，需要资源 `rmvpe-onnx`：`rvc-next assets download rmvpe-onnx`。它不在 `all` 分组里，缺少时界面和命令行会提示下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#directml","content":"人声分离在 DirectML 上默认以 fp16 运行，并使用较小的分块；如果 fp16 失败，任务会自动改用 fp32 重新运行一次（日志中有 \"Retrying in fp32\"）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#apple-siliconmps","content":"把 `compute.device` 设为 `mps` 才会使用 Metal，`auto` 不会选它。MPS 上以 fp32 运行，属于实验性支持。","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#模型缓存","content":"服务器加载过的模型会留在内存（显存）里，下次使用时不必重新加载：HuBERT、各种音高算法的模型，以及最近使用的 3 个音色和它们的索引。实时变声在自己的工作进程里也保留一份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#模型缓存","content":"顶栏的 **显存** 指示器显示已用/总显存和 **已加载：** 的模型列表（没有时显示 **未加载任何模型**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#空闲卸载","content":"`compute.unload_after_minutes`（**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**，默认 10）：服务器里的模型空闲超过这个时间后自动卸载。服务器每 30 秒检查一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"202":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"在顶栏 **显存** 菜单中点 **释放显存**，立即卸载所有缓存的模型，包括空闲的实时变声工作进程中的模型，并把显存还给驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"203":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"只有在**没有任务排队或运行、实时变声也没有运行**时才能释放；否则菜单项显示为 **释放显存（请等待：有任务正在运行）** 或 **释放显存（请等待：实时变声正在运行）**，因为这些模型正在使用，释放后马上又要重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"204":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#释放显存","content":"命令行没有单独的释放命令：每条命令结束时进程退出，显存随之释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"205":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"当推理或训练报告显存不足（CUDA 的 `OutOfMemoryError`，以及 MPS、DirectML 的相应错误）时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"206":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"任务失败，错误为 **GPU 不可用或显存不足**（`compute_unavailable`，`detail.reason` 为 `out_of_memory`；命令行退出码 9）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"207":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"服务器随即卸载所有没在使用的模型，让下一次从空的显存开始；实时变声的工作进程出错时先卸载自己的模型；","locale":"zh-CN"},"208":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"这样失败的任务**不会自动重试**，需要你在 **任务** 中点 **重试**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"209":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"减少显存占用的办法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"210":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"把 **同时运行的 GPU 任务数** 保持为 1；","locale":"zh-CN"},"211":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"转换或训练前先 **释放显存**，或停止实时变声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"训练时减小批大小（`train run --batch-size`），关闭 **将数据集缓存到显存**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#out-of-memory","content":"改用 fp16（如果显卡支持），或在显存很小的卡上改用 CPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"转换、分离和训练任务在 `compute.device` 不是 `cpu` 时属于 GPU 任务：","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"`compute.gpu_jobs`（**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**，默认 1，最大 16）限制同时运行的 GPU 任务数量，其余任务排队（状态 **等待中**，**等待 GPU**）。显存充足时可以调大。","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"设备为 `cpu` 时这些任务改为 CPU 任务，最多同时运行 CPU 核数的一半个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"实验的 **GPU** 设为 `cpu` 时（新实验的默认值来自 `training.gpus`），训练也作为 CPU 任务运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"218":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#gpu-任务排队","content":"预览（只转换前几秒）的优先级高于普通转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"219":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"实时变声对延迟最敏感，所以它开始时（设备不是 `cpu`）会占用 GPU：","locale":"zh-CN"},"220":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"已经在运行的 GPU 任务继续运行；","locale":"zh-CN"},"221":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"新的 GPU 任务进入等待，任务卡片上出现 **仍然运行**，提示 **实时转换正在使用 GPU。同时运行可能导致声音卡顿。** 点它可以不等实时变声结束就开始；","locale":"zh-CN"},"222":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"实时变声停止后，等待的任务自动开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"223":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#实时变声优先","content":"命令行（`rvc-next convert` 等）在自己的进程中运行任务，不参与正在运行的服务器的 GPU 排队。服务器正在实时变声时，在同一台电脑上用命令行跑 GPU 任务同样可能造成卡顿。","locale":"zh-CN"},"224":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"实时变声每次处理一个\"块\"的音频。估计延迟（实时页面和 `live check` 显示）按下式计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"按默认的 **块长** 250 毫秒、**交叉淡化** 50 毫秒，单个双工流时约为 560 毫秒加上设备延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"这里的设备延迟是 PortAudio 报告的值，往往偏乐观（MME、DirectSound 和蓝牙设备尤其如此）。要得到真实数值，把输出接回输入，然后在实时页面使用 **测量延迟**，或运行 `rvc-next live latency`：它让测试噪声经过实时变声所用的同一组缓冲，通过互相关在输入中找到它们，再加上转换器自身的延迟。详见 测量真实延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"要让变声不断音，每块的推理时间必须明显短于块长。实时页面的 **负载** 条显示推理耗时（p95）与块长之比：","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"负载超过 80% 时进度条变红，并出现按钮 **将块长增加到 \\{ms} 毫秒**（建议值让负载回到约 70%，上限 1500 毫秒），点击即可调整；","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-101","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"出现 **欠载**、**溢出** 计数或爆音时，同样应增大块长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-102","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"运行中修改块长、交叉淡化、上下文会重新缓冲，不需要重新加载模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-103","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"CPU 和 GPU 的差别主要体现在这里：在 GPU 上推理快，可以用较短的块长换取低延迟；在 CPU 上推理慢得多，通常需要更长的块长（延迟随之增加），pm 音高算法也比 RMVPE 快。**上下文** 越长效果越平滑，但每块的计算量也越大；降噪会增加一些耗时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/advanced-hardware-104","page_id":"/docs/advanced-hardware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-hardware#live-latency","content":"更多实时变声的使用说明见 实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"233":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"page","content":"从原版 RVC 迁移","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","locale":"zh-CN"},"234":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（以提交 81eed5e 为基准）的重写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"235":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"1\\. 复用原版的 `assets` 文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"236":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"2\\. 直接使用原版的音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"237":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"3\\. 把音色复制进音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"238":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"4\\. 导入原版的训练实验","locale":"zh-CN"},"239":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版的行为差异","content":"与原版的行为差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"240":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版逐位一致的部分","content":"与原版逐位一致的部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"241":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（以提交 `81eed5e` 为基准）的重写。原版的模型文件格式不变：原版训练的音色、索引、底模和实验都可以直接使用，RVC Next 训练出的音色也是同样的格式。本页说明怎样复用一个已有的原版 RVC 安装，以及两者在行为上的差异。","locale":"zh-CN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate","content":"迁移不会修改原版安装里的任何文件，可以两边同时使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"243":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"RVC Next 的资源文件夹与原版的 `assets/` 结构相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"244":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"245":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"246":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"HuBERT","locale":"zh-CN"},"247":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`hubert_base/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"RMVPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`（DirectML 用 `rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"底模","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`pretrained/`、`pretrained_v2/`（如 `f0G40k.pth`、`f0D40k.pth`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`pymss_weights/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"FCPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"`fcpe/fcpe_c_v001.pt`（原版通过 torchfcpe 包自带，RVC Next 需要单独下载）","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"所以把 `paths.assets_dir` 指向原版的 `assets` 文件夹，就不必重新下载这些文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"**设置** › **存储** › **文件夹** 中的 **资源**，填入原版 RVC 的 `assets` 文件夹路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"258":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#1-复用原版的-assets-文件夹","content":"指向原版的 `assets` 后，之后在 RVC Next 里下载的资源（例如 FCPE、缺少的底模）也会写进这个文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"259":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"把原版安装添加为\"原版 RVC 安装\"（设置里的 `paths.legacy_roots`）后，它的音色**直接读取，不复制**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"260":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"音色来自 `<RVC>/assets/weights/*.pth`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"261":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"索引从 `<RVC>/assets/indices` 和 `<RVC>/logs` 中查找，按原版 `get_index_path_from_model` 的打分规则（实验名、说话人、新旧）为每个音色推荐一个 `added_*.index`，名称含 `trained` 的索引不参与。","locale":"zh-CN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"在 Web UI 中：**模型** › **音色** 页面底部的 **原版 RVC 安装**，点 **添加 RVC 安装**，选择 RVC 的根目录（必须包含 `assets` 文件夹）。之后：","locale":"zh-CN"},"263":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"这些音色带有 **旧版** 标记，出现在所有音色选择器里，可以直接用于转换和实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"264":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"**扫描**：重新读取 `assets/weights`，并为还没有选过索引的音色重新按原版规则推荐索引；你手动添加或移除过索引的音色保持你的选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"265":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"**全部导入**：把这个安装里的所有音色复制进 RVC Next 的音色库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"266":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"推荐结果和你之后的修改（改名、说话人名称、换索引、隐藏）保存在数据目录的 `legacy-voices.json` 里，原版的文件夹始终不会被写入。为旧版音色附加的索引如果是上传的文件，会复制到 `models/attached-indexes/<音色>/`；如果是服务器上的路径，则只记录路径。删除旧版音色只是隐藏它（`rvc-next model list --all` 仍能列出），RVC 安装中的文件不会被改动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"267":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"用命令行添加时，写入同样的设置即可，下次运行命令或启动服务器时会读取并推荐索引：","locale":"zh-CN"},"268":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#2-直接使用原版的音色","content":"Web UI 默认允许浏览已添加的原版 RVC 安装中的文件（见 远程访问与安全 中的浏览范围）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"269":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"如果想让音色独立于原版安装（例如之后要删除原版），就导入它们。导入时每个文件按内容识别，`.pth` 和 `.index` 的文件名不需要对应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"270":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"索引的宽度决定它适合哪个版本（256 维为 v1，768 维为 v2），版本不符的不会配对；","locale":"zh-CN"},"271":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"同一次导入中只有一个兼容音色时自动配对；有多个时按实验名、名称相似度和是否在同一文件夹打分，不够确定时由你选择（Web UI 弹出 **检查导入**，命令行打印计划并以退出码 3 结束）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"272":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"把 `.pth`、`.index` 或 `.zip` 拖到 **模型** › **音色** 的导入区。旧版音色也可以在 **原版 RVC 安装** 中点 **全部导入**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"273":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#3-把音色复制进音色库","content":"训练用的 `G_*.pth`/`D_*.pth` 默认作为 **底模** 导入（之后可以在实验设置里选择）；想把 G 检查点直接变成音色，加 `--extract`，或在 **模型** › **工具** 中提取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"274":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"原版的实验文件夹 `logs/<名称>` 可以复制进来继续使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"275":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"**训练** 页面点 **导入实验**，填入 **原版实验文件夹（logs/\\<名称>）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"276":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#4-导入原版的训练实验","content":"文件夹必须包含 `0_gt_wavs` 或 `config.json`。复制时跳过 `eval` 文件夹；输出已经存在的阶段（切片、音高、特征、训练、索引）记为已完成，之后可以接着运行没完成的阶段，或增加轮数继续训练。实验文件夹里没有 `experiment.json` 时，RVC Next 按原版实验来读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"277":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":