,"content":"数值代码是移植而不是重写，并由\"golden\"测试对照原版：在 CPU、fp32、相同随机种子和相同 16 kHz 输入下比较输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"310":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版逐位一致的部分","content":"**离线转换**：pm 和 RMVPE 在 v1 40k、v2 40k、v2 40k 无音高引导和 v2 48k 音色上**逐位相同**，覆盖语音、静音和一段超过分块阈值的 70 秒音频，并包含音高偏移和说话人 id；FCPE 也逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"311":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版逐位一致的部分","content":"**实时变声**：流式引擎逐块与原版 `rtrvc.RVC.infer` 加上实时 GUI 回调中的处理（门限、TorchGate 输入输出降噪、共振峰、响度混合、SOLA）逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"312":{"id":"/docs/advanced-migrate-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-migrate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-migrate#与原版逐位一致的部分","content":"离线转换的输出可能比输入短最多两个 10 毫秒帧，这是原版取整方式的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"313":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"page","content":"远程访问与安全","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote","locale":"zh-CN"},"314":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote","content":"RVC Next 的服务器默认只监听本机（127.0.0.1:7868），只有这台电脑上的浏览器能打开。本页说明怎样让局域网里的其他设备访问，以及服务器为此采取的保护措施。","locale":"zh-CN"},"315":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"地址与端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"316":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#允许其他电脑访问","content":"允许其他电脑访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"317":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"访问令牌（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"318":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"令牌的携带方式","locale":"zh-CN