d-remote-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"端口被占用时直接失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"342":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"`server.open_browser`","locale":"zh-CN"},"343":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"`--open / --no-open`","locale":"zh-CN"},"344":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"345":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"启动后打开浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"346":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#地址与端口","content":"端口被占用（或属于系统保留范围）时，服务器依次尝试后面的端口，最多 20 个，并在日志中提示 \"Port 7868 is unavailable. Using port 7869.\"；开启 `strict_port` 时则直接以退出码 3 结束。Web UI 中这些设置在 **设置** › **常规** 的 **服务器地址** 和 **端口**，修改后 **下次启动服务器时生效。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"347":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#允许其他电脑访问","content":"绑定到所有网卡并启动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"348":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#允许其他电脑访问","content":"服务器会在日志中提醒它可以被其他电脑访问：","locale":"zh-CN"},"349":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#允许其他电脑访问","content":"在另一台设备的浏览器打开 `http://<服务器的 IP>:7868`，即可直接使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"350":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#允许其他电脑访问","content":"不需要访问令牌：任何能连到这个地址的人都能使用全部功能。如果网络不完全可信，请自己加上保护——防火墙只放行信任的设备、通过 VPN 访问、或放在带身份验证的反向代理之后——也可以设置下文的访问令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"351":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"访问令牌是任意足够长的随机字符串，设置后每个浏览器都要先输入它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"352":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"**设置** › **常规**，在 **访问令牌** 中输入后点 **设置令牌**。旁边的标记显示 **已设置访问令牌** 或 **未设置访问令牌**；**清除令牌** 删除它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"353":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"设置后，浏览器加载页面时会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框（\"此服务器需要访问令牌。\"），输入令牌后点 **保存**。浏览器把令牌保存在本地存储中，并写入一个名为 `rvc_next_token` 的 Cookie（用于音频播放和 WebSocket 连接），下次打开不需要再输入。令牌错误或被修改后，对话框会再次出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"354":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"令牌对所有浏览器都生效，**包括服务器本机的浏览器**：设置令牌后，本机打开 Web UI 同样会要求输入一次。命令行不经过 API，不需要令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"355":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#访问令牌可选","content":"服务器默认只提供 HTTP，令牌和音频都以明文在网络上传输，只适合在可信的局域网中使用；需要加密时配置证书（见下文）或由反向代理提供 HTTPS。操作系统的防火墙可能需要放行这个端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"356":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"设置了令牌后，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的每个请求都必须携带它，三种方式任选其一：","locale":"zh-CN"},"357":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"请求头 `Authorization: Bearer <令牌>`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"358":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"Cookie `rvc_next_token=<令牌>`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"359":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"查询参数 `?token=<令牌>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"360":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"不需要令牌的只有健康检查 `/api/v1/app/health`（它告诉页面是否需要令牌）和 Web UI 的静态页面本身。令牌比较使用常量时间比较。用脚本调用 API 的例子：","locale":"zh-CN"},"361":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#令牌的携带方式","content":"令牌修改后立即生效，不需要重启服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"362":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"设置了令牌时，所有请求都要先通过令牌检查；在此基础上（或没有令牌时），服务器再根据请求是否来自本机决定允许哪些操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"363":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"364":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"本机浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"365":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"其他电脑","locale":"zh-CN"},"366":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"上传音频、转换、分离、训练、实时变声、管理模型、修改设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"367":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"368":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"369":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"上传训练数据集（**从这台电脑添加音频**）、下载音色（**下载**）或结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"370":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"371":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以：都不需要服务器上的文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"372":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"浏览服务器文件（**服务器文件**）、使用服务器路径导入模型或指定数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"373":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"374":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以，但只限浏览范围内的文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"375":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"**在文件夹中显示**（在服务器的文件管理器中打开）","locale":"zh-CN"},"376":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"可以","locale":"zh-CN"},"377":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"不可以（\"只能在服务器本机的浏览器中使用\"）","locale":"zh-CN"},"378":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#远程浏览器能做什么","content":"能打开 Web UI 的人（设置了令牌时，持有令牌的人）可以修改所有设置（包括浏览范围和文件夹位置）、删除音色和实验。只让你信任的人访问服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"379":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"Web UI（包括本机浏览器）浏览和使用服务器上的文件时，只能使用 `paths.browse_roots` 中的文件夹，超出范围的路径会被拒绝（`invalid_path`）。默认（列表为空）包括：","locale":"zh-CN"},"380":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"用户主目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"381":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"已添加的原版 RVC 安装；","locale":"zh-CN"},"382":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"数据目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"所有驱动器（Windows 上的 `C:\\`、`D:\\` 等），或已挂载的卷（macOS 的 `/Volumes/*`；Linux 的 `/media/<用户>/*`、`/run/media/<用户>/*`、`/mnt/*`）。系统根目录 `/` 默认不包括。","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"开放给其他电脑时，建议把范围收窄到真正需要的文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"或在 **设置** › **存储** 的 **浏览器可打开的文件夹** 中每行填一个。设置后只有这些文件夹可以浏览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#浏览范围","content":"命令行不受浏览范围限制：在服务器上运行命令的人本来就能访问这些文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#来源检查","content":"为防止其他网站借用你的浏览器操作服务器，服务器对每个请求做两项检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#来源检查","content":"**Host 检查**：只监听本机时，请求的 `Host` 必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1` 或绑定的地址，否则返回 400（`bad_host`）。这可以阻止 DNS 重绑定攻击。绑定到非本机地址时不做这项检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#来源检查","content":"**Origin 检查**：会修改数据的请求（非 GET/HEAD/OPTIONS）和 WebSocket 连接，如果带有 `Origin`，它必须与页面自身的地址相同，或列在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，否则返回 403（`bad_origin`）；没有 `Origin` 的跨站请求同样被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#来源检查","content":"如果你在另一个网页或工具中调用这个 API（例如自己写的前端），把它的来源加入 `server.allowed_origins`，服务器也会为这些来源开启 CORS（CORS 部分在启动时配置，修改后需要重启）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#live-devices","content":"实时变声在**服务器所在的电脑**上运行。选 **服务器设备**（默认）时，麦克风输入、变声输出和监听都使用这台电脑的音频设备，而不是你打开网页的那台设备。设备面板的标题会写明主机名（**\\<主机名> 上的音频设备**），远程访问时还会提示 **这些设备属于服务器所在的电脑，而不是此浏览器。** 命令行的 `rvc-next live devices` 同样列出服务器本机的设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#live-devices","content":"在实时页顶部选 **本浏览器** 时，打开网页的手机或电脑的麦克风会发送到服务器，转换后的声音在那台设备上播放（使用本浏览器的麦克风）。浏览器只允许 **HTTPS** 页面或服务器本机（`localhost`）上的页面使用麦克风。要从其他电脑使用，请给服务器配置证书：","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#live-devices","content":"自签名证书在浏览器中确认警告后即可使用（`openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 365 -subj /CN=my-pc`）。由反向代理终止 HTTPS 也可以；它除了转发 `/ws/` 下的 WebSocket，还需要转发 `/api/v1/live/browser-audio`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"394":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#反向代理","content":"代码没有专门支持在反向代理后运行，也没有可配置的路径前缀。如果确实要这样做，需要注意上面的检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"395":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#反向代理","content":"服务器只监听本机时，代理转发的 `Host` 必须是 `localhost` 或 `127.0.0.1`（否则 400 `bad_host`）；嵌入 rvc-next 的程序可以用 `extra_hosts` / `allow_host()` 允许代理或内网穿透的公网主机名（嵌入）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"396":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#反向代理","content":"浏览器发出的 `Origin` 是代理的地址，与转发后的 `Host` 不一致，需要把它加入 `server.allowed_origins`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"397":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#反向代理","content":"需要转发 `/ws/` 的 WebSocket 连接，以及 `/api/v1/live/browser-audio`（浏览器音频）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"398":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#反向代理","content":"服务器只把来自回环地址、且 `Host` 是本机名称（`localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`）的请求当作本机。代理和服务器在同一台电脑上、又把 `Host` 改写为 `localhost` 时，所有访问者都会被当作本机；保留公网主机名的代理和内网穿透则不会。公开到互联网时，请在代理上加身份验证或设置访问令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#相关页面","content":"配置与环境变量：`server` 和 `paths` 设置的完整说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"400":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#相关页面","content":"设置：Web UI 中的设置页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"401":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#相关页面","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"402":{"id":"/docs/advanced","page_id":"/docs/advanced","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced","locale":"zh-CN"},"403":{"id":"/docs/advanced-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"这一部分面向已经能正常使用 RVC Next、想进一步调整的用户：沿用原版 RVC 的文件、让其他电脑访问服务器、根据显卡调整性能，以及排查常见问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"404":{"id":"/docs/advanced-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"复用原版 RVC 的 `assets` 文件夹、直接读取原版的音色和索引、导入音色和实验，以及与原版行为的差异和逐位一致的部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"405":{"id":"/docs/advanced-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"绑定地址和端口、访问令牌、远程浏览器能做和不能做的事、来源检查，以及实时变声为什么总是使用服务器的音频设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"406":{"id":"/docs/advanced-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"在自己的 Python 程序里启动服务端和网页界面：数据目录与配置目录分开、固定设置、路径前缀，以及挂载到已有的 FastAPI 应用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"407":{"id":"/docs/advanced-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"设备与精度的选择规则、CUDA Graph、DirectML 和 MPS、显存管理与 **释放显存**、显存不足的处理、GPU 任务排队，以及实时变声的延迟与块长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"408":{"id":"/docs/advanced-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"缺少资源、CPU 上转换慢、实时变声没有设备或有爆音、端口被占用、看不到其他磁盘、结果保存在哪里等问题的解答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"409":{"id":"/docs/advanced-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced","content":"命令行的设置项和环境变量见 配置与环境变量；界面上的设置见 设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"410":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","type":"page","content":"命令参考","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","命令行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli-commands","locale":"zh-CN"},"411":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-0","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-commands","content":"本页按命令树列出 rvc-next 的每条命令和子命令，内容来自各命令的 --help 输出。命令和子命令在帮助中按字母顺序排列，本页按用途分组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"412":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-1","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli-commands#根命令","content":"根命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"413":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-2","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli-commands#服务器与系统","content":"服务器与系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"414":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-3","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli-commands#webui","content":"`webui`","locale":"zh-CN"},"415":{"id":"/docs/cli-commands-4","page_id":"/docs/cli-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli-commands#version","co