WARNING`、`ERROR`，默认 `INFO`）。任务的完整日志保存在数据目录的 `jobs/<任务 id>.log`，用 `rvc-next jobs show <任务 id> --log` 查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/cli-57","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"根命令提供 Typer 的补全选项：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/cli-58","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-补全","content":"安装后重新打开终端即可补全命令、子命令和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/cli-59","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#首次准备","content":"国内网络可以在下载时切换下载源（ModelScope 或 hf-mirror），该选择会保存到设置里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/cli-60","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#转换一个文件夹","content":"参数从音色的默认预设开始，命令行上给出的选项覆盖对应的值；`--preset` 改用另一个预设作为起点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/cli-61","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#转换一个文件夹","content":"不带 `-o` 时，结果写到数据目录的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 id>/`；文件名为 `<原文件名>.<音色>.<格式>`，同名时不会覆盖（用 `-o` 并加 `--overwrite` 才会覆盖）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/cli-62","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#转换一个文件夹","content":"只想试听效果时加 `--preview 15`，只转换前 15 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/cli-63","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#转换一个文件夹","content":"转换整首歌的人声并加回伴奏：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/cli-64","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#人声分离","content":"不指定 `-p` 时使用设置中的默认分离预设（`separation.default_preset`，默认 `vocals`）。分离模型在第一次使用前需要下载，例如 `rvc-next assets download --group separation`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/cli-65","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#从头训练一个音色","content":"`train run` 不带 `--stage` 时运行所有未完成或输入已改变的阶段（清理、切片、音高、特征、训练、索引）；用 `--stage fit --stage index` 只运行指定阶段，`--force` 强制重跑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/cli-66","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#从头训练一个音色","content":"多说话人数据集：`train new --dataset <根目录> --multi-speaker`，根目录下是 `名称_ID_重复次数` 形式的子文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/cli-67","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#从头训练一个音色","content":"数据集需要先去伴奏和混响时，用 `--clean vocals-clean` 在切片前先分离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/cli-68","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#导入模型","content":"文件按内容识别（不看扩展名或文件名），索引按版本和名称与音色配对。无法确定配对时，命令会打印导入计划并以退出码 3 结束，这时用 `--pair 音色.pth=索引.index`（多说话人加 `:spkN`）指定，或用 `--keep-unassigned` 把索引放进未分配列表，之后再用 `rvc-next model index assign` 分配。训练检查点（G）默认作为底模导入，加 `--extract` 则提取为音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/cli-69","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#实时变声","content":"`live run` 一直运行到 ctrl+c（或 `--seconds` 指定的时长），终端上显示一行状态：延迟、负载、输入输出电平和欠载/溢出次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/cli-70","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"命令参考：所有命令的参数和选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"配置与环境变量：设置项、环境变量和数据目录结构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#下一步","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/development-api","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"page","content":"API 与事件","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api","locale":"zh-CN"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/development-api-0","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"应用的组装","locale":"zh-CN"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/development-api-1","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#rest-约定","content":"REST 约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/development-api-2","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"路由一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/development-api-3","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"上传与媒体","locale":"zh-CN"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/development-api-4","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#访问控制","content":"访问控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"1740":{"id":"/docs/development-api-5","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"`SecurityMiddleware`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/development-api-6","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"本机客户端与服务器路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/development-api-7","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#socketio-与事件","content":"socket.io 与事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/development-api-8","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"桥接","locale":"zh-CN"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/development-api-9","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"事件与载荷","locale":"zh-CN"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/development-api-10","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#事件进入-openapi","content":"事件进入 OpenAPI","locale":"zh-CN"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/development-api-11","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#从-schema-生成-typescript","content":"从 schema 生成 TypeScript","locale":"zh-CN"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/development-api-12","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#静态页面","content":"静态页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/development-api-13","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#启动端口与-server_ready","content":"启动、端口与 `SERVER_READY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/development-api-14","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个接口","content":"新增一个接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/development-api-15","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"`rvc_next.api` 是 FastAPI 一端：把 HTTP 请求解析成核心层的 `Record` 模型，调用一个核心方法，再把结果原样返回；服务器到浏览器的推送走 socket.io。它不导入 `rvc_next.engine`（整体架构中的分层规则由 `tests/test_architecture.py` 守住），也不含业务逻辑——最大的路由文件 `routers/models.py` 也只是一串“一行调用核心”的路由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/development-api-16","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"本页面向需要增删接口、调整安全策略或新增事件的维护者：应用如何组装、REST 约定、上传与媒体、访问控制、事件与载荷、从 OpenAPI 生成 TypeScript 类型，以及服务器启动时的端口选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/development-api-17","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"`api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, bound_host, bound_port, extra_hosts, serve_ui, api_prefix)` 依次（下文的路径都在 `api_prefix` 之下，默认为空）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/development-api-18","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"建 `RvcNextAPI`（`FastAPI` 子类，见下文“事件进入 OpenAPI”），`docs_url=\"/docs\"`、`openapi_url=\"/openapi.json\"`、关闭 ReDoc，并设 `separate_input_output_schemas=False`；把 `services` 存到 `app.state.services`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/development-api-19","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"`install_error_handlers(app)`：任何 `RvcNextError` 都变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/development-api-20","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"依次挂载 `ROUTERS` 中的 13 个路由模块，统一前缀 `/api`；各路由自带 `/v1/<资源>` 前缀，所以完整路径是 `/api/v1/...`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/development-api-21","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"在 `/ws` 挂载 socket.io（`SocketBridge.asgi_app()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/development-api-22","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"中间件：`server.allowed_origins` 非空时加 `CORSMiddleware`；总是加 `GZipMiddleware(minimum_size=4096)` 与 `SecurityMiddleware`（后加者在外层，所以安全检查最先执行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/development-api-23","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"**最后**挂载 `SPAStaticFiles` 到 `/`，只有找到 `webui/dist/index.html` 时才挂；没有构建产物时只记一条警告，API 照常工作（开发时由 Vite 提供页面）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/development-api-24","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"生命周期（`lifespan`）只负责启动和停止 socket 桥。服务本身由调用方创建与关闭：`rvc-next webui` 用 `build_services(start_background=True)` 启动任务调度和空闲卸载，再交给 `create_app`；测试则传入自己的 `Services`。这样同一个 `create_app` 既能服务真实进程，也能在 `TestClient` 里跑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/development-api-25","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"嵌入模式（`embed.py` 的 `RvcNextServer`）走同一条路：`build_services(data_dir, config_dir, settings_path, settings_overrides, start_background=True)`，绑定端口，`create_app(..., api_prefix=...)`，在后台线程运行 uvicorn，并像 `rvc-next webui` 一样写 `server.json`。`normalize_prefix()` 把 `voice`、`/voice/` 都规范成 `/voice`；`SecurityMiddleware` 按前缀判断受保护路径。用法见 嵌入到其他程序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/development-api-26","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用的组装","content":"依赖注入只有一个：`api/deps.py` 的 `ServicesDep = Annotated[Services, Depends(get_services)]`，从 `request.app.state` 取服务。没有全局服务定位器（InvokeAI 的做法），因此一个路由依赖什么写在它的签名里，测试换掉 `app.state.services` 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/development-api-27","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs