或 `active`/`finished`）、`DELETE \"\"`（清除已完成任务，输出保留）、单个任务、`log?offset=`、`cancel`、`retry`、`run-anyway`、删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"1830":{"id":"/docs/development-api-95","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"`live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/development-api-96","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"`/v1/live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1832":{"id":"/docs/development-api-97","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"`GET state`、`POST start/stop`、`PATCH voice`、`PATCH stream`、`PUT voice-model`、`PUT/GET devices`、`POST devices/check`、`POST devices/test-tone`、`POST meter`、`POST passthrough`、`POST/DELETE recording`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/development-api-98","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"`routers/models.py` 中固定路径（`/catalog`、`/imports`、`/indexes`、`/base`、`/separation`、`/legacy-roots`…）全部写在 `/{voice_id}` 之前。FastAPI 按注册顺序匹配，新增固定路径时必须放在通配路由上面，否则会被当成一个音色 id。`outputs` 的 `POST /zip` 同理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/development-api-99","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"**实时变声的控制也是 REST。** socket 只承载服务器推送（`live_state`、`live_stats`、`devices_changed`），客户端从不经 socket 发命令。这延续了 InvokeAI 与 SD Model Hub 的设计：所有改变状态的操作都有 HTTP 状态码、错误形状和 OpenAPI 描述，可以用 `curl` 或 CLI 复现；socket 断线也不会丢命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/development-api-100","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由一览","content":"**导入的一步式接口。** `PUT /models/import` 与 `POST /models/import-path` 是对导入会话的封装：计划“有把握”（`confident`）时直接提交并返回 `ImportResult`；需要用户决定时抛 `ConflictError`，409 的 `detail.plan` 里带着计划，脚本可以据此改用会话接口提交决定。会话接口（`POST /imports` → `PUT /imports/{sid}/files` 或 `POST …/paths` → `GET /imports/{sid}` → `POST …/commit`）是同步的：提交直接返回 `ImportResult`，而不是一个任务（复制是本地操作，最慢的分离模型加载检查也只要几秒；见 AGENTS.md §8）。识别与配对规则见核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/development-api-101","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"**上传是原始请求体的 `PUT`，不用 multipart。** `api/uploads.py` 的 `spool()` 把 `request.stream()` 按块写入 `<目录>/.incoming/<id>.part`，出错或断开就删除；路由随后用 `read_chunks()` 把文件按 1 MiB 块交给核心（`services.audio.upload`、`imports.add_upload`、`models.set_index_upload`…），无论成败最后都删除临时文件。文件名放在查询参数里（`name` 或 `filename`，最长 255）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1837":{"id":"/docs/development-api-102","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"这样做的原因：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/development-api-103","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"音频和模型动辄几百 MB，multipart 解析要么整块进内存，要么依赖 `python-multipart` 的临时文件策略；原始请求体可以边收边写，内存占用恒定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/development-api-104","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"前端用 `XMLHttpRequest` 直接 `send(file)`，能拿到上传进度（`fetch()` 拿不到）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/development-api-105","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"`RAW_BODY` 作为 `openapi_extra` 写进 schema，声明 `application/octet-stream`，生成的类型因此知道这些端点收二进制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/development-api-106","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"**媒体用 `FileResponse`。** `api/files.py` 的 `audio_response()` 按扩展名给出 MIME，`Cache-Control: private, no-cache`，`Content-Disposition` 同时写 ASCII 回退名和 RFC 5987 的 `filename*`（中文文件名下载不乱码）；`?download=true` 时为 `attachment`。`FileResponse` 支持 `Range`，浏览器在长音频里拖动进度条不必下载整个文件。波形不在浏览器解码：`peaks` 端点返回服务器算好并缓存的峰值（默认 1024 点）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/development-api-107","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#上传与媒体","content":"**打包下载**：`POST /outputs/zip` 以 `StreamingResponse` 边压缩边发送，不在服务器落地 zip 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/development-api-108","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#访问控制","content":"访问控制分两层：`SecurityMiddleware` 处理“谁能连进来”，路由里的 `require_local` 处理只对本机浏览器有意义的操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/development-api-109","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"`api/security.py` 是纯 ASGI 中间件，HTTP 与 WebSocket 都经过它。三项检查依次进行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/development-api-110","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/development-api-111","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/development-api-112","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"防的是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/development-api-113","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"Host","locale":"zh-CN"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/development-api-114","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"绑定在回环地址时，`Host` 头必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、绑定的主机名或 `extra_hosts`（按引用保存，之后加入的名称立即生效，`RvcNextServer.allow_host()` 即靠这一点）；否则 400 `bad_host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/development-api-115","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"DNS 重绑定：恶意网页把自己的域名解析到 127.0.0.1 后调用本机 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/development-api-116","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"Origin","locale":"zh-CN"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/development-api-117","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"非安全方法（`GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS` 以外）和所有 WebSocket 握手：有 `Origin` 时必须等于页面自己的源、在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，或与 `Host` 同主机端口；没有 `Origin` 时 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 只能是 `same-origin`、`none` 或缺省。否则 403 `bad_origin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/development-api-118","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"跨站请求伪造：别的网页在用户浏览器里对本机服务发 `POST`/`DELETE`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/development-api-119","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"访问令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/development-api-120","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/openapi.json`、`/docs` 下的请求必须带令牌；`/api/v1/app/health` 例外。否则 401 `auth_required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/development-api-121","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"局域网或公网上的其他人","locale":"zh-CN"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/development-api-122","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"令牌可以放在三处（`request_token()` 依次查找）：`Authorization: Bearer …`、`rvc_next_token` Cookie、`?token=` 查询参数。比较用 `hmac.compare_digest`。Cookie 的存在是为了 `<audio src>` 这类浏览器自己发出的请求——它们无法附加请求头。`health` 公开，是为了让页面外壳在没有令牌时也能加载，读到 `auth_required: true` 后弹出 `AuthDialog` 向用户要令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/development-api-123","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"WebSocket 被拒绝时以关闭码 1008 断开。中间件读取的设置都是函数（`lambda: services.settings.settings.server.access_token`），所以在设置页修改令牌或允许的源立即生效，不必重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/development-api-124","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#securitymiddleware","content":"令牌是可选的：绑定到非回环地址、或用 `extra_hosts` 接受公网主机名时都不要求它，`rvc-next webui` 和 `RvcNextServer` 只在日志中警告。公开部署的保护（防火墙、VPN、带身份验证的反向代理）由用户自己负责。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/development-api-125","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"判定","locale":"zh-CN"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/development-api-126","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"定义（`api/deps.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/development-api-127","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"用在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/development-api-128","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"`is_local`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/development-api-129","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"客户端地址是回环地址，且 `Host` 是回环名称（内网穿透和同机反向代理转发的公网主机名不算；测试中的 `testclient` 也算）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/development-api-130","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"`AppMeta.local`；`LocalDep` 保护的 `reveal`（在服务器的文件管理器里显示文件）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/development-api-131","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"通过中间件的客户端都可以指名服务器上的路径（浏览、解析音频路径、按路径导入模型或索引、新建实验或修改数据集、导入旧实验、添加旧版 RVC 安装等）。只有 `reveal` 只认本机：远程浏览器没有意义去打开服务器桌面上的文件管理器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1867":{"id":"/docs/development-api-132","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#本机客户端与服务器路径","content":"**音频输入**要落在 `paths.browse_roots` 之内：`GET /audio/browse`、`POST /audio/resolve-path`，以及 `POST /convert`、`POST /separate` 中 `kind == \"path\"` 的输入（路由调用 `services.audio.check_refs`），越界时 400 `invalid_path`，`detail.roots` 列出允许的根。这一检查只在 API 里做——命令行由本机用户直接运行，视为可信，可以读任何路径。模型导入、数据集文件夹等路径不受 `browse_roots` 约束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1868":{"id":"/docs/development-api-133","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"`api/sockets.py` 的 `SocketBridge` 包装 `socketio.AsyncServer(async_mode=\"asgi\")`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1869":{"id":"/docs/development-api-134","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"`start()` 订阅事件总线。`LocalEventBus` 在发布者线程上同步调用处理函数，而发布者多半是任务线程或 worker 输出的读取线程，所以处理函数只做一件事：`loop.call_soon_threadsafe(queue.put_nowait, event)`，把事件交给事件循环。一个后台任务 `_pump()` 再逐个 `emit`，单个事件序列化失败只记日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1870":{"id":"/docs/development-api-135","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"流量只有服务器到客户端，广播给所有连接；没有房间，也没有客户端事件处理器（单用户应用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1871":{"id":"/docs/development-api-136","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"连接时（`_on_connect`）在设置了令牌的情况下验证：先看握手 `auth.token`，再退回 Cookie、`Authorization` 头或查询参数。Origin 检查已由外层中间件完成，所以 `cors_allowed_origins=\"*\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1872":{"id":"/docs/development-api-137","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"`asgi_app()` 用 `route_path(scope)` 规范化挂载后的路径，再交给 engineio 匹配 `/socket.io`，以兼容新旧 Starlette 对挂载前缀的不同处理。客户端连接的是 `<部署根>/ws/socket.io`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1873":{"id":"/docs/development-api-138","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#桥接","content":"**事件携带快照。** 每个事件都是完整的 `Record` 值（例如 `JobUpdatedEvent` 里是 `job.model_copy(deep=True)`），绝不是 worker 还在修改的活对象：序列化发生在稍后的事件循环上，而那时任务线程可能已经改了进度。快照也让客户端无需追溯历史——收到即可替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1874":{"id":"/docs/development-api-139","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"事件类定义在 `core/events/models.py`，都继承 `EventBase` 并设置 `__event_name__`；`EventBase.get_events()` 递归收集所有具名子类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1875":{"id":"/docs/development-api-140","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"1876":{"id":"/docs/development-api-141","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"载荷","locale":"zh-CN"},"1877":{"id":"/docs/development-api-142","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"发布者与频率","locale":"zh-CN"},"1878":{"id":"/docs/development-api-143","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"前端处理（`api/socket.ts`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1879":{"id":"/docs/development-api-144","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`job_updated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1880":{"id":"/docs/development-api-145","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`job: Job`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1881":{"id":"/docs/development-api-146","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"任务服务；状态变化立即发，进度节流到每任务每秒 4 次（`PROGRESS_INTERVAL = 0.25`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1882":{"id":"/docs/development-api-147","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"写入 jobs store 和 `keys.job(id)`；结束时使相关列表失效","locale":"zh-CN"},"1883":{"id":"/docs/development-api-148","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#事件与载荷","content":"`job_log`","local