re","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**核心层不导入框架，也不直接导入 torch。** 它对引擎的 51 处导入全部写在函数内部。结果是 `rvc-next version`、`config`、`--help` 这类命令不付出加载 torch 的代价，第二个测试守着这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`sounddevice` 和 `pymss` 被关在各自的目录里**，设备访问和分离库的变动不会扩散。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`protocol` 只用标准库**，因为它被两侧共享：服务端和 worker 子进程都要能导入它而不带上对方的依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#分层规则及其测试","content":"**`api` 和 `cli` 从不导入 `engine`。** 唯一的跨端导入是 `cli` 的 `webui` 命令在函数内导入 `rvc_next.api.app.create_app` 来启动服务器，规则表为此允许 `cli → api` 和 `uvicorn`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个操作一个核心方法","content":"每个操作在核心层恰好有一个方法，接收并返回 `Record` 模型（`core/record.py`）。路由和命令只做三件事：解析输入、调用这个方法、整理输出。以转换为例，`api/routers/convert.py` 的路由体只是检查服务器路径的访问权限、拒绝只属于命令行的字段，然后 `return services.conversion.convert(body)`；CLI 的 `convert` 命令构造同一个 `ConvertRequest`，调用同一个方法（`foreground=True`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个操作一个核心方法","content":"所以 API 返回的 JSON 和 CLI 的 `--json` 输出形状完全相同：`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 里的 `test_model_json_matches_api_shape` 直接比较 `rvc-next model list --json` 与 `GET /api/v1/models` 的结果。`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`，带默认值的字段在输出模式中标为必填，生成的 TypeScript 类型因此与服务器实际发送的内容一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2011":{"id