进程模型","content":"它拥有音频设备和实时线程，要与服务端的事件循环、GIL 竞争和可能的崩溃隔离开","locale":"zh-CN"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-126","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#进程模型","content":"设备枚举","locale":"zh-CN"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#进程模型","content":"短命子进程 `workers.devices`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#进程模型","content":"在一个已有流打开的进程里重新枚举 PortAudio 会干扰它；原版为了刷新设备列表要调用私有的 `sd._terminate()` 并停掉转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"`workers.train`、`workers.separate` 和 `workers.devices` 遵循同一套约定，源自原版 `tools/pymss_webui.py` 的事件协议：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"核心层把请求写成一个 JSON 文件，以 `sys.executable -m <module> <request.json>` 启动 worker（`core/process.py`：自己的进程组，stdout 与 stderr 合并，`PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`）。原版的 `--pycmd` 参数因此不再需要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"worker 的入口经过 `workers/base.py` 的 `run_worker()`：它把真正的 stdout 复制出来专门写事件，再把文件描述符 1 重定向到 stderr。库函数随手 `print` 的内容因此只会变成日志文本，不会被误当作事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"事件是带前缀 `@rvc ` 的 JSON 行（`protocol/jsonl.py`），类型定义在 `protocol/messages.py`：`progress`、`step`、`log`、`metric`、`output`、`result`、`error`。没有前缀的行一律当作 `info` 日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"失败统一成 `error` 事件：`MissingAssetError` → `asset_missing`（`detail.assets`），`ModelFormatError` → `invalid_model`，显存不足 → `compute_unavailable` 且 `detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`，其余 → `internal_error`，完整堆栈作为 `error` 级日志另发。核心层用 `core/engine_errors.py` 的 `worker_error()` 把它重建为对应的领域错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"退出码：0 成功；`EXIT_CANCELLED = 130` 表示已取消（SIGTERM 也映射到它）；`EXIT_RETRY = 75` 请求在新进程中重试（DirectML 下分离先试 fp16，失败再用 fp32）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"取消即杀掉整个进程树（`kill_process_tree`，移植自原版 `tools/process_utils.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-136","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#worker-协议","content":"`workers.live` 例外：它长驻，需要双向通信，所以走 `multiprocessing.connection`。核心层的 `LiveSupervisor` 开一个带随机 authkey 的 `Listener`，把地址写进请求文件；之后双方交换 `protocol/live.py` 中定义的 JSON 消息（`Start`、`UpdateVoice`、`SetDevices`……以及 `State`、`Stats`、`DeviceLost`、`Log`）。详见核心服务与引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-137","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"以网页上点\"转换\"为例：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-138","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"要点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-139","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"REST 是事实来源，socket 只做服务端到客户端的推送；客户端重连后会重新拉取活动任务、Live 状态和可见列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-140","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"任务请求以 JSON 存进数据库，`JobSpec` 由按 `kind` 注册的工厂从请求重建，所以服务重启后**重试**依然可行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-141","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#一个请求的路径","content":"路由在请求进入时就完成校验（例如缺少 RMVPE 时立即返回 409 `asset_missing`，界面就地提供下载），而不是让任务排队后才失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-142","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`core/errors.py` 是全部错误词汇。每个类携带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`，两端机械地翻译：API 把任何 `RvcNextError` 变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`（`api/errors.py`），CLI 把它变成退出码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-143","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-144","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-145","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"HTTP","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-146","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-147","page_id":"/docs/development-arch