N"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-186","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"8","locale":"zh-CN"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-187","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"音频设备缺失、被占用或拒绝该格式；`detail.reason` 为 `missing` / `busy` / `format` / `permission`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-188","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`ComputeError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-189","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`compute_unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-190","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"503","locale":"zh-CN"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-191","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"9","locale":"zh-CN"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-192","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"GPU 不可用或显存耗尽（`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-193","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`RvcNextError`（基类）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-194","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`internal_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-195","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"500","locale":"zh-CN"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-196","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-197","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"其他","locale":"zh-CN"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-198","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"此外，API 层自己定义了 `NotLocalError`（`not_local`，403），用于\"在资源管理器中显示\"这类只对本机浏览器有意义的操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-199","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"错误从三个方向汇入这张表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-200","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"**引擎异常**（`engine/errors.py`：`MissingAssetError`、`ModelFormatError`、`AudioError`、`Cancelled`）由 `core/engine_errors.py` 的 `map_engine_error()` 转换；引擎永远不导入核心层。显存不足由 `engine/runtime.is_oom()` 识别（`torch.OutOfMemoryError`、错误码为 2 的 `AcceleratorError`、MPS / DirectML 的错误消息）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-201","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"**worker 的 `error` 事件**由 `worker_error()` 重建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-202","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"**Live worker** 的 `State.error` 也使用同样的 `code`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-203","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"`core/settings/models.py` 是一棵 `Record` 树，根为 `Settings`，分组为 `server`、`paths`、`compute`、`downloads`、`convert`、`separation`、`training`、`live`。`SettingsService` 拥有数据目录中的 `settings.toml`，按以下优先级合并（后者覆盖前者）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-204","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"环境变量用 `__` 分隔层级，例如 `RVC_NEXT_SERVER__PORT=8000`、`RVC_NEXT_COMPUTE__DEVICE=cpu`；值能按 JSON 解析就按 JSON，否则作为字符串，`null` / `none` 表示空。环境变量和 overrides 从不写回文件。`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 不是设置项，它决定数据目录本身。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-205","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"`update()` 深度合并补丁、校验、原子写入（先写 `.toml.tmp` 再替换），然后通知监听者，长驻服务因此不用重启就能跟上设置变化。TOML 没有 null，保存时剔除值为 `None` 的键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-206","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"`config set` 和 API 的 `PATCH /settings` 共用同一套点号路径逻辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-207","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"对外的 `SettingsView` 不含访问令牌，只给出 `access_token_configured: bool`；`env_overrides` 列出被环境变量固定的名字，界面据此提示\"此项由环境变量设定\"。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-208","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"目录类设置为空表示\"在数据目录内\"：`SettingsService.models_dir`、`experiments_dir`、`outputs_dir`、`assets_dir` 负责解析。`paths.assets_dir` 可以直接指向一个原版 RVC 的 `assets/` 目录，避免重复下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-209","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#设置","content":"`live` 组（设备、流参数、上次的音色与参数）放在设置而不是客户端状态里，因为设备属于服务器所在的机器，CLI 的 `live run` 也要读同样的值。纯界面偏好（主题、语言、上次的页面）则是客户端状态。各分组字段的含义见配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-210","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"`core/events/models.py` 定义 `EventBase(Record)`，每个子类用类属性 `__event_name__` 命名；`EventBase.get_events()` 收集所有具体子类，API 把它们的 JSON 模式写进 OpenAPI，前端的事件类型因此也是生成的。现有事件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-211","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added`、`outputs_removed`、`models_changed`、`presets_changed`、`assets_changed`、`experiment_changed`、`train_metrics`、`live_state`、`live_stats`、`devices_changed`、`compute_changed`、`settings_changed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-212","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"约定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-213","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"**事件携带快照**，而不是正在被工作线程修改的活对象：`job_updated` 带的是整个 `Job` 的副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-214","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"**在源头节流**：任务进度每个任务每秒至多 4 次，日志成批发送（每批至多 50 行，界面再按字节偏移经 REST 补齐）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-215","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"`LocalEventBus` 在**发布者的线程上同步**调用处理器，处理器异常只记日志不传播。需要在别处运行的订阅者自己转交：`api/sockets.py` 的 `SocketBridge` 用 `loop.call_soon_threadsafe` 把事件放进 asyncio 队列，再由一个任务 `sio.emit(event.__event_name__, event.model_dump(mode=\"json\"))`。CLI 的进度条（`cli/progress.py`）订阅的是同一批事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-216","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#事件","content":"载荷细节见 API 与事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-217","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据库","content":"`core/db/database.py`：一个共享的 `sqlite3` 连接，外加 `RLock`；WAL 模式、外键开启、`synchronous=NORMAL`、`busy_timeout=5000`（服务器写入时 CLI 也会读同一个文件，例如 `rvc-next jobs list` 能看到正在运行的服务器的任务）。迁移是 `MIGRATIONS` 列表中的 SQL 脚本，**只追加、不修改已发布的条目**，`PRAGMA user_version` 记录执行到第几条。目前有两条：第 1 条建表 `voice_models`、`presets`、`jobs`、`outputs`、`audio_files`、`client_state`；第 2 条给 `voice_models` 加 `catalog_id`（标记从演示音色目录下载的音色）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-218","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据库","content":"数据库里的内容分两类：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-219","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据库","content":"**缓存**：`voice_models` 可以由 `models/` 目录和旧版 RVC 安装目录完整重建（`models.rescan()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-220","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据库","content":"**记录**：任务历史和输出的来源信息（输入、音色、参数）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-221","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据库","content":"删除数据库损失的是任务历史、输出来源、自定义预设（默认预设会重建）和界面偏好的服务器端副本；音色库会从磁盘重建。实验、底模、分离模型和未分配的索引根本不在数据库里：它们是带 JSON 附属文件的目录，每次列出时扫描，所以不会与磁盘上的文件不一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-222","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录","content":"`core/paths.py` 的 `default_data_dir()` 依次取 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`、Windows 的 `%APPDATA%\\rvc-next`、macOS 的 `~/Library/Application Support/rvc-next`、其他平台的 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/rvc-next`（默认 `~/.local/share/rvc-next`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-223","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#数据目录","content":"`server.json` 还有一个用途：启动时 `JobService` 会把仍处于活动状态的任务标为 `interrupted`，但如果 `server.json` 表明另一个服务器正在使用这个数据目录，就跳过这一步，以免把别人的任务误判为中断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/development-assets","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"page","content":"资源与模型仓库","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets","locale":"zh-CN"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-0","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets","content":"「资源」（asset）指 RVC Next 运行时需要、但不随 Python 包分发的模型文件：HuBERT、RMVPE（及其 ONNX 版）、FCPE、CREPE、训练底模和人声分离权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-1","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets#资源目录-catalogjson","content":"资源目录 `catalog.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-2","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets#现有资源","content":"现有资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-3","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets#两个下载仓库","content":"两个下载仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-4","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets#rvc-model-的布局","content":"rvc-model 的布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-5","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-assets