163","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"类别","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-164","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-165","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-166","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"示例音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-167","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"`kikiV1`、`keruanV1`、`guanguanV1`（带索引）、`youzhanv2-xi`、`zhanzhanv2-xi`（带索引）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-168","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"原样上传到 rvc-model 的 `voices/<name>/`，进入 `catalog.json` 的 `voices`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-169","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"没有对应音色的索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-170","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"`anchun`、`keqing`、`mi-test`、`mi-test-v1`、`test`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-171","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用：它们的音色从未发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-172","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"被取代或重复的权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-173","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"旧版 `rmvpe.pt`（2023-07 之前的权重）；`model_bs_roformer_ep_317` 的另一份存档","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-174","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用：仓库自身的文件取代了它们","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-175","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不是模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-176","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`、`hubert_inputs.pth`（导出 ONNX 用的样例输入）、`logs/mute/*.spec.pt`（训练加载器生成的频谱缓存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-177","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"不用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-178","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"包内其余所有模型文件都与仓库里的某个文件逐字节相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-179","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"为什么不直接从发行包下载：这些 `.7z` 是固实压缩，音色与其他资源共享 1.3–1.9 GB 的压缩块，取一个文件至少要下载并解压它所在的整个块。这正是 rvc-model 存在的主要理由之一。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-180","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#只存在于官方发行包中的模型","content":"仓库中其余未进入目录的文件及原因：`mute.zip`（内容相同的静音样本已作为包数据随包分发，见 `engine/train/data/mute/`）；`hubert_base.pt`（fairseq 检查点，RVC Next 用 transformers 格式）；`pretrained_v0/`（早期 v1 生成器，没有任何地方选择它们）；`uvr5_weights/` 等（UVR5 分离，所移植的分支已换成 PyMSS）；`weights/白菜357k.pt`（RVC 之前的模型格式，无法加载）；`ffmpeg.exe`/`ffprobe.exe`（RVC Next 用 PyAV 解码）；`RVCRealtime-Win64VST.zip`（实时 VST 插件，与将来的 VST 适配相关）；以及早期版本的代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-181","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"把文件上传到 rvc-model 的对应类别目录，并更新它的 `manifest.json`（大小、SHA-256、上游路径）。若官方仓库也有该文件，记下它在官方仓库里的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-182","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"在 `catalog.json` 的 `assets` 中新增或修改条目：`path` 用原版 `assets/` 布局下的相对路径；`sources` 至少列出一个仓库；`size` 与 `sha256` 必须与 manifest 一致——下载以大小判断完成、以哈希判断损坏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-183","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"人声分离权重还要同步 `engine/separate/presets.py` 的 `MODELS`（检查点名、YAML 名、大小、SHA-256、主副音轨）、`core/separation/presets.json` 中预设的 `assets`，并把 YAML 放进 `engine/separate/configs/`。`tests/engine/test_separate_presets.py` 检查预设与 `MODELS` 的一致性，但不检查 `MODELS` 与 `catalog.json` 的大小和哈希是否相同，需要人工核对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-184","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"新资源若是某个功能的前提，在相应服务的 `require()` 调用里加上它的 id（例如 `ConversionService.required_assets()`、`LiveService._require_assets()`、`TrainingService._preflight()`），界面会自动通过 `AssetGate` 提供下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-185","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"示例音色加在 `voices` 中，`id` 一经发布不要再改：已下载音色靠它与目录条目对应。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/development-assets-186","page_id":"/docs/development-assets","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-assets#新增或更新资源","content":"运行 `python scripts/dev.py check`。`tests/core/test_assets.py` 用模拟传输覆盖续传、校验、仓库回退、删除与示例音色导入。","lo