SON。本页讲它是怎样组织的，以及新增命令时要遵守的规则。每个命令的选项说明见命令参考，设置与环境变量见配置与环境变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-10","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2390":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-11","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"职责","locale":"zh-CN"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-12","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/app.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-13","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`get_app()` 注册全部命令和命令组；`main()` 运行它并统一处理错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-14","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/factory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-15","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`typer_factory()` 与自定义的 Typer 类；对 Typer 私有模块 `typer._click` 的导入只出现在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-16","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/commands/*.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-17","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"命令函数，都是普通函数，不带装饰器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-18","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`cli/output.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-19","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#结构","content":"`open_services()`、`print_json()`、`print_table()`、`human_size()` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-20","