pe":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#集中注册","content":"`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE` 是这棵树的快照，`test_command_tree` 逐层比较。增删命令而不更新快照，测试就会失败，这是有意的：命令行是对外接口，改动它应当是显式的决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-29","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`typer_factory(help)` 让每个应用和命令组拥有相同的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-30","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-31","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-32","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`add_completion=True`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-33","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"支持 shell 补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-34","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`no_args_is_help=True`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-35","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"不带参数运行应用或命令组时显示帮助","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-36","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`cls=AlphabeticalMixedGroup`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-37","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"命令组带 `--debug`，并按字母顺序列出子命令和子组","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-38","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`rich_markup_mode=None`、`rich_help_panel=None`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-39","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"帮助文字是纯文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-40","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`pretty_exceptions_enable=False`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-41","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"异常交给 `main()` 处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-42","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`--debug` 在任何层级都可用（`rvc-next --debug version`、`rvc-next model --debug list`、`rvc-next model index --debug --help`），而没有任何命令函数声明 `debug` 参数。它由三部分实现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-43","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`_make_debug_option()` 构造一个 `is_eager=True`、`expose_value=False` 的标志选项，回调把 `rvc_next` 日志器设为 `DEBUG`。急切求值保证它在命令体之前生效；不暴露值保证它不会传给命令函数；`ctx.resilient_parsing`（shell 补全时）为真时回调什么也不做。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-44","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`DebugTyperCommand` 和 `AlphabeticalMixedGroup` 在 `__init__` 里把这个选项插到参数表最前面（已有则不重复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-45","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`DebugOptionTyper.command()` 默认使用 `DebugTyperCommand`；命令组的类则由工厂的 `cls=` 指定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-46","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#工厂与自定义类","content":"`test_debug_everywhere` 覆盖这三种位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-47","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"领域错误（`core/errors.py`）各自带有 `exit_code`，完整对照表见整体架构。命令行在两个地方把它们变成退出码：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-48","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"**`DebugTyperCommand.invoke()`** 捕获 `RvcNextError`，记录 `e.message`，若 `detail.assets` 非空再提示 `Install with: rvc-next assets download <ids>`，然后 `raise typer.Exit(e.exit_code)`。放在命令类里而不只放在 `main()` 里，是因为测试用 `typer.testing.CliRunner` 直接调用 Click 命令、不经过 `main()`；这样测试看到的退出码与用户看到的一致（`test_missing_asset_exit_code` 断言缺少资源时退出码为 7，`model info nope` 为 2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-49","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"**`main()`** 兜底：`typer.Exit` 原样退出，`Abort` 为 1，`ClickException` 显示后用其退出码（参数错误为 2），`RvcNextError` 用其退出码，`KeyboardInterrupt` 为 130，其他异常打印堆栈后为 1。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-50","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"前台任务失败时，错误不是以异常形式出现的，而是记录在 `Job.error` 里。`cli/progress.py` 的 `finish(job)` 负责收尾：`completed` 直接返回；`cancelled` 以 130 退出；失败时打印消息，按 `job.error.code` 找到对应错误类的退出码退出（`busy` 为 3，`invalid_model` 为 4）。所以 `rvc-next convert` 缺少 RMVPE 时，无论错误出在提交前的校验还是任务执行中，退出码都是 7。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-51","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#错误与退出码","content":"少数命令自行决定退出码，都与领域错误的约定一致：`webui` 的证书文件不存在时退出 4、端口不可用时退出 3；`model import` 的导入计划有歧义时打印计划并退出 3；`live check` / `live run` 遇到设备问题时退出 8。只属于命令行的参数校验用 `typer.BadParameter`（退出码 2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-52","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#输出--json-等于-api-的-json","content":"每个列出或展示数据的命令都有 `--json`。`print_json()` 用 `model_dump(mode=\"json\")` 序列化 `Record`（列表和字典递归处理，`Path` 转字符串），所以输出与 API 返回的 JSON 完全相同。这不是靠约定维持的：命令和路由调用的是同一个核心方法，返回同一个 `Record`。`test_model_json_matches_api_shape` 用 `rvc-next model list --json` 与 `GET /api/v1/models` 的结果直接比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-53","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#输出--json-等于-api-的-json","content":"没有 `--json` 时用 `print_table()` 画 Rich 表格。日志（包括错误消息）经 `rvc_next/logger.py` 的 `RichHandler` 写到 **stderr**，数据写到 **stdout**，所以 `rvc-next model list --json | jq` 不会被日志打断。日志级别默认 `INFO`，可用 `RVC_NEXT_LOG_LEVEL` 或 `--debug` 调整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-54","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"命令通过 `with open_services() as services:` 取得服务。它调用 `build_services()` 时**不启动后台线程**：没有调度器、没有空闲卸载、不监管 Live worker。命令结束时服务被关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-55","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"长操作（转换、分离、训练、下载、合并、提取、建索引）在核心层都是任务。命令行用 `foreground=True` 调用核心方法，后者改走 `JobService.run_now()`：任务照样写入数据库、照样发布事件，但在**调用线程上**执行，Ctrl+C 会设置取消标志、取消引擎令牌并杀掉 worker 子进程，任务以 `cancelled` 结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-56","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"`job_progress(services)` 订阅与 Web UI 相同的 `job_updated` / `job_log` 事件，在 stderr 上画一个临时的 Rich 进度条（\"标题 · 当前步骤\"），并把以 `error` 或 `Traceback` 开头的日志行标红打印。stderr 不是终端或使用了 `--json` 时不画进度条。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-57","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"几个命令的特别之处：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-58","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`jobs list` / `jobs show`** 读的是数据目录里共享的数据库，所以能看到一个正在运行的服务器的任务；SQLite 的 WAL 与 `busy_timeout` 让这种并发读安全。`jobs show --log` 按字节偏移分段读取任务日志。取消任务只能在 Web UI 中，或对前台命令按 Ctrl+C。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-59","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`live run`** 在前台启动同一个 Live worker，每秒刷新四次一行状态（状态、负载 `infer_ms_p95 / block_ms`、延迟、电平），直到 Ctrl+C、`--seconds` 到时或出错。设备参数 `--input`、`--output`、`--monitor` 接受设备 id、名称或 `default`，先从新枚举的设备列表中解析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-60","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#服务与前台任务","content":"**`webui`** 启动服务器，步骤见下文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-61","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#音色参数","content":"音色参数可以写成音色 id、名称，或者 `.pth` 文件路径。给路径时，`convert` 用 `services.models.temporary()` 把它注册为一个**临时音色**（`tmp-…`，不出现在列表里），可以用 `--index` 附上索引；参数则从 `convert.default_params` 起步，而不是从音色的默认预设起步。`live run` 只接受库中的音色（`resolve(..., allow_path=False)`）：`LiveConfig` 以音色 id 指定音色，启动后这个 id 会作为 `live.last_voice` 存进设置，供下一次不带 `--voice` 的 `live run` 和 Web UI 恢复会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-62","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#音色参数","content":"`cli/params.py` 的 `ParamOptions` 定义了 `--speaker`、`--pitch`、`--formant`、`--f0`、`--index-rate`、`--protect`、`--rms-mix`、`--unvoiced`，范围与 `VoiceParamsModel` 一致。`build_params(base, **overrides)` 只把用户给出的选项盖在 `base`（音色的默认预设、`--preset` 指定的预设，或 Live 上次的参数）上，再交给 `VoiceParamsModel` 校验。这与 Web UI 的行为相同：选中一个音色就加载它的默认预设，所以同一个音色在转换和实时变声里听起来一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-63","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`cli/commands/webui.py` 是命令行唯一导入 API 层的地方（在函数内导入）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-64","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`--data-dir` 设置 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`，以便之后启动的 worker 子进程使用同一个数据目录；然后 `build_services(start_background=True)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-65","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"主机不是回环地址时发出警告（不要求访问令牌）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-66","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`bind_first_free_port(host, port, strict=...)` **先绑定套接字**，端口被占用时向上尝试（`--strict-port` 时直接失败，退出码 3）；实际端口与请求的不同时给出警告。绑定而不是试连接，是为了消除\"检查\"与\"真正绑定\"之间的空隙，也能识别 Windows 上被系统保留的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-67","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"用 `create_app(services, bound_host=..., bound_port=...)` 建应用，写 `server.json`，在 stdout 打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=http://…`（供启动器等程序读取），需要时 0.8 秒后打开浏览器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-68","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` 在刚才绑定的套接字上服务；退出时删除 `server.json` 并关闭服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-69","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#webui-命令","content":"详见 API 与事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-70","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**先有核心方法。** 命令要做的事如果核心层还没有对应的方法，先在相应服务里加一个，接收和返回 `Record` 模型。命令里不放业务逻辑，否则 API 和 Web UI 就得各写一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-71","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**在 `cli/commands/` 里写一个普通函数**，参数用 `Annotated[..., typer.Option(...)]` / `typer.Argument(...)` 声明，不加装饰器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-72","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**必填选项不写默认值**，并把这类参数排在有默认值的参数前面（Python 要求如此）。不要写 `= ...`：Typer 把没有默认值的参数视为必填，`...` 只是旧写法，而且它的类型与标注不符，ty 会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-73","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"列出或展示数据的命令提供 `--json`，并直接打印核心方法返回的 `Record`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-74","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"长操作调用核心方法时传 `foreground=True`，用 `with job_progress(services, enabled=not json_output):` 包住，结束后调用 `finish(job)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-75","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"领域错误直接抛出即可，`DebugTyperCommand` 会把它们变成退出码；只有命令行才有的参数问题用 `typer.BadParameter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-76","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**在 `cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 中注册**，给出 `name` 和 `help`；需要新命令组时用 `typer_factory(help=...)` 创建并 `add_typer`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-77","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"**更新 `tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE`**，并为命令写测试（用 `runner` fixture，它把数据目录、tiny 资源目录和 CPU 设备设在环境变量里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-78","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"确认导入 `rvc_next.cli.app` 仍然不会加载 torch 或 FastAPI（`tests/test_architecture.py` 会检查）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/development-cli-79","page_id":"/docs/development-cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-cli#新增一个命令","content":"在用户文档的命令参考中补上这个命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/development-core","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"page","content":"核心服务","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core","locale":"zh-CN"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/development-core-0","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core","content":"核心层（rvcnext/core/）是 RVC Next 的全部业务逻辑：任务调度、显存管理、资源下载、音色库与导入、转换、人声分离、训练、实时变声，以及它们共用的设置、事件和数据库。API 与命令行都只是它的薄外壳，引擎（rvcnext/engine/）只被它以函数调用的方式使用，且只在函数内部惰性导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/development-core-1","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#服务一览","content":"服务一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/development-core-2","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2463":{"id":"/docs/development-core-3","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"注册与请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/development-core-4","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#状态与调度","content":"状态与调度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2465":{"id":"/docs/development-core-5","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#两种运行器","content":"两种运行器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2466":{"id":"/docs/development-core-6","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#失败","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/development-core-7","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"进度、日志与持久化","locale":"zh-CN"},"2468":{"id":"/docs/development-core-8","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#重启与历史","content":"重启与历史","locale":"zh-CN"},"2469":{"id":"/docs/development-core-9","page_id":"/docs/development-core","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-core#显存