h-CN"},"2581":{"id":"/docs/development-core-121","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#服务一览","content":"几处服务彼此需要对方（音色库要建默认预设，资源服务要把下载的示例音色放进音色库，导入会话要写底模和分离模型），构造函数无法表达环形依赖，所以 `build_services()` 在构造后用属性补上：`models.presets`、`assets.models`、`models.imports`、`imports.base`、`imports.separation`、`training.base`、`separation.library`。新增此类依赖时沿用这一做法，不要在构造函数里互相传递。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2582":{"id":"/docs/development-core-122","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#服务一览","content":"`build_services()` 最后调用 `models.rescan()`。`start_background=True`（服务器）还会清理过期上传（`audio.cleanup()`）、启动空闲卸载线程（`compute.start()`）和任务调度线程（`jobs.start()`）；命令行不启动它们，而是用 `jobs.run_now()` 在前台跑一个任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2583":{"id":"/docs/development-core-123","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#任务","content":"每个耗时操作都是一个任务（`core/jobs/`）：一张卡片、一个取消按钮、一份日志，在 Web UI、API 和命令行里一致。这取代了原版各标签页各自的进度显示和全局 `TRAIN_TASK` 锁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2584":{"id":"/docs/development-core-124","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"某种任务（kind）向 `JobService.register(kind, factory)` 注册一个工厂：`request dict → JobSpec(title, run, resources, steps, priority)`。请求本身（纯 JSON）存入 `jobs.request` 列，所以服务器重启之后 **Retry** 仍能用同一请求重新提交（`retry()` 即 `submit(job.kind, job.request)`）。工厂里应当重新校验请求，因为重试时音色或文件可能已经变了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2585":{"id":"/docs/development-core-125","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"kind","locale":"zh-CN"},"2586":{"id":"/docs/development-core-126","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"注册者","locale":"zh-CN"},"2587":{"id":"/docs/development-core-127","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2588":{