core#注册与请求","content":"`download`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2610":{"id":"/docs/development-core-150","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`AssetService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2611":{"id":"/docs/development-core-151","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`io`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2612":{"id":"/docs/development-core-152","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"进程内（httpx）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/development-core-153","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`merge`、`extract`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/development-core-154","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`VoiceModelService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/development-core-155","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"`cpu`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/development-core-156","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"进程内","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/development-core-157","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#注册与请求","content":"导入不是任务：导入提交是同步的（见下文「导入会话」一节）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/development-core-158","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#状态与调度","content":"调度线程 `_schedule_loop()` 每秒或被 `notify()` 唤醒时检查一遍：按 `(-priority, created_at)` 排序（预览转换的 `priority` 为 `PREVIEW_PRIORITY = 10`，所以试听总是插队），对每个排队任务检查它声明的每种资源：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/development-core-159","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#状态与调度","content":"**容量**：`gpu` 为 `compute.gpu_jobs`（默认 1），`cpu` 为 CPU 核数的一半，`io` 为 4。资源满时任务进入 `waiting`，`waiting_for` 为 `gpu` 或 `cpu`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/development-core-160","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#状态与调度","content":"**GPU 租约**：需要 `gpu` 的任务还要 `compute.try_acquire(\"jobs\")`。租约持有者是 `jobs` 时，多个 GPU 任务可以共用；只有实时变声（持有者 `live`）会把它们挡在外面。被实时变声挡住的任务 `can_run_anyway = True`，界面提供 **仍然运行**（`run_anyway()`）：绕过租约启动，代价是实时变声可能出现爆音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/development-core-161","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#状态与调度","content":"最后一个 GPU 任务结束时释放租约（`_thread_main` 的 `finally`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/development-core-162","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#两种运行器","content":"**进程内**：`run(ctx)` 在一个独立线程上执行，通过 `JobContext` 报告进度（`progress`）、步骤（`step`、`add_steps`）、日志（`log`）和下载字节数（`transfer`），用 `check_cancel()` 或 `cancel_token()`（一个跟随任务取消的引擎 `CancelToken`）检查取消。转换在两个分块之间检查取消。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/development-core-163","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#两种运行器","content":"**子进程**：`ctx.run_worker(module, request, on_event=None, env=None)` 把请求写成 `jobs/<job id>.<随机 id>.request.json`，用当前解释器执行 `python -m <module> <request.json>`（`core/process.py:worker_command`，原版的 `--pycmd` 不再需要），逐行解析标准输出上的 JSON 事件（`rvc_next/protocol/messages.py`）。`progress`/`step` 默认直接作用于任务，传入 `on_event` 时由调用方处理（分离和训练要把子进程的进度映射到整个任务的区间）；`log` 总是写入任务日志；`result` 成为返回值；`error` 事件经 `core/engine_errors.py:worker_error()` 还原成对应的领域错误；无 `error` 事件的非零退出码变成 `WorkerExit`。取消就是在后台线程里 `kill_process_tree()`（Windows 用 `taskkill /t /f`，其他平台对新会话的进程组先 `SIGTERM` 后 `SIGKILL`），因为 PyMSS 和训练循环都没有可靠的内部取消点，杀进程也能把显存完整归还。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/development-core-164","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#两种运行器","content":"子进程总是用 `start_process()` 启动：独立进程组、`stdin` 关闭、`stderr` 合并进 `stdout`、`PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1`、`PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/development-core-165","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#两种运行器","content":"命令行调用 `run_now()`：在当前线程直接执行，Ctrl+C 触发取消并杀掉子进程树，任务记为 `cancelled`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/development-core-166","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#失败","content":"`_execute()` 用 `map_engine_error()` 把引擎异常（`MissingAssetError`、`ModelFormatError`、`AudioError`、显存不足、CUDA 错误）映射成领域错误。未能映射的异常连同 traceback 写入任务日志——traceback 只进日志，从不进主界面。显存不足（`ComputeError`，`detail.reason == \"out_of_memory\"`）时额外写一行说明并调用 `compute.release_after_oom()`，见下文「显存」一节。不会自动重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/development-core-167","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2628":{"id":"/docs/development-core-168","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"节流","locale":"zh-CN"},"2629":{"id":"/docs/development-core-169","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"2630":{"id":"/docs/development-core-170","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"`job_updated` 进度事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2631":{"id":"/docs/development-core-171","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"每任务每秒最多 4 次（`PROGRESS_INTERVAL = 0.25`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2632":{"id":"/docs/development-core-172","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"事件携带整个 `Job` 快照，不能每块音频都发","locale":"zh-CN"},"2633":{"id":"/docs/development-core-173","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"进度写库","locale":"zh-CN"},"2634":{"id":"/docs/development-core-174","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"每 2 秒（`DB_PROGRESS_INTERVAL`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2635":{"id":"/docs/development-core-175","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"SQLite 写入有代价，进度只是展示用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2636":{"id":"/docs/development-core-176","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"状态与步骤变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"2637":{"id":"/docs/development-core-177","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"立即写库并发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"2638":{"id":"/docs/development-core-178","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"这些是用户必须看到的转折","locale":"zh-CN"},"2639":{"id":"/docs/development-core-179","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"`job_log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2640":{"id":"/docs/development-core-180","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"0.25 秒一批，每批最多 50 行（`MAX_LOG_EVENT_LINES`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2641":{"id":"/docs/development-core-181","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"事件只是「有新日志」的提示，完整内容走 REST","locale":"zh-CN"},"2642":{"id":"/docs/development-core-182","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"`transfer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2643":{"id":"/docs/development-core-183","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"与进度同节流","locale":"zh-CN"},"2644":{"id":"/docs/development-core-184","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"2645":{"id":"/docs/development-core-185","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"日志写在 `jobs/<id>.log`。`read_log(job_id, offset, limit_bytes=256 KiB)` 按**字节偏移**读取，读满时截到最后一个换行，返回 `next_offset`；`job_log` 事件也带 `offset`，客户端据此判断是否漏了行再去补读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2646":{"id":"/docs/development-core-186","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#进度日志与持久化","content":"`Job.transfer`（`Transfer`：`done_bytes`、`total_bytes`、`bytes_per_second`、`eta_seconds`）由 `ctx.transfer(done, total)` 计算：保留最近 5 秒（`TRANSFER_WINDOW`）的采样点求速度，至少 0.5 秒的跨度才给出速度；字节数倒退（某个文件从头重下）时清空采样窗口。任务结束时 `transfer` 置空。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2647":{"id":"/docs/development-core-187","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#重启与历史","content":"`JobService` 构造时调用 `_mark_interrupted()`：把所有仍处于 `queued`/`waiting`/`running`/`cancelling` 的行改成 `interrupted`——**除非**数据目录里的 `server.json` 指向一个仍存活的进程。这一例外让命令行（例如 `rvc-next jobs list`）在服务器运行时打开同一数据库，不会把服务器正在跑的任务误标为中断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2648":{"id":"/docs/development-core-188","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#重启与历史","content":"`delete()` 拒绝删除活动任务；`clear_finished()` 删除所有已结束任务的行和日志（不删输出文件），并发布 `jobs_cleared`。`list_jobs()` 用 `created_at|id` 游标分页，`state` 可取 `active`、`finished` 或具体状态；活动任务以内存中的最新快照替换数据库行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2649":{"id":"/docs/development-core-189","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"`ComputeService`（`core/compute/service.py`）持有服务器（或一条命令）自己的引擎运行时，并协调所有占用 GPU 的东西。显存管理的思路来自 ComfyUI 的 `comfy/model_management.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2650":{"id":"/docs/development-core-190","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**运行时惰性创建。** `runtime()` 第一次被调用时才构造 `engine.runtime.Runtime`（这时才导入 torch），所以 `version`、`config` 等命令永远不碰 torch。键为 `(compute.device, compute.precision, compute.cuda_graph_offline, assets_dir)`；设置变化导致键变化时，监听器释放旧运行时，下次使用时重建。运行时缓存 HuBERT、F0 模型、最近 3 个音色和索引（见 引擎）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2651":{"id":"/docs/development-core-191","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**GPU 租约。** 同一时刻只有一个持有者：`jobs`（所有并发 GPU 任务共享）或 `live`。`acquire_live()` 立即夺取租约——已在运行的 GPU 任务保留其显存继续跑，新任务等待；这是「实时变声优先」的落实方式，因为实时变声卡顿是用户最先注意到的问题。实时变声停止、出错或 worker 退出时释放租约并 `jobs.notify()` 唤醒调度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2652":{"id":"/docs/development-core-192","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**`MemoryHolder`。** 服务器运行时之外占用显存或正在使用模型的东西各注册一个：任务服务注册 `jobs`（`busy` = 有任何排队或运行中的任务），实时变声注册 `live`（`busy` = 会话处于活动状态或 `stopping`；`cached` = live worker 上次状态消息里报告的已加载模型；`release` = 向空闲的 worker 发送 `P.ReleaseMemory`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2653":{"id":"/docs/development-core-193","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**释放显存**（`release()`，`POST /compute/release`）：只要 `busy()` 为空就允许——不只是服务器缓存里有模型时，因为空闲的 live worker 在它自己的进程里仍持有 HuBERT、音色和 F0 模型。有任何持有者忙时抛 `ConflictError`（409，`detail.reason = \"busy\"`，`detail.busy` 列出原因），因为正在用的模型释放了也只会被立刻重新加载。卸载即丢弃缓存、`gc.collect()`，再 `synchronize`、`empty_cache`、`ipc_collect`（`engine/runtime.soft_empty_cache`）。这取代了原版的「卸载音色省显存」按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2654":{"id":"/docs/development-core-194","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**显存不足。** `engine/runtime.is_oom` 识别 `torch.OutOfMemoryError`、错误码 2 的 `AcceleratorError` 以及 MPS/DirectML 的报错文本，统一成 `compute_unavailable`、`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`。无论来自进程内任务、worker 的 `error` 事件还是 live worker 的错误状态，核心层都调用 `release_after_oom()`：卸载每个**未在使用**的模型（正在运行的任务通过自身引用保留其模型，结束后才释放；运行中的实时变声保留自己的），让重试从空 GPU 开始。live worker 会先卸载它自己的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2655":{"id":"/docs/development-core-195","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**空闲卸载。** `start()` 起一个线程，每 30 秒调用 `Runtime.release_idle(compute.unload_after_minutes × 60)`（默认 10 分钟，0 表示不卸载）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2656":{"id":"/docs/development-core-196","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"**上报。** `usage()` 返回 `ComputeUsage`：设备、已用/总显存、缓存列表（live worker 的模型带 `live:` 前缀）、租约持有者、`busy` 和 `can_release`。`emit_usage()` 每秒最多发布一次 `compute_changed`（`force=True` 时立即发）；任务与实时变声的状态转换都会强制发布，顶栏的显存菜单据此启用或禁用「释放显存」。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2657":{"id":"/docs/development-core-197","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#显存","content":"`info()` 列出每个设备及 GPU 规则选择的精度（会导入 torch），供 `GET /compute/devices` 和 `doctor` 使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2658":{"id":"/docs/development-core-198","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#资源","content":"`AssetService`（`core/assets/service.py`）读取随包分发的 `catalog.json`，计算每个资源的状态，以 `download` 任务下载或校验，并管理示例音色。目录格式、两个下载仓库、断点续传与校验缓存详见 资源与模型仓库。这里只记录其他服务如何使用它：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2659":{"id":"/docs/development-core-199","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#资源","content":"`require(ids, what)`：任何需要资源的操作在**提交任务前**调用，缺失时抛 `AssetMissingError`（409，退出码 7），`detail.assets` 列出资源 id，`detail.size` 给出还需下载的字节数，界面的 `AssetGate` 据此原地提供下载。任务运行时会再检查一次，因为排队期间资源可能被删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2660":{"id":"/docs/development-core-200","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#资源","content":"转换与实时变声所需资源：`hubert`；有音高引导的音色再加所选音高算法的资源（`core/params.f0_assets`）：`rmvpe`（`compute.device == \"dml\"` 时为 `rmvpe-onnx`）、`fcpe`、`crepe` 或 `crepe-tiny`；pm 和 swift 不需要资源。训练前置检查见下文「训练」一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2661":{"id":"/docs/development-core-201","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色库","content":"音色（voice）是用户在各处选择的单位：一个小模型、它的索引、它的说话人和它的默认参数。`VoiceModelService`（`core/models/service.py`）管理它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2662":{"id":"/docs/development-core-202","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/`（`paths.models_dir`，默认在数据目录内）下的每种模型都是文件夹加 JSON 附属文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2663":{"id":"/docs/development-core-203","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"2664":{"id":"/docs/development-core-204","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2665":{"id":"/docs/development-core-205","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"附属文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/development-core-206","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/development-core-207","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/voices/<slug>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/development-core-208","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`model.pth`、`model.index` 或 `spkid<N>.index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/development-core-209","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`voice.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/development-core-210","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`VoiceModelService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/development-core-211","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/indexes/<id>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/development-core-212","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`model.index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/development-core-213","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`index.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2674":{"id":"/docs/development-core-214","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`IndexInbox`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2675":{"id":"/docs/development-core-215","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/base/<slug>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2676":{"id":"/docs/development-core-216","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`G.pth`、可选 `D.pth`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2677":{"id":"/docs/development-core-217","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`base.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2678":{"id":"/docs/development-core-218","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`BaseModelService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2679":{"id":"/docs/development-core-219","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/separation/<slug>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2680":{"id":"/docs/development-core-220","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`model.<ext>`、`config.yaml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2681":{"id":"/docs/development-core-221","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`separation.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2682":{"id":"/docs/development-core-222","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`SeparationLibrary`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/development-core-223","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`models/attached-indexes/<voice>/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/development-core-224","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"为旧版或临时音色复制的索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/development-core-225","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/development-core-226","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`VoiceModelService.set_index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2687":{"id":"/docs/development-core-227","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"只有音色进数据库（`voice_models` 表），而且只是缓存：`rescan()` 从 `models/voices/` 和各旧版目录重建它，删掉对应文件已不存在的行。底模、分离模型和收件箱索引每次列出时直接扫描文件夹——没有查询需要它们进数据库，而扫描文件夹不会与文件产生偏差（AGENTS.md §8 的偏离之一）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2688":{"id":"/docs/development-core-228","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`voice.json` 记录 `name`、`description`、`tags`、`speakers`（用户命名的说话人）、`source_files`、`index_sources`（各索引导入时的原文件名，便于追溯改过名的 `.index`）、`imported_at`，以及来源字段（`catalog_id`、`merged_from`/`alpha`、`extracted_from`、`experiment`/`checkpoint`）。`.pth` 本身从不改写，所以库里的音色仍能直接拿回原版使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2689":{"id":"/docs/development-core-229","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"写入一律先写到 `.<slug>.part` 临时文件夹再整体 `rename`（`_add_to_library`），附属文件先写 `.tmp` 再 `replace`，中途失败不会留下半个音色。2026-10-04 之前的库位于 `models/<slug>/`，`rescan()` 里的 `_migrate_layout()` 会把含 `model.pth` 且不属于保留名（`RESERVED`）的文件夹逐个移到 `models/voices/` 下，id 不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2690":{"id":"/docs/development-core-230","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#磁盘布局与数据库缓存","content":"`_upsert_from_pth()` 以 `(mtime_ns, size, model_path)` 判断 `.pth` 是否变化：未变化时只更新元数据列，变化时才用引擎的 `checkpoint.summarize` 重新读取采样率、版本、音高引导、说话人和 `info`。读到的是训练检查点（G）而非小模型时拒绝，并提示先提取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2691":{"id":"/docs/development-core-231","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`location`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2692":{"id":"/docs/development-core-232","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"id 形式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/development-core-233","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/development-core-234","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`library`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/development-core-235","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`slugify(name)`，冲突时加 `-2`、`-3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/development-core-236","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"导入、下载、合并、提取、训练导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/development-core-237","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`legacy:<root id>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/development-core-238","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`legacy-<root id>-<slug>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/development-core-239","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"原版安装的 `assets/weights/*.pth`，原地读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/development-core-240","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`temporary`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2701":{"id":"/docs/development-core-241","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`tmp-<路径 sha1 前 12 位>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2702":{"id":"/docs/development-core-242","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"命令行直接给的 `.pth` 路径、训练「试听」","locale":"zh-CN"},"2703":{"id":"/docs/development-core-243","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音色-id-与位置","content":"`slugify()` 保留中日韩等文字，只把其他符号折叠成连字符。临时音色不出现在列表里；`resolve(ref)` 依次按 id、按名称（不区分大小写）、最后（命令行）按 `.pth` 路径查找。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2704":{"id":"/docs/development-core-244","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#说话人","content":"一个音色只有在 `.pth` 带 `speaker_info`（或用户命名过说话人）时才算多说话人。每个训练出的音色都有 109 行说话人嵌入，若按行数判断，所有音色都会变成多说话人（AGENTS.md §8）。`speaker_slots` 仍报告嵌入行数，用来校验 `speaker_id` 的范围。说话人名称保存在 `voice.json`（旧版音色保存在 `legacy-voices.json`），不改 `.pth`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2705":{"id":"/docs/development-core-245","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#索引","content":"每个音色每个说话人键最多一个索引：键为 `default` 或 `spk<N>`，文件名分别为 `model.index` 与 `spkid<N>.index`；再挂一个会替换旧的（不支持同键多索引，这是导入计划时的决定）。`index_for(voice, speaker_id)` 先找 `spk<N>`，再找 `default`；多说话人音色找不到对应键时不退而求其次地用别人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2706":{"id":"/docs/development-core-246","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#索引","content":"`set_index()` 接受任意文件名，但先用 `check_index_fits()` 检查：索引宽度必须与音色版本一致（256 ↔ v1，768 ↔ v2），否则抛 `ValidationError`（`detail.reason = \"version_mismatch\"`）；`ntotal == 0` 的 `trained_` 索引抛 `empty_index`。库音色得到一份复制；旧版或临时音色只记路径——若来源是上传、收件箱或导入会话（`persist`），先复制到 `models/attached-indexes/<voice>/`，因为旧版安装的文件夹永远不写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2707":{"id":"/docs/development-core-247","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#旧版目录","content":"`paths.legacy_roots` 指向原版 RVC 安装。`add_legacy_root()` 要求目录下有 `assets/`，生成 root id 后立即扫描。扫描读取 `assets/weights/*.pth`，并在第一次扫描、以及用户显式重新扫描时（只针对索引仍是建议、`suggested` 为真的音色）用 `importers.suggest_index()`——原版 `get_index_path_from_model` 的打分：在 `assets/indices` 与 `logs` 下找名字含实验名的 `added` 索引，说话人匹配、标准命名、靠前的根目录、较新的文件优先——为每个音色建议索引。建议与用户之后的修改一起存在数据目录的 `legacy-voices.json`。推理时从不猜测索引：原版每次选模型都按文件名重新打分，结果落在一个用户可能改过的文本框里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2708":{"id":"/docs/development-core-248","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#旧版目录","content":"旧版音色不能删除，只能隐藏（`hidden`）；`import_legacy_root()`（**全部导入**）把它们复制进库。`remove_legacy_root()` 只忘记该目录，不动文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2709":{"id":"/docs/development-core-249","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#合并与提取","content":"两者都是 `cpu` 任务，产物写到 `uploads/` 下的临时文件夹再经 `add_model_file()` 进库：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2710":{"id":"/docs/development-core-250","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#合并与提取","content":"`merge`：`engine.models.merge.merge_models(a, b, alpha)`，记录 `merged_from` 与 `alpha`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2711":{"id":"/docs/development-core-251","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#合并与提取","content":"`extract`：从 G 检查点提取小模型。`checkpoint` 可以是绝对路径或 `<实验名>/<文件名>`。采样率、版本、音高引导与说话人优先从检查点所在文件夹的 `experiment.json` 或原版 `config.json` 读取（`_checkpoint_context`），读不到采样率时才要求用户给出——原版要用户手填这些，填错就得到坏模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2712":{"id":"/docs/development-core-252","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#合并与提取","content":"删除库音色会把整个文件夹移到系统回收站（`send2trash`），不可用时移到数据目录的 `trash/`（`core/files.py:trash`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2713":{"id":"/docs/development-core-253","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#导入会话","content":"所有导入入口——Web UI 的拖放区、`PUT /models/imports/{sid}/files`、`POST /models/imports/{sid}/paths`、`rvc-next model import`、旧的一步式 `PUT /models/import` 与 `POST /models/import-path`——都经过同一个导入会话（`core/models/imports.py`）。设计目标：`.pth` 与 `.index` 文件名毫无关联时也能正确配对，且四种模型（音色、索引、底模、分离模型）各自独立导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2714":{"id":"/docs/development-core-254","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"会话是 `uploads/imports/<sid>/`，含 `session.json` 和 `files/<file id>/<原文件名>`；创建新会话时顺带清除 24 小时（`SESSION_TTL`）未动的旧会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2715":{"id":"/docs/development-core-255","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"上传：原始请求体流式写入 `.part`，再移入会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2716":{"id":"/docs/development-core-256","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"链接（`add_urls`，`POST /imports/{sid}/urls`）：一个 `fetch` 任务；`core/net/fetch.resolve` 把每个链接变成文件（Hugging Face 的文件，或通过 Hub API 列出的仓库或文件夹并按可导入的扩展名过滤，都经过 `downloads.source` 的 Hugging Face 端点，下载源为 ModelScope 时用 huggingface.co（`assets.service.hf_endpoint`）；Google Drive 文件；或链接本身），`fetch` 逐个下载，对每一跳重定向和实际连接的对端检查是否为回环、私有、链路本地、组播和保留地址，然后像上传一样暂存（分组为链接的主机和路径）。API 从不允许私有地址（反向代理会让远程浏览器看起来像本机）；命令行允许。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2717":{"id":"/docs/development-core-257","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"服务器路径：优先硬链接，失败则复制（大文件不复制两次）。文件夹会被递归收集；若是原版 RVC 安装（有 `assets/weights/`），只取 `assets/weights/*.pth` 和 `assets/indices`、`logs` 下的 `added_*.index`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2718":{"id":"/docs/development-core-258","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"`.zip`：逐个解出受支持的成员（跳过目录、隐藏文件、`__MACOSX`，单个成员上限 4 GiB），保留压缩包内的文件夹作为 `group`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2719":{"id":"/docs/development-core-259","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#暂存","content":"`group`（来源文件夹或压缩包）是配对的证据之一：同一组里的文件很可能属于一起。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2720":{"id":"/docs/development-core-260","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"扩展名只决定用哪个读取器；文件是什么由内容决定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2721":{"id":"/docs/development-core-261","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"读取器（扩展名）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2722":{"id":"/docs/development-core-262","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"判定","locale":"zh-CN"},"2723":{"id":"/docs/development-core-263","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"读出的信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"2724":{"id":"/docs/development-core-264","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"faiss（`.index`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2725":{"id":"/docs/development-core-265","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"2726":{"id":"/docs/development-core-266","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"宽度 `d`（256 → v1，768 → v2）、向量数 `ntotal`（0 即 `trained_` 索引），`engine/index/inspect.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/development-core-267","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"torch（`.pth`、`.pt`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/development-core-268","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"有 `weight` 与 `config` → 音色（小模型）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/development-core-269","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"版本、采样率、音高引导、说话人","locale":"zh-CN"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/development-core-270","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/development-core-271","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"状态字典有 `discriminators.*` → 判别器 D","locale":"zh-CN"},"2732":{"id":"/docs/development-core-272","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"子判别器数：7 → v1，9 → v2（D 不含采样率）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2733":{"id":"/docs/development-core-273","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"2734":{"id":"/docs/development-core-274","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"状态字典有 `dec.*` → 生成器 G","locale":"zh-CN"},"2735":{"id":"/docs/development-core-275","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"`enc_p.emb_phone` 宽度定版本，`enc_q.pre` 输入宽度与上采样核定采样率，`dec.m_source` 存在即有音高引导（`engine/models/checkpoint.py:inspect_checkpoint`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2736":{"id":"/docs/development-core-276","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"2737":{"id":"/docs/development-core-277","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"其他","locale":"zh-CN"},"2738":{"id":"/docs/development-core-278","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"人声分离检查点（有些分离模型以 `.pth` 发布，由同次导入的 YAML 认领）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2739":{"id":"/docs/development-core-279","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"YAML（`.yaml`、`.yml`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2740":{"id":"/docs/development-core-280","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"人声分离配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2741":{"id":"/docs/development-core-281","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"pymss_core 的 `detect_model_type`、`training.instruments`、`target_instrument`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2742":{"id":"/docs/development-core-282","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"`.ckpt`、`.bin`、`.safetensors`、`.chpt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2743":{"id":"/docs/development-core-283","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"人声分离检查点","locale":"zh-CN"},"2744":{"id":"/docs/development-core-284","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"不读取，提交时由分离 worker 试加载验证","locale":"zh-CN"},"2745":{"id":"/docs/development-core-285","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#按内容识别","content":"读取失败的文件记为 `unsupported`，附上原因，提交时列入 `skipped`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2746":{"id":"/docs/development-core-286","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`core/models/pairing.py` 是纯函数，只看识别结果，便于表格化测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2747":{"id":"/docs/development-core-287","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"**索引 ↔ 音色**（`pair_indexes`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2748":{"id":"/docs/development-core-288","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"**硬性检查**：`ntotal == 0` → 状态 `empty`；宽度不是 256/768 → `incompatible`；版本相符的候选音色先取本次导入里的音色，**只有本次导入没有合适音色时**才考虑库里的音色——否则一次导入「新音色 + 它的索引」时，名字相近的库音色会来抢。没有候选 → `incompatible`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2749":{"id":"/docs/development-core-289","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"**名称打分**（`name_score`）：索引名按 `added_IVF<n>_Flat_nprobe_1_<exp>_<v1|v2>[_spkid<N>]` 解析出的实验名等于音色去掉 `_e<N>_s<N>` 后的名字 → 1.0（`experiment_name`）；一方包含另一方（至少 3 个字符）→ 0.8（`name_contains`）；否则为去掉样板词后的词集 Jaccard × 0.7（`similar_name`）。另加：同一文件夹/压缩包 +0.2（`same_folder`），名字里的版本后缀相符 +0.1，`_spkid<N>` 与音色的说话人相符 +0.1（`speaker`，并把键设为 `spk<N>`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2750":{"id":"/docs/development-core-290","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"**决定**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2751":{"id":"/docs/development-core-291","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`unique`：本次导入里只有一个兼容音色，且只有这一个兼容索引竞争同一个键 → 自动配对，`confident`，不管名字（「按版本配对」）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2752":{"id":"/docs/development-core-292","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`evidence`：最高分 ≥ 0.5 且领先第二名 ≥ 0.25 → 提议；只有对象是本次导入的音色且得分 ≥ 0.8 时才 `confident`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2753":{"id":"/docs/development-core-293","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`choose`：其余情况，不提议，由用户在候选里选。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2754":{"id":"/docs/development-core-294","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`duplicate`：两个索引提议给同一音色同一键时，得分低的一个让给用户决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2755":{"id":"/docs/development-core-295","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"**G ↔ D、YAML ↔ 检查点**（`pair_partners`）：一对一时直接配对（G/D 还要求版本相同）；否则把 G 名里的 `G` 换成 `D`（`G_TO_D`：`f0G40k` ↔ `f0D40k`、`G_2333333` ↔ `D_2333333`）后完全相同得 1.0，再加词集相似度与同组加分，阈值与索引相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2756":{"id":"/docs/development-core-296","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#配对规则","content":"`plan()` 每次被请求时重新计算，所以总是反映音色库的当前状态。计划 `confident` 的条件：有可执行的内容；每个非 `empty` 索引都 `confident`；每个 YAML 都有检查点；每个 D 都配上了 G。分离计划的主副音轨由 `target_instrument` 推断，`vocals`/`other` 组合的副音轨标签默认 `instrumental`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2757":{"id":"/docs/development-core-297","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#提交","content":"`commit(sid, decisions)` 先用 `apply()` 把用户的决定（`ImportDecisions`，省略的列表保留提议）覆盖到计划上，`_validate()` 再做一次硬检查（空索引、版本不符、同一音色同一键两个索引），然后**同步**执行：导入音色（连同配给它的索引）、把配给库音色的索引交给 `set_index()`、未分配或配给被跳过音色的索引放进收件箱、G 按 `action` 成为底模（`base`）或提取成音色（`extract`）、YAML 加检查点进入分离模型库。最后删除会话并发布一次 `models_changed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2758":{"id":"/docs/development-core-298","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#提交","content":"计划中曾设想把提交做成任务并新增 `imports_changed` 事件；实际全是本地复制，最慢的一步是分离模型的试加载（几秒），所以直接返回 `ImportResult`（`voices`、`attached`、`inbox`、`base_models`、`separation_models`、`checkpoints`、`skipped`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2759":{"id":"/docs/development-core-299","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#提交","content":"`import_now()` 是一步式导入（命令行、旧路由、示例音色以外的所有「直接导入」）：建会话、暂存、计算计划；`name` 只在恰好一个音色时生效；`--index` 只能配一个音色；计划不 `confident` 且没有决定时抛 `ConflictError`，`detail.plan` 带完整计划——API 返回 409，命令行打印计划并以退出码 3 结束，由 `--pair`、`--keep-unassigned`、`--extract` 补充决定。会话无论成败都会删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2760":{"id":"/docs/development-core-300","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#索引收件箱","content":"`IndexInbox`（`core/models/inbox.py`）保存没有音色可配的索引：`models/indexes/<id>/model.index` 加 `index.json`（导入名、宽度、向量数、时间）。`list_indexes()` 每次都对库音色重新运行 `pair_indexes`，给出兼容候选与提议；`assign()` 经 `set_index()`（含版本检查）挂到音色上后删除收件箱条目；`delete()` 移入回收站。事件里收件箱条目的 id 以 `index:` 为前缀。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2761":{"id":"/docs/development-core-301","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#底模","content":"`BaseModelService`（`core/models/base.py`）把官方底模和导入的底模并列：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2762":{"id":"/docs/development-core-302","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#底模","content":"官方：`v1`/`v2` × `32k`/`40k`/`48k` × 有无音高共 12 个，id 为 `official-<版本>-<采样率>[-f0]`，文件就是资源目录里的 `pretrained/` 或 `pretrained_v2/` 下的 `[f0]G<rate>.pth` 与 `[f0]D<rate>.pth`，所属资源为 `pretrained-<版本>-<采样率>`（每个资源 4 个文件：有无音高各一对 G/D）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2763":{"id":"/docs/development-core-303","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#底模","content":"导入：`models/base/<slug>/G.pth`（加可选 `D.pth`）与 `base.json`。采样率、版本、音高引导都从 G 的权重读出，用户什么都不用填；缺 D 允许（判别器从头训练，原版也允许）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2764":{"id":"/docs/development-core-304","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#底模","content":"`list_base(sample_rate, version, pitch_guidance)` 只返回匹配的底模，训练设置里的选择器因此只显示能用的；`check_fits()` 拒绝不匹配（`detail.reason = \"base_model_mismatch\"`）。删除官方底模只删它自己的那一对 G/D（`AssetService.delete_files`），所属资源变成 `partial`，可以再下载；导入的底模移入回收站。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2765":{"id":"/docs/development-core-305","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#预设","content":"`PresetService`（`core/presets/`）存 `VoiceParamsModel`（以及实时变声预设的 `StreamParamsModel`）。每个音色有且只有一个默认预设（名为 `Default`），在音色入库时由 `ensure_default()` 用 `convert.default_params` 创建；删除默认预设会立刻再建一个。在任何界面选中一个音色都会载入它的默认预设，所以同一音色在转换和实时变声里听起来一样。`model_id` 为空的是全局预设；`resolve()` 按名称查找时音色自己的预设优先。设为默认时同一事务里清掉该音色其他预设的默认标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2766":{"id":"/docs/development-core-306","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#预设","content":"`VoiceParamsModel` 与 `StreamParamsModel`（`core/params.py`）镜像引擎的冻结数据类，取值范围写成字段约束，`to_engine()` 转换时不导入 torch。Web UI 的 `paramSpecs.ts` 由 `typegen` 从这些约束生成，所以各端显示的范围、默认值和说明一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2767":{"id":"/docs/development-core-307","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`AudioFileService`（`core/audio/service.py`）把三种输入来源统一成 `AudioRef`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2768":{"id":"/docs/development-core-308","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`kind`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2769":{"id":"/docs/development-core-309","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2770":{"id":"/docs/development-core-310","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`upload`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2771":{"id":"/docs/development-core-311","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`PUT` 原始请求体写入 `uploads/<id>/<name>`（先 `.part`），PyAV 探测后记入 `audio_files`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2772":{"id":"/docs/development-core-312","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2773":{"id":"/docs/development-core-313","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"服务器上的文件或文件夹；文件夹展开成其中的音频文件（`recursive` 时递归）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2774":{"id":"/docs/development-core-314","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`output` / `output-source`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/development-core-315","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"之前某个输出本身，或生成该输出时用的输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"2776":{"id":"/docs/development-core-316","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"服务器路径必须位于 `paths.browse_roots` 之内——这个检查在 **API** 里做（路由调用 `check_refs()`，`browse()` 与 `resolve_path()` 也检查），命令行属于本机用户，不受限制。`browse_roots` 为空时默认为用户主目录、各旧版目录、数据目录以及每个盘符/挂载卷（`SettingsService.browse_roots()`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2777":{"id":"/docs/development-core-317","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"**峰值**：`peaks(path, points)` 把点数限制在 64–4096，以 `sha1(路径|大小|mtime|点数)` 为键缓存到 `cache/peaks/<xx>/<key>.json`。浏览器从不为了画波形解码整个文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2778":{"id":"/docs/development-core-318","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"**输出**：任务写到 `outputs/<本地日期>/<job id>/`（`convert.output_dir` 可整体改位置），文件名 `output_path()` 生成 `<stem>.<后缀>.<格式>`，冲突时加数字，从不覆盖。每个输出一行 `outputs`，带来源路径、音色 id 和 `VoiceParamsModel`，所以结果可以试听、与源 A/B、作为下一步输入、或用同样设置重跑；`add_output()` 发布 `outputs_added`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2779":{"id":"/docs/development-core-319","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`zip_outputs()` 以 `ZIP_STORED` 边写边产出，不在内存或磁盘上先拼出整个 zip。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2780":{"id":"/docs/development-core-320","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#音频文件与输出","content":"`cleanup()`（服务器启动时）删除 24 小时以前且没有输出引用的上传（导入会话目录也在 `uploads/` 下，按同样的期限清理），并按 `convert.keep_outputs_days`（0 表示永久保留）删除旧输出。输出按路径记录其来源；上传按它在 `uploads/` 下的条目（以上传 id 命名的文件夹）匹配，绝不比较整条路径：比较完整的绝对路径时，数据目录一旦从别处打开，所有上传都会被删掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2781":{"id":"/docs/development-core-321","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"数据目录可以被移动、改名、复制或通过链接打开，它记录的东西必须跟着走。`audio_files.path`、`outputs.path` 和 `outputs.source_path` 对数据目录内的文件记录相对于它的路径（`outputs/2026-10-19/<job>/a.wav`，所有平台都用 `/`），对其他位置的文件记录绝对路径。这条规则由 `core/storage.py` 负责（`StorageService.store` / `resolve`，基于 `core/files.py` 的 `to_stored` / `from_stored`）；对外给出的记录（`Output.path`、`AudioFile.path`）是文件此刻在磁盘上的绝对路径，文件不在时 `exists` 为假。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2782":{"id":"/docs/development-core-322","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"**在新位置打开**：`meta` 表（迁移 4）记录上次打开的位置（`data_dir`）。位置不同或没有记录（以前的数据库，全是绝对路径）时，`StorageService.reconcile` 把目录内文件的记录一次性改写为相对路径，在一个 `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` 事务中完成，并记下之前的位置（`data_dir_previous`；没有记录时从旧记录推断），供实验指纹升级使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2783":{"id":"/docs/development-core-323","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"**重新找到**：文件不在记录的位置时，按记录路径的末尾几段到数据目录、结果目录和实验目录下查找（`relocations`，能读两种平台的分隔符），行里记有大小时须与之一致；找到后改写记录。对指向数据目录之外的记录，目录内的副本优先，所以复制出来的数据目录绝不会读取或删除原目录的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2784":{"id":"/docs/development-core-324","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"**缺失**：哪里都找不到的文件报 `not_found`，`detail.reason` 为 `file_missing`（另有 `detail.recorded`、`detail.path`），从不跳过；删除这条输出只删记录，不把任何文件移到回收站。`rvc-next output check`（`POST /outputs/check`，`StorageService.check`）列出、改写（`--fix`）、换前缀（`--rebase OLD NEW`）和清除（`--prune-missing`）记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2785":{"id":"/docs/development-core-325","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"`legacy-voices.json` 对模型目录下的索引（`attached-indexes/` 中的副本）记录相对于它的路径；`voice_models` 缓存存绝对路径，由 `rescan()` 重建。不存在的库文件夹或旧版目录保留其音色（`VoiceModel.missing`），而不是删除——删除会连带删掉它们的预设（`ON DELETE CASCADE`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2786":{"id":"/docs/development-core-326","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#记录的文件路径","content":"相对的 `paths.*` 目录位于数据目录内，而不是当前工作目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2787":{"id":"/docs/development-core-327","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"`ConversionService`（`core/conversion/`）一次请求一个任务，每个输入一个步骤：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2788":{"id":"/docs/development-core-328","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"`validate()`（提交前）：说话人在范围内、资源齐全、分离预设可用、`remix` 必须配 `separate`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2789":{"id":"/docs/development-core-329","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"有 `separate` 时，所有输入在**一个**分离 worker 里先分离（占进度的前 40%），中间音轨写到 `<输出目录>/stems/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2790":{"id":"/docs/development-core-330","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"用服务器运行时加载音色（缓存命中时立即开始），`index_rate > 0` 且有索引时加载索引（按路径与 mtime 缓存，整个任务只加载一次——原版每个文件都 `read_index`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2791":{"id":"/docs/development-core-331","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"每个输入解码为 16 kHz 单声道（预览只解码前 `preview_seconds` 秒），`OfflineConverter.convert()` 转换主音轨（分离预设的 `primary_stem`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2792":{"id":"/docs/development-core-332","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"有 `remix` 时把转换后的人声按 `vocal_gain_db` 与伴奏（优先 `instrumental`/`accompaniment`/`other`/`no_vocals` 标签）按 `gain_db` 混成立体声，峰值超过 0.99 时整体缩放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2793":{"id":"/docs/development-core-333","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"写出 `<stem>.<音色 slug>[.preview].<格式>`，记录输出（`converted`、`remix` 或 `preview`），最后删除中间音轨。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2794":{"id":"/docs/development-core-334","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#转换","content":"只有命令行的 `-o` 加 `--overwrite` 会覆盖同名文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2795":{"id":"/docs/development-core-335","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#人声分离","content":"`SeparationService`（`core/separation/service.py`）的预设来自两处：引擎读取的内置 `core/separation/presets.json`（`vocals`、`vocals-aggressive`、`dereverb`、`dereverb-aggressive`、`karaoke` 五个单模型预设，以及 `vocals-clean`（人声 → 去混响）和 `lead-clean`（人声 → 主唱 → 去混响）两条链），和每个导入分离模型各一个单步预设（`source: \"imported\"`，id `user-<slug>`）。预设声明 `stems`、`primary_stem`（转换前置步骤要转换的那条）和 `assets`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2796":{"id":"/docs/development-core-336","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#人声分离","content":"`run_files()` 是分离页面、转换前置步骤和训练清理阶段共用的入口：把所有输入、预设和模型规格（内置的由 `engine.separate.presets.resolve()` 解析，导入的由 `SeparationLibrary.spec()` 给出）放进一个请求，一个 `workers.separate` 子进程处理全部输入。worker 的 `output` 事件按来源与标签收集音轨，需要时登记为 `stem` 输出。退出码 `EXIT_RETRY = 75` 表示 DirectML 上 fp16 失败，核心层用 fp32 重跑一次——保留原版 `pymss_webui.py` 的做法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2797":{"id":"/docs/development-core-337","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#人声分离","content":"导入的分离模型（`SeparationLibrary`）入库前会在分离 worker 里以 `check` 动作加载一次（`_check_loads()`，超时 600 秒），YAML 与检查点不匹配时在导入时就报错（`detail.reason = \"separation_load\"`），而不是第一次分离时。音轨标签只能用字母、数字、`-`、`_`，且两条不同。用户自定义的分离链暂不支持。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2798":{"id":"/docs/development-core-338","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#训练","content":"`TrainingService`（`core/training/service.py`）。实验不进数据库：每个实验是 `experiments/<name>/` 一个文件夹，含 `experiment.json` 和原版的阶段子目录（`0_gt_wavs/`、`1_16k_wavs/`、`2a_f0/`、`2b-f0nsf/`、`3_feature256|768/`、G/D 检查点、`added_*.index`……），所以从别处复制进来的文件夹直接出现在列表里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2799":{"id":"/docs/development-core-339","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#训练","content":"没有 `experiment.json` 但有阶段目录的文件夹按**旧版实验**读取（`engine.train.experiment.read_legacy`：从 `config.json` 与 `multispeaker_manifest.json` 读采样率、版本、说话人表），输出已存在的阶段标为 `done`，然后写出 `experiment.json`。`import_legacy()` 把原版 `logs/<exp>` 复制进来（忽略 `eval`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2800":{"id":"/docs/development-core-340","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#训练","content":"`experiment.json` 的写入先写 `.tmp` 再替换；损坏时报 `ValidationError` 而不是静默重建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2801":{"id":"/docs/development-core-341","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2802":{"id":"/docs/development-core-342","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"何时适用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2803":{"id":"/docs/development-core-343","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"指纹输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"2804":{"id":"/docs/development-core-344","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2805":{"id":"/docs/development-core-345","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"设置了 `dataset.clean_preset`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2806":{"id":"/docs/development-core-346","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"数据集文件夹 + 预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"2807":{"id":"/docs/development-core-347","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`slice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2808":{"id":"/docs/development-core-348","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"总是","locale":"zh-CN"},"2809":{"id":"/docs/development-core-349","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`dataset_clean/`（有清理时）或数据集文件夹 + 采样率 + 说话人表","locale":"zh-CN"},"2810":{"id":"/docs/development-core-350","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`f0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2811":{"id":"/docs/development-core-351","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"有音高引导","locale":"zh-CN"},"2812":{"id":"/docs/development-core-352","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`1_16k_wavs/` + F0 方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2813":{"id":"/docs/development-core-353","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`features`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2814":{"id":"/docs/development-core-354","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"总是","locale":"zh-CN"},"2815":{"id":"/docs/development-core-355","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`1_16k_wavs/` + 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2816":{"id":"/docs/development-core-356","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`fit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2817":{"id":"/docs/development-core-357","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"总是","locale":"zh-CN"},"2818":{"id":"/docs/development-core-358","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"特征目录、`0_gt_wavs/`、（有音高时）`2b-f0nsf/` + 采样率、版本、音高、说话人表","locale":"zh-CN"},"2819":{"id":"/docs/development-core-359","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`index`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2820":{"id":"/docs/development-core-360","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"总是","locale":"zh-CN"},"2821":{"id":"/docs/development-core-361","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"特征目录 + 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2822":{"id":"/docs/development-core-362","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"指纹（`engine/train/fingerprint.py:of_paths`）是对路径下每个文件名、大小和 mtime 再加上决定输出的设置做的 SHA-1；路径不存在与空文件夹的哈希不同。阶段完成时把指纹记入 `StageState.fingerprint`。实验文件夹内的路径以相对于它的形式命名（`base`），所以移动实验目录或数据目录后各阶段仍然是最新的；`experiment.json` 对实验内的数据集文件夹（`dataset_upload/`）也记相对路径，并记录 `\"fingerprints\": 2`。以前写的实验（没有 `fingerprints`）在加载时升级：每个已存指纹按旧方式（路径用绝对形式）重算，分别按路径现在的位置和实验以前的位置（来自 `data_dir_previous`，或上传数据集记录的文件夹）；吻合的换成新形式，其余保留旧指纹，显示为已变化。索引自己的 `index_fingerprint.json` 在其文件夹没有移动时同样沿用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2823":{"id":"/docs/development-core-363","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"**全部运行**（`plan()`，`RunRequest.stages` 为空）执行适用阶段中状态不是 `done` 的那些，以及 `epochs` 比上次完成时更大的 `fit`（`counts[\"epochs\"]`）——所以加训只需把轮数调大再点一次。`force` 重跑选中的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2824":{"id":"/docs/development-core-364","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"**过期标记**：`update()` 修改实验时，按改动项把对应阶段及其后续阶段中 `done` 的标成 `stale`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2825":{"id":"/docs/development-core-365","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2826":{"id":"/docs/development-core-366","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"从哪一阶段起过期","locale":"zh-CN"},"2827":{"id":"/docs/development-core-367","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"清理预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"2828":{"id":"/docs/development-core-368","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2829":{"id":"/docs/development-core-369","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"数据集（文件夹、说话人表）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2830":{"id":"/docs/development-core-370","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`slice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2831":{"id":"/docs/development-core-371","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"2832":{"id":"/docs/development-core-372","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`slice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2833":{"id":"/docs/development-core-373","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"音高引导、F0 方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2834":{"id":"/docs/development-core-374","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`f0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2835":{"id":"/docs/development-core-375","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"2836":{"id":"/docs/development-core-376","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"`features`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2837":{"id":"/docs/development-core-377","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"某个阶段重跑完成后，未在本次运行中的后续 `done` 阶段也标成 `stale`。`stale` 阶段重跑时向 worker 传 `clean: true`，丢弃旧输出；索引阶段另有自己的指纹文件（`index_fingerprint.json`，见 引擎），特征变化时重建——原版只要存在任何 `added_*.index` 就跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2838":{"id":"/docs/development-core-378","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#阶段","content":"「全部运行」（不指定阶段）由 `plan()` 决定：未完成的阶段、以及存储的指纹与当前重新计算的指纹不一致的阶段（例如有人直接往数据集文件夹里加删文件）都要跑，并且从第一个这样的阶段起，其后所有适用的阶段都在同一个任务里重跑，因为它们读取前者的输出；没有指纹的阶段（旧版实验）视为未变。只是 `epochs` 增大时，只续训 `fit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2839":{"id":"/docs/development-core-379","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#运行","content":"`run()` 把选中的阶段作为**一个** `train` 任务提交（每个阶段一个步骤，进度按 `STAGE_WEIGHT` 加权，`fit` 占大头）。同一实验同时只能有一个运行（`BusyError`）；运行中不能修改或删除实验。提交前 `_preflight()` 检查：`slice` 需要数据集；`features` 需要 `hubert`；RMVPE 提取 F0 需要 `rmvpe`；`fit` 需要所选底模（`fit.base_model`，经 `check_fits`）或对应的官方 `pretrained-<版本>-<采样率>`；`clean` 需要其预设的资源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2840":{"id":"/docs/development-core-380","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#运行","content":"每个阶段起一个 `workers.train` 子进程（`clean` 除外，它调用分离服务的 `run_files()`，把每个说话人的主音轨写到 `dataset_clean/<说话人 id>/`）。每个阶段独立进程的理由与原版相同：取消就是杀进程树，CUDA 上下文干净，DDP 本来就需要自己的进程。worker 的 `metric` 事件转成 `train_metrics` 事件（送进 Web UI 的 Pinia store 画损失曲线），完整指标在实验目录的 `metrics.jsonl`，`metrics(name, since)` 读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/development-core-381","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#运行","content":"其他默认值：`training.f0_method = \"auto\"` 在有合格 CUDA 设备时用 `rmvpe`，否则 `pm`；`training.gpus = \"auto\"` 是新实验 `fit.gpus` 的默认值，训练按实验的 `fit.gpus` 选卡（`auto` 取所有合格 CUDA 设备，也可写成原版的 `0-1`；`train run --gpus` 写入实验）；`batch_size` 为空时取最小 GPU 显存（GiB）÷ 2，与原版相同；`cpu_workers` 为空时取 CPU 数 ÷ 1.5。切片的 `per` 在有 GPU 时为 3.7 秒、纯 CPU 时为 3.0 秒，沿用原版。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/development-core-382","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#结果","content":"`export`（`io` 任务）：取指定或最新的小模型（没有则最新 G，先提取，多说话人实验带上说话人名），连同实验的 `added_*.index`（按 `_spkid<N>` 分键）加入音色库，并把 `voice_id` 写回实验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/development-core-383","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#结果","content":"`try_checkpoint()`：把某个已保存的小模型或 G 检查点注册成临时音色，带上实验的索引，供转换页试听；G 检查点先提取成小模型，缓存在实验的 `.try/` 中（检查点更新时才重新提取），D 检查点会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/development-core-384","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#结果","content":"`build_index_for_voice()`（`index` 任务）：用某个实验已提取的特征为一个已有音色构建索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/development-core-385","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#实时变声","content":"`LiveService`（`core/live/service.py`）同一时刻只管理一个会话，它不在服务器进程里处理音频，而是监督一个长期存活的 `workers.live` 进程：音频设备和实时线程归那个进程，与服务器的事件循环、GIL 竞争和可能的崩溃隔开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/development-core-386","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#worker-与连接","content":"`LiveSupervisor`（`core/live/supervisor.py`）按需启动 worker：在 `127.0.0.1` 随机端口开一个 `multiprocessing.connection.Listener`，带 32 字节随机 authkey；把地址和 authkey 连同运行参数写进请求文件，以 `python -m rvc_next.workers.live <request.json>` 启动；最多等 60 秒连接（worker 先退出则立即失败）。之后一个读线程把收到的消息（`rvc_next/protocol/live.py` 的数据类，JSON 编码）交给 `LiveService._on_event`；worker 的 stdout/stderr 转入服务器日志。连接断开时调用一次 `on_exit(expected)`，非预期退出时会话进入 `error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2847":{"id":"/docs/development-core-387","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#worker-与连接","content":"worker 在会话停止后仍保持运行（为了电平表和快速再启动），模型留在它自己的进程里，这正是「释放显存」要通知它的原因（`P.ReleaseMemory`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/development-core-388","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#控制锁与音色切换","content":"`start`、`update_voice`、`update_stream`、`set_voice`、`set_devices` 都在 `_control` 锁里执行「读状态 → 发消息 → 写回状态」，因为切换音色及其引起的说话人重置是两条紧挨着的消息，不能与另一个请求交错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2849":{"id":"/docs/development-core-389","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#控制锁与音色切换","content":"切换音色时 worker 用带 `voice_path` 的 `State` 消息回答**现在实际在转换的音色**：新音色，或新音色加载失败时保留的旧音色。服务用 `_voice_ids`（模型路径 → 音色 id）反查，让状态跟随 worker 而不是跟随请求，并把 `live.last_voice` 更新为实际在用的那个。切换后说话人超出新音色范围时重置为 0。修改 F0 方法时先检查对应资源，worker 加载不了新方法时保留原方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2850":{"id":"/docs/development-core-390","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#控制锁与音色切换","content":"worker 一连上就会宣告一次 `stopped`；`_awaiting_start` 让服务忽略这条，直到 `Start` 被处理，否则界面会在启动时闪回「已停止」。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2851":{"id":"/docs/development-core-391","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#空闲时的输入电平","content":"`POST /live/meter` 只是把一份 15 秒的租约延长（`METER_LEASE`；`on: false` 立即结束）并马上返回：没有请求需要等 worker 启动或设备打开。另有一个线程（`_meter_loop` / `_sync_meter`）在租约有效且实时变声空闲（已停止或 `error`、未开 **监听自己**、不在测量延迟）时打开电平表：必要时启动 worker，用缓存的设备列表解析保存的输入，发送 `Meter(on, input, input_gain_db)`。每次状态变化、`live.devices` 设置变化（换了输入或增益：worker 重开流，或只更新增益）和 `devices_changed` 都会唤醒它。空闲时收到 `DeviceLost`、或 worker 意外退出，按 1、2、5、10 秒重试（`METER_RETRY`），设备列表变化时立即重试。因此第一次开始之前就有电平，会话结束、出错或麦克风重新插上后也会自动恢复。Web 界面里每个显示中的设备面板持有一个占用（`useMeterClaim`），页面可见时每 5 秒续约；页面关闭或隐藏后麦克风会被释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2852":{"id":"/docs/development-core-392","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#空闲时的输入电平","content":"worker 回应电平表或直通请求时保留上一个错误：以前会话失败后电平表重新打开，会在用户看清之前把错误清掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2853":{"id":"/docs/development-core-393","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"**枚举**在一个短命子进程 `workers.devices` 里完成（`action: enumerate`），只导入 sounddevice、不导入 torch。原版刷新设备要调用私有的 `sd._terminate()`/`sd._initialize()` 并停止音频流；放在别的进程里则永远不会打扰正在运行的流。结果缓存；`devices(refresh=True)` 重新枚举，签名（去掉时间戳和 PortAudio 序号）不同时发布 `devices_changed`。`live.enable_asio` 打开时给子进程设置 `SD_ENABLE_ASIO=1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2854":{"id":"/docs/development-core-394","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"**解析**（`engine/audio_io/devices.py:resolve_selection`）在每次启动和每次换设备前对新列表执行，依次尝试：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2855":{"id":"/docs/development-core-395","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"2856":{"id":"/docs/development-core-396","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"匹配","locale":"zh-CN"},"2857":{"id":"/docs/development-core-397","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2858":{"id":"/docs/development-core-398","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2859":{"id":"/docs/development-core-399","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"同一 `device_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2860":{"id":"/docs/development-core-400","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`exact`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2861":{"id":"/docs/development-core-401","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"2","locale":"zh-CN"},"2862":{"id":"/docs/development-core-402","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"同一物理设备键、同一宿主 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2863":{"id":"/docs/development-core-403","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`matched`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2864":{"id":"/docs/development-core-404","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"3","locale":"zh-CN"},"2865":{"id":"/docs/development-core-405","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"同一物理设备键、推荐的宿主 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2866":{"id":"/docs/development-core-406","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`matched`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2867":{"id":"/docs/development-core-407","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"4","locale":"zh-CN"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/development-core-408","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"同名（含 MME 31 字符截断名的前缀匹配），任意宿主 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2869":{"id":"/docs/development-core-409","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`matched`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2870":{"id":"/docs/development-core-410","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"5","locale":"zh-CN"},"2871":{"id":"/docs/development-core-411","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"系统默认设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"2872":{"id":"/docs/development-core-412","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`default_fallback`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2873":{"id":"/docs/development-core-413","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"2874":{"id":"/docs/development-core-414","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"连默认设备都没有","locale":"zh-CN"},"2875":{"id":"/docs/development-core-415","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`missing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2876":{"id":"/docs/development-core-416","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"未指定设备的选择跟随系统默认，算 `exact`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2877":{"id":"/docs/development-core-417","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"**自动选择驱动**（`DeviceSelection.driver`：`auto`、`fixed`，或 None，即在这个字段出现之前保存的选择：host API 是推荐的或为空时算自动，否则算固定；独占模式总是固定驱动）。`resolve_drivers` 把这台物理设备的各个变体按优先顺序放进 `ResolvedDevice.candidates`，声道数不够所选声道、或不支持指定采样率的变体不计入；按 id 或 key 找到的设备，无论在哪个驱动下都算 `exact`。core 把它们作为每个端点的 `candidates` 发给 worker，worker 通过 `engine/audio_io/fallback.open_with_fallback` 打开：某个角色打开或启动时抛出 `DeviceOpenError`（`busy`、`missing`、`format`、`channels`、`stopped`；`permission` 从不重试）时，换上这个角色的下一个候选，总共最多打开 8 次。驱动启动音频流后马上自行停掉，也属于这种情况：会话中有可回退的设备（`Endpoint.can_fall_back`）时，`AudioSession.start` 会盯住它的流 `SETTLE_SECONDS`（0.4 秒，至少两个块），期间停掉就抛 `stopped`，而不是报告设备丢失；固定驱动不做这个等待。没有指明是哪台设备的双工流错误，先换输入。被拒的记录随 `P.State.fallbacks` 传回，旁边是 `P.State.opened`（角色 → 打开的变体），检查的结果里则是 `opened`/`attempts`；core 记住每台物理设备最后打开它的驱动（`LiveService._drivers`），下次先试它，设备列表变化时清空。面板通过 `LiveState.opened` 和 `ResolvedDevice.fallback` 显示设备是由哪个驱动打开的，以及其他驱动为什么打不开。所有候选都打不开时，错误逐个列出（`detail.drivers`）。会话期间以实际打开的端点为准：`Endpoint.same` 比较候选集合，所以回退之后只改音量不会重新打开设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2878":{"id":"/docs/development-core-418","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"**输出回退需要确认。** 原版在保存的设备丢失时静默换成默认设备；把转换后的声音送到扬声器而不是虚拟声卡，是用户最容易发现的事故。所以输出解析为 `default_fallback` 时，`start()` 抛 `DeviceError`（`detail.fallback = true`），除非请求带 `allow_output_fallback`。输入或监听回退只作为提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2879":{"id":"/docs/development-core-419","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"`check()`（`POST /live/devices/check`）先解析，再让设备子进程用 `check` 动作按确切配置（设备、声道、采样率、独占）问 PortAudio 能否打开，返回拓扑（`duplex`/`split`）、采样率、估计延迟和带建议操作的问题（`choose`、`use_48k`、`disable_exclusive`、`grant_permission`）。`test_tone()` 在设备子进程里播放提示音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2880":{"id":"/docs/development-core-420","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设备","content":"**重连**：worker 报告 `DeviceLost` 后（且 `live.auto_reconnect` 开启），一个线程每 2 秒重新枚举，丢失的角色重新解析为 `exact` 或 `matched` 时发 `SetDevices` 重新打开，音色不重新加载。自动重连关闭时，进入 `reconnecting` 即发送 `Stop`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2881":{"id":"/docs/development-core-421","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"设备不是 `cpu` 时，启动即 `compute.acquire_live()` 夺取 GPU 租约；`stopped`/`error`/worker 退出时释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2882":{"id":"/docs/development-core-422","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"`start()` 把设备、流参数、`last_voice`、`last_params` 写回设置（`live` 组），所以不带参数的 **Start** 恢复上一次会话，`rvc-next live run` 读的也是同样的值。设备属于服务器所在的机器，因此放在设置里而不是浏览器的客户端状态里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2883":{"id":"/docs/development-core-423","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"worker 的 `Stats` 消息（约 10 Hz）转成 `live_stats` 事件，状态变化转成 `live_state`。live worker 报告显存不足时，它先卸载自己的模型，核心层再调用 `release_after_oom(\"Live\")`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2884":{"id":"/docs/development-core-424","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"电平表（`meter`）和直通（`passthrough`）在会话未运行时也会按需启动 worker；会话运行时显示会话自己的电平。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2885":{"id":"/docs/development-core-425","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"**录音**（`start_recording`/`stop_recording`，`POST`/`DELETE /live/recording`）：核心层选定文件（`outputs/<日期>/live/Live <时间>.<音色>.<来源>.wav`）并发送 `Record`；worker 的 `engine/audio_io/recorder.Recorder` 通过 `AudioSession.tap` 拿到每一块，在自己的线程里写入。录音结束（停止、会话结束、采样率改变）时 worker 发送 `Recorded`，核心层把文件作为 `recording` 类型的输出加入，并记下会话的音色和参数。`LiveState.recording` 以 worker 的确认为准，所以在 `Record` 到达前发出的状态不会把它清掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2886":{"id":"/docs/development-core-426","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#与其他服务的关系","content":"只改变音量或监听来源的 `SetDevices` 会就地更新正在运行的 `AudioSession.config`（`SessionConfig.same_endpoints`），其他改动会重新打开设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2887":{"id":"/docs/development-core-427","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"`SettingsService`（`core/settings/`）拥有 `settings.toml`。生效值的层次（后者覆盖前者）：模型默认值 \\< 文件 \\< 环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`（`__` 分隔层级，值能按 JSON 解析就按 JSON，否则当字符串）\\< 构造时传入的 `overrides`。环境变量和覆盖值从不写回文件；`env_override_names()` 让界面标出被固定的字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2888":{"id":"/docs/development-core-428","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"分组：`server`、`paths`、`compute`、`downloads`、`convert`、`separation`、`training`、`live`（模型见 `core/settings/models.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2889":{"id":"/docs/development-core-429","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"`update(patch)` 深合并进**文件层**（字典合并，其他值替换，`None` 清除可选值），先校验文件层、再校验生效值，原子写入（`.toml.tmp` → `replace`），TOML 没有 null 所以保存前去掉 `None`，最后同步调用监听器（`ComputeService` 借此重建运行时）。`mutate(fn)` 在文件层字典上做任意修改后保存（旧版目录的增删用它）。`set_value()` 供 `config set` 使用，只允许已有的键（字典型分组内可新增键）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2890":{"id":"/docs/development-core-430","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"`view()` 返回 `SettingsView`：`access_token` 换成 `access_token_configured`，令牌永不离开服务器；另附 `resolved_paths`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2891":{"id":"/docs/development-core-431","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"文件夹设置为空表示「在数据目录里」：`models_dir`、`experiments_dir`、`outputs_dir`（`convert.output_dir` 优先）、`assets_dir`。数据目录本身由 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或平台用户数据目录决定（`core/paths.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2892":{"id":"/docs/development-core-432","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#设置","content":"`SettingsService` 在每次实际改动后用 `changed_keys()` 算出改动的点分键，通知 `on_change`（新设置）与 `on_keys_change`（键名）监听器。改动可以来自 `update()`，也可以来自其他进程写的 `settings.toml`：读取 `settings` 时最多每 `FILE_CHECK_INTERVAL`（1 秒）比较一次文件的 mtime 与大小，变了就重新读取（解析或校验失败时记警告并保留原设置）；`update()` 写入前强制检查一次，在文件当前内容上合并。`core/context.py` 注册的键监听器发布 `settings_changed`，并在 `paths.*` 改变时调用 `models.rescan()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2893":{"id":"/docs/development-core-433","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`core/events/models.py` 定义所有事件（`EventBase` 子类，`__event_name__` 为事件名），`LocalEventBus` 在发布线程上同步调用订阅者；Socket.IO 桥接与 OpenAPI 中的事件模式见 API 与事件。每个事件都携带**快照**（例如 `job.model_copy(deep=True)`），因为桥接会在事件循环上稍后序列化，而 worker 线程仍在修改原对象。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2894":{"id":"/docs/development-core-434","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2895":{"id":"/docs/development-core-435","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"载荷","locale":"zh-CN"},"2896":{"id":"/docs/development-core-436","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"发布者","locale":"zh-CN"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/development-core-437","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`job_updated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/development-core-438","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"整个 `Job`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/development-core-439","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`JobService`（进度每秒最多 4 次）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/development-core-440","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`job_log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2901":{"id":"/docs/development-core-441","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`job_id`、`offset`、`lines`（≤ 50）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2902":{"id":"/docs/development-core-442","page_id":"/docs/development-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-core#事件","content":"`JobService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2903":{"id":"/docs/development-core-443","page_id":"/docs/developm