l":"/docs/development-engine","content":"本页按模块讲引擎做了什么、为什么这样做。与原版逐行对照的规则、golden 测试和行为变化见与原版的一致性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-36","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**参数是冻结的 dataclass**：`VoiceParams`（`engine/convert/params.py`）、`StreamParams`（`engine/stream/params.py`），以及训练各阶段的 `SliceRequest`、`F0Request`、`FeatureRequest`、`TrainRequest`、`IndexRequest`。核心层用 `VoiceParamsModel`/`StreamParamsModel`（`core/params.py`）镜像前两者并加上取值范围；引擎自己不做范围校验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2999":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-37","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**重依赖在函数内导入**：torch、transformers、faiss、av、pymss、sounddevice、parselmouth 都在用到它们的函数里 `import`，所以 `import rvc_next.engine.xxx` 很便宜，`rvc-next --help` 不会加载 torch。例外是移植文件（`engine/graph.py`、`engine/f0/rmvpe.py`、`engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`、`engine/audio/sinc_resample.py`、`engine/audio/denoise.py`、`engine/models/*.py`），它们在模块顶层导入 torch，只能从其他函数里被惰性导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3000":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-38","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**异常**只有 `engine/errors.py` 里的几种：`EngineError` 基类、`MissingAssetError`（带 `assets`，资源目录 id 列表）、`ModelFormatError`、`AudioError`、`Cancelled`。核心层在 `core/engine_errors.py:map_engine_error()` 里把它们映射成领域错误；worker 子进程在 `workers/base.py:run_worker()` 里把它们变成 `error` 事件，核心层再用 `worker_error()` 重建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3001":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-39","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**取消**是协作式的：`engine/cancel.py:CancelToken`，引擎在分块之间调用 `cancel.check()`，抛出 `Cancelled`。子进程里的工作不靠它，取消就是杀进程树。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3002":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-40","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#约定","content":"**`sounddevice` 只出现在 `engine/audio_io/`，`pymss` 只出现在 `engine/separate/`**（架构测试检查），这样其余引擎代码在没有 PortAudio 或 pymss 的环境里也能导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3003":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-41","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3004":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-42","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3005":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-43","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"来自原版","locale":"zh-CN"},"3006":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-44","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`runtime.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3007":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-45","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"GPU 规则、`ChunkConfig`、资源路径、模型缓存、显存释放与 OOM 判断","locale":"zh-CN"},"3008":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-46","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`configs/config.py` 的 GPU 规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3009":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-47","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`graph.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3010":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-48","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"CUDA Graph 捕获与回放缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3011":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-49","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`tools/cuda_graph.py`（照搬）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3012":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-50","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模块地图","content":"`features/hubert.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3013":{"id":