":"golden 测试在 CPU fp32 上运行，原版那边用的正是最后一行（`scripts/golden.py` 的 `_OriginalConfig`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3079":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-117","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3080":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-118","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"缓存键","locale":"zh-CN"},"3081":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-119","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"3082":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-120","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`hubert()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3083":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-121","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"唯一","locale":"zh-CN"},"3084":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-122","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"加载一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"3085":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-123","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`f0(method)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3086":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-124","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`engine.f0.METHODS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3087":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-125","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"每种加载一次（`engine/f0/__init__.py:create_provider`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3088":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-126","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`voice(path)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3089":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-127","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"解析后的路径 + `st_mtime_ns`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3090":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-128","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"LRU，保留最近 `max_voices`（默认 3）个；淘汰时清掉该网络的 CUDA Graph 缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3091":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-129","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`index(path)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3092":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-130","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"路径 + `st_mtime_ns`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3093":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-131","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"每个文件加载一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"3094":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-132","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"以修改时间入键，是为了让覆盖同名文件（重新导出、重新构建索引）自动生效，而不必通知运行时。所有方法都在一把 `RLock` 下，可以从多个线程调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3095":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-133","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型缓存","content":"`cached()` 返回 `hubert`、`f0:<method>`、`voice:<文件名>`、`index:<文件名>` 这样的名字列表，供计算面板显示；`release()` 卸载全部并调用 `soft_empty_cache()`；`release_idle(seconds)` 在所有条目都闲置超过给定秒数时整体卸载（核心层按 `compute.unload_after_minutes` 调用）；`vram()` 在 CUDA 上用 `torch.cuda.mem_get_info` 返回 `(已用, 总量)` MiB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3096":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-134","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#显存释放与-oom","content":"这两个函数的做法参考 ComfyUI 的 `comfy/model_management.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3097":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-135","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#显存释放与-oom","content":"`soft_empty_cache()`：先 `gc.collect()`，然后在 CUDA 上 `synchronize` → `empty_cache` → `ipc_collect`（MPS 上 `torch.mps.empty_cache()`）。先同步，保证没有内核仍在使用要归还的块。torch 未加载时什么也不做。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3098":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-136","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#显存释放与-oom","content":"`is_oom(error)`：识别 `torch.OutOfMemoryError`、CUDA 的 `AcceleratorError` 错误码 2、以及消息里含 \"out of memory\"/\"not enough gpu video memory\" 的 `RuntimeError`/`MemoryError`（MPS、DirectML）。识别到 CUDA 的异步错误时，会触发一次小运算并同步，把挂起的错误“消化”掉，以免下一次操作继承它。它从 `sys.modules` 取 torch，不会因为判断错误而导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3099":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-137","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#显存释放与-oom","content":"OOM 之后由谁卸载什么，是核心层的策略（`release_after_oom`），见核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3100":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-138","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#cuda-graph","content":"`engine/graph.py` 照搬原版 `tools/cuda_graph.py`：每个“所有者”对象（`net_g`、HuBERT、RMVPE、重采样器……）上挂一个 `_GraphCache`，按调用点命名空间加上每个输入张量的形状、步长、dtype、设备和 `requires_grad` 作键。第一次遇到新签名时在侧流上预热三次再捕获；之后回放时把输入复制进静态张量、`replay()`、克隆输出。捕获失败的签名记入 `failures`，以后直接走 eager。缓存按 LRU 淘汰，容量来自环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE`（默认 8）。`get_cuda_graph_stats()` 返回捕获、回放、回退、淘汰计数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3101":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-139","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#cuda-graph","content":"与原版的区别只有开关：原版读环境变量 `RVC_CUDA_GRAPH`，这里由 `Runtime` 构造时调用 `configure_cuda_graph(device, wanted)` 设置进程级开关，并且只在设备通过一次捕获—回放探测（`detect_cuda_graph_support`）后才打开。`wanted` 来自设置：服务器进程用 `compute.cuda_graph_offline`（默认关，与原版离线默认一致），Live worker 用 `compute.cuda_graph_live`（默认开）。训练从不开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3102":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-140","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#cuda-graph","content":"调用方写法统一为 `run_cuda_graph(owner, namespace, fn, *inputs)`；开关关闭或输入不在 CUDA 上时它直接调用 `fn`。由于形状是键的一部分，命名空间里要带上影响形状的参数（例如流式引擎的 `rvc-realtime-f0-{skip}-{ret}-{ret2}`、离线共振峰的 `rvc-synth-f0-formant-{n_res}`），否则会误用同一张图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3103":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-141","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#cuda-graph","content":"离线转换器的 `_empty_cache()` 只在 CUDA Graph 关闭时调用 `torch.cuda.empty_cache()`：图捕获的内存池必须保留，归还后回放会失败。这一点与原版 `Pipeline` 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3104":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-142","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"`features/hubert.py` 用 transformers 的 `HubertModel` 加一层 `final_proj`（`HubertModelWithFinalProj`），从资源目录 `hubert_base/`（`config.json`、`preprocessor_config.json`、`pytorch_model.bin` 或 `model.safetensors`）以 `local_files_only=True` 加载；缺文件抛 `MissingAssetError([\"hubert\"])`。DirectML（设备字符串含 `privateuseone`）上强制 `attn_implementation=\"eager\"`，因为 DirectML 不实现 transformers 用的全部 SDPA 内核。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3105":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-143","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"`extract_features(model, source, version, padding_mask)`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3106":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-144","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"v1：`hidden_states[9]` 经 `final_proj`，256 维；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3107":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-145","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"v2：`last_hidden_state`，768 维；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3108":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-146","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"四种（版本 × 有无 mask）各自一个 CUDA Graph 命名空间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3109":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-147","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#hubert-特征","content":"**归一化只有一处**：`normalize_input()` 读 `preprocessor_config.json` 的 `do_normalize`（`requires_normalization()`，`lru_cache`），为真时做 `F.layer_norm`。原版在训练特征提取里按这个标志归一化、推理里从不归一化，潜在地造成训练/推理不一致；真实资源的 `do_normalize` 是 `false`，所以两边都不归一化，结果与原版一致，而训练（`train/feature_extract.py`）和推理共用这一个函数，以后换资源也不会再分叉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3110":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-148","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`f0/base.py` 定义 `F0Provider` 协议：`compute(x, p_len)` 对 16 kHz 音频每 10 ms（160 个采样点）给出一个 Hz 值，清音为 0。原版把移调、清音插值和 256 级量化在离线管线、实时引擎和训练提取里各写了一遍，这里各只有一份：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3111":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-149","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`interpolate_unvoiced()`：用相邻浊音帧线性插值填补清音帧（离线规则）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3112":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-150","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`shift(f0, semitones)`：乘以 `2^(semitones/12)`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3113":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-151","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`to_coarse()`：mel 刻度上量化到合成器音高嵌入读取的 1..255；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3114":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-152","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`offline_f0()`：计算 → 插值 → 移调 → 量化，返回 `(coarse, hz)`，即原版 `Pipeline.get_f0`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3115":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-153","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"流式引擎因为要在设备上处理张量，有自己的 `_get_f0`/`_f0_post`，数学相同（见下文）。训练的 F0 不移调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3116":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-154","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3117":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-155","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"3118":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-156","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3119":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-157","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"资源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3120":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-158","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`pm`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3121":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-159","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`PmProvider`：parselmouth `to_pitch_ac`，时间步 10 ms，浊音阈值 0.6，50–1100 Hz，两端补零到 `p_len`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3122":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-160","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"3123":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-161","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"3124":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-162","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`rmvpe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3125":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-163","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`RmvpeProvider` → `f0/rmvpe.py:RMVPE`（照搬），`infer_from_audio(x, thred=0.03)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3126":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-164","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"CUDA/CPU 用 PyTorch；DirectML 用 onnxruntime 的 `DmlExecutionProvider`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3127":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-165","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`rmvpe`（`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`）；DirectML 上 `rmvpe-onnx`（`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3128":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-166","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`fcpe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3129":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-167","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`FcpeProvider` → `f0/fcpe.py:FCPEInfer` → `f0/fcpe_model.py`，`local_argmax` 解码，阈值 0.006","locale":"zh-CN"},"3130":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-168","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"全部；DirectML 上 mel 与解码在 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"3131":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-169","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`fcpe`（`fcpe/fcpe_c_v001.pt`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3132":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-170","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`crepe`、`crepe-tiny`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3133":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-171","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`CrepeProvider` → `f0/crepe_model.py:crepe_f0`：Viterbi 解码，周期性做 3 帧中值滤波，f0 做 3 帧均值滤波，周期性低于 0.1 处为 0，50–1100 Hz（即 RVC 和 Applio 调用 torchcrepe 的方式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3134":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-172","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"全部；DirectML 上在 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"3135":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-173","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`crepe`（`crepe/full.pth`）、`crepe-tiny`（`crepe/tiny.pth`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3136":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-174","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`swift`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3137":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-175","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`SwiftProvider` → `f0/swift_model.py`（SwiftF0 0.3.0），Applio 的次谐波修复，16 ms 帧按对数频率插值到 10 ms，置信度 ≥ 0.5 为浊音","locale":"zh-CN"},"3138":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-176","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"全部；DirectML 上在 CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"3139":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-177","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"无：`f0/data/swift_f0.pt` 随包分发","locale":"zh-CN"},"3140":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-178","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#f0-提取","content":"`RmvpeProvider` 根据设备检查对应文件，缺失时抛出带正确资源 id 的 `MissingAssetError`，这样界面提示下载的是 ONNX 还是 PyTorch 权重。`RMVPE` 只在 CUDA 上用半精度（运行时已按 GPU 规则决定）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3141":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-179","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#fcpe-的移植","content":"原版通过 `torchfcpe.spawn_bundled_infer_model` 使用 FCPE。`f0/fcpe_model.py` 只移植了这一个模型真正走到的路径：`Wav2Mel`（128 bin log-mel，16 kHz，hop 160）、纯卷积的 `CFNaiveMelPE`（`ConvOnlyEncoder` 堆叠 `ConformerConvModule`）、两种解码器和 `load_fcpe()`。注意力分支（依赖 `einops`、`local_attention`）对 `conv_only: true` 的 `fcpe_c_v001.pt` 永远不执行，所以没有移植；非 16 kHz 输入用移植的 `sinc_resample.Resample` 重采样，与 torchfcpe 使用 torchaudio 时相同。算术未改，输出与 torchfcpe 逐位相同（`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py`）。这样 rvc-next 不再依赖 torchfcpe（它会拉入 torchaudio），权重作为 `fcpe` 资源下载（来源见资源与模型仓库）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3142":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-180","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#fcpe-的移植","content":"`f0/fcpe.py:FCPEInfer` 在此之上处理设备差异：CUDA 且 CUDA Graph 开启时，mel 在图外计算，网络和解码在图内（解码的偏移张量提前放在设备上，因为图捕获禁止主机到设备拷贝）；DirectML 缺少 mel 阶段用的复数 STFT，且 `gather` 返回错误的 bin，所以 mel 和解码在 CPU、只有网络在 GPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3143":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-181","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#检索索引","content":"**检索**（`index/retrieval.py`）：`load_index()` 读 faiss 索引并一次性 `reconstruct_n` 出全部向量，得到 `LoadedIndex(path, index, vectors)`；名字含 `trained` 且同目录有对应 `added` 文件时换成后者（原版行为）。`blend(feats, index, k=8)` 用 top-8 近邻按距离平方倒数加权平均。原版每转换一个文件都重新 `read_index` + `reconstruct_n`，批量转换很慢；这里由 `Runtime.index()` 按路径和修改时间缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3144":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-182","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#检索索引","content":"**识别**（`index/inspect.py`）：`inspect_index()` 以 mmap 方式打开，只读 `d` 和 `ntotal`。`IndexInfo.version` 由维度给出（256 → v1，768 → v2），`empty` 表示 `ntotal == 0`，即没有加入向量的 `trained_*` 索引。导入会话和索引收件箱用它按内容判断索引与音色是否匹配，而不是按文件名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3145":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-183","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#检索索引","content":"**构建**（`index/build.py`，训练的 `index` 阶段，移植自 `train/train_index.py`）：拼接特征、打乱、存 `total_fea*.npy`；超过 `KMEANS_THRESHOLD`（200,000）个向量时用 faiss k-means 降到 `KMEANS_CENTRES`（10,000）个中心（原版用 scikit-learn 的 MiniBatchKMeans，换成 faiss 少一个依赖）；`IVF{n},Flat`，`n = min(16·√N, N/39)`，`nprobe = 1`；先写 `trained_IVF…index`，再分批 8192 加入向量写 `added_IVF…index`。多说话人实验（有 `multispeaker_manifest.json`）每个说话人一个索引，文件名带 `_spkid<N>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3146":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-184","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#检索索引","content":"原版只要存在任何 `added_*.index` 就跳过构建，新数据训练后仍用旧索引。这里每组特征文件的指纹（`train/fingerprint.py:of_paths`，混入版本和名字）存在 `index_fingerprint.json`，指纹变了或 `force=True` 才删掉旧文件重建，否则返回 `reused: true`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3147":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-185","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"`models/{synthesizer,modules,attentions,commons,transforms}.py` 从原版 `infer/module/` 照搬，只改了导入路径，并保持原版格式（不参加 `ruff format` 和 ty，见与原版的一致性）。四个合成器类按 `(version, pitch_guidance)` 选择（`models/loader.py:synthesizer_class`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3148":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-186","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"有音高引导","locale":"zh-CN"},"3149":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-187","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"无音高引导","locale":"zh-CN"},"3150":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-188","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"v1（256 维）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3151":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-189","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3152":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-190","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid_nono`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3153":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-191","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"v2（768 维）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3154":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-192","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3155":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-193","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid_nono`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3156":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-194","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#网络","content":"判别器为 `MultiPeriodDiscriminator`（v1）和 `MultiPeriodDiscriminatorV2`（v2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3157":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-195","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`models/checkpoint.py` 是用户已有模型能否继续使用的关键，所以原样读写：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3158":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-196","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"**小模型**（音色）：`{weight: 去掉 enc_q 的 fp16 state_dict, config: 18 个位置超参, info, sr, f0, version, speaker_info?}`。`read_small_model()` 解析成 `SmallModel`，未知键保存在 `extra` 里并在写回时保留；`target_sample_rate` 取 `config[-1]`，`speaker_slots` 取 `emb_g.weight` 的行数。`speaker_info` 经 `normalize_speaker_info()` 规范为 id 唯一、小于 110 的 `{id, name}` 列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3159":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-197","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"**完整检查点**：`G_<step>.pth`/`D_<step>.pth`，`{model, optimizer, learning_rate, iteration}`；“只保存最新”时步数固定为 `2333333`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3160":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-198","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"写入一律经 `torch_save()` 先写 `.tmp` 再 `os.replace`，崩溃不会留下半个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-199","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`summarize()` 不建网络就能描述一个小模型或 G 检查点；`inspect_checkpoint()` 则按内容识别任意 `.pth`，供导入会话使用，读得出来的文件从不抛异常：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-200","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"种类","locale":"zh-CN"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-201","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"判断依据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3164":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-202","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`small`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-203","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"有 `weight` 和 `config`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-204","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`D`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3167":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-205","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"状态字典有 `discriminators.*`；子判别器 7 个为 v1，9 个为 v2；D 无法告诉采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"3168":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-206","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`G`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3169":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-207","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"有 `dec.*`；`enc_p.emb_phone.weight` 宽 768 为 v2，否则 v1；`dec.m_source*` 存在即有音高引导；采样率由 `enc_q.pre.weight` 输入宽度（513 → 32k，1025 → 40k/48k）加上采样卷积核尺寸查 `_G_RATES`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3170":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-208","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`unknown`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3171":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-209","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"其他，附说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3172":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-210","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`enc_q.pre` 宽度","locale":"zh-CN"},"3173":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-211","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"上采样核","locale":"zh-CN"},"3174":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-212","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"3175":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-213","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"513","locale":"zh-CN"},"3176":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-214","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`(16, 16, 4, 4, 4)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3177":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-215","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"32k v1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3178":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-216","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"513","locale":"zh-CN"},"3179":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-217","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`(20, 16, 4, 4)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3180":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-218","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"32k v2","locale":"zh-CN"},"3181":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-219","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"1025","locale":"zh-CN"},"3182":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-220","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`(16, 16, 4, 4)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3183":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-221","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"40k（v1、v2 同构）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3184":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-222","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"1025","locale":"zh-CN"},"3185":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-223","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`(16, 16, 4, 4, 4)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3186":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-224","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"48k v1","locale":"zh-CN"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-225","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"1025","locale":"zh-CN"},"3188":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-226","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"`(24, 20, 4, 4)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3189":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-227","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#pth-格式","content":"48k v2","locale":"zh-CN"},"3190":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-228","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#加载融合提取改信息","content":"`loader.py:load_voice()`：读小模型，把 `config[-3]`（说话人数）改成 `emb_g` 的实际行数，构建对应合成器、删除 `enc_q`、`load_state_dict(strict=False)`，按精度转半精度或单精度。即原版 `VC.get_vc`，去掉了返回 Gradio 更新字典的部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3191":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-229","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#加载融合提取改信息","content":"`merge.py:merge_models(a, b, dst, alpha=…)`：`alpha·a + (1−alpha)·b`，结果为 fp16。两者的版本、音高引导和采样率必须相同、结构必须一致；`emb_g` 行数不同时保留较短的（原版规则）；采样率、版本取自 `a`；`speaker_info` 只在两者相同时保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3192":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-230","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#加载融合提取改信息","content":"`extract.py:extract_small_model()`：从 G 检查点提取小模型。`config_for(sample_rate, version)` 生成原版写入的 18 项配置——v2 的 40k 用 v1 的 40k 布局，与原版 `configs/v1/40k.json` 一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-231","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#加载融合提取改信息","content":"`checkpoint.py:change_info()`：复制一个小模型并改写 `info` 或说话人名（原版“修改信息”）。音色库把用户改的说话人名存在 `voice.json`，不改 `.pth`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-232","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"`convert/offline.py` 的 `OfflineConverter.convert(audio_16k, voice, params, index=…, resample_to=…, progress=…, cancel=…)` 逐行移植原版 `infer/vc/pipeline.py`，返回 `(int16 采样, 采样率)`。输入是已经解码成 16 kHz 单声道的 float32（解码由核心层用 `audio/io.py:decode` 完成）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-233","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"要点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3196":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-234","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"**F0 只算一次**，覆盖整个填充后的音频，再按块切片，避免块边界处音高不连续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-235","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"**索引**：`index_rate == 0` 或没有索引时完全跳过检索。融合在 fp32 下进行（半精度时先转 fp32 再转回），与原版一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3198":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-236","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"**protect**：`protect < 0.5` 且有音高时，把原始特征按 `pitchf` 混回——浊音帧权重 1、清音帧权重 `protect`——以保护辅音和呼吸声。`0.5` 关闭保护。整合包在这一判断之前就插值了清音帧，所以 `unvoiced = \"original\"` 时没有任何帧低于 1 Hz，protect 从不生效；`\"protect\"`（core 的默认值）改用检测器自己的有声判断作为掩码（由 `offline_f0` 返回），仍然送入插值后的音高；`\"zero\"` 在这些帧保留 0 Hz，与经典 RVC 相同。`unvoiced` 不是 `\"original\"` 时，`StreamEngine` 也做同样的混合，掩码来自与 `cache_pitchf` 同步移动的有声缓存（原版实时没有 protect）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3199":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-237","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"**说话人** `params.speaker_id` 直接作为 `sid` 传给合成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3200":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-238","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线转换","content":"**取消与进度**：每块之前 `cancel.check()`，每块之后 `progress(n/total)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3201":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-239","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"原版只有实时引擎支持共振峰（formant）偏移，这里把实时的方法搬到了离线：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3202":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-240","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"F0 按 `pitch − formant` 移调（与实时相同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3203":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-241","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"`factor = 2^(formant/12)`，要求合成器生成 `n_res = ceil(frames · factor)` 帧，并把 NSF 的连续音高 `pitchf` 乘以 `n_res / frames`，使生成更长的音频时音高不变；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3204":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-242","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"`_formant_resample()` 用 `upp_res = floor(factor · tgt_sr / 100)` 个采样每帧截取，再用 `sinc_resample.Resample(upp_res → tgt_sr/100)` 压回原长度——时长恢复，频谱包络整体上移 `factor`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3205":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-243","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"`formant == 0` 时 `n_res` 为 `None`，走的是原版完全相同的调用，所以默认参数下输出与原版逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3206":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-244","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#离线共振峰偏移","content":"输出可能比输入短至多两个 10 ms 帧，这来自原版逐块 `p_len = len // 160` 的取整，有意保留以维持逐位一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3207":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-245","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#流式引擎","content":"`stream/engine.py` 的 `StreamEngine` 是“一块进、一块出、没有 I/O”的实时转换器。数学来自原版 `infer/rtrvc.py`（`RVC.infer`）和 `realtime_gui.py` 的 `start_vc`、`audio_callback`；原版这套 DSP 链在 GUI 回调、`rtrvc` 和 VST worker 里有三份拷贝，这里合为一个类。`process()` 是同步的、只接受普通数组，所以它可以由 PortAudio 会话驱动、由测试拿 WAV 驱动，也可以在将来由 VST 适配器或浏览器传输驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3208":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-246","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"全部长度按设备采样率 `sample_rate` 计，`zc = sample_rate // 100`（10 ms），毫秒参数都四舍五入到整 10 ms（`_frames`，原版的取整方式）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3209":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-247","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3210":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-248","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"3211":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-249","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`block_frame`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3212":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-250","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`block_ms`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3213":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-251","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`crossfade_frame`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3214":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-252","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`crossfade_ms`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3215":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-253","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`sola_buffer_frame`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3216":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-254","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`min(crossfade_frame, 4·zc)`（最多 40 ms）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3217":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-255","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`sola_search_frame`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3218":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-256","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`zc`（10 ms）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3219":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-257","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`extra_frame`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3220":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-258","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`context_ms`（原版的 `extra_time`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3221":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-259","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`input_wav`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3222":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-260","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`extra + crossfade + sola_search + block`，设备采样率滚动缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"3223":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-261","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`input_wav_res`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3224":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-262","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"同一缓冲的 16 kHz 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3225":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-263","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`skip_head` / `return_length`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3226":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-264","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#缓冲区_build","content":"`extra_frame // zc` / `(block + sola_buffer + sola_search) // zc`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3227":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-265","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#每块的处理_process-与-_infer","content":"HuBERT 对整个 `context` 运行（上下文越长，特征越稳），但检索只处理 `skip_head // 2` 之后的新帧，生成也只生成新的音频（`skip_head`/`return_length`），这是延迟可控的原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3228":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-266","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#每块的处理_process-与-_infer","content":"F0 只在缓冲尾部计算：长度 `block_frame_16k + 800`，RMVPE 时向上取整到 5120 的倍数再减 160（RMVPE 的帧对齐）。结果去掉首尾几帧后滚入 1024 帧的 `cache_pitch`/`cache_pitchf`。实时的 pm 与离线不同：两端按 65 Hz 下限补零、截到块的帧数（`_pm`），这是原版的实时写法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3229":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-267","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#每块的处理_process-与-_infer","content":"共振峰：`return_length2 = ceil(return_length · factor)`，`cache_pitchf` 乘 `return_length2 / return_length`，生成后按 `upp_res` 重采样回来——离线方法就是从这里来的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3230":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-268","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#每块的处理_process-与-_infer","content":"SOLA（`audio/sola.py`，来自 DDSP-SVC）：在 `sola_search_frame` 范围内找与上一块尾部归一化互相关最大的偏移，`sin²` 淡入淡出，保存下一块要用的尾部。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3231":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-269","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#每块的处理_process-与-_infer","content":"设备采样率与 16 kHz、合成器采样率与设备采样率之间的重采样都用移植的 `sinc_resample.Resample`，并走 CUDA Graph（`realtime-input-resample`、`realtime-output-resample`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3232":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-270","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#与原版的两处不同","content":"**说话人生效**：原版 `rtrvc.py` 把 `sid` 写死为 0，多说话人音色在实时 GUI 和 VST 里无法选人；这里用 `params.speaker_id`，并钳制到 `[0, n_spk−1]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3233":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-271","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#与原版的两处不同","content":"**改块长不重载模型**：见下一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3234":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-272","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3235":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-273","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"3236":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-274","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`update(VoiceParams)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3237":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-275","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"音高、共振峰、索引强度、protect、响度混合、说话人、F0 方法从下一块生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"3238":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-276","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`reconfigure(StreamParams)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3239":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-277","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"阈值、降噪开关是热的；`block_ms`、`crossfade_ms`、`context_ms` 变化时（`StreamParams.same_buffers()` 为假）重建缓冲区，音色保持加载，约一块静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"3240":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-278","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`set_voice(voice, index)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3241":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-279","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"在两块之间换音色；HuBERT 和 F0 模型由运行时共享","locale":"zh-CN"},"3242":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-280","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`set_index(index)` / `reset()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3243":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-281","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"换索引 / 清空全部缓冲（设备切换后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3244":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-282","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`prewarm()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3245":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-283","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"用一块 220 Hz 测试音走一遍全部阶段，触发 CUDA Graph 捕获和惰性加载，然后 `reset()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3246":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-284","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`passthrough` 属性","locale":"zh-CN"},"3247":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-285","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"跳过音色，返回（门限、降噪后的）输入，取代原版的 `im` 模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3248":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-286","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"所有入口都在同一把 `RLock` 下，所以控制线程的更新不会和处理线程的 `process()` 交错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3249":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-287","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#热更新","content":"`prepare_voice()` 对音色的 `net_g` 调用 `remove_weight_norm()`，与原版实时加载器一致（权重归一化折叠进权重，推理更快）。这会就地改变运行时缓存里的对象，所以 `StreamEngine` 只在 Live worker 自己的 `Runtime` 里使用，从不使用服务器进程的运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3250":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-288","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#延迟估算","content":"`stream/latency.py:estimate_latency_ms()` 是原版显示公式（输出延迟 + 块 + 交叉淡化 + 10 ms，加上输入降噪项 `min(crossfade, 40 ms)`）的扩展：再加上输出环形缓冲预填充的一块、分离流时环形缓冲的目标填充一块，以及输入设备延迟。实测的推理耗时另外在统计里报告（`infer_ms_p50/p95`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3251":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-289","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3252":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-290","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3253":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-291","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/io.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3254":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-292","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`probe()`（时长、采样率、声道、编码；无时长的容器逐帧计数）、`decode()`（PyAV + libswresample 一次完成解码、混音、重采样，`max_seconds` 用于预览）、`encode()`（wav/flac 用 soundfile，mp3/m4a 经 PyAV 转码；先写 `.<name>.part` 再改名）、`to_int16()`。PyAV 失败时退回 `ffmpeg`/`ffprobe` 命令（若在 PATH 上）。原版 `clean_path` 去引号、去空格的处理被删掉——路径到这里已是干净的，任何操作系统接受的路径都可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3255":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-293","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/resample.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3256":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-294","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`resample()`：librosa 默认（soxr）重采样，用于转换后的“重采样到”选项，与原版相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"3257":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-295","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/sinc_resample.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3258":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-296","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"从 torchaudio 2.11 移植的 `Resample`、`sinc_resample_kernel`、`apply_sinc_resample_kernel`，逐位相同（见与原版的一致性）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3259":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-297","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/dsp.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3260":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-298","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`highpass_16k()`（48 Hz 5 阶 Butterworth，零相位）、`change_rms()`（原版响度包络混合）、dB 换算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3261":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-299","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/peaks.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3262":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-300","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`compute_peaks()`：波形显示用的交错 (min, max) 对，由核心层缓存到 `cache/peaks/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3263":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-301","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/sola.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3264":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-302","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"SOLA 交叉淡化","locale":"zh-CN"},"3265":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-303","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/denoise.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3266":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-304","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"TorchGate 谱门降噪，照搬原版 `tools/torchgate/`（它复用 `f0/rmvpe.py` 的 `STFT`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3267":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-305","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"`audio/effects.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3268":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-306","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"基于 pedalboard 的效果链（可选依赖，只在这里导入）：`EFFECTS` 是效果目录，列出每种效果的参数默认值和范围（沿用 pedalboard 的参数名；核心层据此校验，`GET /convert/effects` 把它发给界面）；`apply()` 处理整个文件，为混响和延迟补上尾音，并在 −80 dB 处截断；`EffectsChain` 处理音频流，块与块之间保留插件状态，每次都返回完整的一块。变调只用于离线（`streams=False`）：在流中，pedalboard 的变调会压住约一秒音频。`unavailable_reason()` 会先在子进程中导入一次 pedalboard：它的某些安装包在较旧的处理器上会以非法指令终止导入它的进程，这时效果会被报告为不可用，而不是让进程崩溃","locale":"zh-CN"},"3269":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-307","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#音频编解码与-dsp","content":"PyAV 用的 libavformat/libswresample 正是原版通过 `ffmpeg` 命令调用的库，所以不必依赖系统里装了 ffmpeg。mp3 和 AAC 只接受固定的采样率，`_transcode()` 用 `encoder_rate()` 把 40 kHz 输出升到 44.1 kHz——原版的 `wav2` 不做这一步，40k 模型导出 mp3/m4a 会失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3270":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-308","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#实时音频设备audio_io","content":"原版 `realtime_gui.py` 的设备处理有一串问题：同一个麦克风按 Windows 每种驱动（MME、DirectSound、WASAPI、WDM-KS）各出现一次，用户必须先选驱动类型；MME 把名字截到 31 个字符，GUI 又按名字保存和匹配；单个双工 `sd.Stream` 要求输入输出同一驱动类型；保存的设备不在时静默换成系统默认；刷新列表要停止转换并调用私有的 `sd._terminate()`/`sd._initialize()`；改任何设备都要停流重载模型。`audio_io/` 是对这些问题的重写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3271":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-309","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"`enumerate_raw()` 是唯一导入 `sounddevice` 的函数：`query_hostapis()`、`query_devices()`，并用 `check_input_settings`/`check_output_settings` 探测 44.1/48/88.2/96 kHz 是否支持。它在短命的 `workers.devices` 子进程里运行，所以重新枚举不会扰动正在运行的流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3272":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-310","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"`group_devices()` 与 `resolve_selection()` 都是纯函数，测试用捕获的真实枚举结果（`tests/fixtures/devices/{windows,macos,linux_pipewire}.json`）驱动：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3273":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-311","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"名字规范化（`normalize_name`）：大小写折叠、合并空白、去掉某些驱动追加的 `(<host api>)` 后缀。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3274":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-312","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"按名字从长到短分组，这样 MME 截断到 31 字符的名字可以作为前缀找到同一设备的完整名字；前缀有歧义时单独成组——分错的代价是重复显示，比合错安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3275":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-313","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"每组是一个物理设备，`variants` 按驱动排名排列，第一个是推荐驱动。排名（`HOST_API_RANKS`，越小越好）：Windows ASIO → WASAPI → WDM-KS → DirectSound → MME；macOS Core Audio；Linux JACK → ALSA → Pulse → OSS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3276":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-314","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"设备 id 是 `sha1(host_api | 原始名字 | 方向 | 同名序号)[:12]`，跨枚举稳定；`portaudio_index` 只在本次枚举内有效，从不保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3277":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-315","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"`Microsoft Sound Mapper`、`Primary Sound Driver` 这类“跟随系统默认”的别名不列出；虚拟设备（VB-Audio、VoiceMeeter、BlackHole、Loopback、Soundflower、null sink……）打上 `is_virtual`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3278":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-316","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#枚举与分组devicespy","content":"`resolve_selection(selection, device_list, direction)` 在新列表里找回保存的选择，依次尝试：相同 `device_id` → 相同物理键且同驱动 → 相同物理键的推荐驱动 → 任意驱动上的相同名字 → 系统默认。返回状态 `exact`、`matched`、`default_fallback` 或 `missing`，后两者带一句说明。是否允许输出回退到默认设备是核心层的决定（`allow_output_fallback`），因为把转换后的声音送到扬声器而不是虚拟线缆，是用户最先注意到的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3279":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-317","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"`AudioSession` 在一个 `Backend` 上打开输入、输出和可选的监听输出，用环形缓冲连接，并运行一个处理线程把整块交给处理器（通常是 `StreamEngine.process`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3280":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-318","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**引擎采样率**（`engine_rate`）：输出端选定的采样率；否则输出设备默认采样率（若支持）；否则 48 kHz。这取代了原版用户难以判断的 `sr_model`/`sr_device` 开关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3281":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-319","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**拓扑**（`choose_topology`）：输入输出同一驱动且都支持该采样率时用一个双工流（`duplex`，延迟最低）；否则输入流 + 输出流（`split`），中间的环形缓冲带漂移校正。输入设备不支持引擎采样率时以自己的默认采样率打开，用 `LinearResampler` 线性插值转换——引擎反正要再重采样到 16 kHz，这里线性插值的代价很小。监听输出永远是独立的输出流，由处理线程分出一路（`monitor_source`：`converted`、`input` 或 `both`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3282":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-320","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**声道**：输入打开到所选最高声道（默认单声道），回调里把所选声道混成单声道；输出把单声道写到所选声道（默认前两个）。有些驱动不接受比设备本身更少的声道（WDM-KS 的 pin、只支持立体声的声卡），以单声道打开会报 `Invalid number of channels [PaErrorCode -9998]`。所以枚举时也探测声道数（`probe_device`：在默认采样率下试 1、2 和最大值，其中有失败时再逐个试到 8），设备拒绝某些声道数时记为 `channel_counts`。打开流时取不小于所需的下一个可用声道数（`accepted_channels`），多出的声道不用；支持的采样率也按这个声道数探测。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3283":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-321","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**回调只搬数据和计数**，不碰 torch、不写日志、不分配大对象。输出环形缓冲启动时预填一块静音（`split` 时两块）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3284":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-322","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**设备丢失**：流的 `finished_callback` 意外触发，或看门狗发现某个角色超过 `max(0.5 s, 3 块)` 没有回调，即报告丢失（`on_device_lost(role, device_id, reason, message)`），只报一次。PortAudio 错误文本由 `classify_portaudio_error()` 归入 `missing`、`busy`、`channels`（-9998，单独列出：换采样率解决不了）、`format`、`permission`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3285":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-323","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"**统计**：输入/输出峰值与 RMS、推理耗时 p50/p95（最近 50 块）、欠载/过载计数、`split` 时的漂移 ppm。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3286":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-324","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"`Ring`（`rings.py`）是单生产者单消费者的 float32 环形缓冲，锁只覆盖索引运算和两次切片拷贝，所以音频回调等待处理线程的时间不超过一次拷贝；写满算一次过载，读空算欠载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3287":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-325","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"`DriftCorrector`（`drift.py`）解决两个设备时钟永远不完全同步的问题：读端对环形缓冲的填充量做指数平滑；偏离目标超过半块时，每 10 ms 删除或复制一个采样（选在每段 10 ms 中最安静的位置），直到回到目标的 1/8 块以内。目标填充量在前 1 秒后取实测值，因为两个回调的相位决定了填充量稳定在哪里，任何常数都猜不准。真实时钟的漂移是几十 ppm，相当于每秒几个采样，听不出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3288":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-326","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#会话与拓扑streamspy","content":"`SounddeviceBackend` 用 PortAudio（`latency=\"low\"`，WASAPI 经 `WasapiSettings`：选了独占就独占，否则共享模式加 `auto_convert`，由 Windows 转换声道数和采样率——PortAudio 自己只做单声道 ↔ 立体声的转换）；`enable_asio` 设置 `SD_ENABLE_ASIO=1`，选用 sounddevice 0.5.1 起在 Windows 上附带的 ASIO 版 PortAudio。`fake.py:FakeBackend` 模拟设备：每个流一个线程按设备自己的时钟（`1 + ppm·1e-6` 倍标称速率）调用回调，`lose(index)` 模拟拔出 USB 设备，`refuse` 让打开失败，输出被录下来供断言。测试和 worker 请求里的 `backend: \"fake\"` 都走它（`backend_from_request`）。`tone.py:chime()` 是“测试”按钮播放的提示音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3289":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-327","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#录制输出设备capturepy","content":"PortAudio 无法录制渲染端点：输出设备没有输入声道，按输入打开会报 `Invalid number of channels [PaErrorCode -9998]`。PortAudio 的 WASAPI 宿主 API 在 2022 年才加入环回设备（每个输出再以 `<输出名> [Loopback]` 的名字列为输入，用 `AUDCLNT_STREAMFLAGS_LOOPBACK` 打开），晚于 sounddevice 附带的 19.7.0 DLL；它的 ALSA 宿主 API 也无法指定 PulseAudio 监视器。因此由一个环回提供者负责录制：`SoundcardLoopback` 基于 SoundCard（≥ 0.4.3，没有声音播放时返回静音而不是阻塞），Windows 上用 WASAPI 环回，PulseAudio/PipeWire 上用监视器源。macOS 没有提供者（Core Audio 的进程 tap 不在 PortAudio 之内），`loopback_provider()` 会说明这一点，消息进入 `DeviceList.errors`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3290":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-328","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#录制输出设备capturepy","content":"**列出**：打开 `live.show_all_devices` 时，枚举会请求环回源（`\"loopback\": true`）。`add_loopback_sources` 把它们作为 `Loopback` 宿主 API 下的输入设备追加进去，索引为负，带 `loopback_source`（提供者的 id）和 `loopback_of`（输出的名称）。本身就是环回的 PortAudio 设备（`[Loopback]`、`Monitor of …`，见 `devices.loopback_target`）直接使用，不再询问提供者。环回输入的物理设备键以 `loopback:` 开头，不会和同名麦克风合并；设置关闭时核心层会隐藏环回输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3291":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-329","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#录制输出设备capturepy","content":"**打开**：`SounddeviceBackend.open_input` 和 `check` 把带 `loopback_source` 的端点交给提供者。`CaptureStream` 在自己的线程里打开、读取（`record(None)`，到了多少取多少）并关闭录制器（Windows 上处于 COM 多线程单元），等待打开完成，因此拒绝会表现为 `DeviceOpenError`；`start()` 之后才调用输入回调，录制器中途失效时报告设备丢失。提供者会转换任意采样率和声道数；`choose_topology` 总是用 `split`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3292":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-330","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#录制输出设备capturepy","content":"**回授**：输入的 `loopback_of` 正是输出或监听设备时，核心层拒绝（`feedback`，在检查、开始、运行中换设备和监听自己时）；按名称比较，在 Windows 上是精确的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3293":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-331","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`workers/live.py` 是一个长期运行的进程，拥有音频设备和实时线程，与服务器的事件循环、GIL 竞争和崩溃隔离。它用 `multiprocessing.connection.Client` 连回核心层（地址和随机 authkey 在请求文件里，`protocol/live.py:WorkerRequest`），收发 `protocol/live.py` 定义的 JSON 消息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3294":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-332","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"发往 worker","locale":"zh-CN"},"3295":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-333","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3296":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-334","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Start(config)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3297":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-335","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"加载音色（`voice_path`、`index_path`）、构建引擎、预热、打开设备；状态依次 `starting` → `loading` → `prewarming` → `running`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3298":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-336","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Stop` / `Shutdown`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3299":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-337","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"停止会话 / 退出进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"3300":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-338","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`UpdateVoice(params)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3301":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-339","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"热更新；换 F0 方法时先在控制线程里加载新模型，缺资源就保留旧方法并报 `asset_missing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3302":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-340","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`UpdateStream(stream)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3303":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-341","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"阈值、降噪热更新；块长等变化时关流、`reconfigure`、重新开流，音色不重载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3304":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-342","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`SetVoice(voice_path, index_path, speaker_id)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3305":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-343","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"运行中换音色：新音色加载期间旧音色继续转换；加载失败报 `detail.reason == \"voice_load\"` 并继续用旧音色。无论成败都回送带 `voice_path` 的 `State`，核心层据此知道实际在转换的是哪个音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"3306":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-344","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`SetDevices(devices)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3307":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-345","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"只关闭和重开流；引擎采样率变了才重建引擎（音色仍在运行时缓存里）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3308":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-346","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Meter(on, input, input_gain_db)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3309":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-347","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"空闲时单独打开输入，只测电平；同一输入再次请求时保留流、只更新增益。何时打开由核心层决定（租约、状态、重试）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3310":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-348","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`TestTone(device)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3311":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-349","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"在一个输出上播放提示音","locale":"zh-CN"},"3312":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-350","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Passthrough(on)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3313":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-351","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"把输入直通到监听（或输出），检查路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3314":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-352","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`ReleaseMemory`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3315":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-353","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"卸载引擎和全部模型；会话活动时忽略","locale":"zh-CN"},"3316":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-354","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"来自 worker","locale":"zh-CN"},"3317":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-355","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3318":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-356","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`State`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3319":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-357","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`state`、`error`（`{code, message, detail}`）、`topology`、`sample_rate`、`meter`、`passthrough`、`cached`（worker 运行时里加载的模型，用于“释放显存”）、`voice_path`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3320":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-358","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Stats`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3321":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-359","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"10 Hz 的电平（输入、输出、监听）、推理耗时、块长、估算延迟、欠载/过载、漂移、显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3322":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-360","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`DeviceLost`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3323":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-361","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"角色、设备 id、原因、消息","locale":"zh-CN"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-362","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"`Log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-363","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-364","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#live-worker-与控制协议","content":"设备丢失后 worker 报告 `DeviceLost`、停止会话并进入 `reconnecting`，然后等待 `SetDevices`；重新枚举、按 `exact`/`matched` 重开的策略在核心层（见核心服务）。处理线程出错、或加载/预热时 OOM，worker 先卸载自己的全部模型，再报 `compute_unavailable`（`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-365","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"**模型表与预设**（`separate/presets.py`）：`MODELS` 是原版 `tools/pymss_webui.py` 的 `MODEL_SPECS`——五个 Roformer 模型（`vocals`、`vocals-aggressive`、`dereverb`、`dereverb-aggressive`、`karaoke`），每个有检查点、YAML、主/副输出音轨及其标签、批大小、重叠、大小和 SHA-256。预设本身是数据，放在 `core/separation/presets.json`：五个单模型预设，加两个链 `vocals-clean`（vocals → dereverb）和 `lead-clean`（vocals → karaoke → dereverb）。YAML 随包分发（`separate/configs/`），只有检查点需要下载；`resolve_model()` 若在资源目录的 `pymss_weights/` 旁找到 YAML 就优先用它，以便直接指向原版安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-366","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"**链规划**（`plan_chain`）：每一步分离上一步的主音轨；最后一步的主音轨以预设的 `primary_stem` 标签写出，其他音轨在预设 `stems` 列出其标签时写出，每个标签只写一次。输出名 `<输入>.<标签>.<格式>`，冲突时加 `-2`、`-3`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-367","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"**运行器**（`separate/runner.py:run_separation`）：每个输入以 44.1 kHz 立体声解码一次，按计划逐步分离并写出音轨；模型在一个任务里只加载一次；进度按“已处理音频秒数 / 总秒数 × 步数”计算。`PymssSeparator` 用 pymss 2.1.7 的 `MSSeparator`，选项与原版相同；pymss 只认识 cpu/cuda/mps，所以 DirectML 上模型先在 CPU 加载再移到设备（fp16 尝试时转半精度）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-368","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"**DirectML 的 fp16 → fp32 重试**：DirectML 先用 fp16；在任何文件成功之前出现可重试的错误（不是内存不足）时抛 `RetryInFp32`，worker 以退出码 `75`（`EXIT_RETRY`）结束，核心层用 `precision: \"fp32\"` 在新进程里重跑——与原版的设计相同，因为失败的 DirectML 上下文无法在进程内恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3331":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-369","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"**导入检查**：`workers/separate.py` 的 `check` 动作在 CPU 上加载一次导入的模型，让错误的检查点/YAML 组合在导入时就失败。`inspect_config()` 用 pymss_core 的 `detect_model_type` 识别 YAML，`custom_model()` 为导入的模型生成与 `resolve_model()` 同形的描述。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3332":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-370","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#人声分离","content":"`FakeSeparator` 把输入减半作为两个音轨，可配置延迟和 fp16 失败，供测试使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3333":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-371","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"核心层在这些阶段之前还有一个可选的 `clean` 阶段（用分离预设清理数据集），它调用分离服务而不是引擎的训练代码，见核心服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3334":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-372","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"每个阶段是一个函数：接收冻结的请求 dataclass，写入实验文件夹，通过回调报告进度和日志，已完成的工作跳过。它们在 `workers.train` 子进程里运行（每个阶段一个进程，取消即杀进程树）；需要并行的部分由 `train/parallel.py:run_parts()` 以 `spawn` 方式启动子进程（fork 会破坏 CUDA 和部分 BLAS），只有一个部分时在本进程内运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3335":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-373","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3336":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-374","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"函数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3337":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-375","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"输出（实验文件夹内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3338":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-376","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3339":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-377","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"`slice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3340":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-378","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"`train/preprocess.py:run(SliceRequest)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3341":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-379","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"`0_gt_wavs/`、`1_16k_wavs/`、`slice_done.txt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3342":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-380","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"slicer2（−42 dB），约 3.7 s 一片、0.3 s 重叠，因果高通后归一化写出；**每一片的尾部都写出**（修正原版回归）；完成的输入键记入 `slice_done.txt`，中断后只重切未完成的","locale":"zh-CN"},"3343":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-381","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"ty