的 `CONFIGS`（原版 `configs/v1|v2/*.json`）；v2 没有 40k 文件，用 `v1/40k`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3362":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-400","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"从最新的 G/D 恢复，继续**之后**的轮次（原版会重复已保存的那一轮）；否则加载底模，说话人数多于底模时扩展 `emb_g`（`load_pretrained_generator`）。AMP 仅当所选的每张卡都符合 fp16 时开启（`training_is_half`，原版 `get_training_dtype`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3363":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-401","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"原版的 `os._exit(0)`、`argparse` 和全局状态都去掉了；进度、日志、指标、保存的文件经 `Sink` 报告（同进程直接回调，DDP 时 rank 0 经队列）。每行指标写入 `metrics.jsonl` 并作为 `metric` 事件发出，核心层转成 `train_metrics`。TensorBoard 可选。小模型写入 `<实验>/weights/`，不再写进全局的 `assets/weights/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3364":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-402","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#训练","content":"其他辅助：`train/multispeaker.py`（说话人表、`Name_ID_Repeat` 文件夹约定、`multispeaker_manifest.json`，切片文件以 `output_key` 命名，从而把说话人带过 F0、特征、文件列表和索引）、`train/scan.py:scan_dataset()`（切片前报告片段数、时长、采样率、过短/过长/削波等问题）、`train/experiment.py`（阶段输出是否存在、检查点列表、读取 `metrics.jsonl`、读取原版实验文件夹 `read_legacy()`、默认批大小为最小显卡显存 GiB ÷ 2、默认 CPU 进程数为核数 ÷ 1.5）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3365":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-403","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#指纹","content":"`train/fingerprint.py:of_paths(paths, extra)` 对给定文件和文件夹（递归）的相对名字、大小、修改时间做 SHA-1，`extra`（采样率、F0 方法等决定输出的设置）以文本混入；缺失的路径与空文件夹哈希不同。只看元数据而不读内容，所以对几 GB 的数据集也是瞬间完成。它有两个用户：索引阶段用它决定是否重建（见上文“检索索引”）；核心层在 `experiment.json` 里为每个完成的阶段记下指纹。“全部运行”会把存储的指纹与重新计算的指纹比较，不一致的阶段及其后各阶段都重跑；设置修改和上游重跑另外会显式标记过期（见核心服务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3366":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-404","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"四个 worker 都是 `python -m rvc_next.workers.<name> <request.json>`，共用 `workers/base.py:run_worker()`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3367":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-405","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"把真正的 stdout 复制一份留给事件，再把 fd 1 重定向到 stderr——第三方库 `print` 的内容就不会混进事件流，而是作为日志文本保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3368":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-406","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"事件是带前缀 `@rvc ` 的 JSON 行（`protocol/jsonl.py`）；没有前缀的行由 `parse_line()` 当作 info 日志。事件类型在 `protocol/messages.py`：`progress`、`step`、`log`、`metric`、`output`、`result`、`error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3369":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-407","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"`rvc_next` 日志记录器的输出转成 `log` 事件；`SIGTERM` 以退出码 130（`EXIT_CANCELLED`）结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3370":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-408","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"异常映射：`Cancelled` → 130；`MissingAssetError` → `asset_missing`（带 `detail.assets`）；`ModelFormatError` → `invalid_model`；OOM → `compute_unavailable`（`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`）；其他 → `internal_error`，先把完整回溯作为 `log` 事件发出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3371":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-409","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"Worker","locale":"zh-CN"},"3372":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-410","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"3373":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-411","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#worker-子进程的入口","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"3374":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-412","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-e