s/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity","content":"原版是一个 2026 年的重度修改分支，不是上游：它用 transformers 的 HuBERT 替换了 fairseq，用 PyMSS 替换了 UVR5，并加入了 CUDA Graph 加速、多说话人训练、命令行和 VST 插件。下文所说的“原版”都指这个分支。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3403":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-15","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"**照搬**：以下文件从原版复制，只修正导入路径，保持原版的形状，以便逐行 diff：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3404":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-16","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"3405":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-17","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"原版","locale":"zh-CN"},"3406":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-18","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/models/{synthesizer,modules,attentions,commons,transforms}.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3407":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-19","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`infer/module/*.py`（四个合成器类和两种判别器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3408":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-20","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/f0/rmvpe.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3409":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-21","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`infer/rmvpe.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3410":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-22","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/audio/denoise.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3411":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-23","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`tools/torchgate/`（TorchGate）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3412":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-24","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/graph.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3413":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-25","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`tools/cuda_graph.py`（只有开关从环境变量改为进程级设置）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3414":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-26","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/train/{slicer,losses,mel}.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3415":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-27","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`train/dataset/slicer2.py`、`train/losses.py`、`train/mel_processing.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-28","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`engine/train/dataset.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-29","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"`train/data_utils.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-30","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"**逐行移植到新接口**：管线的数学一行不改，但包在新的函数和类里——离线转换（`engine/convert/offline.py` ← `infer/vc/pipeline.py`）、流式转换（`engine/stream/engine.py` ← `infer/rtrvc.py` 加 `realtime_gui.py` 的 `start_vc`/`audio_callback`）、训练各阶段（`engine/train/*` ← `train/*.py`、`train/dataset/*.py`、`tools/multispeaker.py`、`webui.py` 的文件列表代码）、检查点工具（`engine/models/{checkpoint,merge,extract}.py` ← `train/process_ckpt.py`）、GPU 规则（`engine/runtime.py` ← `configs/config.py`）、分离模型表（`engine/separate/` ← `tools/pymss_webui.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-31","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"**不移植**：Gradio 处理函数、实时 GUI 的回调和控件、进程启动方式（`Popen(cmd, shell=True)` 加 `%` 格式化的命令行）、中文状态字符串、返回 Gradio 更新字典的引擎接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-32","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#移植规则","content":"为了让照搬的文件能与原版对比，`pyproject.toml` 把 `engine/models/{attentions,commons,modules,transforms,synthesizer}.py` 和 `engine/f0/rmvpe.py` 排除在 `ruff format` 和 ty 之外，并给它们以及 `engine/audio/denoise.py`、`engine/train/{dataset,losses,mel,slicer}.py` 按文件忽略 `B`、`SIM`、`UP`、`E402`、`E712`、`E741`、`F841` 等规则（见开发环境）。修改这些文件时保持原版风格；修 bug 时在 golden 测试里确认数值没变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-33","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#golden-测试","content":"golden 测试在同一台机器上同时运行原版和 rvc-next，对比输出。两边都在 **CPU、fp32**、相同随机种子、相同的 16 kHz 输入（只解码一次）上运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3422":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-34","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#离线scriptsgoldenpy","content":"`scripts/golden.py` 把原版 checkout 放到 `sys.path` 上，只导入 `infer.hubert`、`infer.vc.pipeline` 和 `infer.module.models`（不加载任何界面），用原版的 CPU 分块参数（`x_pad/x_query/x_center/x_max = 1/6/38/41`）构造 `Pipeline`；rvc-next 一侧用 `Runtime(device=\"cpu\", precision=\"fp32\")` 和 `OfflineConverter`。每个 (音色, 片段, F0 方法) 输出一行：样本差的 RMS（−1..1 刻度）以及是否逐位相同。容差 `TOLERANCE = 1e-4`，超出则退出码 1。不给 `--f0` 时只比 `pm` 和 `rmvpe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3423":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-35","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"两个测试都带 `golden` 标记，默认不选（`addopts = \"-m 'not live and not golden and not assets'\"`），用 `pytest -m golden` 运行。环境变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3424":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-36","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3425":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-37","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3426":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-38","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_ORIGINAL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-39","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"原版 checkout，默认 `~/code_workspace/Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-40","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3429":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-41","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"原版布局的资源目录（`hubert_base/`、`rmvpe/`，离线测试还需 `fcpe/fcpe_c_v001.pt`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3430":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-42","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_VOICES`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-43","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"用 `os.pathsep` 分隔的 `.pth` 列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-44","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_CLIP`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-45","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"一个音频文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-46","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`test_offline_golden.py`：通过 `scripts/golden.py` 对每个音色跑 `pm`、`rmvpe`、`fcpe`，移调 2、说话人 1；要求全部在 1e-4 以内**且逐位相同**。原版的 FCPE 依赖 torchfcpe，所以测试 `importorskip(\"torchfcpe\")`——torchfcpe 要装在运行测试的环境里，供原版一侧使用，rvc-next 自己不依赖它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-47","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"`test_stream_golden.py`：原版的 `start_vc`/`audio_callback` 写在 GUI 的 `__main__` 块里无法导入，测试里有一份去掉 GUI 的拷贝（`OriginalStream`），驱动原版的 `rtrvc.RVC`；rvc-next 一侧是 `StreamEngine`。对每个音色逐块（最多 12 块）比较，每块前用相同种子。三组参数覆盖 48k/40k、RMVPE/pm、移调、共振峰 1.0、输入输出降噪和门限。原版实时代码导入 torchaudio，所以测试 `importorskip(\"torchaudio\")`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-48","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#pytesttestsgolden","content":"缺少原版 checkout、资源或所需的包时，测试跳过而不是失败（CI 里没有原版的这些依赖）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-49","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#已经证明的","content":"按照 AGENTS.md 的记录，CPU fp32 下：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-50","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#已经证明的","content":"**离线**，pm 和 RMVPE：v1 40k、v2 40k、v2 40k 无音高、v2 48k 四类音色，在语音、静音和一段超过分块阈值的 70 秒片段上，带移调和说话人 id，输出**逐位相同**；FCPE 同样逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-51","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#已经证明的","content":"**流式**：`StreamEngine` 与 `rtrvc.RVC.infer` 加实时 GUI 回调数学（门限、输入输出 TorchGate、共振峰、RMS 混合、SOLA）逐块逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-52","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#已经证明的","content":"HuBERT、RMVPE 和 FCPE 的权重初始化（随后被检查点覆盖）会从全局随机数生成器取数，而原版在 `Pipeline` 内部才构建 RMVPE/FCPE。如果一边先播种再建模型、另一边相反，两边后续的随机序列就错开了（例如 NSF 的噪声源），结果不再逐位相同。所以 golden 代码先 `runtime.hubert()`、`runtime.f0(method)`，原版一侧也预先构建 RMVPE/FCPE 塞进 `pipeline.model_rmvpe`/`model_fcpe`，然后才 `torch.manual_seed()`。新增 golden 用例时保持这个顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-53","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"每一项都在原版代码里找到了原因；默认参数下，影响数值的变化都不改变 golden 结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-54","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-55","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"原版","locale":"zh-CN"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-56","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-57","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-58","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"切片保留每一片的尾部","locale":"zh-CN"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-59","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"`train/preprocess.py` 里最后的 `norm_write(tmp_audio…)` 在 `for audio in self.slicer.slice(audio)` 循环之外，只写最后一段的尾部（`81eed5e` 引入的回归，`5d47da1` 时在循环内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-60","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#有意的行为变化","content":"`PreProcess.slices()` 在循环内收集尾部","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/doc