y#有意的行为变化","content":"**CUDA Graph 开关**：原版环境变量 `RVC_CUDA_GRAPH`，rvc-next 是设置 `compute.cuda_graph_offline`（默认关）和 `compute.cuda_graph_live`（默认开）；缓存容量变量改名为 `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE`。golden 代码运行前会清掉 `RVC_CUDA_GRAPH`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-111","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"原版通过 torchaudio 做实时重采样，通过 torchfcpe 做 FCPE。torchaudio 的最后一个版本是 2.11，而且不声明对 torch 的依赖，无约束的 torch 会解析到它无法加载的版本；torchfcpe 又会拉入 torchaudio。所以 rvc-next 把用到的部分移植进来，不再依赖这两个包：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-112","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"移植","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-113","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-114","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"用在","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-115","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"证明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-116","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"`engine/audio/sinc_resample.py`：`Resample`、`sinc_resample_kernel`、`apply_sinc_resample_kernel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-117","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"torchaudio 2.11 的 `transforms.Resample` 与 `functional._get_sinc_resample_kernel`/`_apply_sinc_resample_kernel`（BSD-2，许可证全文在文件头）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-118","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"流式引擎的输入→16 kHz、音色→设备采样率、两处共振峰重采样、FCPE 的非 16 kHz 输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-119","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"`tests/engine/test_sinc_resample.py`：在 rvc-next 实际用到的采样率对上（48000→16000、44100→16000、40000→48000、471→400、504→480 等），核与输出与 torchaudio `torch.equal`；Kaiser 窗也相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-120","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"`engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`：`Wav2Mel`、纯卷积的 `CFNaiveMelPE`、解码器、`load_fcpe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3509":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-121","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"torchfcpe（FCPE，MIT；conformer 来自 Diffusion-SVC）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-122","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"`fcpe` F0 方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-123","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py`：mel 与 F0 在 `argmax` 和 `local_argmax` 两种解码下与 torchfcpe 逐位相同（清音帧两边都是 NaN）；内置权重与 torchfcpe 附带的一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/development-parity-124","page_id":"/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-parity#torchaudio-和-torchfcpe-的移植","content":"两处改动都只涉及类型、异常类型和去掉弃用名字，算术逐步不变。torchaudio/torchfcpe 不安装时，这些对比测试 `importorskip` 跳过，其余测试（长度、恒等、频率保持、非法参数、从运行时创建 provider）照常运行。FCPE 的权重 `fcpe_c_v001.pt` 作为 `fcpe` 资源下载，来源见资源与模型仓库。许可证见仓