ment-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#devapi-与-vite-一起跑","content":"`dev`：API 与 Vite 一起跑","locale":"zh-CN"},"3612":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-6","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#构建-wheel","content":"构建 wheel","locale":"zh-CN"},"3613":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-7","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#发布","content":"发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"3614":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-8","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"构建文档站","locale":"zh-CN"},"3615":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-9","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"依赖约束","locale":"zh-CN"},"3616":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-10","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"代码约定速览","locale":"zh-CN"},"3617":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-11","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"Git 工作流","locale":"zh-CN"},"3618":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-12","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"RVC Next **只在自己的环境里运行**：一个独立的 venv，或一份独立的 Python，绝不与其他项目共用。这不是洁癖，而是依赖约束逼出来的（见下文“依赖约束”一节）：`transformers` 5.x 经由 `tokenizers` 要求 `huggingface_hub < 2`，与使用 `huggingface_hub` 2.x 的项目无法共存；`torch` 的版本又被 pymss 和 torchaudio 的发布节奏夹在一个窗口里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3619":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-13","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"开发环境是仓库根目录下的 `.venv`（已在 `.gitignore` 中），由 Python 3.11 解释器用 uv 创建，不继承系统 site-packages：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3620":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-14","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"之后一律用 `.venv/bin/python`（或激活后的 `python`）运行一切，包括 `python scripts/dev.py ...`：`dev.py` 用的是**运行它的那个解释器**（`sys.executable`），而不是 `PATH` 上的第一个 `python`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3621":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-15","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"先装 torch 的原因与用户安装时相同：`pyproject.toml` 只声明 `torch>=2.7.1`，不指定构建变体。先从 PyTorch 的 index 装好适合硬件的构建，后面的 `pip install` 发现约束已满足，就不会再从 PyPI 拉一个（通常是 CUDA 版的大包）回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3622":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-16","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"RVC Next 已经移植了 torchaudio 的 `Resample` 和 torchfcpe 的 FCPE 推理路径，自身不再导入这两个包（分层测试会拦住）。只有两类测试会用到它们，缺失时自动跳过：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3623":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-17","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"`tests/engine/test_sinc_resample.py`、`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py` 里与原库逐位比较的用例；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3624":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"golden 测试中**原版一侧**的代码（原版的实时代码导入 torchaudio，原版的 FCPE 导入 torchfcpe）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3625":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"若要跑这些用例，torchaudio 必须与 torch **成对**安装同一版本：torchaudio 的最后一个版本是 2.11，不声明对 torch 的要求，与更新的 torch 放在一起会拒绝加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3626":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"其他按需依赖也在 `pyproject.toml` 中声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3627":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"训练的 TensorBoard 日志：`uv pip install -e '.[tensorboard]'`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3628":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"与原库比较的测试：先按上面的要求安装匹配的 torch / torchaudio，再执行 `uv pip install --group parity`；此组还包含 torchcrepe、torchfcpe 和 SwiftF0 的参考实现，不随 `dev` 组安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3629":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#独立的虚拟环境","content":"重新提取 SwiftF0 权重：`uv pip install --group extract-swift-f0`，然后运行 `scripts/extract_swift_f0.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3630":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"3631":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3632":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"3633":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-27","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"PortAudio（Linux 上的 `libportaudio2`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3634":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-28","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"`sounddevice` 打开音频设备；实时变声和设备枚举测试需要它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3635":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-29","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"系统包管理器；CI 中是 `sudo apt-get install -y libportaudio2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3636":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-30","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#其他系统依赖","content":"bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"3637":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-31","page_id":"/docs