tup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"`site-install` / `site-dev` / `site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3675":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-69","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"文档站的 `bun install`、本地预览、构建（在 `site/` 中，见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3676":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-70","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"`test-site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3677":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-71","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"文档站的 `bun run test`（vitest）加 `bun run check`（tsc）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3678":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-72","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"`test`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3679":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-73","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"`test-py`、`test-web` 加 `test-site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3680":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-74","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"`check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3681":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-75","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"**CI 跑的全部内容**：`lint`、`typecheck-py`、`test-py`、`test-web`、`test-site`、`typegen-check`，遇到第一个失败即停","locale":"zh-CN"},"3682":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-76","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy","content":"提交前跑一次 `python scripts/dev.py check`。改了 API（路由、请求或响应模型、事件模型、`VoiceParamsModel` / `StreamParamsModel` 的范围）后必须跑 `typegen` 并把两个生成文件一起提交，否则 `typegen-check` 会失败。原理见 API 与事件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3683":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-77","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#devapi-与-vite-一起跑","content":"API 侧执行 `python -m rvc_next webui --no-open --port <api-port> --strict-port`。用 `--strict-port` 是因为 Vite 的代理目标是在启动时固定的：如果 API 悄悄换到了下一个端口，Vite 会一直代理到错的地址。端口被占用（例如另一个 RVC Next 已经在 7868 上）时请换 `--api-port`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3684":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-78","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#devapi-与-vite-一起跑","content":"Web 侧执行 `bun run dev --port <web-port> --strictPort`，并设置 `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:<api-port>`。`vite.config.ts` 把 `/api`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/ws` 代理到这个地址（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:7868`），浏览器打开 `http://localhost:<web-port>` 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3685":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-79","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#devapi-与-vite-一起跑","content":"两个进程同生共死：任一个退出，另一个也会停；Ctrl+C 或 SIGTERM 会停掉两者。子进程在各自的进程组里，信号由 `dev.py` 统一转发，后台启动时也不会留下孤儿进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3686":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-80","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#devapi-与-vite-一起跑","content":"Vite 有热模块替换；**API 进程不会自动重载**。改了 Python 代码就重启 `dev`。频繁改后端时，可以在两个终端分别运行 `rvc-next webui --no-open --strict-port` 和 `python scripts/dev.py web-dev`，只重启前者。API 重启期间代理失败是正常的，`vite.config.ts` 会把这类错误（`ECONNREFUSED`、`ECONNRESET` 等）压缩成每 5 秒最多一行的提示，而不是满屏堆栈。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3687":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-81","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建-wheel","content":"顺序很重要：setuptools 只打包**运行时已经存在**的文件，`pyproject.toml` 把 `rvc_next/webui/dist/**/*` 声明为包数据，所以必须先构建 Web UI。直接运行 `python -m build` 会得到一个没有 Web UI 的包，服务端启动时只会警告\"No web UI build found\"并只提供 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3688":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-82","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建-wheel","content":"脚本的步骤是：`bun install --frozen-lockfile` → `bun run build`（`--ci` 时是只打包的 `build:only`，因为 CI 把类型检查和测试作为单独步骤跑）→ `python -m build --outdir dist/`。非 `--ci` 且未加 `--keep-web-dist` 时，结束后删除 `rvc_next/webui/dist/`，让本地检出保持原样。环境变量 `CI`、`KEEP_WEB_DIST` 分别是这两个开关的默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3689":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-83","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建-wheel","content":"其他随包发布的数据（同样在 `[tool.setuptools.package-data]` 中声明）：`core/assets/catalog.json`、`core/separation/presets.json`、`engine/train/data/mute/**`（训练用的静音样本，取代原版单独下载的 `mute.zip`）、`engine/separate/configs/*.yaml`（分离模型的配置）。新增运行时要读的数据文件时，记得加进这张表，否则从 wheel 安装后会找不到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3690":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-84","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#发布","content":"`.github/workflows/release.yml` 在三种情况下触发：`main` 上修改了 `rvc_next/version.py` 的推送、`v*` 标签、手动运行。流程是：复用 `ci.yml` 跑完全部检查 → 用 `build_wheel.py --ci` 构建 → 校验 wheel 中确有 `rvc_next/webui/dist/index.html`、`twine check`、在全新 venv 中安装并运行 `rvc-next version` → 发布到 PyPI（`pypi` 环境，可要求审批）→ 标签触发时再创建 GitHub Release。标签触发时还会检查标签与 `rvc_next/version.py` 中的 `VERSION` 一致。版本号只有 `version.py` 一处，`pyproject.toml` 通过 `dynamic = [\"version\"]` 读取它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3691":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-85","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"文档站（主页与本文档）是 `site/` 下一个独立的前端项目，结构沿用 Hanafubuki 的网站：Fumadocs 跑在 TanStack Start 与 Vite 之上，用 bun 管理依赖，构建后输出纯静态文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3692":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-86","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"3693":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-87","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3694":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-88","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"`site/content/docs/*.mdx`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3695":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-89","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"文档页面。中文为 `<页面>.mdx`，英文为同名的 `<页面>.en.mdx`；`meta.json` / `meta.en.json` 决定侧边栏的顺序与分组（`---分组---` 是分隔标题）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3696":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-90","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"`site/src/routes/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3697":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-91","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"页面路由：`index.tsx` 是主页，`docs/$.tsx` 渲染文档，`api/search.ts` 生成静态搜索索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"3698":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-92","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"`site/src/components/home/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3699":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-93","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"主页的各个区块；文案集中在 `site/src/lib/site-copy.ts`，中英文各一份","locale":"zh-CN"},"3700":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-94","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"`site/src/components/mdx.tsx`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3701":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-95","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"MDX 中可用的组件：`Callout`、`Tabs`/`Tab`、`Cards`/`Card`、`Steps`/`Step`、`Accordions`/`Accordion`、`Mermaid`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3702":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-96","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"写文档时注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3703":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-97","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"**每个中文页面都要有英文版。** `src/lib/i18n-content.test.ts` 检查每个 `.mdx` 都有对应的 `.en.mdx`，且两个 `meta` 文件的页面顺序一致；文档路由按两种语言同时加载页面，缺少任何一种都会让该页无法构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3704":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-98","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"**新增页面**时把它的文件名（不含扩展名）加进 `meta.json` 与 `meta.en.json`；页面的标题、说明和侧边栏图标（lucide 图标名）写在 frontmatter 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3705":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-99","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"**链接**一律写成 `/docs/<页面>`（可带 `#锚点`）；标题可用 `## 标题 [#自定义-id]` 指定稳定的锚点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3706":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-100","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"**MDX 不是 Markdown**：正文中的 `<`、`{`、`}` 会被当成 JSX，需要放进代码里或写成 `&lt;`、`\\{`、`\\}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3707":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-101","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"**Mermaid** 图写成 `<Mermaid chart=\"…\" />`，在浏览器中从 CDN 按需加载渲染。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3708":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-102","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#构建文档站","content":"发布：`.github/workflows/site.yml` 在 `main` 上 `site/**` 变化时（或手动）运行：类型检查、测试，以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/rvc-next/` 构建，再把 `site/.output/public` 强制推送到 `gh-pages` 分支。同一站点也可以直接部署到 Netlify（根目录 `netlify.toml`）、Cloudflare Pages（`wrangler.toml`）或 Vercel（`site/vercel.json`），这些平台从根路径提供服务，不需要设置 `VITE_BASE_PATH`。CI（`ci.yml`）中的 **Documentation site** 任务对每次提交做同样的检查与构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3709":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-103","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`pyproject.toml` 的原则是：**下限**是代码需要或某个依赖强制的版本，**上限**停在下一个未经测试的大版本前；torch 例外，不设上限，因为它由用户按硬件先行安装。因为 RVC Next 运行在自己的环境里，上限不会妨碍别人；它防止的是某天 `pip install` 解析出一个从没测过的组合。项目在两端都测试过，测试套件均通过：Python 3.10 上 torch 2.7.1 且其余依赖都取下限，Python 3.12 至 3.14 上 torch 2.11 配 numpy 2.5、librosa 1.0、av 19，以及 Python 3.12 上的 torch 2.13 和 2.14（从构建好的 wheel 安装；下限一端对直接依赖使用 `uv pip install --resolution lowest-direct`）。开发环境（Python 3.11）通过完整检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3710":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-104","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"约束","locale":"zh-CN"},"3711":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-105","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"3712":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-106","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`torch>=2.7.1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3713":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-107","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"下限：pymss 2.1.7 需要 torch 2.7.1。不设上限：torch 由用户按硬件先行安装，而 torchaudio 与 torchfcpe 移除后，已没有依赖把 torch 绑定到某个版本。跑 golden 测试时原版一侧仍需要与 torch 同版本的 torchaudio","locale":"zh-CN"},"3714":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-108","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`transformers>=5,<6`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3715":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-109","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"4.x 需要 `huggingface_hub < 1`，而当前的 `huggingface_hub` 是 1.x。原版锁定的是 4.50 以下；HuBERT 各层输出在 5.x 下不变，golden 测试逐位一致（见与原版的一致性）。另外，`tokenizers` 的所有版本（含 1.0 预发布）都要求 `huggingface_hub < 2`，这就是不能与 `huggingface_hub` 2.x 的项目共用环境的原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"3716":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-110","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`numpy>=1.26,<3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3717":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-111","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"允许 numpy 2：numpy 1.x 没有 Python 3.13 的 wheel","locale":"zh-CN"},"3718":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-112","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`pymss==2.1.7`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3719":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-113","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"精确锁定：分离适配器是按这个版本的 `MSSeparator` 写的","locale":"zh-CN"},"3720":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-114","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`sounddevice>=0.5.1,<0.6`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3721":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-115","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"0.5.1 起 Windows wheel 自带支持 ASIO 的 PortAudio（由 `SD_ENABLE_ASIO` 选择）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3722":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-116","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`websockets>=12`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3723":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-117","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"没有它 uvicorn 不支持 WebSocket，socket.io 会退回长轮询","locale":"zh-CN"},"3724":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-118","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`pydantic>=2.7,<3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3725":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-119","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"只支持 Pydantic v2（FastAPI ≥ 0.100 本来就要求 v2）；SD Model Hub 为 v1 宿主做的兼容层已删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"3726":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-120","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`typer>=0.26.7,<0.28`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3727":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-121","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"上限停在下一个次版本前：CLI 工厂用到了 Typer 的私有模块 `typer._click`（只在 `cli/factory.py` 中），Typer 一旦挪动它，CLI 测试（命令树快照、`--debug`）会最先失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"3728":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-122","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`tomli>=2; python_version < '3.11'`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3729":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-123","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"3.10 没有 `tomllib`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3730":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-124","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"可选组 `directml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3731":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-125","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"`torch-directml`、`onnxruntime-directml`：Windows 上 AMD / Intel 显卡用 DirectML，RMVPE 走 ONNX","locale":"zh-CN"},"3732":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-126","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#依赖约束","content":"开发依赖组 `dev` 中的 `ruff` 和 `ty` 不锁定版本，总是使用最新版。`[tool.ruff.lint]` 的 `select` 逐条写出：ruff 升级会改变默认规则集，写明规则后，升级不会改变检查哪些规则（但新版本对同一规则的判断可能更严格）。其中 `ANN` 要求 `rvc_next/` 中每个函数都有类型标注（允许 `Any`）；移植文件、测试和脚本不受此限。`tomli` 也在 `dev` 组里，好让 ty 在新版 Python 上也能解析 3.10 的回退导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3733":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-127","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"完整说明分散在各页，这里列出改代码时最常碰到的几条：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3734":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-128","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"**Python ≥ 3.10**。ruff 行宽 180、缩进 4；ty 以 3.10 为目标、`error-on-warning`。抑制警告时必须写明规则名（`# ty: ignore[invalid-argument-type]`、`# noqa: E402`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3735":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-129","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"**移植文件保持原样**：`engine/models/{attentions,commons,modules,transforms,synthesizer}.py` 和 `engine/f0/rmvpe.py` 不参与 `ruff format` 和 ty；它们连同 `engine/audio/denoise.py`、`engine/train/{dataset,losses,mel,slicer}.py` 在 `[tool.ruff.lint.per-file-ignores]` 中豁免了 `B`、`SIM`、`UP` 等规则。目的是能与原版逐行 diff，所以不要\"顺手\"整理它们（见与原版的一致性）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3736":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-130","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"**重量级导入放在函数内部**：torch、transformers、faiss、av、pymss、sounddevice。`rvc-next version`、`--help` 因此保持快速，分层测试也会检查导入核心层不加载 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3737":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-131","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"**只用 Pydantic v2**。跨 API 边界的模型都继承 `core/record.py` 的 `Record`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3738":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-132","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"类里如果有用 `list[...]` 标注的地方，就不要把方法命名为 `list`（ty 会把 `list` 解析成该方法）：用 `list_assets`、`list_jobs`、`list_voices` 这样的名字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3739":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-133","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#代码约定速览","content":"新增 CLI 命令、API 路由、事件或资源的步骤分别见命令行实现、API 与事件、资源与模型仓库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3740":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-134","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"项目历史是 `main` 上的线性提交，没有长期分支。提交的习惯是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3741":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-135","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"标题一句话说明**结果**（例如 \"Port FCPE; rvc-next no longer depends on torchfcpe or torchaudio\"），正文解释原因、取舍和验证方式；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3742":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-136","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"一个提交是一件完整的事：代码、测试、重新生成的 `schema.d.ts` / `paramSpecs.ts`，以及需要时对 `AGENTS.md` 的更新放在一起；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3743":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-137","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"提交前 `python scripts/dev.py check` 通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3744":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-138","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#git-工作流","content":"`AGENTS.md` 规定智能体只在用户要求时才提交或开 PR。这是对智能体的约束，不是对人类贡献者的流程要求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3745":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"page","content":"测试与检查","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"3746":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"RVC Next 的测试有一个前提：默认测试套件离线、只用 CPU、不需要下载任何东西，在一台没有 GPU、没有声卡的机器上几分钟内跑完。做到这一点靠三样东西：随机初始化的 tiny 模型、模拟的 PortAudio 后端和模拟的分离器，以及在临时目录里构建的服务。需要真实模型或原版仓库的测试打上标记，默认不选。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3747":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-1","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#一条命令devpy-check","content":"一条命令：`dev.py check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3748":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-2","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#pytest-标记与环境变量","content":"pytest 标记与环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"3749":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-3","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#tiny-模型","content":"tiny 模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3750":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-4","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#fixtures","content":"fixtures","locale":"zh-CN"},"3751":{"id":"/docs/developm