nt":"服务通过 `environ=` 构建，从不读取真实的 `os.environ`，所以开发者本机的 `RVC_NEXT_*` 设置不会泄漏进测试。网络通过 `transport=`（`httpx.MockTransport`）替换，下载测试在本地模拟断点续传、校验失败和仓库回退。CLI 测试用 `monkeypatch.setenv` 设置 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`、`RVC_NEXT_PATHS__ASSETS_DIR` 和 `RVC_NEXT_COMPUTE__DEVICE=cpu`，因为命令在内部自己构建服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3853":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-107","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"3854":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-108","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"覆盖的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3855":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-109","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`engine/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3856":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-110","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"检查点读写往返、合并时 `emb_g` 截断、从 G 提取；按内容识别索引和检查点；F0 后处理（插值、移调、粗量化）；离线转换的形状、FCPE、共振峰、分块与取消；流式引擎的逐块处理、门限、降噪、热更新、换音色、说话人、直通、延迟估算；环形缓冲、漂移校正、SOLA、拓扑选择、设备丢失（模拟后端）；设备分组与选择解析（录制的枚举）；训练阶段（切片保留每段尾部、F0、特征、文件列表、指纹）、两轮 tiny 拟合与续训、CPU 上的 gloo DDP；多说话人；分离预设；移植的重采样器与 FCPE；显存释放与 OOM 识别；编码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3857":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-111","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`core/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3858":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-112","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"设置的分层与校验；端口选择；任务的调度、GPU 容量与 Live 租约、取消、子进程事件与杀进程、重启后的 `interrupted`；资源下载的续传、校验、仓库选择、速度与 ETA、删除；音色库导入、旧版安装、数据库丢失后重建；导入会话与配对规则；转换的输出与来源、预览、提交前校验；训练的完整运行、导出与过期标记；Live 服务（模拟后端）；释放显存与 OOM 后卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3859":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-113","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`api/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3860":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-114","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"错误形状、Host / Origin / 令牌、原始上传、Range、峰值、浏览根目录、通过 API 提交转换、OpenAPI 中列出事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3861":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-115","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`cli/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3862":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-116","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"命令树快照、各层 `--debug`、`config`、`--json` 与 API 一致、用 `.pth` 路径转换、缺少资源的退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3863":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-117","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"`workers/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3864":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-118","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#测试布局","content":"设备 worker（枚举、格式检查、测试音，以及本机真实 PortAudio 的枚举）；Live worker（启动、热更新、换音色、设备丢失后重连、错误不致命、电平表 / 直通 / 测试音、端到端进程、空闲释放与 OOM 卸载）；分离 worker（模拟分离器下的链式事件、不覆盖已有文件、单个输入失败、缺少权重、DirectML fp16 失败请求 fp32 重试、杀进程取消）；训练 worker（切片 → F0 → 特征 → 索引）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3865":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-119","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**模拟 PortAudio**（`engine/audio_io/fake.py`）：每个设备有自己的时钟（名义速率乘以 `1 + ppm·1e-6`），流在线程里按块回调；输入来自信号函数，输出按设备录下；`lose(index)` 让设备停止送数据（像拔掉 USB 设备），`refuse` 让打开失败并给出原因。漂移校正、欠载 / 过载计数、设备丢失与重连都在它上面测试。Live worker 和设备 worker 的请求里写 `\"backend\": \"fake\"` 即使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3866":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-120","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**模拟分离器**：分离 worker 的请求带 `test_fake` 时，`engine/separate/runner.py` 用 `FakeSeparator` 代替 pymss，可以假装处于 DirectML（`pretend_dml`）以测试 fp16 → fp32 的重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3867":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#替身","content":"**录制的设备枚举**（`tests/fixtures/devices/`）：Windows（MME、DirectSound、WASAPI、WDM-KS、虚拟声卡）、macOS 和 Linux PipeWire 机器上 `query_devices` / `query_hostapis` 的输出，用于测试分组、排序、虚拟设备标记和每一种解析结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3868":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`rvc_next/webui` 用 vitest（`happy-dom` 环境）和 `@vue/test-utils`，`bun run test` 运行，`bun run typecheck` 做 `vue-tsc` 类型检查。`src/test/setup.ts` 补上 happy-dom 缺少的 `attachInternals`（`@material/web` 需要它），`src/test/motion-zero.css` 把所有动效时长设为 0，让动效测试快速且确定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3869":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"除了组件和 store 的单元测试，还有一批**规则测试**，把约定变成会失败的测试：`tokens.test.ts`（`src/theme/` 之外不得出现十六进制颜色）、`imports.test.ts`（模块之间用 `@/` 别名导入）、`layout.test.ts`（含文件名的行给文本项 `min-width: 0`、页面是一列段落等布局规则）、`i18n/i18n.test.ts`（`zh-CN` 与 `en` 的键和占位符一致，固定词汇）、`ui/motion/motion.test.ts`（完整动效与减弱动效下都能运行、视图过渡）等。逐个说明见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3870":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在推送到 `main`、拉取请求、手动触发和被其他工作流调用（`release.yml` 复用它）时运行，同一分支上新的运行会取消旧的：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3871":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"作业","locale":"zh-CN"},"3872":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"3873":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3874":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-128","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Lint and format","locale":"zh-CN"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-129","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu，Python 3.11","locale":"zh-CN"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-130","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"只装最新版 `ruff`，`ruff check` 与 `ruff format --check`。拉取请求上同样运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-131","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"ty","locale":"zh-CN"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-132","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu / Windows / macOS × Python 3.10–3.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-133","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CPU 版 torch 加 `pip install -e . --group dev`，`ty check --python-version <版本> --python-platform <平台> --error-on-warning`。只为解析导入，所以装 CPU 版 torch 就够了","locale":"zh-CN"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-134","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Tests","locale":"zh-CN"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-135","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu，Python 3.10 与 3.12","locale":"zh-CN"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-136","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"装 `libportaudio2`、CPU 版 torch 和开发依赖，`pytest -q`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3883":