-webui-12","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"新增一个界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-13","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"Web UI 是 `rvc_next/webui/` 下的一个 Vue 3 项目，同时也是一个 Python 包：构建产物 `dist/` 被 git 忽略，作为包数据打进 wheel，由 API 的 `SPAStaticFiles` 提供（见 API 与事件）。它没有自己的业务逻辑——REST 是唯一的数据来源，socket 事件只负责让缓存保持新鲜。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-14","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"骨架（主题、`ui/` 组件、动效、规则测试、API 客户端与 socket 封装）来自 Hanaikada，Hanaikada 又承自 SD Model Hub；RVC Next 在其上加了音频相关的组件（波形、电平表、设备菜单、参数滑块）和五个功能界面。本页说明技术栈、目录、共享组件与“统一体验”约定、数据流、布局与动效规则、国际化、测试，以及新增一个界面的步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-15","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-16","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"选型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-17","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"备注","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-18","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"框架","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-19","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"Vue 3.5、`<script setup lang=\"ts\">`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-20","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#技术栈","content":"构建","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-21","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"t