、`web`、`web-dev`、`test-web`（测试 + 类型检查）、`dev`（API 与 Vite 一起运行，Vite 带热模块替换），见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3943":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-52","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#开发代理","content":"`vite.config.ts` 把 `/api`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/ws`（WebSocket）代理到 `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND`（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:7868`），浏览器只面对 Vite 一个源，不需要 CORS。开发时 API 进程随 Python 改动频繁重启（它不会自动重载，需要手动重启），socket 每隔几秒重连一次；代理对 `ECONNREFUSED`、`ECONNRESET` 等“后端没起来”的错误只打印一行节流过的提示（最多每 5 秒一次），并给 HTTP 请求回一个 502 JSON（`code: \"api_unreachable\"`），而不是让浏览器一直等。其他错误照常完整打印。`isExpectedProxyError` 由 `devProxy.test.ts` 测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-53","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#开发代理","content":"`vite.config.ts` 还把以 `md-` 开头的标签声明为自定义元素，设置 `@` 别名指向 `src/`，并在测试中内联 `@material/material-color-utilities`（它的 0.4.0 版有一处不带扩展名的导入，纯 Node 无法解析）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3945":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-54","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-55","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-56","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`meta.screen`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-57","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`/convert`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3949":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-58","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`ConvertView`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-59","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":