i#目录结构","content":"`ModelsView`（音色、底模、分离模型、资源、工具五个标签）、`ModelDetailView`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-71","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-72","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`/jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-73","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`JobsView`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-74","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3966":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-75","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`/settings`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3967":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-76","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`SettingsView`（常规、计算、音频、存储、下载、训练、外观、关于）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3968":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-77","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`settings`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3969":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-78","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`/dev`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3970":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-79","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`DevComponentsView`（所有共享组件的陈列，用来检查主题与动效）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3971":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-80","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`dev`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3972":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-81","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#目录结构","content":"`/` 重定向到上次停留的目的地（`Preferences.lastScreen`，直接从 localStorage 读取，因为此时 Pinia 尚未就绪），未知路径重定向到 `/convert`。`router.ts` 还记录每个目的地最后的完整地址（`addressOf`），导航栏据此回到离开时的实验或音色，而不是它的列表；这份记录只在内存里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3973":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-82","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"`src/ui/` 是唯一导入 `@material/web` 与 `@lucide/vue` 的地方（另有 `test/setup.ts` 为测试打补丁），视图和业务组件只从 `@/ui` 导入（`ui/index.ts`）。这一层的意义在于隔离风险：`@material/web` 已不再新增组件，若它在某个浏览器上出问题，可以在 `ui/` 里逐个替换，而应用代码不变。图标经 `ui/icons.ts` 重新导出，用 `<AppIcon :icon=\"icons.X\" />` 渲染。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3974":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-83","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"组件分两类：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3975":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-84","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"**包装 `md-*` 元素的**：`AppButton`、`IconButton`、`Fab`、`Checkbox`、`Switch`、`Slider`、`TextField`、`Tabs`、`SegmentedButton`（另以 `SegmentedControl` 名导出）、`FilterChip`、`Divider`、`ProgressCircle`、`ProgressBar`（只用其不定进度形态）、`ParamSlider`。它们拥有 props、事件名与类型，不在 `md-*` 自带动画上叠加第二层动画。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3976":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-85","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"**自建的**（`@material/web` 没有或不合用）：`AppShell`、`NavigationRail`、`NavigationBar`、`TopAppBar`、`AppCard`、`Surface`、`AppDialog`、`ConfirmDialog`、`SideSheet`、`Snackbar`、`Tooltip`、`AppMenu`、`ContextMenu`、`SelectField`、`DeviceMenu`、`SearchField`、`TokenField`、`PathField`、`DataList`、`Breadcrumbs`、`Stepper`、`ExpansionPanel`、`EmptyState`、`Skeleton`、`Badge`、`Chip`、`KeyHint`、`DropZone`、`Waveform`、`LineChart`、`LevelMeter`、`PageFooter`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3977":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-86","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"几个跨组件的机制：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3978":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-87","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"`layers.ts`（`useLayer`、`useLayerBase`）：页面之上打开的一切（对话框、侧边面板、菜单、展开的选择器和下拉框）按打开顺序登记在这一处。后打开的层总在先打开的层之上（每类有 `LAYER_Z` 下限）；`Escape` 和外部点击只关闭最上层；模态层打开时，页面和它下面的层设为 `inert`；焦点移入层内，关闭后回到打开它的元素。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3979":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-88","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"`reveal.ts`（`revealDropdown`、`useRevealWhileOpen`）：在原地展开的列表（音色选择器、设备菜单）若被粘性的 `PageFooter` 遮住，就把滚动容器往上滚到露出为止，但不越过列表顶端。`PageFooter` 用 `data-page-footer` 标记自己。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3980":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-89","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui设计系统层","content":"`useSnackbar`：全局队列，一次显示一条。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3981":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-90","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与令牌","content":"`theme/scheme.ts`：`DEFAULT_SOURCE_COLOR = '#3f5f90'` 是项目里唯一手选的颜色（标志的蓝色），设置页的取色器（`<input type=\"color\">`，同 Hanaikada）可以换成任意颜色；`generateScheme()` 用 `SchemeTonalSpot` 生成 `ROLES` 中的全部角色，支持亮/暗与对比度 0、0.5、1。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3982":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-91","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与令牌","content":"`theme/applyTheme.ts` 把角色写成 `:root` 上的 `--md-sys-color-*`，`watchSystemTheme` 在“跟随系统”时响应系统切换。`index.html` 的内联脚本在包加载前设置 `data-theme`，避免首屏闪烁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3983":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-92","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与令牌","content":"`theme/tokens.css`：字体、形状、高度、动效、状态层（hover 8%、focus 12%、pressed 12%、dragged 16%）等 MD3 令牌，以及项目令牌 `--app-*`：间距 `--app-space-*`、宽度 `--app-width-*`（都是 `clamp()`，宽屏时随之变宽）、页面内层级 `--app-z-*`（页面之上打开的层由 `ui/layers.ts` 排列）、禁用透明度等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3984":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-93","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与令牌","content":"`theme/breakpoints.ts`：MD3 窗口尺寸类（600、840、1200、1600 px）。`AppShell` 在 compact（\\< 600 px）时用底部导航栏，否则用侧边导航栏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3985":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-94","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#主题与令牌","content":"规则：组件和视图里没有字面颜色、圆角、字号或时长，只用令牌（颜色由 `tokens.test.ts` 强制）；颜色角色成对使用（`primary` 上用 `on-primary`）；层次先靠表面色调，再靠阴影。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3986":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-95","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"动效遵循 MD3 的四种模式，命名过渡集中在 `ui/motion/motion.css` 与 `ui/motion/transitions.ts` 的 `TRANSITIONS`，视图用 `<Transition :name=\"TRANSITIONS.x\">`，不自写过渡。原则是“每个可见变化都有动画”，并且退出比进入快、用加速曲线。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3987":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-96","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"3988":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-97","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3989":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-98","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"实际用处","locale":"zh-CN"},"3990":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-99","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`fade-through`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3991":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-100","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"无关联的两个状态互换","locale":"zh-CN"},"3992":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-101","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"目的地切换的回退方案（无 View Transitions 时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3993":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-102","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`shared-axis-x`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3994":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-103","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"同级的标签或步骤，方向由 `--axis-dir` 决定","locale":"zh-CN"},"3995":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-104","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"Models 的标签、Settings 的分节、实验的四个步骤；`useAxisDirection()` 在值变化时同步算出方向","locale":"zh-CN"},"3996":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-105","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`container`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3997":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-106","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"卡片长成对话框","locale":"zh-CN"},"3998":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-107","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`AppDialog` 与 `ModelDetailView` 用 `containerFrom(from, to)` 算出起始变换；没有源矩形时退化为淡入缩放","locale":"zh-CN"},"3999":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-108","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`sheet` / `scrim`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4000":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-109","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"侧边面板从边缘滑入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4001":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-110","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`SideSheet`（任务面板）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4002":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-111","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`list`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4003":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-112","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"列表项增删、重排（`TransitionGroup`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4004":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-113","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"结果、任务卡、音色网格；`staggerStyle(i)` 每项错开 20 ms，最多 12 项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4005":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-114","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`collapse`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4006":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-115","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"展开/收起，高度由 `collapseHooks` 设定","locale":"zh-CN"},"4007":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-116","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`ExpansionPanel`、`JobCard`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4008":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-117","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`snackbar`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4009":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-118","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"底部提示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4010":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-119","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"`Snackbar`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4011":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-120","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"**目的地切换用 View Transitions API。** `ui/motion/viewTransition.ts` 的 `installViewTransitions(router)` 在浏览器支持 `document.startViewTransition` 时，把跨目的地的导航（`to.name !== from.name`）包进一次视图过渡；同一目的地内的导航不包。要点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4012":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-121","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"浏览器在更新回调运行期间暂停渲染，`requestAnimationFrame` 也随之暂停，所以回调必须在 Vue 的 `nextTick`（新视图已在 DOM 中）完成，绝不能等一帧——早期按帧等待导致导航卡死。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4013":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-122","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"新的导航打断未完成的过渡时，先让旧过渡结束；被跳过的过渡会 reject 的 Promise 都被吞掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4014":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-123","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"支持时 `App.vue` 直接渲染视图，不再套 `<Transition>`；不支持时用 `fade-through` 的 `<Transition mode=\"out-in\">` 作为回退。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4015":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-124","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"**外壳保持静止。** 只有滚动容器 `main.content` 有 `view-transition-name: app-content`，`motion.css` 关闭了 root 快照的动画，所以导航栏、指示器和顶栏原地切换，只有页面内容淡出淡入；带圆角背景的 `.frame` 属于外壳、在快照之外。早先整个文档根参与过渡，淡入的 `scale(0.92)` 会让侧栏和顶栏一起缩放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4016":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-125","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"**降低动效。** 系统的 `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` 或设置里选“减少”（`<html data-motion=\"reduced\">`）时：所有过渡变成 100 ms 线性淡入淡出、去掉位移和缩放；视图过渡变成 100 ms 无缩放的交叉淡化；不显示涟漪；CSS 动画缩到一瞬。目的地切换在降低动效下仍然包进视图过渡——变成短促的交叉淡化，而不是硬切，因为无障碍关心的是运动，突然的跳变同样令人不适。`prefersReducedMotion()` 同时检查两种来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4017":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-126","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#动效","content":"**高频值。** `ProgressBar` 的确定进度条是自绘的：`md-linear-progress` 每次更新都以 250 ms 缓入缓出重新开始，一秒变化几次的值（实时变声负载、上传、任务）会一顿一顿；自绘条用缓出曲线追赶新值。`LevelMeter` 用 `transform` 移动（每次更新不触发布局），按音频表的习惯“上升立即、下降缓慢”，峰值标记下降得最慢；`useFalling()` 记录上一次变化方向。`LiveStatsBar` 的条在 10 Hz 统计之间平滑滑动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4018":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-127","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"每个功能看起来属于同一个应用，靠的是一组共享组件；评审每个界面时以它们为清单（AGENTS.md §7）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4019":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-128","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4020":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-129","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"4021":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-130","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"用在","locale":"zh-CN"},"4022":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-131","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`VoicePicker`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4023":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-132","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"选择音色的唯一入口：按名搜索，显示采样率、版本、说话人，标出没有索引的音色；多说话人音色附带说话人菜单（`v-model:speaker`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4024":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-133","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"转换、实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4025":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-134","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`VoiceParamsPanel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4026":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-135","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"唯一的参数面板：标签、范围、默认值、帮助和顺序处处相同。范围来自 `paramSpecs.ts`（服务器 schema），顺序来自 `paramFields.ts` 的 `VOICE_FIELDS`；选中音色时加载它的默认预设（保留说话人）；控件不可用时说明原因（无索引时的索引强度、无音高引导时的辅音保护）；`live` 模式拖动即生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4027":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-136","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"转换、实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4028":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-137","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`StreamParamsPanel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4029":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-138","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"实时变声的缓冲与降噪参数，每项显示它在估计延迟中所占的份额（`latencyShare`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4030":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-139","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4031":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-140","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`AudioSourceInput`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4032":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-141","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"提供音频的唯一方式：拖入文件、选服务器文件（`ServerPathDialog`，限 `paths.browse_roots`）、选之前的结果（`OutputsPickerDialog`）；`folders` 允许整个服务器文件夹作为一个输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4033":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-142","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"转换、人声分离、模型详情的试听","locale":"zh-CN"},"4034":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-143","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`JobCard` + `JobsSheet`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4035":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-144","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"每个长操作一张卡：标题、步骤、进度、取消、重试、“仍然运行”、日志（`JobLogView`）；下载显示“88 MB / 210 MB · 8.4 MB/s · 剩余 14 秒”。卡片出现在启动它的界面的 `PageFooter` 里，也出现在任务面板中；面板先列本会话的任务，再合并 REST 的近期历史","locale":"zh-CN"},"4036":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-145","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"所有界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4037":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-146","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`ResultsList` + `ABCompare`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4038":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-147","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"统一的结果列表：波形（服务器峰值）、播放、与源音频 A/B、下载、在文件管理器中显示（仅本机）、“作为输入”“用这些设置重跑”“转换这个”；`groupBySource` 把分离出的分轨归到各自输入下。全页只有一个播放器（`stores/player.ts` 包装 `audio/player.ts`），A/B 在同一位置切换源","locale":"zh-CN"},"4039":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-148","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"转换、人声分离、模型详情的试听","locale":"zh-CN"},"4040":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-149","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`AssetGate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4041":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-150","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"缺资源时不报错，而是在动作的位置显示“需要 RMVPE — 下载（大小）”；装好后恢复原动作并发出 `ready`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4042":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-151","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"转换、实时变声、人声分离、训练、模型详情","locale":"zh-CN"},"4043":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-152","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`ErrorNotice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4044":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-153","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"按错误码显示翻译后的标题、服务器原文，以及可展开的“详情”（`errors.ts` 的 `errorView`）；回溯只在任务日志里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4045":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-154","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"所有界面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4046":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-155","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`DevicePanel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4047":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-156","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"设备选择器：物理设备的完整名称、标题中的服务器主机名、输入电平、测试音、可选监听输出、“高级”里的驱动，问题显示在对应设备旁；选项构造在可单测的 `devices.ts` 中","locale":"zh-CN"},"4048":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-157","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"实时变声、设置 › 音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4049":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-158","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`LiveStatsBar`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4050":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-159","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"输入输出电平、负载条（推理时间 / 块长，超过 0.8 变警告色并提议增大块长）、延迟、欠载与溢出计数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4051":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-160","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4052":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-161","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"`ResourceRow`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4053":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-162","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"一切可下载或已安装的模型共用一种行：名称与细节、状态、带速度和剩余时间的下载进度，以及下载、校验、打开、删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"4054":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-163","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"模型 › 资源、底模、分离模型、演示音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4055":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-164","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"另有几个约定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4056":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-165","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"**界面间的交接**（“作为输入”“转换这个”“试用”“用这些设置重跑”）经 `stores/handoff.ts`：发送方 `sendInputs(screen, items)` / `sendVoice(id, params)`，接收界面打开时 `take…()` 取走。不经 URL 传递，避免把路径或参数暴露在地址栏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4057":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-166","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"**导入**：模型页的每个拖放区（音色、底模、分离模型）都调用 `components/useModelImport.ts`：建会话、逐个上传（带进度）、读计划；`plan.confident` 时立即提交，否则把计划交给 `ImportReviewDialog`，其中每个索引只列出兼容的候选音色，外加“保持未分配”。未分配的索引显示在音色页的 `IndexInbox`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4058":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-167","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#统一体验约定","content":"**统一用词**：`i18n.test.ts` 检查固定词汇（Voice/音色、Index strength、Consonant protection、Loudness match），并确保原版不一致的叫法（检索特征占比、响度因子、`rms_mix_rate`）不出现在任何文案里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4059":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-168","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**REST 是唯一的事实来源。** `api/client.ts` 的 `api = createClient<paths>({ baseUrl: BASE_URL })` 附带一个中间件：有令牌就加 `Authorization: Bearer`，遇到 401 置 `useAuthStore().needed`，`AuthDialog` 随即弹出。`unwrap()` 把 `openapi-fetch` 的结果变成数据或 `ApiError(status, code, message, detail)`；`ApiError.missingAssets` 读出 `asset_missing` 的 `detail.assets`。上传用 `uploadRaw()`（`XMLHttpRequest`，有进度）；媒体 URL 由 `urls` 构造，`<audio>` 靠 `rvc_next_token` Cookie 认证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4060":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-169","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**查询**：`api/queries/<资源>.ts` 包装 `useQuery`/`useMutation`，键都在 `keys.ts`，socket 处理器与查询共用。变更成功后使受影响的键失效；启动任务的变更把返回的 `Job` 写进 jobs store 并记下来源界面（`jobs.upsert(job, 'convert')`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4061":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-170","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**socket**（`api/socket.ts`）：连接一次，路径 `${BASE_PATH}/ws/socket.io`，握手 `auth` 回调里带令牌。事件要么直接写入缓存（`assets_changed`、`live_state`、`devices_changed`、`compute_changed` 都携带完整快照），要么通过 `createInvalidator()` 合并失效——300 ms 内同一个键只失效一次，一阵事件只引起一次重新获取。每个事件的处理见 API 与事件的事件表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4062":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-171","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**高频数据进 store**：`stores/jobs.ts`（任务及进度）、`stores/live.ts`（实时状态与 10 Hz 统计，`load` = p95 推理时间 / 块长）、`stores/train.ts`（每个实验最多保留 20000 个指标点，REST 填充、事件追加、按 epoch/step 去重）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4063":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-172","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**乱序保护**：socket 事件可能与 REST 快照赛跑。`jobs.ts` 的 `isNewer()` 按生命周期阶段排序（排队/等待 \\< 运行 \\< 取消中 \\< 结束），绝不让任务“倒退”，结束后按 `finished_at` 取新，运行中同一步骤的进度只增不减。`onFinished` 监听者因此对每个任务只触发一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4064":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-173","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**重连**：`connect` 时 `resync()` 重新获取活动任务和实时状态；`reconnect` 时再使音色、输出、任务、资源、实验、显存、设备列表失效。断线期间错过的事件由此补齐。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4065":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-174","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**跨界面通知**：在别的界面启动的任务完成或失败时，`App.vue` 弹出提示；失败提示带“打开日志”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4066":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-175","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**偏好**（`stores/preferences.ts`）：主题、源颜色、对比度、语言（`auto` 跟随系统）、动效、上次的界面、转换的上次音色、分离的上次预设。存 localStorage（`rvc-next:preferences`，供 `index.html` 与路由在 Pinia 之前读取），并在加载服务器副本后以 500 ms 防抖写到 `client-state/preferences`，跟随用户跨浏览器。带 `version` 字段，`merge()` 迁移旧数据（版本 2 把旧版卡住的“减少动效”恢复为跟随系统）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4067":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-176","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#数据流","content":"**部署根**：`api/baseUrl.ts` 的 `deriveBaseUrl(import.meta.url, origin)` 取运行中脚本 URL 里最后一个 `/assets/` 之前的部分作为根，所以没有任何 API 地址被编译进产物；开发服务器上没有 `/assets/`，根就是页面源，由 Vite 代理转发。来自其他源的脚本回落到页面源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4068":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-177","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**视图常驻。** `App.vue` 用 `<KeepAlive :max=\"12\">` 缓存视图，键是目的地名，实验和音色详情则是完整路径（每个实验、每个音色各一份）。切走再回来，标签、筛选、表单都还在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4069":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-178","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**滚动位置。** 所有页面共享外壳的同一个滚动容器，所以 `App.vue` 在 `beforeEach` 时记下离开页面的 `scrollTop`，在新视图显示前恢复——有视图过渡时在其更新回调完成前（`nextTick`），回退路径在 `<Transition @enter>` 时，因此没有跳动。只存在内存里：刷新后所有视图重置，真正持久的只有偏好。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4070":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-179","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**一列分节。** 转换、人声分离、实时变声以及模型详情和模型 › 工具，都是一列纵向排列的分节（`Surface`），分节随页面加宽，内部控件用 `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr))` 这样的网格换行，而不是把分节并排。运行按钮、本界面启动的任务卡和错误放在粘性的 `PageFooter` 里，无论页面多长都在视野中。页面不设 `max-width`，填满内容区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4071":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-180","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**容器查询。** `main.content` 是尺寸容器 `app-content`（`container: app-content / inline-size`）。页面按自己实际得到的宽度调整（目前是 `@container app-content (max-width: 599px)` 时收紧内边距），而不是按窗口宽度——侧栏、侧边面板都会改变可用宽度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4072":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-181","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**字段行**：输入框旁带按钮（添加、浏览、构建）的行用 `align-items: center`，按钮与输入框居中对齐。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4073":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-182","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"**可收缩的名称**：音频文件名、音色名常是一个很长的不可断词；flex 子项默认 `min-width: auto`，会把行内按钮挤出视野，所以承载文字的元素必须声明 `min-width: 0` 才能显示省略号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4074":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-183","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#外壳视图状态与布局","content":"这些规则都由 `src/layout.test.ts` 读取源文件的样式来检查（列出了具体文件与选择器）。新增一个含名称的行或一个分节页时，把它加到对应列表里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4075":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-184","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#国际化","content":"`src/i18n/index.ts` 是一个很小的实现：嵌套的消息对象、`t(key, params)`（`{name}` 占位）、缺失时回落英文、再回落键名；`tOr(key, fallback)` 用于由服务器值拼出的键（错误码、阶段 id），没有对应消息时显示可读的回退。语言有 `en` 与 `zh-CN` 两种，偏好为 `auto` 时由 `detectLocale()` 按浏览器语言决定（任何 `zh`/`zh-*` 都映射到 `zh-CN`），并响应 `languagechange`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4076":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-185","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#国际化","content":"`i18n.test.ts` 要求 `zh-CN` 与 `en` 键完全相同、占位符一致，并检查固定词汇。服务器发来的设备问题消息是英文的：界面翻译原因码，原样显示服务器消息（AGENTS.md §7）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4077":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-186","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`bun run test`（vitest，happy-dom）与 `bun run typecheck`（`vue-tsc`）由 `python scripts/dev.py test-web` 运行，也是 `check` 的一部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4078":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-187","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4079":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-188","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4080":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-189","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"守护什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4081":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-190","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4082":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-191","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`imports.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4083":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-192","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`src/` 内的模块只经 `@/` 别名互相导入，没有相对路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"4084":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-193","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4085":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-194","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`tokens.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4086":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-195","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`src/theme/` 之外的样式与模板中没有十六进制颜色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4087":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-196","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4088":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-197","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`layout.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4089":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-198","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"名称可收缩、一列分节 + `PageFooter`、字段行居中、没有把分节并排的网格","locale":"zh-CN"},"4090":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-199","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"4091":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-200","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`i18n/i18n.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4092":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-201","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"两种语言键与占位符一致；固定词汇","locale":"zh-CN"},"4093":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-202","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"动效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4094":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-203","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`ui/motion/motion.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4095":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-204","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"在零时长测试样式表（`test/motion-zero.css`）下，完整动效和降低动效两种情况的退出都能结束（时长为 0 时不会等不到 `transitionend` 而卡住）；两种降低动效来源都有规则；目的地切换包进视图过渡；降低动效下是短交叉淡化","locale":"zh-CN"},"4096":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-205","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4097":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-206","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`ui/ui.test.ts`、`ui/layers.test.ts`、`ui/bars.test.ts`、`ui/reveal.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4098":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-207","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"基础组件行为、图层栈、动效辅助函数、配色生成、窗口尺寸类、格式化；进度条与电平表；下拉列表避开页脚","locale":"zh-CN"},"4099":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-208","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"业务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4100":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-209","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`VoiceParamsPanel.test.ts`、`ImportReviewDialog.test.ts`、`ResourceRow.test.ts`、`GpuIndicator.test.ts`、`devices.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4101":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-210","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"参数范围来自 schema、默认预设与禁用原因；只提供兼容音色；下载行；释放显存的可用性；设备菜单排序与解析状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4102":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-211","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4103":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-212","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`stores/jobs.test.ts`、`stores/preferences.test.ts`、`audio/player.test.ts`、`api/baseUrl.test.ts`、`devProxy.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4104":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-213","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"任务不倒退、完成只通知一次；偏好迁移；A/B 播放器；部署根推导；代理错误分类","locale":"zh-CN"},"4105":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-214","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#测试","content":"`test/setup.ts` 为 `HTMLElement` 补上 `attachInternals`：happy-dom 没有 `ElementInternals`，而 `@material/web` 的表单关联元素（按钮、输入框）在创建时就会调用它。组件测试用 `@vue/test-utils` 挂载，查询与 store 按需模拟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4106":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-215","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**API 先行。** 若需要新接口，先在核心层和 `api/routers/` 加好，运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，在 `api/types.ts` 为常用 schema 起别名（见 API 与事件）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4107":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-216","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**查询。** 在 `api/queries/keys.ts` 加键，在 `api/queries/<资源>.ts` 写 `useQuery`/`useMutation`；启动任务的变更把 `Job` 写进 `useJobsStore().upsert(job, '<screen>')`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4108":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-217","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**事件。** 新事件或已有事件影响新数据时，在 `api/socket.ts` 中写入或失效对应的键；高频数据放进 store，不进缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4109":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-218","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**视图。** 在 `views/` 新建 `XxxView.vue`，在 `router.ts` 加路由并设 `meta.screen`。若是导航目的地：在 `App.vue` 的 `nav` 加一项（用 `addressOf()`），并同步 `router.ts` 的 `SCREENS` 与 `App.vue` 中记录 `lastScreen` 的列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4110":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-219","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**组成。** 只从 `@/ui` 导入基础组件，优先复用统一体验组件；页面是 `.sections` 一列 `Surface` 分节，动作放 `PageFooter`，含名称的行给文字元素 `min-width: 0`，并把新文件加入 `layout.test.ts` 的相应列表。过渡用 `TRANSITIONS` 中的名称，不写字面时长与颜色。缺的基础组件加到 `ui/` 并从 `ui/index.ts` 导出，不在调用处打补丁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4111":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-220","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**文案。** 在 `i18n/en.ts` 与 `i18n/zh-CN.ts` 同时加键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4112":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-221","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面","content":"**检查。** `python scripts/dev.py test-web`，然后在浏览器里用 `python scripts/dev.py dev` 实际走一遍，包括窄屏（\\< 600 px）和降低动效；新组件可放进 `DevComponentsView` 检查主题与动效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4113":{"id":"/docs/development","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development","locale":"zh-CN"},"4114":{"id":"/docs/development-0","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"这一部分写给要修改、扩展或审查 RVC Next 代码的人：维护者、贡献者，以及在这个仓库里工作的编程智能体。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4115":{"id":"/docs/development-1","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#与-agentsmd-的关系","content":"与 AGENTS.md 的关系","locale":"zh-CN"},"4116":{"id":"/docs/development-2","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"页面地图","locale":"zh-CN"},"4117":{"id":"/docs/development-3","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"项目由来","locale":"zh-CN"},"4118":{"id":"/docs/development-