4151":{"id":"/docs/development-37","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"命令行实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"4152":{"id":"/docs/development-38","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"Typer 工厂、命令注册、错误到退出码、`--json`、前台任务、如何新增命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4153":{"id":"/docs/development-39","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"资源与模型仓库","locale":"zh-CN"},"4154":{"id":"/docs/development-40","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"`catalog.json` 格式、两个下载仓库、校验与断点续传、如何新增资源、只存在于整合包中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/development-41","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"与原版的一致性","locale":"zh-CN"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/development-42","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"移植规则、golden 测试、与原版的行为差异及原因、torchaudio / torchfcpe 的移植","locale":"zh-CN"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/development-43","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"测试与检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4158":{"id":"/docs/development-44","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"`dev.py check`、pytest 标记与环境变量、tiny 模型、测试布局与 CI","locale":"zh-CN"},"4159":{"id":"/docs/development-45","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面地图","content":"第一次接触代码，建议按 开发环境 → 整体架构 → 与手头工作相关的那一层 的顺序读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4160":{"id":"/docs/development-46","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"RVC Next 是对 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（下称\"原版\"，以本地检出 `81eed5e` 为准，那是一个 2026 年的重度修改分支：用 `transformers` 的 HuBERT 取代 fairseq，用 PyMSS 取代 UVR5，加入了 CUDA Graph、多说话人训练和 VST 插件）的重写。原版把功能分散在五个入口里：Gradio WebUI、桌面实时变声 GUI、VST 插件、各训练阶段的命令行脚本，以及内置的 PyMSS 命令行，每个入口各有一套设置、模型选择和进度显示。重写把它们合并成一个应用：**转换（Convert）**、**实时变声（Live）**、**人声分离（Separate）**、**训练（Train）**和**模型（Models）**，放在同一个 FastAPI 服务、同一个 Vue 3 Web UI 和同一个 Typer 命令行后面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4161":{"id":"/docs/development-47","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"代码有三个来源，处理方式各不相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4162":{"id":"/docs/development-48","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"4163":{"id":"/docs/development-49","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"拿来了什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4164":{"id":"/docs/development-50","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"处理方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/development-51","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"SD Model Hub（经由 Hanaikada）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4166":{"id":"/docs/development-52","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"应用骨架：设置、事件总线、SQLite 数据库、安全中间件、端口绑定、CLI 工厂、Web UI 的主题、`ui/` 组件库、动效系统和规则测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/development-53","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"改名后沿用；Hanaikada 的 `embed.py`（嵌入其他应用）没有带过来，因为没有宿主应用需要嵌入 RVC Next","locale":"zh-CN"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/development-54","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"原版 RVC","locale":"zh-CN"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/development-55","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"合成器与判别器网络、RMVPE、TorchGate、CUDA Graph 缓存、离线 / 流式 / 训练的数值计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/development-56","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"**移植而非重写**，用 golden 测试与原版逐位比对，保证已有音色听起来完全一样（见与原版的一致性）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4171":{"id":"/docs/development-57","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"torchaudio、torchfcpe","locale":"zh-CN"},"4172":{"id":"/docs/development-58","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"`transforms.Resample` 的加窗 sinc 重采样器；FCPE 推理路径（mel 前端、纯卷积的 `CFNaiveMelPE`、解码器、加载器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4173":{"id":"/docs/development-59","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"逐步移植到 `engine/audio/sinc_resample.py` 和 `engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`，测试在装有原库时与之逐位相等。这样 RVC Next 不再依赖 torchaudio（其最后一个版本是 2.11）和 torchfcpe","locale":"zh-CN"},"4174":{"id":"/docs/development-60","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#项目由来","content":"编排、存储、进程控制和全部用户界面都是新写的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4175":{"id":"/docs/development-61","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"RVC Next 以 **GPL-3.0-only** 发布（`LICENSE`，`pyproject.toml` 中 `license = \"GPL-3.0-only\"`）。原因是骨架代码来自 GPLv3 的 SD Model Hub 与 Hanaikada。移植来的代码保留其原许可声明，集中列在 `NOTICE`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4176":{"id":"/docs/development-62","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"原版 RVC：MIT；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4177":{"id":"/docs/development-63","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"torchaudio：BSD 2-Clause，全文同时保留在 `engine/audio/sinc_resample.py` 里；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4178":{"id":"/docs/development-64","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"FCPE / torchfcpe：MIT（其 conformer 来自 Diffusion-SVC，同为 MIT）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4179":{"id":"/docs/development-65","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#许可","content":"PyMSS 作为依赖使用（MIT）；RMVPE、DDSP-SVC 的 SOLA 交叉淡化、TorchGate 也在其中注明出处。","locale":"zh-CN"}