h-CN"},"4237":{"id":"/docs/first-run-55","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"转换需要两个基础模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4238":{"id":"/docs/first-run-56","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"**HuBERT**（约 180 MB）：提取语音内容特征，每次转换都需要；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4239":{"id":"/docs/first-run-57","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"**RMVPE**（约 173 MB）：默认的音高算法，转换带音高引导的音色时需要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4240":{"id":"/docs/first-run-58","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"另外还有几个可选的音高模型，只有在音高算法中选了对应算法时才需要：**FCPE**（约 41 MB）、**CREPE**（约 85 MB）和 **CREPE tiny**（约 2 MB）。`pm` 和 **SwiftF0** 不需要下载任何文件（SwiftF0 的小模型随 RVC Next 一起提供）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4241":{"id":"/docs/first-run-59","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"你可以任选一种方式下载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4242":{"id":"/docs/first-run-60","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"RVC Next 不会让你在缺少模型时碰到报错。只要页面上的操作需要某个尚未下载的模型，原本的按钮就会被替换成一行提示，例如“**需要 HuBERT, RMVPE**”，旁边是 **下载（353 MB）** 按钮。点一下就开始下载，进度条显示在原处，下载完成后按钮自动恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4243":{"id":"/docs/first-run-61","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"点击导航栏的 **模型**，切换到 **资源** 标签页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4244":{"id":"/docs/first-run-62","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"在 **转换** 分组中点 **下载全部转换文件**，或在 HuBERT、RMVPE 各自那一行点 **下载**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4245":{"id":"/docs/first-run-63","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"每行会显示下载进度、已下载/总大小、速度和剩余时间；完成后状态变为 **已安装**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4246":{"id":"/docs/first-run-64","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"已安装的文件可以点 **校验**，按 SHA-256 重新检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4247":{"id":"/docs/first-run-65","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"下载支持断点续传，失败会自动重试，完成后会校验 SHA-256。默认从 Hugging Face 上的 licyk/rvc-model 仓库下载；如果访问 Hugging Face 不方便，可以在 **设置 › 下载** 中把 **下载源** 改为 **ModelScope（魔搭）**（licyks/rvc-model，适合中国大陆）或 **hf-mirror.com**，或者用命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4248":{"id":"/docs/first-run-66","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#下载-hubert-和-rmvpe","content":"可以直接复用原版 `assets/` 中已下载的模型，不必重复下载。做法见从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4249":{"id":"/docs/first-run-67","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"音色库一开始是空的。RVC Next 可以一键下载 RVC 官方的示例音色（连同索引），用来试用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4250":{"id":"/docs/first-run-68","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"点击 **模型**，切换到 **资源** 标签页，滚动到 **示例音色** 分组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4251":{"id":"/docs/first-run-69","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"如果你在 **音色** 标签页看到“还没有音色”，点其中的 **获取示例音色** 按钮也会跳到这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4252":{"id":"/docs/first-run-70","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"每行显示采样率、版本、是否 **含索引** 和大小。在想要的音色那一行点 **下载**，或点分组右上角的 **全部下载**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4253":{"id":"/docs/first-run-71","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"下载完成后，这一行显示 **已安装**，并出现 **已在音色库** 按钮，点它可以打开该音色的详情页。音色同时出现在 **模型 › 音色** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4254":{"id":"/docs/first-run-72","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"目前目录中有 `kikiV1`、`keruanV1`、`guanguanV1`（v1，40 kHz）、`zhanzhanv2-xi`（v2，40 kHz）和 `youzhanv2-xi`（v2，48 kHz，官方没有发布它的索引）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4255":{"id":"/docs/first-run-73","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#获取一个示例音色","content":"你自己的 `.pth` 模型可以直接拖到 **模型 › 音色** 顶部的导入区域，详见模型管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4256":{"id":"/docs/first-run-74","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"点击导航栏的 **转换**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4257":{"id":"/docs/first-run-75","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"在 **输入** 区域，把一个音频文件拖到“将音频文件拖放到这里”，或点击它选择文件。支持 WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、OGG 等格式。文件会上传到服务器，上传完成后可以点左侧的播放按钮试听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4258":{"id":"/docs/first-run-76","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"点击音色选择框（显示“选择音色”），在弹出的列表中选中刚下载的示例音色。选择框下方会显示它的采样率、版本以及是否有 **音高引导**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4259":{"id":"/docs/first-run-77","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"调整 **音色参数**。第一次只需要关注 **音高**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4260":{"id":"/docs/first-run-78","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"男声转女声音色，一般设为 **+12** 左右；女声转男声音色，设为 **−12** 左右；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4261":{"id":"/docs/first-run-79","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"同性别之间转换，保持 **0** 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4262":{"id":"/docs/first-run-80","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"其他参数先保持默认，含义见音色参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4263":{"id":"/docs/first-run-81","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"看页面底部固定的操作栏。如果显示“**需要 HuBERT, RMVPE**”，先点 **下载**，等待完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4264":{"id":"/docs/first-run-82","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"先点 **预览 15 秒**，只转换开头 15 秒，几秒钟就能听到效果；满意后再点 **转换** 处理整个文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4265":{"id":"/docs/first-run-83","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"操作栏中会出现任务卡片，显示状态和进度。完成后，结果出现在 **结果** 区域：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4266":{"id":"/docs/first-run-84","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"点播放按钮收听，点波形可以跳到对应位置；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4267":{"id":"/docs/first-run-85","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"用 **结果 / 源音频** 切换按钮在同一位置对比转换前后；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4268":{"id":"/docs/first-run-86","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"点右侧的 **更多操作**（⋮）可以 **下载** 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4269":{"id":"/docs/first-run-87","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"结果文件保存在数据文件夹的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 ID>/` 中，文件名为 `<原文件名>.<音色名>.<格式>`，例如 `song.kikiv1.wav`；预览结果的文件名带 `.preview`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4270":{"id":"/docs/first-run-88","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"用命令行完成同样的转换：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4271":{"id":"/docs/first-run-89","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#完成第一次转换","content":"直接转换带伴奏的歌曲效果通常不好。在 **转换** 页展开 **可选步骤**，打开 **先分离人声** 和 **加回伴奏**，就能一次完成“分离人声 → 转换 → 混回伴奏”。详见转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4272":{"id":"/docs/first-run-90","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"熟悉界面布局、任务和结果列表：界面总览","locale":"zh-CN"},"4273":{"id":"/docs/first-run-91","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"深入了解每个页面：使用教程","locale":"zh-CN"},"4274":{"id":"/docs/first-run-92","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"用命令行批量处理：命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4275":{"id":"/docs/first-run-93","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"遇到问题：常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4276":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"page","content":"转换","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert","locale":"zh-CN"},"4277":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"转换 页面把音频文件转换成选定音色的声音。它可以处理单个文件，也可以一次处理多个文件或整个文件夹；还可以在转换前先分离人声，转换后再把伴奏加回去，一次完成一首歌的翻唱。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4278":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#inputs","content":"添加输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4279":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#拖入或选择文件","content":"拖入或选择文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4280":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"服务器文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4281":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#之前的结果","content":"之前的结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4282":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#tts","content":"文字转语音","locale":"zh-CN"},"4283":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#管理输入列表","content":"管理输入列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4284":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"选择音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4285":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#调整音色参数","content":"调整音色参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4286":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#optional-steps","content":"可选步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"4287":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"先分离人声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4288":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#输出","content":"输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4289":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4290":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"预览与转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4291":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4292":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#结果","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4293":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#文件保存在哪里叫什么","content":"文件保存在哪里、叫什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4294":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"批量转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4295":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"页面从上到下分为三个分区，底部是固定的操作栏：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4296":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"**输入**：要转换的音频；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4297":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"音色选择框、**音色参数** 和折叠的 **可选步骤**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4298":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"**结果**：本次会话中在此页面得到的结果；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4299":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert","content":"底部操作栏：任务卡片、**预览 15 秒** 和 **转换** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4300":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#inputs","content":"**输入** 分区中有三种添加音频的方式，可以混合使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4301":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#拖入或选择文件","content":"把文件拖到“将音频文件拖放到这里”区域，或点击该区域在对话框中选择，可以一次选多个。常见的音频格式（WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、OGG、OPUS、AAC、WMA 等）都可以；视频文件也能直接拖入，会使用其中的音轨。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4302":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#拖入或选择文件","content":"文件会上传到服务器，每个文件下方显示上传进度。上传完成后，左侧出现播放按钮，右侧显示时长；上传失败的文件会显示“无法上传 ……”和原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4303":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"当浏览器与服务器在同一台电脑上（或服务器设置了访问令牌）时，会出现 **服务器文件** 按钮。它直接使用服务器磁盘上的文件，**不需要上传**，适合大文件和大量文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4304":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"点 **服务器文件**，对话框中先列出可以浏览的 **文件夹**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4305":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"点文件夹进入，点 **上一级** 返回。对话框只列出文件夹和音频文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4306":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"勾选要用的文件，点 **添加 N 个**；或者在某个文件夹中直接点 **添加此文件夹**，把整个文件夹作为一个输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4307":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"把文件夹作为输入时，转换会处理该文件夹**第一层**的所有音频文件，不包括子文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4308":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#服务器文件","content":"可以浏览的文件夹默认是你的主目录、已添加的原版 RVC 安装、数据文件夹以及各个磁盘分区；可以在 **设置 › 存储** 的 **浏览器可打开的文件夹** 中修改（每行一个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4309":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#之前的结果","content":"点 **之前的结果**，可以从所有历史结果（包括其他页面、之前会话中的结果）里勾选若干个，点 **添加 N 个** 加入输入。例如把 **分离** 得到的人声拿来转换，或者把一次转换的结果再转换一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4310":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#tts","content":"点 **文字转语音**，输入文字，让在线语音读出来；生成的语音会作为输入加入，可直接转换成你的音色（相当于 Applio 的 TTS 页）。选择 **语言** 和 **发音人**（微软 Edge 的朗读语音，约 140 种语言、300 多个发音人；会记住上次的发音人），需要时调整 **语速**（−50 到 +100 %）和 **音高**（−50 到 +50 Hz）。每次最多 5000 字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4311":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#tts","content":"文字会通过互联网发送到微软的语音服务；点 **添加** 之前不会发送任何内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4312":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#tts","content":"服务器需要 `pip install \"rvc-next[tts]\"`（edge-tts）；没有安装时，对话框会给出提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4313":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#tts","content":"命令行：`rvc-next tts speak \"文字\" --voice zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural -o hello.mp3`，再转换 `hello.mp3`（`tts`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4314":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#管理输入列表","content":"点每一项左侧的播放按钮试听；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4315":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#管理输入列表","content":"点右侧的 **移除**（×）删掉一项；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4316":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#管理输入列表","content":"输入多于一项时，可以点 **清空** 一次全部移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4317":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"点击音色选择框（未选时显示“选择音色”），弹出音色列表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4318":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"顶部的 **搜索音色** 可以按名称或标签筛选；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4319":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"每个音色下方显示采样率、版本（v1/v2）、**音高引导** 或 **无音高引导**，以及多说话人音色的说话人数；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4320":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"没有索引的音色带 **无索引** 标记，来自原版 RVC 安装（直接读取、未复制进音色库）的音色带 **旧版** 标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4321":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"如果音色库是空的，这里会显示“还没有音色”和 **打开模型** 按钮。导入和下载音色见模型管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4322":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"**多说话人音色**会在选择框下方多出一个 **说话人** 下拉框，从中选择要使用的说话人。选择新音色时会自动选中它的第一个说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4323":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#选择音色","content":"选择音色时，**音色参数** 会自动载入该音色的默认预设，所以同一个音色在转换和实时变声中听起来一致。RVC Next 会记住你在本页上次选择的音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4324":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#调整音色参数","content":"**音色参数** 面板中有 **音高算法**、**音高**、**共振峰**、**索引强度**、**辅音保护** 和 **响度匹配**，面板右上角的 **预设** 菜单可以应用或保存预设。在转换页面，参数“在下一次转换时生效”：修改后点 **预览 15 秒** 或 **转换** 才会用上新值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4325":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#调整音色参数","content":"每个参数的含义、范围、默认值和调节建议，见音色参数。最常调的是 **音高**：男声转女声音色约 +12，女声转男声音色约 −12。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4326":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#optional-steps","content":"点开 **可选步骤** 折叠面板，可以设置以下内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4327":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"打开 **先分离人声**（说明为“只转换歌曲中的人声。”）后，转换前会先用分离模型拆分音频，只转换其中的人声部分。打开后会出现：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4328":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"**预设**：使用哪个分离预设，默认是 **Vocals**。各个预设的区别见人声分离。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4329":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"**加回伴奏**：打开后，转换好的人声会叠加到分离出的伴奏上，输出一首完整的歌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4330":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"**伴奏音量**：加回伴奏时伴奏的增益，范围 −24 到 +12 dB，默认 0 dB。觉得伴奏盖过人声时调低，反之调高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4331":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"需要注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4332":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"被转换的是预设的“主分轨”：**Vocals** 和 **Vocals, aggressive** 是 `vocals`，**Lead vocal** 和 **Lead vocal, clean** 是主唱 `main_vocal`，**Vocals, clean** 是去混响后的 `vocals`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4333":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"加回的“伴奏”优先取 `instrumental` 分轨；预设没有伴奏分轨时取另一个分轨。例如用 **Remove reverb** 预设时，加回的就是分离出的混响，相当于“转换干声，再把原来的混响加回去”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4334":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"加回伴奏后输出为立体声；如果叠加后会削波，整体音量会自动压低到不削波。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4335":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"分离出的中间分轨在转换完成后会被删除。如果你也需要这些分轨，请改用人声分离页面先分离，再把人声送来转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4336":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#先分离人声","content":"打开 **先分离人声** 后，所选预设需要的分离模型也会加入“需要下载”的检查。分离模型较大（每个 300～440 MB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4337":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#输出","content":"**格式**：WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A 或 OGG（Opus，文件小；始终为 48 kHz）。默认值来自 **设置 › 训练默认值** 中的 **结果格式**（初始为 WAV）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4338":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#输出","content":"**采样率**：默认为 **音色自身的采样率**（例如 40 kHz 音色输出 40 kHz）；也可以选择 22.05、32、40、44.1 或 48 kHz，结果会重采样到该采样率。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4339":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#输出","content":"**降噪**：0 ～ 1，默认 0（关）。用随噪声变化而调整的频谱门限去除转换结果中的嘶声和背景噪声（即 Applio 的“清理音频”）；数值越高去除越多，也可能让声音发闷。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4340":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"**输出** 下的 **效果** 可以给转换后的人声加一串音频效果，从上到下依次处理，在加回伴奏之前：高通和低通滤波、噪声门、压缩器、变调、失真、降位、削波、合唱、相位器、延迟、混响、增益和限幅器（来自 Spotify 的 pedalboard，与 Applio 的后处理相同，但顺序任意，最多 16 个）。**添加效果** 以默认设置追加一个效果；每个效果的滑块是它的参数，箭头和垃圾桶按钮用来移动和移除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4341":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"混响和延迟会在人声结束后继续响：结果会长出可听到的尾音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4342":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"限幅器在限幅的同时也会抬高音量（pedalboard 的限幅器带补偿增益）；可在它前面加一个 **增益** 来控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4343":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"服务器需要 `pip install \"rvc-next[effects]\"`；没有安装时，此处会给出提示，带效果的转换会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4344":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#effects","content":"效果不保存在预设里；命令行用 `--effect` 指定（`convert`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4345":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"底部操作栏中有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4346":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"4347":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4348":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"**预览 15 秒**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4349":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"只转换每个输入的前 15 秒。预览任务会排到其他排队任务之前，适合快速试参数。结果带 **预览** 标签，文件名中带 `.preview`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4350":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"**转换**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4351":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"转换全部输入的完整内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4352":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"按钮不可用时，左侧会说明原因：“请选择音色。”或“请添加要转换的音频。”；仍有输入在上传时也无法开始。如果缺少所需的模型（HuBERT、所选音高算法对应的模型、分离模型），按钮会被替换为“**需要 ……**”和 **下载** 按钮，见界面总览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4353":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"推荐的流程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4354":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"添加输入、选择音色、设置 **音高**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4355":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"点 **预览 15 秒**，在 **结果** 中用 **结果 / 源音频** 对比；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4356":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"根据效果调整参数（见音色参数），再次预览；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4357":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#预览与转换","content":"满意后点 **转换**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4358":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"每点一次 **转换**（或 **预览 15 秒**），就会创建**一个**任务，包含当前所有输入。任务卡片出现在底部操作栏中：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4359":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"标题形如 `Convert song.wav · kikiV1`，多个输入时为 `Convert song.wav and 4 more · kikiV1`，预览为 `Preview ……`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4360":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"打开了 **先分离人声** 时，第一步是 `Separate`（一次处理全部输入），然后每个输入一步；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4361":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"可以随时 **取消**；失败、取消或中断后可以 **重试**；点 **日志** 查看详细过程。例如音色没有索引而 **索引强度** 大于 0 时，日志中会记录 `No index for this voice; index strength has no effect`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4362":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#任务","content":"点击按钮后，你可以继续修改参数或输入、再次提交，新任务会排在后面。任务的通用说明见界面总览 › 任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4363":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#结果","content":"完成的结果出现在 **结果** 分区，类型标签为 **已转换**、**混音**（加回了伴奏）或 **预览**。播放、波形跳转、**结果 / 源音频** 对比和 **更多操作** 菜单的用法见界面总览 › 结果列表。在本页特别有用的两项：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4364":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#结果","content":"**用作输入**：把结果加回本页的输入，例如对转换结果再做一次处理；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4365":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#结果","content":"**用这些设置重新运行**：恢复生成该结果时的音色和参数，并把它的源文件加回输入，方便在旧设置的基础上微调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4366":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#文件保存在哪里叫什么","content":"结果保存在数据文件夹的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 ID>/` 中（结果文件夹可以在 **设置 › 存储** 中更改）。文件名规则是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4367":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#文件保存在哪里叫什么","content":"例如用音色 `kikiV1` 转换 `song.flac` 并输出 WAV，得到 `song.kikiv1.wav`。音色名部分会转为小写，空格和符号换成 `-`，中文等文字保留。预览的文件名为 `song.kikiv1.preview.wav`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4368":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#文件保存在哪里叫什么","content":"RVC Next **从不覆盖已有文件**：如果同名文件已经存在（例如同一批输入里既有 `song.wav` 又有 `song.flac`），会自动在末尾加序号，如 `song.kikiv1_1.wav`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4369":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#文件保存在哪里叫什么","content":"结果默认一直保留；如果希望自动清理旧结果，在 **设置 › 存储** 中设置“结果保留天数（0：一直保留）”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4370":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"一次转换很多文件有几种做法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4371":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"**多选或拖入多个文件**：它们会在同一个任务中依次转换；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4372":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"**添加文件夹**：通过 **服务器文件** 的 **添加此文件夹**，转换文件夹第一层的所有音频文件；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4373":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"**用命令行**：可以递归子文件夹，也可以指定输出文件夹。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4374":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"命令行默认从音色的默认预设出发，用 `--preset` 可以换成别的预设，再用 `--pitch`、`--index-rate` 等单独覆盖。只有在用 `-o` 指定了输出文件夹时，才可以用 `--overwrite` 覆盖同名文件。全部选项见命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4375":{"id":"/docs/guide-convert-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-convert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-convert#批量转换","content":"转换使用 **设置 › 计算** 中 **设备** 所选的设备。默认为 **自动**：按原版 RVC 的规则选择 GPU，没有合适的 GPU 时使用 CPU。CPU 上的转换结果与原版逐位一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4376":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"page","content":"界面总览","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface","locale":"zh-CN"},"4377":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface","content":"本页介绍 RVC Next 网页界面的整体布局，以及在各个页面中反复出现的部分：导航、顶部栏、页面底部的操作栏、任务卡片、结果列表和页面之间的“传递”。掌握这些之后，阅读具体页面的教程会轻松很多。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4378":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#整体布局","content":"整体布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"4379":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#切换页面时会保留什么","content":"切换页面时会保留什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4380":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"页面的结构","locale":"zh-CN"},"4381":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#missing-models","content":"缺少模型时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4382":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#出错时","content":"出错时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4383":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#jobs","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4384":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"任务卡片","locale":"zh-CN"},"4385":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务侧边栏和任务页","content":"任务侧边栏和任务页","locale":"zh-CN"},"4386":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"结果列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4387":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"页面之间的传递","locale":"zh-CN"},"4388":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#顶部栏的其他按钮","content":"顶部栏的其他按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"4389":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"4390":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#主题","content":"主题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4391":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#实时状态标签","content":"实时状态标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"4392":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"4393":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"键盘操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"4394":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#整体布局","content":"界面由三部分组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4395":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#整体布局","content":"**导航**：窗口较宽时在左侧显示为一列导航栏，依次是 **转换**、**实时**、**分离**、**训练**、**模型**，最下方是 **设置**。窗口宽度小于 600 像素时（例如手机或窄窗口），导航移到底部，变成一排六个按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4396":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#整体布局","content":"**顶部栏**：左侧始终显示应用名称 **RVC Next**；右侧是实时状态标签（仅在实时变声运行时出现）、任务按钮、显存按钮和主题按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4397":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#整体布局","content":"**内容区**：当前页面。只有这一部分会在切换页面时淡入淡出，导航和顶部栏保持不动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4398":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#切换页面时会保留什么","content":"每个页面在切换走之后**保持原样**：已添加的输入、选中的音色、调好的参数、滚动位置都还在，切回来可以接着用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4399":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#切换页面时会保留什么","content":"导航按钮会回到该页面上次所在的位置。例如你在 **训练** 中打开了某个实验，切到 **转换** 再点 **训练**，回到的仍是那个实验。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4400":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#切换页面时会保留什么","content":"**刷新浏览器会重置**所有页面的临时状态。只有真正的偏好会被保存：主题、上次所在的页面、**转换** 中上次选的音色、**分离** 中上次选的预设等。这些偏好保存在服务器上，换一个浏览器打开也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4401":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"**转换**、**分离**、**实时** 等页面都是同样的结构：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4402":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"**一列分区**：从上到下排列，例如 **转换** 页依次是 **输入**、音色与 **音色参数**、**结果**。每个分区与页面同宽，分区内部的字段会根据宽度自动换行排列。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4403":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"**底部操作栏**：固定在页面底部，无论页面滚动到哪里都可见。其中包含：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4404":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"本页面的出错提示；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4405":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"从本页面启动、尚未结束的任务卡片（多个任务时可在其中滚动）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4406":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面的结构","content":"运行按钮，例如 **预览 15 秒** 和 **转换**。按钮不可用时，左侧会用一行小字说明原因，例如“请添加要转换的音频。”或“请选择音色。”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4407":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#missing-models","content":"如果当前操作需要的模型还没有下载，操作栏中的运行按钮会被替换为一行提示，例如“**需要 HuBERT, RMVPE**”，以及 **下载（353 MB）** 按钮。点击后就地显示下载进度；下载完成后，运行按钮自动回来。所以你不必事先记住每个功能需要哪些文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4408":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#出错时","content":"错误会显示在发生的位置（操作栏、任务卡片或对话框中）：标题是翻译后的错误类型（例如“缺少所需的模型文件”“GPU 不可用或显存不足”），下面是服务器给出的具体信息（英文）。有更多细节时会出现 **详情** 按钮，点开可以看到完整内容，反馈问题时可以一并附上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4409":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#jobs","content":"转换、分离、训练、下载、融合、提取等耗时操作都会作为**任务**在服务器上运行。任务在后台排队执行，不会阻塞界面；关掉浏览器标签页，任务也会继续运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4410":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"任务卡片会出现在启动它的页面的操作栏中，也会出现在 **任务** 侧边栏里。每张卡片显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4411":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**标题**：由服务器生成，目前是英文，例如 `Convert song.wav · kikiV1`、`Preview song.wav · kikiV1`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4412":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**状态**：**排队中**、**等待中**（会具体说明 **等待 GPU**、**等待 CPU** 或 **等待下载**）、**运行中**、**正在取消**、**已取消**、**失败**、**完成**、**已中断**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4413":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"当前步骤，以及多步任务的完成数，例如 `2/5`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4414":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"运行时的进度条；下载任务还会显示已下载/总大小、速度和剩余时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4415":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"卡片右侧的按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4416":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"4417":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4418":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**取消**（×）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4419":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"停止尚未结束的任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4420":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**重试**（↻）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4421":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"用完全相同的请求重新运行。适用于 **失败**、**已取消** 和 **已中断** 的任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4422":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**日志**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4423":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"在卡片中展开或收起这个任务的日志；再点一次为 **隐藏日志**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4424":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"几种特殊情况：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4425":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**已中断**：服务器在任务运行中被关闭，下次启动时该任务会标记为已中断。因为请求被保存了下来，可以直接 **重试**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4426":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**仍然运行**：实时变声正在使用 GPU 时，新的 GPU 任务会等待，卡片上会提示“实时转换正在使用 GPU。同时运行可能导致声音卡顿。”，并提供 **仍然运行** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4427":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务卡片","content":"**预览优先**：预览任务会排到其他排队任务前面，尽快给你结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4428":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务侧边栏和任务页","content":"点击顶部栏的 **任务** 按钮会打开 **任务** 侧边栏。没有任务运行时按钮显示为一个清单图标；有任务运行时，图标会转动，并带有运行中任务数的角标（提示文字为“N 个运行中”）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4429":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务侧边栏和任务页","content":"侧边栏列出所有页面的任务：本次会话启动的任务（带实时进度）在前，然后是服务器记录的近期历史，最多 30 个。点右上角的 **全部任务** 可以打开完整的任务页，在其中用 **全部**、**进行中**、**已结束** 筛选，或点 **清除已结束的任务**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4430":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#任务侧边栏和任务页","content":"在其他页面启动的任务完成或失败时，屏幕底部会弹出提示，例如“…… 已完成”；失败的提示带有 **查看日志** 按钮，点击会打开任务侧边栏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4431":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**转换** 和 **分离** 页面（以及音色详情页的 **试听**）都用同一种 **结果** 列表。列表中只显示**本次会话里从这个页面启动**的任务所产生的结果，最新的在前；刷新浏览器后列表会清空，但文件仍在，可以通过输入区的 **之前的结果** 重新找到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4432":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"每个结果一行，包括：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4433":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**播放**按钮：所有结果共用一个播放器，播放一个会停止另一个；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4434":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"文件名、类型标签（**已转换**、**混音**、**分轨**、**预览**）、分轨名称（如 `vocals`）和时长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4435":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**波形**：显示播放进度，点击可跳到对应位置；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4436":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**结果 / 源音频** 切换：在同一播放位置切换听转换后与转换前的声音，方便 A/B 对比；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4437":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**更多操作**（⋮）菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4438":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**更多操作** 菜单中的项目：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4439":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4440":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4441":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"出现条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**下载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4443":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"把文件下载到浏览器所在的电脑","locale":"zh-CN"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"始终","locale":"zh-CN"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**在文件夹中显示**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"在服务器电脑的文件管理器中定位文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4447":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"浏览器与服务器在同一台电脑上时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4448":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**用作输入**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4449":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"把这个结果加入当前页面的输入，再处理一次","locale":"zh-CN"},"4450":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"始终","locale":"zh-CN"},"4451":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**分析**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4452":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"打开它的频谱图和音高曲线，并与原音频对照（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4453":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"始终","locale":"zh-CN"},"4454":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**转换这个**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4455":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"把这个分轨送到 **转换** 页","locale":"zh-CN"},"4456":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"分轨结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4457":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**用这些设置重新运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4458":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"在 **转换** 页恢复生成它时用的音色和参数，并把它的源文件加回输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4459":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"转换结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4460":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**删除**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4461":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"把文件移到系统回收站，并从记录中移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"4462":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"始终","locale":"zh-CN"},"4463":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"**分析** 会打开一个窗口，显示结果的 **频谱图**（横轴时间，纵轴频率，越亮越响）和 **音高** 曲线；结果有原音频时一并显示原音频的：**结果** 和 **原音频** 切换频谱图，音高图同时画出两条曲线。窗口还列出时长、格式和中位音高，以及结果比原音频高或低多少个半音。频谱图能显示耳朵需要仔细找的东西：音色的采样率表现为声音能到达的最高频率（32k 音色止于 16 kHz），嘶声和嗡声表现为一片雾，分离残留表现为伴奏的纹理。音高曲线能显示八度跳变，以及某个参数如何改变了音高。音高由 SwiftF0 在处理器上计算，分析从不等待 GPU；超过 30 分钟的文件不做分析。命令行：`rvc-next analyse <文件> [--csv curve.csv]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4464":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#results","content":"结果多于一个时，列表右上角会出现 **全部下载**，把它们打包成一个 zip 下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4465":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"不同页面之间可以直接传递音频和音色，不必先下载再上传：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4466":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"在 **分离** 的结果上选 **转换这个**：分轨被加入 **转换** 页的输入，并自动切换到 **转换** 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4467":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"在任意页面的输入区点 **之前的结果**：从所有历史结果中勾选若干个加入输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4468":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"在 **训练** 的检查点上点 **试听**：用这个检查点生成一个临时音色，并打开 **转换** 页、选好该音色，直接试听训练效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4469":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#页面之间的传递","content":"在 **转换** 的结果上选 **用这些设置重新运行**：恢复当时的音色和参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4470":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#显存","content":"顶部栏的内存条图标显示显存使用情况。把鼠标悬停在上面，会看到“显存：已用 / 总量 · 已加载：……”（没有 GPU 时显示所用的设备），角标是当前已加载到内存的模型数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4471":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#显存","content":"点击它打开菜单，其中只有一项 **释放显存**：卸载 HuBERT、音色、音高模型等所有缓存的模型，并让 PyTorch 归还显存。只要没有任务在运行、实时变声也没有运行，就可以使用；否则菜单项不可用，并显示原因，例如“释放显存（请等待：有任务正在运行）”。成功后会提示“已释放显存”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4472":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#显存","content":"此外，模型在空闲一段时间后也会自动卸载，时长在 **设置 › 计算** 的“空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）”中设置，默认 10 分钟。出现显存不足时，RVC Next 会自动卸载所有当前没在用的模型，并把错误报告为“GPU 不可用或显存不足”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4473":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#主题","content":"最右侧的按钮切换主题，每点一次按 **浅色** → **深色** → **跟随系统** 循环，图标显示当前的选择。更多外观选项（**颜色**、**对比度**、**动画**）在 **设置 › 外观** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4474":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#实时状态标签","content":"实时变声运行期间，顶部栏右侧按钮组的最前面会出现一个标签，在每个页面上都可见。运行时显示“实时 · N 毫秒”（估计延迟），启动、加载、重连等过程中显示当前状态，例如“正在加载音色…”“正在重新连接设备…”。点击标签打开 **实时** 页；点旁边的方块按钮 **停止** 可以直接停止实时变声。详见实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4475":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌是可选的，其他电脑访问服务器也不需要它。如果服务器设置了访问令牌，浏览器第一次连接时会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框，输入后即可使用。只有 **在文件夹中显示** 这类操作只在浏览器与服务器位于同一台电脑上时可用。详见远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4476":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"esc 关闭最上层的对话框、菜单或侧边栏（一次只关一层）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4477":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"拖放区域可以用 tab 选中后按 enter 或 space 打开文件选择对话框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4478":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"结果的波形可以用 tab 选中，再用 arrow-left / arrow-right 每次后退或前进 5%。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4479":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"可点击的卡片（如 **分离** 的预设、音色库中的音色）选中后按 enter 即可激活。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4480":{"id":"/docs/guide-interface-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-interface","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-interface#键盘操作","content":"如果你希望减少界面动画，在 **设置 › 外观 › 动画** 中选择 **减少**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4481":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"page","content":"在其他程序中使用实时变声","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","locale":"zh-CN"},"4482":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"把实时变声的声音当作麦克风，送进 Discord、Zoom、OBS、游戏或任何其他程序：分步讲解 Windows（VB-CABLE 或 Voicemeeter）、macOS（BlackHole）和 Linux（PipeWire 或 PulseAudio 虚拟麦克风）上的虚拟声卡设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4483":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"开始之前","locale":"zh-CN"},"4484":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-vb-cable","content":"Windows：VB-CABLE","locale":"zh-CN"},"4485":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"4486":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"设置 rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"4487":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置其他程序","content":"设置其他程序","locale":"zh-CN"},"4488":{"id":"/docs/g