nt":"4\\. 设置 rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"4509":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#5-设置其他程序","content":"5\\. 设置其他程序","locale":"zh-CN"},"4510":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"永久生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4511":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#移除","content":"移除","locale":"zh-CN"},"4512":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"其他程序里的设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4513":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"日常使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4514":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"rvc-next 在另一台电脑上","locale":"zh-CN"},"4515":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"问题排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4516":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"实时变声把转换后的声音播放到一个输出设备上。要让其他程序把它当作麦克风来录，需要一块**虚拟声卡**：它有一个*播放端*，由 rvc-next 往里播放；还有一个*录音端*，由其他程序从中录制。播放进一端的声音，会从另一端出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4517":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"4518":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"虚拟声卡","locale":"zh-CN"},"4519":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"rvc-next 的 **输出**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4520":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"其他程序的麦克风","locale":"zh-CN"},"4521":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"4522":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"VB-CABLE（最简单）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4523":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**CABLE Input (VB-Audio Virtual Cable)**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4524":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**CABLE Output (VB-Audio Virtual Cable)**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4525":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"4526":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"Voicemeeter Banana（需要混入其他声音时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4527":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**Voicemeeter AUX Input**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4528":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**Voicemeeter Out B1**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4529":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"macOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4530":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"BlackHole 2ch","locale":"zh-CN"},"4531":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**BlackHole 2ch**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4532":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**BlackHole 2ch**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4533":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"Linux","locale":"zh-CN"},"4534":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"PipeWire / PulseAudio 虚拟麦克风","locale":"zh-CN"},"4535":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**rvc-next-virtual**（自己添加的 ALSA 设备）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4536":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing","content":"**RVC-Next-Microphone**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4537":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**rvc-next 要和其他程序运行在同一台电脑上。** 实时变声打开的是服务器所在电脑的设备（**服务器设备**）。rvc-next 运行在另一台电脑上时，见 rvc-next 在另一台电脑上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4538":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**先用耳机把实时变声调通。** **输入** 选麦克风，**输出** 选耳机，确认 **输入电平** 会跳动，点 **测试**，再点 **开始** 听一听。调通之后，再按下文把 **输出** 换成虚拟声卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4539":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**戴耳机。** 用扬声器时，麦克风会录到对方的声音，把它也转换一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4540":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**系统的默认输出保持为真实的耳机或扬声器**，只在 rvc-next 和其他程序里选虚拟声卡。如果把虚拟声卡设为默认输出，电脑播放的所有声音（包括通话本身）都会进入你的“麦克风”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4541":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**如果你把虚拟声卡设成了系统的默认输入**（有些游戏没有麦克风设置），rvc-next 的 **输入** 必须按名称选真实的麦克风，而不是 **系统默认**，否则 rvc-next 会录到自己的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4542":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#开始之前","content":"**用监听听自己。** rvc-next 的 **监听** 是第二个输出：选你的耳机，**监听内容** 选 **转换后**，就能听到对方听到的声音。**输出** 旁的 **测试** 播放进虚拟声卡，所以你听不到；检查耳机请用 **监听** 旁的 **测试**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4543":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-vb-cable","content":"VB-CABLE 是 VB-Audio 出品的一条免费（捐赠软件）虚拟音频线。配合 rvc-next 的监听，语音聊天只需要它就够了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4544":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"从 vb-audio.com/Cable 下载 **VB-CABLE Driver Pack**，解压整个 zip。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4545":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"右键 **VBCABLE_Setup_x64.exe**（32 位 Windows 用 VBCABLE_Setup.exe），选 **以管理员身份运行**，再点 **Install Driver**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4546":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"重启 Windows。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4547":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"打开声音控制面板（**设置 › 系统 › 声音 › 更多声音设置**）。**播放** 选项卡里多了 **CABLE Input**，**录制** 选项卡里多了 **CABLE Output**。确认真实的耳机（播放）和麦克风（录制）仍是默认设备；如果安装程序把虚拟线设成了默认，右键真实设备选 **设为默认设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4548":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"可选，为了最低延迟：打开 **CABLE Input** 和 **CABLE Output** 的 **属性 › 高级**，把两者的 **默认格式** 设成一样，例如 2 通道、24 位、48000 Hz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4549":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装","content":"可选，推荐：为麦克风、耳机和虚拟线的两端 关闭独占控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4550":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"打开 **实时**，点 **刷新设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4551":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"**输入**：你的麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4552":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"**输出**：**CABLE Input (VB-Audio Virtual Cable)**，带 **虚拟** 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4553":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"**监听**：你的耳机；**监听内容**：**转换后**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4554":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"**高级** 里的驱动保持推荐的 WASAPI，**独占模式（WASAPI）** 保持关闭，这样其他程序可以同时使用这条虚拟线。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4555":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next","content":"点 **开始** 并说话。声音控制面板 **录制** 选项卡里 **CABLE Output** 旁的电平条会随之跳动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4556":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置其他程序","content":"把它的麦克风选为 **CABLE Output (VB-Audio Virtual Cable)**，扬声器选你的耳机。需要关闭的处理见 其他程序里的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4557":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置其他程序","content":"很多 VB-CABLE 教程让你在 **CABLE Output › 属性 › 侦听** 中勾选 **侦听此设备**，以便听到虚拟线里的声音。rvc-next 的 **监听** 已经做了这件事；两者同时打开，你会听到两遍自己，第二遍还多一段延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4558":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-voicemeeter","content":"Voicemeeter（VB-Audio 出品，免费，捐赠软件）是一个虚拟调音台。如果通话或直播里除了你的声音还要混入别的声音（音乐、游戏声），或者想给声音加上它的均衡器和压缩器，就用它代替 VB-CABLE。下面的步骤以 **Voicemeeter Banana** 为例；之后是 Standard 与 Potato 的说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4559":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"Voicemeeter 会添加虚拟播放设备（rvc-next 往里播放）和虚拟录音设备（其他程序从中录制）。2024 年的版本换了新驱动，录音设备从此叫 **Out B1/B2/B3**；旧的安装显示旧名称：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4560":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"Voicemeeter 的通道条或总线","locale":"zh-CN"},"4561":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"播放设备（rvc-next 的 **输出**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4562":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"录音设备，现在的名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"4563":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"录音设备，2024 年之前","locale":"zh-CN"},"4564":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟输入 **VAIO**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4565":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter Input**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4566":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4567":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4568":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟输入 **AUX**（Banana、Potato）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4569":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter AUX Input**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4570":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4571":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4572":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟输入 **VAIO3**（Potato）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4573":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter VAIO3 Input**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4574":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4575":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4576":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟总线 **B1**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4577":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4578":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter Out B1**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4579":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter Output**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4580":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟总线 **B2**（Banana、Potato）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4581":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4582":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter Out B2**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4583":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter AUX Output**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4584":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"虚拟总线 **B3**（Potato）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4585":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"—","locale":"zh-CN"},"4586":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter Out B3**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4587":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"**Voicemeeter VAIO3 Output**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4588":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设备名称","content":"每个名称后面的括号里是驱动名，例如 *(VB-Audio Voicemeeter VAIO)*。从旧版本升级后，要在每个用过它们的程序里重新选择设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4589":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-1","content":"从 vb-audio.com/Voicemeeter/banana.htm 下载 Voicemeeter Banana，**以管理员身份** 运行安装程序，然后重启 Windows。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4590":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-1","content":"启动 Voicemeeter Banana。它必须在运行，它的设备才会有声音：打开 **Menu › Run on Windows Startup**（开机启动）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4591":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"Voicemeeter 窗口左侧是输入通道条（三个硬件输入，然后是两个虚拟输入 **VOICEMEETER VAIO** 和 **VOICEMEETER AUX**），右侧是输出。每个输入通道条上的 **A1 A2 A3 B1 B2** 按钮决定这路输入送往哪些总线：**A** 总线是真实的输出设备，**B** 总线是虚拟录音设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4592":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"**先选 A1。** 点右上角 **HARDWARE OUT** 下的 **A1**，选你的耳机，最好选 **WDM** 开头的那一项（**KS** 也可以，**MME** 作为后备）。A1 是 Voicemeeter 的主输出：整个调音台的采样率和缓冲都跟随它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4593":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"**硬件输入不要动。** rvc-next 会自己打开麦克风。不要把麦克风选为 **Hardware Input 1**；如果已经选了，把那条通道的 **B1** 关掉。否则对方会同时听到你的原声和转换后的声音，而且 Voicemeeter 可能占住麦克风，让 rvc-next 报告 **被其他程序占用**。为麦克风和 Voicemeeter 的设备 关闭独占控制 也有帮助。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4594":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"**VOICEMEETER AUX** 通道条（rvc-next 往这里播放）：打开 **B1**，转换后的声音就会进入 **Voicemeeter Out B1**。想通过 Voicemeeter 听到自己，再打开 **A1**，这时 rvc-next 的 **监听** 选 **不监听**（两边都开会听到两遍）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4595":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"**VOICEMEETER VAIO** 通道条：如果按 VB-Audio 自己的教程把 **Voicemeeter Input** 设为默认播放设备，Windows 的声音就会进入这一条。打开 **A1**、关闭 **B1**，这样电脑的声音能传到耳机，但不会进入通话。要有意把音乐或游戏声送进通话，再打开它的 **B1**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4596":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-voicemeeter","content":"让 rvc-next 走 AUX，是为了把两者分开：如果 rvc-next 走 VAIO，而 VAIO 又是默认播放设备，Windows 的所有声音都会和你的声音一起进入通话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4597":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-1","content":"打开 **实时**，点 **刷新设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4598":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-1","content":"**输入**：你的麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4599":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-1","content":"**输出**：**Voicemeeter AUX Input**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4600":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-1","content":"**监听**：如果已通过 Voicemeeter 的 A1 听自己，选 **不监听**；否则选你的耳机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4601":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-1","content":"点 **开始** 并说话：**VOICEMEETER AUX** 通道条和 **B1** 总线的电平表会跳动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4602":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置其他程序-1","content":"把它的麦克风选为 **Voicemeeter Out B1**（2024 年之前：**Voicemeeter Output**）。在 OBS 里，把 **Voicemeeter Out B1** 添加为一个 **音频输入采集** 来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4603":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#延迟与排查","content":"Voicemeeter 会在 rvc-next 的延迟之上再加自己的缓冲。**Menu › System Settings / Options** 里可以按驱动类型设置缓冲；缓冲越小延迟越低，但出现爆音就说明对你的电脑太小了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4604":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#延迟与排查","content":"在 Windows 里改动过设备，或某条通道一直没有声音时，用 **Menu › Restart Audio Engine**（重启音频引擎）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4605":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#延迟与排查","content":"所有 Voicemeeter 设备都以 A1 的采样率运行。在声音控制面板里把 Voicemeeter 的播放和录音设备设成同一格式（48000 Hz）；麦克风也用 48 kHz 时，rvc-next 会显示 **单个双工流**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4606":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#voicemeeter-editions","content":"**Voicemeeter（Standard）** 只有一个虚拟输入（**VAIO**）和一条虚拟总线（**B**）。rvc-next 的输出选 **Voicemeeter Input**，打开 VAIO 通道条的 **B**，其他程序录 **Voicemeeter Out B1**。不要把 **Voicemeeter Input** 设为默认播放设备，否则 Windows 的所有声音都会进入通话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4607":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#voicemeeter-editions","content":"**Voicemeeter Potato** 多一个虚拟输入和一条虚拟总线（**VAIO3**、**B3**）。Banana 的步骤原样适用；VAIO3 可以用来接第二个声源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4608":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"Windows 允许一个程序把设备据为己有（*独占模式*）：它占着设备时，其他程序都不能通过这台设备播放或录音。默认情况下每台设备都允许这样做，而且独占请求甚至会把设备从正在使用它的程序手里抢走（“给与独占模式应用程序优先”）。有些游戏、语音聊天程序和播放器会请求独占模式，这时 rvc-next 会在会话中途失去麦克风或虚拟声卡（实时变声进入 **正在重新连接设备…**），或者根本打不开它（**被其他程序占用**）。反过来，其他程序也可能这样被 rvc-next 抢走设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4609":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"为链路中的设备关闭独占控制，就能避免这类问题。这一步是可选的：遇到上述现象时，或者在直播、通话要依赖这套设置之前做一次即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4610":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"按 **Win + R**，输入 `mmsys.cpl` 后回车。（或者 **设置 › 系统 › 声音 › 更多声音设置**。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4611":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"在 **录制** 选项卡中双击你的 **麦克风**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4612":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"打开 **高级** 选项卡，在 **独占模式** 下取消勾选 **允许应用程序独占控制该设备**（Allow applications to take exclusive control of this device）。下方的 **给与独占模式应用程序优先**（Give exclusive mode applications priority）会随之变灰。点 **应用**，再点 **确定**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4613":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"对链路中的其他设备做同样的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4614":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"**录制** 选项卡：其他程序使用的录音端（**CABLE Output** 或 **Voicemeeter Out B1**）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4615":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"**播放** 选项卡：你的 **耳机**（rvc-next 的监听、Voicemeeter 的 A1），以及 rvc-next 播放进去的播放端（**CABLE Input**，或 **Voicemeeter Input** / **Voicemeeter AUX Input**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4616":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"停止并重新开始实时变声，并重启其他程序，让它们重新打开设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4617":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"较新的 Windows 11 版本（26H2 起）在“设置”应用里也有这个开关：**设置 › 系统 › 声音**，选择设备，然后在 **高级** 下关闭 **独占模式**。上面的控制面板方法在所有 Windows 10 和 11 版本上都适用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4618":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"说明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4619":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"rvc-next 自己的 **高级 › 独占模式（WASAPI）** 保持关闭（默认即关闭）。在已关闭独占控制的设备上，Windows 会拒绝它；如果你打开了它，设备面板会报告问题并给出 **关闭独占模式** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4620":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"如果某台设备你有意让其他程序独占使用（例如比特完美播放的音乐播放器、DAW），就保留它的独占控制。ASIO 驱动完全不经过这些 Windows 设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4621":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows-exclusive","content":"同一个 **高级** 选项卡也用来设置设备的 **默认格式**（VB-CABLE › 安装 第 5 步）。有些设备在这里还有 **启用音频增强**（或单独的 **增强** 选项卡）；在麦克风上关闭它，可以避免驱动自带的处理改变 rvc-next 要转换的声音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4622":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows麦克风权限与自动降低音量","content":"**设置 › 隐私和安全性 › 麦克风**：**麦克风访问权限** 和 **允许桌面应用访问你的麦克风** 必须打开，否则 rvc-next（一个 Python 程序）只能录到静音，或报告 **麦克风权限被拒绝**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4623":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#windows麦克风权限与自动降低音量","content":"语音聊天程序录音时，Windows 可能会降低其他所有声音。不想这样的话，打开声音控制面板的 **通信** 选项卡，选 **不执行任何操作**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4624":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#macos","content":"macOS 本身没有虚拟声卡，**BlackHole**（Existential Audio 出品，免费开源）可以添加一个。变声用 **BlackHole 2ch** 这一个立体声设备：它既是输出（rvc-next 往里播放），也是输入（其他程序从中录制）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4625":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"退出所有正在使用音频的程序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4626":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"安装 BlackHole 2ch，任选其一：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4627":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"用 existential.audio/blackhole 的安装包，提示时重启；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4628":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"用 Homebrew：`brew install blackhole-2ch`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4629":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"打开 **音频 MIDI 设置**（**应用程序 › 实用工具**）。左侧列表里有 **BlackHole 2ch**；选中它，把 **格式** 设为 **48,000 Hz**（大多数麦克风使用的采样率）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4630":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"系统输出保持为你的耳机（**系统设置 › 声音 › 输出**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4631":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#安装-2","content":"如果没看到 BlackHole，用 `sudo killall -9 coreaudiod` 重启 Core Audio，或者重启 Mac。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4632":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#允许使用麦克风","content":"rvc-next 第一次打开麦克风时，macOS 会询问启动 rvc-next 的程序（终端、iTerm2、VS Code…）能否使用麦克风，请允许。如果点了拒绝，或 rvc-next 报告 **麦克风权限被拒绝**，在 **系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 麦克风** 中打开那个程序，然后彻底退出它，再重新启动 rvc-next。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4633":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-2","content":"打开 **实时**，点 **刷新设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4634":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-2","content":"**输入**：你的麦克风（例如 **MacBook Pro 麦克风** 或 USB 麦克风）。这里不要选 **BlackHole 2ch**：那会录到 rvc-next 自己的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4635":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-2","content":"**输出**：**BlackHole 2ch**，带 **虚拟** 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4636":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-2","content":"**监听**：你的耳机；**监听内容**：**转换后**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4637":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置-rvc-next-2","content":"点 **开始** 并说话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4638":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#设置其他程序-2","content":"把它的麦克风选为 **BlackHole 2ch**。见 其他程序里的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4639":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#说明","content":"**不需要“多输出设备”。** 很多 BlackHole 教程会在音频 MIDI 设置里创建一个多输出设备，让 Mac 自己的声音同时送到 BlackHole 和扬声器。那是为了录制电脑的声音；对于转换后的声音，“自己听”这部分由 rvc-next 的 **监听** 负责。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4640":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#说明","content":"**想把 Mac 自己的声音（视频、游戏）作为实时变声的输入**，需要*第二个*环回设备，因为一个设备不能同时作为 rvc-next 的输入和输出。再安装 **BlackHole 16ch**（`brew install blackhole-16ch`），用耳机和 BlackHole 16ch 创建一个 **多输出设备** 并设为系统输出，然后把 **BlackHole 16ch** 选为 rvc-next 的输入；BlackHole 2ch 仍作为输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4641":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#说明","content":"**蓝牙耳机**：一旦使用它们的麦克风，AirPods 和大多数蓝牙耳机都会切换到低音质的通话模式，蓝牙本身也会增加延迟。请用 Mac 内置麦克风或 USB 麦克风作为输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#说明","content":"**其他选择**：Rogue Amoeba 的 Loopback（付费）可以创建有名称的虚拟设备并混合多个声源；VB-CABLE for Mac 的用法和 Windows 上的 VB-CABLE 一样。两者用法相同：rvc-next 往它的输出端播放，其他程序录它的输入端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#说明","content":"**卸载**：`sudo rm -R /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/HAL/BlackHole2ch.driver`，然后 `sudo killall -9 coreaudiod`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux","content":"在 Linux 桌面上，声卡由声音服务器管理（目前大多数发行版用 PipeWire，较旧的用 PulseAudio）。你要创建一个**虚拟输出（sink）**，供 rvc-next 往里播放；再创建一个**虚拟麦克风**，携带这个输出的声音，供其他程序录制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux","content":"Linux 上有两点不同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux","content":"**浏览器和 Electron 程序（Discord、Slack…）会把“Monitor of …”这类监视器源从麦克风列表里隐藏掉。** 所以下面的步骤会添加一个真正的虚拟麦克风（*重映射源*），而不是直接用输出的监视器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux","content":"**rvc-next 不会逐个列出 PipeWire 或 PulseAudio 的输出。** 大多数发行版自带的 PortAudio 库只和 ALSA（以及 JACK）打交道；声音服务器只以 ALSA 设备 **pipewire**、**pulse**、**default** 的形式出现，它们都播放到*默认*输出。所以要添加一个小小的 ALSA 设备 **rvc-next-virtual**，让它播放到虚拟输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#1-查看声音服务器","content":"显示 `PulseAudio (on PipeWire 1.x.x)` 表示 PipeWire；显示 `pulseaudio` 表示 PulseAudio。如果没有 `pactl`，安装 `pulseaudio-utils`（Debian、Ubuntu、Fedora）或 `libpulse`（Arch）；两种服务器都能用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4649":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#2-创建虚拟输出和虚拟麦克风","content":"第一条命令创建输出 **RVC-Next**（`rvc_next`），第二条创建输入源 **RVC-Next-Microphone**（`rvc_next_mic`），它携带播放进该输出的所有声音。用 `pactl list short sinks` 和 `pactl list short sources` 检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4650":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#2-创建虚拟输出和虚拟麦克风","content":"这两条命令在 PipeWire 和 PulseAudio 上都适用，但只保留到注销或重启声音服务器为止。要一直保留，见 永久生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#3-为-rvc-next-添加-alsa-设备","content":"在 `~/.asoundrc` 里加入下面其中一段（文件不存在就新建；已有内容保留）。按 rvc-next 的 **输出** 菜单里已经有的设备来选：有 **pipewire** 说明装了 PipeWire 的 ALSA 插件（软件包 `pipewire-alsa`），有 **pulse** 说明装了 PulseAudio 的 ALSA 插件（Debian、Ubuntu 上是 `libasound2-plugins`，Fedora 上是 `alsa-plugins-pulseaudio`，Arch 上是 `alsa-plugins`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#3-为-rvc-next-添加-alsa-设备","content":"它在 PipeWire 上也能用（通过 PipeWire 的 PulseAudio 服务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#3-为-rvc-next-添加-alsa-设备","content":"两段都定义了一个名为 **rvc-next-virtual** 的 ALSA 设备，播放到 `rvc_next` 输出。修改文件后重启 rvc-next：ALSA 在程序启动时读取它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"打开 **实时**，点 **刷新设备**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"**输入**：**pipewire** 或 **pulse**（系统的默认麦克风），或 **系统默认**。它们经过声音服务器，其他程序可以同时使用麦克风。想用哪个麦克风，就在桌面的声音设置里把它设为默认输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"**输出**：**rvc-next-virtual**，带 **虚拟** 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"**监听**：**pipewire** 或 **pulse**，它们播放到你的默认输出（耳机）；**监听内容**：**转换后**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"在 **高级** 里把 **采样率** 从 **自动** 改为 **48 kHz**（PipeWire 通常使用的采样率）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#4-设置-rvc-next","content":"点 **开始** 并说话。在 `pavucontrol`（PulseAudio 音量控制）的 **输入设备** 选项卡里，**RVC-Next-Microphone** 的电平会跳动；**回放** 选项卡里能看到 rvc-next 的两路声音，一路在 **RVC-Next** 上，监听那一路在耳机上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#5-设置其他程序","content":"把它的麦克风选为 **RVC-Next-Microphone**。Discord、Zoom、OBS 的 Flatpak 和 Snap 版本也能看到它。在 Discord 里不要选 **默认**：它可能跟随另一台设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#5-设置其他程序","content":"不要把 **RVC-Next-Microphone** 设为系统的默认输入：rvc-next 的 **pipewire**、**pulse** 和 **系统默认** 输入录的就是默认输入，那样 rvc-next 会录到自己的输出。对于没有麦克风设置的程序，先启动它，再在 `pavucontrol` 的 **录音** 选项卡里把它的那一路移到 **RVC-Next-Microphone**；声音服务器下次会记住这个选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"`~/.asoundrc` 会一直保留。虚拟输出和虚拟麦克风这样保留：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"新建 `~/.config/pipewire/pipewire-pulse.conf.d/rvc-next.conf`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4664":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"然后重启声音服务器（或注销后重新登录）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4665":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"新建 `~/.config/pulse/default.pa`（已经存在的话，只加后两行）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4666":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#linux-permanent","content":"然后用 `pulseaudio -k` 重启 PulseAudio（它会自动重新启动）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4667":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#移除","content":"这两条会移除*所有*重映射源和空输出，包括你为其他用途创建的。然后从 `~/.asoundrc` 删掉 `rvc-next-virtual` 那一段，并删除 **永久生效** 里新建的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4668":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"语音聊天程序会处理麦克风，以便清理真人的声音。转换后的声音本来就是干净的，这些处理反而容易吞掉辅音、让音量忽大忽小或切掉字词，所以请关掉它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4669":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"程序","locale":"zh-CN"},"4670":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"麦克风","locale":"zh-CN"},"4671":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"关闭 / 修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"4672":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**Discord**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4673":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**用户设置 › 语音和视频 › 输入设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4674":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**噪声抑制**：无（或标准；Krisp 最激进）；**回声消除**：戴耳机时关闭；**自动增益控制**：关闭；**自动确定输入灵敏度**：关闭，再把滑块调到说话时变绿的位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4675":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**Zoom**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4676":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**设置 › 音频 › 麦克风**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4677":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**自动调节麦克风音量**：关闭；**抑制背景噪音**：低","locale":"zh-CN"},"4678":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**OBS Studio**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4679":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**来源 › + › 音频输入采集 › 设备**，或 **设置 › 音频 › 麦克风/辅助音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4680":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"这个来源上不要加降噪滤镜","locale":"zh-CN"},"4681":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**网页应用**（Google Meet、网页版 Teams、浏览器里的 Discord）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4682":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"会议的音频设置，或网站的麦克风权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"4683":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"应用自带的降噪（如果有）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4684":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"**没有麦克风设置的游戏和程序**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4685":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"它们使用系统的默认输入：在 **设置 › 系统 › 声音 › 输入**（Windows）或 **系统设置 › 声音 › 输入**（macOS）里把录音端设为默认。Linux：改为在 `pavucontrol › 录音` 里移动它的那一路（Linux 第 5 步）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4686":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"Windows、macOS：rvc-next 的 **输入** 必须选真实的麦克风，而不是 **系统默认**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4687":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#apps","content":"用程序自带的麦克风测试（Discord 的 **我们来检查一下**、Zoom 的 **测试麦克风**）听听对方会听到什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4688":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"**按键说话。** rvc-next 会增加约半秒的延迟（实时页上显示的延迟）。如果一说完就松开按键，句尾会被切掉：把程序的按键说话释放延迟（Discord：**按键说话释放延迟**）调到高于这个延迟，或者多按住一会儿。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4689":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"**语音激活。** 用语音激活时，请用实时变声的 **输入门限**（在 **缓冲与降噪** 里），以免背景噪音被转换成类似人声的声音，让通话的语音激活一直打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4690":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"**全程用同一个采样率。** 麦克风和虚拟声卡都是 48 kHz 时，设备面板显示 **单个双工流**，比 **分离的输入输出流** 少一个块的延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4691":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"**测量软件链路的延迟。** **测量延迟** 可以直接经过虚拟声卡：输入选录音端（**CABLE Output**、**BlackHole 2ch**），输出选播放端（Windows 和 macOS）。需要先停止实时变声；测完后把输入和输出改回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4692":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#日常使用","content":"**启动顺序无所谓。** 实时变声停止时，其他程序可以一直选着虚拟麦克风；点 **开始** 之前它听到的是静音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4693":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"虚拟声卡必须装在实时变声所用设备的那台电脑上：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4694":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"**服务器设备**：把虚拟声卡装在服务器电脑上，其他程序也在那台电脑上运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4695":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"**本浏览器**：转换后的声音在浏览器所在的电脑上、通过浏览器的输出播放。要把它送进那台电脑上的某个程序，就让*浏览器*播放到虚拟声卡：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4696":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"Windows：**设置 › 系统 › 声音 › 音量合成器**，选浏览器，把它的 **输出设备** 设为 **CABLE Input**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4697":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"Linux：在 `pavucontrol` 的 **回放** 选项卡里，把浏览器的那一路移到 **RVC-Next**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4698":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"macOS 没有按程序选择输出的功能；用 Rogue Amoeba 的 Loopback，或者说话期间把 BlackHole 2ch 设为系统输出，并把通话程序的扬声器设为耳机（这时 Mac 播放的其他声音也会进入通话）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4699":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#remote","content":"这时浏览器的麦克风必须是你的真实麦克风，而且浏览器播放的其他声音也都会进入虚拟声卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4700":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"对方什么也听不到","locale":"zh-CN"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"其他程序要用*录音端*（**CABLE Output**、**Voicemeeter Out B1**、**BlackHole 2ch**、**RVC-Next-Microphone**），rvc-next 的输出要用*播放端*。实时变声必须处于 **运行中**。Voicemeeter：AUX 通道条的 **B1** 已打开，并且 Voicemeeter 正在运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"对方还听到了我的原声，或只听到原声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"其他程序录的是真实麦克风（或 **默认**）；Voicemeeter 中麦克风那条通道送到了 **B1**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"对方听到了通话、音乐或系统声音","locale":"zh-CN"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"虚拟声卡被设成了系统默认输出，或者（Voicemeeter）VAIO 通道条的 **B1** 开着","locale":"zh-CN"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"我听到两遍自己","locale":"zh-CN"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"rvc-next 的监听和 Voicemeeter 的 **A1**（或 Windows 的 **侦听此设备**）同时开着，保留一个","locale":"zh-CN"},"4710":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"声音像机器人、断断续续或有爆音","locale":"zh-CN"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"先看实时页的 **负载** 和 **欠载**（实时变声 的降低延迟建议）；再检查采样率（全部 48 kHz），用 Voicemeeter 时加大缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"rvc-next 的菜单里没有虚拟声卡","locale":"zh-CN"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-231","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"安装驱动后重启电脑（Windows、macOS），再点 **刷新设备**。Linux：修改 `~/.asoundrc` 后重启 rvc-next","locale":"zh-CN"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-232","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"Linux：**rvc-next-virtual** 打不开","locale":"zh-CN"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-233","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"那一段的 `type` 必须对应已安装的插件：`type pipewire` 需要有 **pipewire** 设备，`type pulse` 需要有 **pulse** 设备。`pactl list short sinks` 里必须有 `rvc_next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-234","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"Windows：游戏或其他程序启动时，实时变声失去设备（**正在重新连接设备…**）或报告 **被其他程序占用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-235","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"那个程序以独占模式占用了设备：为它 关闭独占控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-236","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"**麦克风权限被拒绝**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-237","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"Windows：**允许桌面应用访问你的麦克风**。macOS：在 **隐私与安全性 › 麦克风** 中允许终端，然后重启它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-routing-238","page_id":"/docs/guide-live-routing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live-routing#问题排查","content":"设备、缓冲和延迟见 实时变声，延迟数据见 硬件与性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/guide-live","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"page","content":"实时变声","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live","locale":"zh-CN"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live","content":"实时 页面把麦克风里的声音即时转换成所选音色，再送到耳机、扬声器或虚拟声卡（例如给直播、语音聊天软件使用）。整个页面从上到下分成三块：音频设备、音色与参数、缓冲与降噪，底部固定着 开始 / 停止 按钮和状态栏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"快速上手","locale":"zh-CN"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"使用本浏览器的麦克风","locale":"zh-CN"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#音频设备","content":"音频设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"输入、输出与监听","locale":"zh-CN"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"录制输出设备（内录）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#监听自己","content":"监听自己","locale":"zh-CN"},"4729":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"高级","locale":"zh-CN"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"测量真实延迟","locale":"zh-CN"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"设备问题与修复按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"4732":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"自动选择驱动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4733":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#输出设备不见了怎么办","content":"输出设备不见了怎么办","locale":"zh-CN"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"音色与参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"缓冲与降噪","locale":"zh-CN"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#effects","content":"效果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"开始、停止与状态栏","locale":"zh-CN"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"录音","locale":"zh-CN"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#顶栏的实时标签","content":"顶栏的实时标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"设备断开与自动重连","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#和其他任务一起使用-gpu","content":"和其他任务一起使用 GPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"降低延迟的建议","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#asiowindows","content":"ASIO（Windows）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-live#用命令行运行","content":"用命令行运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live","content":"实时转换跑在一个独立的后台进程里，和服务器、转换任务互不干扰；它打开的是**服务器所在电脑**上的声卡，而不是你正在用的浏览器所在的设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live","content":"说明服务器的 Python 环境里没有安装 `sounddevice`（PortAudio 的 Python 封装）。在 Linux 上还需要系统级的 `libportaudio2`。安装方法见 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"打开左侧导航的 **实时**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"在 **音频设备** 区域选好 **输入**（麦克风）和 **输出**（耳机；要在 Discord、OBS 等程序中使用，选虚拟声卡，见 在其他程序中使用实时变声）。对着麦克风说话，**输入电平** 表应该会跳动；点 **输出** 旁边的 **测试**，应能听到一声提示音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"在 **音色** 选择器里选一个音色，按需调整 **音色参数**（例如男声转女声把 **音高** 调到 +12 左右）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"第一次使用时，开始按钮的位置可能显示 **需要 …** 和 **下载（大小）** 按钮：实时转换总是需要 HuBERT；音色有音高引导、且音高算法选的是 RMVPE、FCPE 或 CREPE 时，还需要对应的模型（pm 和 SwiftF0 不需要额外下载）。点下载，完成后按钮会恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"点底部的 **开始**。按钮会依次显示正在进行的每一步（检查音频设备，加载 PyTorch、音色和模型，然后 **正在预热…**），进入 **运行中** 后即可开口说话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"结束时点 **停止**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#快速上手","content":"下次打开页面时，上一次的设备、音色、参数和缓冲设置都会自动恢复，直接点 **开始** 即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"页面顶部的 **服务器设备** 和 **本浏览器** 决定声音从哪里来、到哪里去。**本浏览器** 使用打开网页的设备的麦克风和扬声器——例如用笔记本或手机连接另一台电脑上的 rvc-next，或者服务器根本没有声卡（这时只有这一个选项）：浏览器通过 WebSocket 把麦克风发送到服务器，并从一个小的抖动缓冲中播放转换后的声音（60 ms，断音后重新缓冲；积压超过 250 ms 的部分会被丢弃）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"第一次点 **开始** 时浏览器会请求麦克风权限，请允许。浏览器自带的回声消除、降噪和自动增益会被关闭，因为它们会干扰转换——请戴耳机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"会话以浏览器的音频采样率运行（通常是 48 或 44.1 kHz）。音色、参数、缓冲、效果、增益（来自 **设置 › 音频**）和录音与服务器设备相同；监听、输入电平表和 **测试** 只属于服务器设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"实际延迟是显示的延迟，加上网络往返时间和 60 ms 缓冲。同一场所的有线或良好 Wi-Fi 网络能让它保持较小；标题下的一行显示缓冲和断音次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"浏览器只允许 HTTPS 页面或 `localhost` 使用麦克风；配置 HTTPS 见远程访问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4759":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#browser-audio","content":"关闭标签页，或连接中断 3 秒，会话就会停止。同一时间只能连接一个浏览器：后连接的会接管。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4760":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音频设备","content":"设备面板的标题是 **\\{主机名} 上的音频设备**，提醒你这些是服务器那台电脑的设备。如果你是从另一台电脑远程打开网页，面板会额外提示：**这些设备属于服务器所在的电脑，而不是此浏览器。** 右上角的 **刷新设备** 按钮会重新扫描设备；停止状态下页面可见时，也会每 5 秒自动刷新一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4761":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音频设备","content":"同一个设备面板也出现在 **设置 › 音频** 中，两处改的是同一份设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4762":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"**输入**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4765":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"麦克风。只要设备面板显示着，下方的 **输入电平** 表就实时显示音量：第一次 **开始** 之前、会话运行中、停止之后（包括出错停止）都是如此。电平表在后台打开，页面不会等它；麦克风被拔出或被占用时，可用后会自动恢复。可在 **设置 › 音频 › 停止时显示输入电平** 中关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4766":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"**输出**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4767":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"转换后的声音送往这里。下方的 **输出电平** 显示 rvc-next 送往该设备的声音（转换后的声音，或 **监听自己** 时的输入），没有声音时显示 **—**。旁边的 **测试** 按钮会在该设备上播放一段提示音。要把声音交给其他程序，请选择虚拟声卡的播放端（在其他程序中使用实时变声）；要转换某台输出设备播放的声音，见 录制输出设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4768":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"**监听**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4769":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"可选的第二个输出，默认 **不监听**。适合“输出给虚拟声卡、自己用耳机听”的场景。选了监听设备后会出现 **监听电平** 表、**测试** 按钮，以及：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4770":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"监听内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4771":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"**转换后** / **输入** / **两者**（原声与转换后的声音叠加）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4772":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"**监听音量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4773":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"−60 ～ +12 dB，默认 0 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4774":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"设备菜单的排列规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4775":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"每台设备占一整行，菜单展开后和这一行一样宽，长名称会换行而不会被截断。名称下方还有一行说明：推荐的驱动、声道数和默认采样率。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4776":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"服务器还在列出设备时（需要一点时间，安装的驱动较多时更久），每个菜单显示 **正在查找音频设备…**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4777":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"列表较长时（九项或以上，Windows 上很常见），顶部有搜索框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4778":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"第一项总是 **系统默认**：跟随操作系统当前的默认设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4779":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"接着是系统默认的那台设备（带 **默认** 标签），然后按名称排序；虚拟声卡带 **虚拟** 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4780":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"菜单里每一项是一台**物理设备**，显示完整名称。Windows 上同一个麦克风会同时出现在 MME、DirectSound、WASAPI 等多个驱动下，rvc-next 会把它们合并成一项，并自动选择推荐的驱动（Windows 上依次偏好 ASIO、WASAPI、WDM-KS、DirectSound、MME；Linux 上依次是 JACK、ALSA、PulseAudio；大多数 Linux 发行版自带的 PortAudio 没有 PulseAudio 驱动，PulseAudio 和 PipeWire 以 ALSA 设备 **pulse**、**pipewire**、**default** 的形式出现）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4781":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输入输出与监听","content":"之前保存、但现在没连接的设备仍会以灰色显示，并带 **未连接** 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4782":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"想转换电脑播放的声音而不是麦克风（视频、游戏、通话等），打开 **设置 › 音频 › 把输出设备当作输入（内录）**。输入菜单里就会同时列出所有输出设备，带 **内录** 标签；选中其中一台，它播放的声音就成为输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4783":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"系统","locale":"zh-CN"},"4784":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"录制方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4785":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4786":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"4787":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"WASAPI 环回","locale":"zh-CN"},"4788":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"任何输出设备、任何采样率都可以；没有声音播放时得到的是静音","locale":"zh-CN"},"4789":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"Linux","locale":"zh-CN"},"4790":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"每个输出在 PulseAudio/PipeWire 里的监视器（“Monitor of …”）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4791":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"需要正在运行的 PulseAudio 或 PipeWire（pipewire-pulse）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4792":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"macOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4793":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"仅靠系统无法录制","locale":"zh-CN"},"4794":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"安装 BlackHole 等环回驱动，把声音送到它，再把它的输入（普通输入设备）选为输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4795":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"无法录制时，设备面板会说明原因。转换后的声音要送到**另一台**设备（耳机，或给其他程序用的虚拟声卡）：如果录制的正是播放转换声音的那台输出，声音会被反复录回去，rvc-next 会拒绝（**会录到自己的输出**）。关闭该设置后，这些输入会再次隐藏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4796":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#loopback","content":"输入设备无法“播放进去”，所以输出菜单只列输出设备。要把转换后的声音交给其他程序，请把虚拟声卡的播放端（例如 **CABLE Input**）选为输出，其他程序录制它的录音端（**CABLE Output**）。在其他程序中使用实时变声 分步讲解了 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 上的设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4797":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#监听自己","content":"**监听自己** 开关会把输入的原声直接送到监听设备（没有设置监听设备时送到输出），用来检查“麦克风 → 耳机”这条路由是否通畅。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4798":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#监听自己","content":"停止状态下打开：只做直通，不加载音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4799":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#监听自己","content":"运行中打开：设置了监听设备时，监听设备听到原声、输出仍是转换后的声音；没有设置监听设备时，输出会直接变成原声（相当于临时绕过转换）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4800":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"展开 **高级** 可以看到：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4801":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4802":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4803":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**输入 · 驱动** / **输出 · 驱动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4804":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"同一台物理设备有多个驱动（host API）时才显示。**自动**（默认，列表第一项）先用推荐的驱动打开设备，这个驱动打不开时再依次尝试其他驱动，见 自动选择驱动。选定某个驱动（推荐项标为 **…（推荐）**）则只用这一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4805":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**输入 · 声道** / **输出 · 声道**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4806":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"输入的所选声道混成单声道；输出把声音写到所选声道。默认项 **默认（声道 1）**（输入）/ **默认（声道 1+2）**（输出，单声道设备为声道 1），也可选 **声道 N** 或 **混合 1+2**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4807":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**采样率**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4808":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**自动**（默认）或设备支持的固定采样率。自动时使用输出设备的默认采样率（不支持时用 48 kHz）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4809":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**独占模式（WASAPI）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4810":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"仅当输出走 WASAPI 驱动时显示；驱动为 **自动** 时，看输出实际是通过哪个驱动打开的（还没打开时看第一个要尝试的驱动）。独占模式可以降低延迟，但会让其他程序无法同时使用该设备。开启后输出的驱动固定为 WASAPI：独占流打不开时会直接报告，而不会悄悄换成其他驱动的共享流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4811":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**输入音量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4812":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"−24 ～ +24 dB，默认 0 dB，在输入被测量电平和转换之前作用：调高声音小的麦克风，或调低过响的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4813":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**输出音量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4814":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"−60 ～ +12 dB，默认 0 dB，作用于送往输出设备的转换结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4815":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"运行中修改音量（或监听的来源）会从下一块开始生效，不会重新打开设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4816":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"默认时输入只读取**第 1 声道**。如果你的麦克风接在声卡的第 2 声道（常见于多通道声卡），请明确选择 **声道 2** 或 **混合 1+2**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4817":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"面板底部有一行状态，例如 `48 kHz · 单个双工流 · 估计延迟 640 毫秒`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4818":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**单个双工流**：输入和输出走同一个驱动、同一个采样率，用一个流同时收发，延迟最低。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4819":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#高级","content":"**分离的输入输出流**：两者无法合成一个流（驱动或采样率不同），中间多一个缓冲区，延迟会多出一个块长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4820":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"估计值依赖驱动报告的延迟，而这个值往往偏乐观。状态行下方的 **测量延迟** 会实际测一次：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4821":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"把输出接回输入：用音频线连接输出和输入、使用虚拟声卡自带的回环，或把扬声器靠近麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4822":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"点击 **测量延迟**。几秒内，输出设备播放四段短噪声，输入设备同时监听。测量时实时变声必须已停止（**监听自己** 也要关闭），输入电平表会暂停。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4823":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"结果类似：`实测延迟 620 毫秒：经过设备的往返 560 毫秒 + 转换 60 毫秒（估计 580 毫秒）`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4824":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"**往返** 是实测值：测试噪声经过实时变声所用的同一组缓冲（输出预填充、设备双向的缓冲、音频线或空气）。**转换** 部分是转换器自身的延迟（交叉淡化 + 10 ms，开启输入降噪时再加 min(交叉淡化, 40 ms)），只取决于设置，因此是计算值；SOLA 每块最多会让它少 10 ms。只要没有欠载，推理耗时不会增加延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4825":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"只要输入、输出和块长不变，测量结果就一直有效。用这些设置运行时，状态栏会在估计值旁显示 **实测 N 毫秒**，顶栏的实时变声标签也改用实测值。改交叉淡化或降噪只会重新计算转换部分；换设备或改块长会清除测量结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4826":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#measure-latency","content":"如果没有检测到返回的噪声，面板会提示：检查连接并调高音量。如果各段噪声返回的时间不一致（断音，或两个设备之间时钟漂移），请加大块长，或让输入输出使用同一驱动。用扬声器和麦克风测量时，结果包含声音在空气中传播的时间（约每米 3 毫秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4827":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"每次修改设备，rvc-next 都会在后台实际尝试按当前配置打开设备：先让驱动检查设置，实时转换停止时还会把输出和监听设备真正运行片刻（输入设备本来就为 **输入电平** 表打开着）。所以问题会在点 **开始** 之前就显示在对应设备下方，**测试** 声音或 **监听自己** 失败时也一样。问题格式为 **原因：服务器给出的说明**（说明文字来自服务器，为英文，会写出设备名称）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4828":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4829":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4830":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"处理方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4831":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**未连接**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4832":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"找不到该设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"4833":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"提示 **选择其他设备**：在菜单里换一个","locale":"zh-CN"},"4834":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**被其他程序占用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4835":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"设备正被别的程序使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4836":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"若开着独占模式，会出现 **关闭独占模式** 按钮；否则提示 **选择其他设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4837":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**会录到自己的输出**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4838":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"输入录制的正是播放转换声音的输出（或监听）设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"4839":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"提示 **选择其他设备**：换一个输入或输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4840":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**不支持此声道数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4841":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"驱动不肯以这个声道数打开设备（rvc-next 已经选用设备报告可用的声道数，出现这一条通常是开了独占模式或设备有了变化）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4842":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"若开着独占模式，会出现 **关闭独占模式** 按钮；否则提示 **选择其他设备**（同一设备换个驱动通常就行）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4843":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**不支持此格式**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4844":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"设备拒绝当前采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"4845":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"点 **使用 48 kHz** 按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"4846":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**启动后立即停止**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4847":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"驱动接受了设置，但音频流一运行就被结束（设备被禁用或已断开、被其他程序独占，或驱动故障）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4848":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"提示 **选择其他设备**（同一设备换个驱动常常可行）；开着独占模式时出现 **关闭独占模式**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4849":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**麦克风权限被拒绝**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4850":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"系统没有授予麦克风权限","locale":"zh-CN"},"4851":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"提示 **如何授予权限**：在系统的隐私设置中允许","locale":"zh-CN"},"4852":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"**回退到默认设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4853":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"保存的设备不在了，将改用系统默认设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"4854":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"提示 **选择其他设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4855":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备问题与修复按钮","content":"设备下方还可能出现一行提示，说明保存的设备是怎样被重新找到的，例如 **在另一个驱动下找到了 \\{设备名}。**（换了驱动但还是同一台设备），或 **未找到 \\{设备名}：使用系统默认设备。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4856":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"在 Windows 上，某个驱动可能打不开其他驱动能打开的设备：比如 WDM-KS 下的麦克风被其他程序占用，或者音频流能打开、一启动就报 **Unanticipated host error**，而 DirectSound 打开同一个麦克风却毫无问题。**驱动** 选 **自动** 时，rvc-next 会自己完成这种切换：先用推荐的驱动打开设备，打不开就按上面的偏好顺序逐个尝试该设备的其他驱动，直到有一个能打开。开始、输入电平表、**监听自己**、**测试** 和开始前的检查都是如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4857":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"换用了其他驱动时，设备下方会有一行提示，说明改用了哪个驱动，以及之前的驱动给出的原因：**之前的驱动无法打开，已改用 DirectSound（WASAPI: …）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4858":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"之后这台设备会优先尝试这个驱动，直到设备列表发生变化（插上或拔掉设备），之后又从推荐的驱动开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4859":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"只有所有驱动都打不开时，才会报告设备不可用。消息会列出每个驱动及其回答，**详情** 中的 **尝试过的驱动** 一项也逐行列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4860":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"驱动启动了音频流、却在刚开始的一瞬间（约 0.4 秒；块长更长时为两个块）自行把它停掉，也算打不开：会接着尝试下一个驱动，而不是等这台设备恢复。因此对有多个驱动的设备，开始、输入电平表和 **监听自己** 会多花这么一点时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4861":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"权限被拒（麦克风在系统隐私设置中被禁用）不会重试：它对所有驱动都一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4862":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"这样输入和输出可能走不同的驱动，成为 **分离的输入输出流**（多一个块长的延迟）。想保持单个双工流，可在 **高级** 中给两者选同一个驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4863":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#automatic-driver","content":"在有这个选项之前选好的设备照常可用：保存在推荐驱动上的视为 **自动**，保存在其他驱动上的仍固定用那个驱动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4864":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#输出设备不见了怎么办","content":"点 **开始** 时，如果保存的**输出**设备已经不存在，而系统默认设备可用，rvc-next 不会悄悄把声音送到默认设备（那可能是你的外放扬声器），而是弹出确认框：**保存的输出设备不存在，将使用系统默认设备。** 只有点 **使用默认输出启动** 才会继续。输入或监听设备完全找不到时，则直接报错，需要先换一个设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4865":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"中间一块是 **音色** 选择器和 **音色参数** 面板，和 **转换** 页面用的是同一套控件，含义见 音色参数。在实时页面上：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4866":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"参数面板上方会提示 **拖动时即时生效。**：运行中拖动 **音高**、**共振峰**、**索引强度**、**辅音保护**、**响度匹配** 滑块，或切换 **音高算法**，都会立刻作用到正在转换的声音上，不会中断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4867":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"切换到一个尚未下载的音高模型时，会继续使用当前的算法并提示缺少的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4868":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"**切换音色是热切换**：新音色在后台加载，旧音色继续转换，加载完成后在两个块之间无缝切过去，HuBERT 和音高模型保持加载。新音色加载失败时，会继续使用原来的音色，选择器也会退回原来的音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4869":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"多说话人音色会显示 **说话人** 菜单，运行中也可以切换；换了音色后，说话人会回到新音色的第一个说话人。若该说话人有专属索引（`spk<N>`），也会一并换上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4870":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#音色与参数","content":"选择一个音色会载入它的默认预设；**预设** 按钮可以载入或保存预设，详见 音色参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4871":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**缓冲与降噪** 区域控制声音如何分块送进模型。每个滑块的说明末尾会用 `(+N ms)` 标出它在估计延迟中所占的份额。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4872":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4873":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"范围（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4874":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4875":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"延迟份额","locale":"zh-CN"},"4876":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"运行中修改","locale":"zh-CN"},"4877":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**块长**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4878":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"20–1500 ms（250）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4879":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"每步处理的音频长度。越长越稳定，越短越快","locale":"zh-CN"},"4880":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"2 × 块长","locale":"zh-CN"},"4881":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**交叉淡化**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4883":{"i