ide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"即时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**输入降噪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"开 / 关（关）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4899":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"转换前对输入降噪","locale":"zh-CN"},"4900":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"min(交叉淡化, 40 ms)","locale":"zh-CN"},"4901":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"即时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4902":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**输出降噪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4903":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"开 / 关（关）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4904":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"对转换结果降噪","locale":"zh-CN"},"4905":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"4906":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"即时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4907":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**降噪强度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4908":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"0–1（0.9）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4909":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"开启任一降噪时显示：噪声被压低多少；1 去除最多，也可能带走一些人声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4910":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"4911":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"即时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4912":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"**相位声码器交叉淡化**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4913":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"开 / 关（关）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4914":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"用相位声码器（来自 RVC 后来的实时界面，Applio 也采用）代替普通交叉淡化拼接各块：当相邻两块以不同相位渲染同一个声音时，普通交叉淡化在拼接中间会出现音量下陷，这种方式不会","locale":"zh-CN"},"4915":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"4916":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"即时生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"4917":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"“重新缓冲”是指：运行中修改块长、交叉淡化或上下文时，音频流会被关闭并按新的缓冲区重新打开，会有一次短暂的中断，但音色不会重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4918":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"估计延迟 ≈ 块长 + 交叉淡化 + 10 ms（拼接搜索）+ 块长（输出端预填充）+ 设备自身的输入、输出延迟；分离的输入输出流再加一个块长；开启输入降噪再加 min(交叉淡化, 40 ms)。默认设置（块长 250 ms、交叉淡化 50 ms）在双工流下约为 560 ms 加上设备延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4919":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#缓冲与降噪","content":"停止状态下修改缓冲设置会直接保存到设置里；运行中修改则立即发给正在运行的会话，同样会被记住。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4920":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#effects","content":"缓冲设置下方的 **效果** 与转换页上的效果链相同（效果），作用于每个转换好的块，再播放出去；混响的尾音和压缩器的包络会在块之间延续。修改从下一个块起生效，不需要重新缓冲，并与其他实时变声设置一起保存；**监听自己** 直通输入时不经过效果。这里不提供 **变调**：在实时流中，pedalboard 的变调会压住约一秒的音频；请用音色的 **音高**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4921":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"页面底部固定着一条栏：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4922":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**开始 / 停止** 按钮。从点击的那一刻起，按钮上依次显示启动的每一步：**正在检查音频设备…**、**正在启动实时进程…**（仅首次启动）、**正在加载 PyTorch 和计算设备…**（仅首次启动）、**正在加载音色…**、**正在加载索引…**、**正在加载 HuBERT…**、**正在加载音高模型…**、**正在预热…**；无需执行的步骤会跳过。停止过程中显示 **正在停止…**。没有选音色时按钮不可用，并提示 **选择一个音色以开始。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4923":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"出错时，按钮上方会显示错误说明（**因错误停止**），一直保留到下一次 **开始**，或点它的 **×** 按钮关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4924":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"音频设备出问题时会指明是哪一个：**输入设备不可用**、**输出设备不可用** 或 **监听设备不可用**，后面是原因（被其他程序占用、未连接、不支持此格式…）和设备名称，例如 *The output device “Speakers (Realtek)” is in use by another program, or refused to open: …*。输入和输出共用一个音频流、又无法判断是哪一个时，消息会同时列出两者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4925":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"实时进程本身退出时（驱动或 GPU 库崩溃、系统内存耗尽等），标题为 **后台进程意外退出**，消息说明它是如何结束的（退出代码或信号），输出中有线索时也会给出原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4926":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**详情** 逐项列出所有字段（设备、驱动、驱动自己的消息、异常、退出代码…），调用栈和进程最后的输出完整显示。**复制** 会把这些内容复制为文本，可直接贴到问题反馈里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4927":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"状态栏每秒更新 10 次，包括：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4928":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4929":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4930":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**输入** / **输出** 电平表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4931":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"输入与转换后输出的音量（RMS 与峰值）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4932":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**负载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4933":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"推理耗时（最近 50 块的第 95 百分位；不足 10 块时取中位数）÷ 块长。超过 80% 时进度条变成警示色，表示模型快跟不上实时了；超过 100% 时显示 **>100%**，输出会断音。某一块晚了时，会话会跳过过时的输入并裁掉输出缓冲里多出的部分，延迟不会因此一直增加","locale":"zh-CN"},"4934":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**将块长增加到 N 毫秒**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4935":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"负载过高时出现。按最近推理耗时的 95 分位估算一个能让负载回到约 70% 的块长（上限 1500 ms），点一下即应用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4936":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**延迟 N ms**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4937":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"当前的估计端到端延迟","locale":"zh-CN"},"4938":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**实测 N 毫秒**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4939":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"实测延迟，当测量结果与本次会话的设备和块长相符时显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4940":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**N 次欠载** / **N 次溢出**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4941":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"输出缓冲用空了（会听到断续）/ 输入缓冲溢出的次数，只在发生过时显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4942":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"**GPU N MB**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4943":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#开始停止与状态栏","content":"实时进程占用的显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"4944":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"实时变声运行时，开始按钮旁的 **录音** 会把会话写成输出文件夹里的 WAV 文件（`<日期>/live/`）。可以选择保留什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4945":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4946":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4947":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"**变声与输入（立体声）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4948":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"左声道是输入，右声道是变声结果：便于对比，或之后单独编辑其中之一","locale":"zh-CN"},"4949":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"**仅变声**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4950":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"只有变声结果，单声道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4951":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"**仅输入**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4952":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"只有你的输入，单声道（经过 **输入音量**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4953":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-231","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#record","content":"之后按钮显示 **停止录音 · 0:12**。录音在你停止它、实时变声停止或采样率改变时结束，随后出现在实时页的 **录音** 一节和所有输出列表中，并记录所用的音色和参数。录音不在音频线程上进行，不会让任何一块变晚。输出音量和监听音量不作用于录音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4954":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-232","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#顶栏的实时标签","content":"会话处于活动状态时（运行中、加载中、重新连接中等），所有页面的顶栏都会显示一个实时标签，例如 **实时 · 620 毫秒**；加载等过程中则显示当前状态。点击标签回到 **实时** 页面，点它右侧的 按钮可以在任何页面直接停止。重新连接或出错时，标签会变成红色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4955":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-233","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"运行中拔掉耳机或 USB 麦克风时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4956":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-234","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"会话进入 **正在重新连接设备…** 状态，顶栏标签显示这一状态并变红；页面底部会说明断开的是哪个设备，例如 **输出设备已断开** 以及它的名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4957":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-235","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"服务器每 2 秒重新扫描一次设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4958":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-236","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"原设备重新出现（包括在另一个驱动下找到同一台设备）时，自动重新打开并回到 **运行中**，音色不需要重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4959":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-237","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#设备断开与自动重连","content":"这个行为由 **设置 › 音频 › 自动重新连接丢失的设备** 控制（默认开启）。关闭后，设备一旦断开，会话就直接停止，错误说明会指出断开的是哪个设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4960":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-238","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#和其他任务一起使用-gpu","content":"实时转换在 GPU 上运行时会占用 GPU：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4961":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-239","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#和其他任务一起使用-gpu","content":"此时排队的 GPU 任务（转换、分离、训练等）会显示 **等待 GPU**，并提供 **仍然运行** 按钮，提示 **实时转换正在使用 GPU。同时运行可能导致声音卡顿。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4962":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-240","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#和其他任务一起使用-gpu","content":"实时会话活动时，顶栏的 **释放显存** 不可用。停止后，空闲的实时进程仍会保留已加载的模型以便下次快速启动，此时可以用 **释放显存** 释放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4963":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-241","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#和其他任务一起使用-gpu","content":"显存不足时会话会以 **GPU 不可用或显存不足** 停止，实时进程和服务器都会自动卸载已加载的模型。可以关闭其他占显存的程序后重试，或在 **设置 › 计算** 中改用 CPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4964":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-242","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"**先保证不卡顿，再压延迟。** 从默认的 250 ms 块长开始，观察 **负载**：长期低于 50% 再逐步减小块长；超过 80% 或出现 **欠载** 就加大块长（或直接点 **将块长增加到 N 毫秒**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4965":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-243","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"**让输入输出走同一个驱动和采样率**，状态行显示 **单个双工流**，可以省掉一个块长的延迟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4966":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-244","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"**使用低延迟驱动**：Windows 上优先 WASAPI 或 ASIO，Linux 上优先 JACK 或 ALSA，在 **高级 › 驱动** 中选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4967":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-245","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"**上下文** 不增加延迟，但会增加每块的计算量；负载偏高时可以从 2500 ms 适当减小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4968":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-246","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"**交叉淡化** 直接计入延迟，一般 50 ms 足够；开启 **输入降噪** 会再增加最多 40 ms。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4969":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-247","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"音高算法上，pm 最快，RMVPE 质量最好；GPU 较弱时可以试试 pm。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4970":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-248","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#降低延迟的建议","content":"GPU 上默认启用 **设置 › 计算 › 实时转换使用 CUDA Graph**，可以减少每块的开销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4971":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-249","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#asiowindows","content":"专业声卡常提供 ASIO 驱动，延迟通常比 WASAPI 更低。默认情况下 ASIO 不会被列出，需要：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4972":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-250","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#asiowindows","content":"打开 **设置 › 音频**，开启 **启用 ASIO 驱动（Windows）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4973":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-251","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#asiowindows","content":"回到 **实时** 页面，点 **刷新设备**。支持 ASIO 的设备会以 ASIO 作为推荐驱动，也可以在 **高级 › 驱动** 中手动选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4974":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-252","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#asiowindows","content":"实时后台进程在第一次使用时启动并一直保留。切换 ASIO 开关后如果 ASIO 设备打不开，重启一次 rvc-next 服务器即可让新设置作用于实时进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4975":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-253","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#用命令行运行","content":"不打开网页也可以实时变声，设备和参数默认沿用网页里保存的设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4976":{"id":"/docs/guide-live-254","page_id":"/docs/guide-live","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-live#用命令行运行","content":"`live run` 还支持 `--block-ms`、`--crossfade-ms`、`--context-ms`、`--threshold-db`、`--denoise-strength`、`--phase-vocoder`、`--input-gain`、`--record both|converted|input`、`--allow-fallback` 等选项，完整列表见 命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4977":{"id":"/docs/guide-models","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"page","content":"模型管理","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"4978":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"模型 页面集中管理 rvc-next 用到的所有模型文件：你的音色、训练用的底模、人声分离模型，以及 HuBERT、RMVPE 等必需的资源文件。页面顶部有五个标签页：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4979":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#音色库","content":"音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"4980":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#浏览与筛选","content":"浏览与筛选","locale":"zh-CN"},"4981":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#音色详情","content":"音色详情","locale":"zh-CN"},"4982":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#删除与隐藏","content":"删除与隐藏","locale":"zh-CN"},"4983":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#音色库在磁盘上的样子","content":"音色库在磁盘上的样子","locale":"zh-CN"},"4984":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型","content":"导入模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4985":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#recognized-files","content":"能识别哪些文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4986":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#导入步骤","content":"导入步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"4987":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#links","content":"从链接添加","locale":"