","locale":"zh-CN"},"5312":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#f0","content":"**无音高引导**的音色（训练时关闭了音高引导）不使用音高，此时这一行会变暗，选择哪种算法都没有影响，也不需要下载音高模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5313":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"> 以半音为单位：+12 为升高一个八度。男声转女声约 +12。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5314":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"把输入的音高整体平移若干个半音后再交给音色。这是最常调整的参数：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5315":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"情况","locale":"zh-CN"},"5316":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"建议值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5317":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"男声输入，女声音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5318":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"约 +12（有时 +8 ～ +12 更自然）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5319":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"女声输入，男声音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5320":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"约 −12","locale":"zh-CN"},"5321":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"同性别之间","locale":"zh-CN"},"5322":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"0，再按需要 ±1 ～ ±3 微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5323":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"翻唱时匹配原曲调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5324":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"按音色本身的音域，以 12 的倍数为主，避免与伴奏跑调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5325":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"调整的目标是让移调后的音高落在**音色训练数据的音域**内。偏离太多时，声音会发虚、走音或失真。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5326":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"如果打开了 **先分离人声** 和 **加回伴奏**，伴奏不会跟着移调。此时 **音高** 最好用 0 或 ±12，否则人声会与伴奏不在一个调上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5327":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#pitch","content":"界面中按 1 个半音调节；命令行和 API 接受小数，例如 `--pitch 1.5`。**音高** 只对有音高引导的音色起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5328":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"> 改变声道的音色而不改变音高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5329":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"共振峰决定了声音听起来像“多大的人”在说话。**正值**会抬高共振峰，声音更细、更亮、更年轻；**负值**会降低共振峰，声音更厚、更沉。音高不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5330":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"跨性别转换时，**音高** 调好后声音仍然“不像”，可以把 **共振峰** 向同一方向小幅调整，例如男转女时 +0.5 ～ +1；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5331":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"调整幅度不宜过大，±2 已经是很明显的变化，过大会让声音不自然。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5332":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#formant","content":"原版 RVC 只在实时变声中提供共振峰偏移。RVC Next 把同样的方法也用在文件转换上；**共振峰** 为 0 时，计算与原版完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5333":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"> 从音色的索引中取用多少它自身的音色特征。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5334":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"音色的索引（`.index` 文件）保存了训练数据的特征。转换时，RVC 会在索引中查找与输入最接近的特征，按这个比例混入，让结果更像训练时的声音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5335":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**越高**：音色越接近训练数据，口音和咬字也更像训练者；但如果索引质量不好或数据量太少，可能带来杂音、含糊或咬字不清；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5336":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**越低**：更多保留输入本身的发音，咬字更清楚，但音色相似度降低；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5337":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"**0**：完全不使用索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5338":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"建议从默认的 0.75 开始；发音含糊或有杂音时降到 0.3 ～ 0.6。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5339":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#index-rate","content":"如果音色没有附加索引，这个滑块会变灰，并提示“此音色没有索引，索引强度不起作用。可在“模型”中附加索引。”附加索引的方法见模型管理。多说话人音色可以为每个说话人附加单独的索引，转换时会使用所选说话人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5340":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"> 在输入没有音高的地方保持呼吸声和辅音清晰；0.5 为关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5341":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"清辅音（如 s、sh、t、k）和呼吸声没有音高，用音色特征替换它们容易产生“电音”、撕裂声。辅音保护会在这些没有音高的位置保留更多输入本身的特征。它抑制的是索引的作用：**索引强度** 为 0 或音色没有索引时，它不改变任何东西。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5342":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"**数值越小，保护越强**；**0.5 表示关闭保护**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5343":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"默认 0.33 适合大多数情况；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5344":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"如果齿音、呼吸声出现撕裂或电子音，降低到 0.2 ～ 0.3；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5345":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"保护过强（接近 0）会让这些位置更像原声，也会削弱 **索引强度** 的效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5346":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#protect","content":"**无音高引导**的音色不使用这项，滑块会变灰，并提示“此音色没有音高引导，此项不起作用。”**无音高帧** 选为 **填补（RVC 2026）** 时它同样不起作用，滑块会说明这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5347":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中。音高算法在呼吸声和清辅音中找不到音高，这一项决定这些帧如何处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5348":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5349":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`--unvoiced`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5350":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5351":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**保护**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5352":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`protect`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5353":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"用相邻帧填补音高，并对这些帧应用 **辅音保护**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5354":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**无音高（经典 RVC）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`zero`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"这些帧也不给音高，音色在这里发出噪声而不是乐音，与经典 RVC 和 Applio 的转换相同。网上分享的音色大多是这样训练的，用这一项可能更干净。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"**填补（RVC 2026）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"`original`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5359":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"RVC Next 所依据的 RVC 整合包的规则：填补音高，辅音保护不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#unvoiced","content":"RVC 2026 在辅音保护寻找无音高帧之前就把音高填补了，所以它永远找不到，保护也就从不生效。**保护** 保留填补后的音高（用 RVC 2026 或 RVC Next 训练的音色需要它），但按音高算法自己的判断确定这些帧。实时变声使用同一设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；只用于 **RMVPE**，且只在转换中生效（实时变声不提供：它会让每一块的音高分析耗时翻倍）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"RMVPE 的训练数据大约到 C6（约 1040 Hz）为止。高于这个音时，它会非常确定地报出低一个八度（或低一个八度加五度）的音，转换出的声音也就唱在那里。**纠正为真实音高** 会把音频降低一个八度再跑一遍 RMVPE（在那里它能读对），用这一遍把每一帧放回正确的八度；两遍一致的地方保留第一遍更精细的音高曲线。低于 460 Hz 的帧从不改动，所以说话和大多数演唱的结果与原来完全相同；音高分析耗时约为三倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`--high-register`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5365":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**按检测结果**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`off`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5368":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"使用 RMVPE 的结果，与原版相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5369":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正为真实音高**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`true_pitch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5371":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正的最高音高**（默认 1250 Hz）以内的音得到真实音高；更高的音保持低一个八度，因为用 RMVPE 音高训练的音色很少能发出更高的音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5372":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"**纠正，但低一个八度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5373":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"`fold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5374":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"只修正被读错音名的音，并写成比真实音高低一个八度，让每个音都留在音色训练过的音域内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5375":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#high-register","content":"这个纠正方法来自 Applio。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；只在转换中生效（实时变声中调会随块跳动）。它计算输入的常用音高（有声帧的中位数）与音色的音高相差多少，并在 **音高** 之外再移调这么多：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5378":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`--auto-pitch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"移调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**关**（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5381":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`off`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"不移调","locale":"zh-CN"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**到最近的半音**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5384":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`semitone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"把差距取整到半音（最多两个八度）。适合说话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5386":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**按整八度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5387":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"`octave`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5388":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"把差距取整到整八度，歌曲保持原调。适合唱歌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5389":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#auto-pitch","content":"**目标** 是目标音高。为 0 时就是音色自己的音高：rvc-next 训练音色时会测量训练数据的中位音高，并在音色的 **信息** 中显示为 **训练音高（中位数）**。没有记录它的音色（大多数下载的音色）以 155 Hz（较低的声音）为目标；较高的声音可设为约 255 Hz。任务日志会写出选定的调。来自 Applio 的“建议音高”，它按分块计算；这里对整个文件只选一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5390":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#autotune","content":"位于 **音高细节** 中；转换和实时变声都可用。把每个有声帧拉向 A4 = 440 Hz 调律下最近的半音：1 让每一帧都对齐到音符上（机械的“电音”效果），0.3 ～ 0.6 在保留一些颤音的同时让音准更稳，0 不改变。呼吸声和辅音不会被赋予音符。它修正的是你最终听到的音高，即经过 **音高**、**自动定调** 和 **共振峰** 之后的音高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5391":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"> 0 跟随输入的响度，1 保持转换后的响度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5392":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"控制输出的音量变化（响度包络）跟随谁：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"**0**：输出的音量起伏完全跟随输入，适合需要保留原有轻重、强弱表现的歌声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"**1**：保持模型生成的响度，不做调整；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"默认 **0.25**：以输入的起伏为主。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#rms-mix","content":"想更多保留原声的轻重、强弱表现时调低；想让输出更接近模型自身的响度时调高。拿不准时保持默认。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#speaker","content":"多说话人音色（模型文件中带有说话人信息）在音色选择框下方会多出一个 **说话人** 下拉框，按名称和编号列出各个说话人。选择新音色时，会自动选中它的第一个说话人。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#speaker","content":"单说话人音色不显示这个下拉框，使用编号 0。说话人的名称可以在音色详情页中修改，见模型管理。命令行用 `--speaker <编号>` 指定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#presets","content":"预设是一组保存下来的音色参数（不含说话人）。每个预设要么**属于某个音色**，要么是**所有音色**通用的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"每个音色都有一个**默认预设**，导入音色时自动创建，名为 `Default`，初始值来自设置中的 `convert.default_params`（即上表中的默认值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"在任意页面**选择一个音色时，参数面板会自动载入它的默认预设**（说话人保持不变）。所以把常用的音高、索引强度等存进默认预设后，这个音色在 **转换** 和 **实时** 中一选即用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#每个音色的默认预设","content":"修改默认预设：打开 **模型 › 音色**，点击音色进入详情页，在 **默认参数** 分区中调整参数，点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5403":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"点参数面板右上角的 **预设**，菜单中列出：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5404":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"当前音色的预设，其中默认预设带“· 默认”；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5405":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"所有音色通用的预设，带“· 所有音色”；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5406":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"最后一项 **保存为预设**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5407":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#应用预设","content":"点一个预设即应用它的参数（说话人保持不变），屏幕底部会提示预设名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5408":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"调好参数后，点 **预设** › **保存为预设**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5409":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"在 **预设名称** 中输入名称。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5410":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"勾选 **仅用于此音色**，预设只属于当前音色；取消勾选则保存为所有音色通用的预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"勾选了 **仅用于此音色** 时，还可以勾选 **设为此音色的默认预设**，用它替换原来的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5412":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"界面中暂时不能删除或重命名预设，请使用命令行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-231","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#保存预设","content":"`rvc-next convert` 默认从音色的默认预设出发，`--preset <名称>` 改用其他预设，再用 `--pitch` 等选项单独覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-232","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"在 **实时** 页面，参数面板的说明变为“拖动时即时生效。”：所有音色参数（**音高**、**共振峰**、**索引强度**、**辅音保护**、**响度匹配**、**音高细节**；实时变声没有 **极高音** 和 **自动定调**）在拖动滑块时就会应用到正在进行的变声，不需要停止再启动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-233","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换 **音高算法** 时，新算法的模型会在后台加载。如果它尚未下载，变声会继续使用原来的算法，并提示缺少的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-234","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换 **说话人** 时，会同时换用该说话人的索引。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5418":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-235","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"切换音色同样即时生效，并会载入新音色的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5419":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-236","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"实时页使用的参数会被记住，下次打开时恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5420":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-237","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"此外，实时页还有一组 **缓冲与降噪** 参数，控制延迟与稳定性：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5421":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-238","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5422":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-239","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"5423":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-240","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-241","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"生效方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-242","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**块长**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-243","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"20 ～ 1500 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-244","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"250 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-245","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-246","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**交叉淡化**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5430":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-247","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"10 ～ 150 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5431":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-248","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"50 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-249","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-250","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**上下文**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-251","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"50 ～ 5000 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-252","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"2500 毫秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-253","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"修改后音频流会短暂重新缓冲","locale":"zh-CN"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-254","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**输入门限**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-255","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"−60 ～ 0 dB（−60 为关闭）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-256","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"−60 dB","locale":"zh-CN"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-257","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"即时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-258","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"**输入降噪** / **输出降噪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-259","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"开 / 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-260","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5444":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-261","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"即时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5445":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-262","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"这些参数的详细说明和调节方法见实时变声。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5446":{"id":"/docs/guide-parameters-263","page_id":"/docs/guide-parameters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-parameters#live","content":"实时变声参数的数学处理与原版实时变声逐块一致（在 CPU 上测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5447":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"page","content":"人声分离","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate","locale":"zh-CN"},"5448":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"分离 页面用 RoFormer 系列模型拆分音频：把歌曲分成人声与伴奏、去除人声中的混响、把主唱与和声分开。几个步骤还可以串联成一个预设一次完成。分出的任何分轨都可以直接送到 转换 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5449":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"使用步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"5450":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"5451":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"怎么选","locale":"zh-CN"},"5452":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#导入的分离模型","content":"导入的分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5453":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"下载分离模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5454":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"5455":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5456":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-separate#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5457":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"页面从上到下是 **输入**、**预设**（含 **格式**）和 **结果** 三个分区，底部是固定的操作栏，其中有任务卡片和 **分离** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5458":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate","content":"如果你的目的是“分离人声 → 转换 → 加回伴奏”，不必先来这里：在 **转换** 页打开 **先分离人声** 和 **加回伴奏** 就能一步完成，见转换 › 可选步骤。当你需要**保留**分离出的分轨，或要先检查、处理分轨时，再使用本页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5459":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **输入** 中添加音频：拖入文件、点 **服务器文件** 选择服务器上的文件或整个文件夹（处理该文件夹第一层的音频文件），或点 **之前的结果**。用法与转换页的输入完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5460":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **预设** 中点选一张卡片。每张卡片显示预设名称、说明和它输出的分轨，例如“分轨：vocals, instrumental”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5461":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"在 **格式** 中选择输出格式：WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A 或 OGG（Opus，始终为 48 kHz）。默认是 FLAC。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5462":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"如果操作栏显示“**需要 Separation: ……**”，先点 **下载** 获取该预设所需的分离模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5463":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"点 **分离**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#使用步骤","content":"页面会记住你上次选的预设。从未选过时，使用 **设置 › 训练默认值** 中的 **默认分离预设**（初始为 **Vocals**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设的名称和说明由服务器提供，目前以英文显示。内置预设如下：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"预设（界面显示）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"输出的分轨","locale":"zh-CN"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tag