rl":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`lead-clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"先分离人声，再提取主唱，最后去混响：得到干净的主唱、和声和伴奏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`main_vocal`、`instrumental`、`off_vocal`、`reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"Vocals + Lead vocal + Remove reverb","locale":"zh-CN"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"分轨名称的含义：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"分轨","locale":"zh-CN"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`vocals`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5510":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"人声（串联预设中为去混响后的干声）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`instrumental`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"伴奏","locale":"zh-CN"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`noreverb` / `reverb`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5514":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"去除混响后的声音 / 被分离出来的混响","locale":"zh-CN"},"5515":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"`main_vocal` / `off_vocal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5516":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"主唱 / 和声","locale":"zh-CN"},"5517":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#presets","content":"带 **串联** 标记的预设会依次运行多个模型：每一步处理上一步的主分轨（例如 **Vocals, clean** 先得到人声，再对人声去混响），每个分轨只输出一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5518":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**普通歌曲转换**：用 **Vocals**。分离后人声里还残留伴奏时，试试 **Vocals, aggressive**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5519":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**人声混响很重**：用 **Vocals, clean**，直接得到干声，转换效果通常更好。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5520":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**有和声的歌曲**：用 **Lead vocal, clean** 只保留主唱再转换，避免和声被一起转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5521":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**已经是干净的人声，只是有混响**：直接用 **Remove reverb** 或 **Remove reverb, aggressive**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5522":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#怎么选","content":"**Lead vocal** 要用在人声上，而不是整首歌：先用 **Vocals** 分出人声，再在人声结果上选 **用作输入**，换成 **Lead vocal** 预设分离一次。或者直接用串联的 **Lead vocal, clean**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5523":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#导入的分离模型","content":"你也可以在 **模型 › 分离模型** 中导入自己的分离模型（检查点及其 `.yaml` 配置）。每个导入的模型都会在这里成为一个单步预设，卡片上带 **已导入** 标记。导入方法见模型管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"每个内置预设需要一个或多个分离模型，每个约 305 MB（两个 Vocals 模型）或约 436 MB（其余三个）。获取方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"选好预设后，如果模型尚未下载，操作栏中的 **分离** 按钮会被替换为“**需要 Separation: Vocals**”之类的提示和 **下载** 按钮，点击即可下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"**模型 › 分离模型** 的 **内置** 分组列出全部五个内置模型，可以逐个 **下载** 或删除；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"**模型 › 资源** 的 **分离** 分组中，点 **下载全部分离文件** 一次下载全部。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#下载分离模型","content":"分离模型保存在资源文件夹的 `pymss_weights/` 中，与原版 RVC 的布局相同。如果你在设置中把资源文件夹指向原版 RVC 的 `assets/`，已经下载过的同名模型可以直接使用，见从原版 RVC 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5529":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"每点一次 **分离**，就为当前全部输入创建**一个**任务，标题形如 `Separate song.flac · Vocals`（多个输入时为 `Separate song.flac and 2 more · Vocals`），每个输入是一步。分离在一个独立的工作进程中运行，可以随时 **取消**，失败后可以 **重试**，点 **日志** 查看过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"分离使用 **设置 › 计算** 中选择的设备。CPU 也能运行，但 RoFormer 模型在 CPU 上较慢，长歌曲需要耐心等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#任务","content":"在 DirectML 上，如果模型以半精度失败，RVC Next 会自动改用 fp32 重新运行（日志中记录 `Retrying in fp32`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"分离出的分轨出现在 **结果** 分区，**按源文件分组**：每组以源文件名为标题，下面是它的各个分轨，每个分轨带 **分轨** 标签和分轨名称（如 `vocals`）。播放、对比、下载等通用操作见界面总览 › 结果列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5533":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"本页特有的两个操作，在每个分轨的 **更多操作**（⋮）菜单中：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"**转换这个**：把该分轨加入 **转换** 页的输入，并跳转到 **转换** 页。选好音色就可以转换了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"**用作输入**：把该分轨加回本页的输入，用另一个预设再分离一次，例如对 `vocals` 运行 **Lead vocal**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"结果保存在数据文件夹的 `outputs/<日期>/<任务 ID>/` 中，文件名为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#结果","content":"例如 `song.flac` 用 **Vocals** 分离并输出 FLAC，得到 `song.vocals.flac` 和 `song.instrumental.flac`。同名文件已存在时会加序号，如 `song.vocals-2.flac`，不会覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/guide-separate-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-separate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-separate#命令行","content":"全部选项见命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5539":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"设置 页面集中了 rvc-next 的所有选项，按八个标签页分组：常规、计算、音频、存储、下载、训练默认值、外观、关于。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"设置保存在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"5542":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"常规","locale":"zh-CN"},"5543":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"5544":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5545":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5546":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#存储","content":"存储","locale":"zh-CN"},"5547":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"5548":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#浏览器可打开的文件夹","content":"浏览器可打开的文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"5549":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#结果保留天数","content":"结果保留天数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5550":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#下载","content":"下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5551":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练默认值","content":"训练默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5552":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#外观","content":"外观","locale":"zh-CN"},"5553":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#关于","content":"关于","locale":"zh-CN"},"5554":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#在命令行中修改设置","content":"在命令行中修改设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"5555":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"大多数选项改动后立即保存，并提示 **设置已保存**；**存储** 标签页中的文件夹需要点 **保存**。少数选项（服务器地址、端口）要到下次启动服务器时才生效，界面上会注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5556":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"服务器的设置保存在数据文件夹的 `settings.toml` 中。数据文件夹默认为：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5557":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"Windows：`%APPDATA%\\rvc-next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5558":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"macOS：`~/Library/Application Support/rvc-next`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5559":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"Linux：`~/.local/share/rvc-next`（或 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/rvc-next`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5560":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"可以用环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或 `rvc-next webui --data-dir` 指定其他位置。`rvc-next config path` 会打印设置文件的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5561":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"**外观** 和 **常规 › 语言** 属于界面偏好：它们保存在服务器上（换个浏览器打开也一样），同时在浏览器本地保留一份副本，不写入 `settings.toml`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5562":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#设置保存在哪里","content":"每个设置都可以用 `RVC_NEXT_<分组>__<字段>` 形式的环境变量覆盖，例如 `RVC_NEXT_SERVER__PORT=8000`、`RVC_NEXT_PATHS__ASSETS_DIR=D:\\rvc-assets`。环境变量的优先级高于 `settings.toml`：界面上显示的是最终生效的值；在界面上修改会写入 `settings.toml`，但只要环境变量还在，生效的仍是环境变量的值。**存储** 标签页中被环境变量固定的文件夹会标注 **由环境变量设置**。完整列表见 配置与环境变量，或运行 `rvc-next env`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5563":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5564":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5565":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5566":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**语言**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5567":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**自动（…）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5568":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"界面语言：自动跟随系统，或固定为 English / 简体中文。立即生效","locale":"zh-CN"},"5569":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**服务器启动时打开浏览器**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5570":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5571":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"运行 `rvc-next webui` 时自动打开网页。命令行的 `--open/--no-open` 可以临时覆盖","locale":"zh-CN"},"5572":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**服务器地址**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5573":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"`127.0.0.1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5574":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"服务器监听的地址。**下次启动服务器时生效。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5575":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**端口**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5576":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"`7868`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5577":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"服务器端口，下次启动时生效。端口被占用时会自动尝试下一个端口","locale":"zh-CN"},"5578":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"访问令牌是可选的一层保护：设置之后，每个访问服务器 API 的请求（包括网页本身发出的请求）都必须带上它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5579":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"在 **访问令牌** 输入框中输入一个足够长的随机字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5580":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"点 **设置令牌**。左侧标签会变成 **已设置访问令牌**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5581":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"浏览器之后会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框（**此服务器需要访问令牌。**），输入同一个令牌即可继续使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5582":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"要取消，点 **清除令牌**。令牌保存后不会再显示出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5583":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问令牌","content":"默认地址 `127.0.0.1` 只允许本机访问。把 **服务器地址** 改成 `0.0.0.0` 或局域网 IP 之后，不需要访问令牌，能连上的人都能使用全部功能（包括浏览下面允许的服务器文件夹）。只在可信的网络中这样做，或自己加上防火墙、VPN 等保护，或设置访问令牌。详见 远程访问与安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5584":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5585":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5586":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5587":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5588":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5589":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"用哪个设备运行模型。下拉框列出检测到的设备及显存，不满足要求的设备标有 ✕。自动时选择最合适的 NVIDIA 显卡（计算能力最高、显存最大），没有时尝试 DirectML，再没有就用 CPU。也可以固定为某张显卡（`cuda:N`）、DirectML、CPU，或实验性的 Apple MPS（`mps`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5590":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**精度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5591":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5592":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**自动** / **fp32** / **fp16**。自动时在支持的显卡上用半精度（fp16），否则用 fp32，规则与原版相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5593":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**转换时使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5594":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5595":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"离线转换时用 CUDA Graph 减少 GPU 调度开销","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**实时转换使用 CUDA Graph**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"实时变声时使用 CUDA Graph","locale":"zh-CN"},"5599":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5600":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"10","locale":"zh-CN"},"5601":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"模型闲置超过这么久后自动卸载，释放显存。0 表示从不自动卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5602":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#计算","content":"**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5603":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-setting