"},"5614":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**自动重新连接丢失的设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5615":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5616":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"实时变声运行中设备断开时，每 2 秒重新查找，设备回来后自动恢复；关闭后设备一断开就停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"5617":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**停止时显示输入电平**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5618":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"开","locale":"zh-CN"},"5619":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"设备面板显示时，即使实时变声未运行，也会打开麦克风显示 **输入电平**；页面关闭或隐藏约 15 秒后释放麦克风。如果不希望麦克风一直被占用，可以关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"5620":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"**把输出设备当作输入（内录）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5621":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5622":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#音频","content":"在 **输入** 菜单中列出所有输出设备，带 **内录** 标签：这台设备播放的声音（视频、游戏等）就成为输入。Windows 通过 WASAPI 环回录制，Linux 通过 PulseAudio/PipeWire 的监视器录制；macOS 需要安装 BlackHole 等环回驱动，并把它作为普通输入选择。见 录制输出设备。要把转换后的声音*送给*其他程序，见 在其他程序中使用实时变声","locale":"zh-CN"},"5623":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#文件夹","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5624":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-84","pag