cale":"zh-CN"},"5874":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"开（默认）/ 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5875":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"每次保存时，用当时的音色渲染一段训练片段（最长的切片）到 `previews/`；**结果 › 样例** 中列出","locale":"zh-CN"},"5876":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**高级** 中：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5877":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"5878":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5879":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5880":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**精度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5881":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"自动 / 全精度（fp32）/ bf16","locale":"zh-CN"},"5882":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"自动：所选显卡都支持时用半精度（fp16，带损失缩放）训练，与原版一致；bf16 不需要损失缩放，适合较新的 NVIDIA（RTX 30 系列及以后）、AMD 和 Intel 显卡（不支持 bf16 时退回 fp32，并在日志中说明）；fp32 最慢也最精确","locale":"zh-CN"},"5883":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**TF32 运算**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5884":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"开 / 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5885":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"让 RTX 30 系列及以后的 NVIDIA 显卡用 TF32 做全精度矩阵运算：更快，精确度略低","locale":"zh-CN"},"5886":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**节省显存（梯度检查点）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5887":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"开 / 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5888":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"在反向传播时重新计算生成器的上采样和残差块以及每个判别器，而不是保存它们的激活值：适合显存较小的显卡，代价是每步更慢","locale":"zh-CN"},"5889":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**新的说话人向量**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5890":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"开 / 关","locale":"zh-CN"},"5891":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"实验中的每个说话人从新的随机向量（大小与底模的相同）开始，而不是底模自己的向量；所有官方底模里说话人 0 和 1 的向量相同，所以多说话人音色的两个说话人起点一样。来自 Applio","locale":"zh-CN"},"5892":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"fp16 的损失缩放值会和检查点一起保存，继续训练时从它接着走，而不是重新开始。训练出的音色会记录轮数、步数和日期，设置了 **设置 › 训练 › 作者** 时还有作者；音色详情页的 **信息** 中可以看到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5893":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"**底模**：训练从底模开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5894":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"默认项 **根据采样率、版本和音高引导选择** 使用对应的官方底模。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5895":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"你在 **模型 › 底模** 中导入的底模也会列在这里，但 **只列出采样率、版本和音高引导都匹配的底模**。没有判别器（D）的底模会标注 **无 D**。改变采样率、版本或音高引导后，如果已选的底模不再匹配，会自动回到默认项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5896":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#第-2-步设置","content":"设置完成后点 **保存**。如果所需的文件还没下载（官方底模、HuBERT、使用 RMVPE 时的 RMVPE 模型），**保存** 按钮的位置会显示 **需要 …** 和 **下载（大小）**，下载完成后才能保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5897":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"每个阶段完成时都会记录它的输入“指纹”。保存修改后，受影响的已完成阶段会被标为 **已过期**，并提示 **此阶段运行后输入已改变。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5898":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"**全部运行** 时还会重新计算每个已完成阶段的指纹：即使没有在页面上改设置，只要直接往数据集文件夹里加入、删除或替换了录音，切片及其后的阶段也会在这次运行中全部重做。只增加 **训练轮数** 时，只继续训练，不会重做前面的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5899":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"修改内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5900":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"从哪个阶段开始过期","locale":"zh-CN"},"5901":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"数据集文件夹或说话人表格","locale":"zh-CN"},"5902":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"切片","locale":"zh-CN"},"5903":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"清理预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"5904":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#改了设置哪些阶段要重跑","content":"清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5905":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-164","pag