allation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"3.10 或更新（3.10 至 3.14）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6042":{"id":"/docs/installation-13","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"独立的虚拟环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"6043":{"id":"/docs/installation-14","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"一个只给 RVC Next 用的 venv 或独立 Python，**不要**与其他应用共用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6044":{"id":"/docs/installation-15","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"PyTorch","locale":"zh-CN"},"6045":{"id":"/docs/installation-16","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"2.7.1 或更新的版本，按你的硬件选择 CUDA 版或 CPU 版，**先于** RVC Next 安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"6046":{"id":"/docs/installation-17","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"磁盘空间","locale":"zh-CN"},"6047":{"id":"/docs/installation-18","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"模型另需空间：转换必需的 HuBERT 和 RMVPE 约 353 MB，每个分离模型 300～440 MB，每组训练底模约 350～420 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"6048":{"id":"/docs/installation-19","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"PortAudio（仅 Linux，仅实时变声）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6049":{"id":"/docs/installation-20","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"见下文","locale":"zh-CN"},"6050":{"id":"/docs/installation-21","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"RVC Next 把依赖限定在测试过的版本范围内。例如它需要 `transformers` 5.x，而 `transformers` 依赖的 `tokenizers` 要求 `huggingface_hub` 低于 2；如果同一环境中的其他项目需要 `huggingface_hub` 2.x，两者无法共存。用一个专属的虚拟环境可以避免这类冲突。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6051":{"id":"/docs/installation-22","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#准备工作","content":"RVC Next 已经移植了所需的重采样和 FCPE 代码，不再依赖 `torchaudio`，也不需要单独安装 `torchfcpe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6052":{"id":"/docs/installation-23","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第一步创建虚拟环境","content":"`py -3.11` 只是示例，换成你已安装的 3.10～3.14 中任一版本即可。之后的所有命令都在激活了该环境的终端中执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6053":{"id":"/docs/installation-24","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"PyTorch 需要按硬件选择对应的构建，所以要**先**单独安装。版本须为 2.7.1 或更新。按操作系统和显卡在下面选择对应的命令；其他构建见 pytorch.org。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6054":{"id":"/docs/installation-25","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"Windows 和 Linux：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6055":{"id":"/docs/installation-26","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"CUDA 13.0 构建需要较新的 NVIDIA 驱动（580 或更新版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6056":{"id":"/docs/installation-27","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"Windows 和 Linux：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6057":{"id":"/docs/installation-28","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"这是 AMD 自己发布的 ROCm 10 构建，来自 AMD 的软件包索引（它的 PyTorch 版本比官方发布稍晚，所以是 2.13）。附加项 `device-all` 会安装它支持的所有 AMD 显卡的 GPU 代码（每个显卡系列一个 `amd-torch-device-gfx…` 包），下载量较大。安装后 AMD 显卡显示为 `cuda:N`。加引号是为了防止 zsh 等 shell 把方括号当成文件通配符。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6058":{"id":"/docs/installation-29","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"Windows 和 Linux：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6059":{"id":"/docs/installation-30","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"需要较新的 Intel 显卡驱动。安装后 Intel 显卡显示为 `xpu:N`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6060":{"id":"/docs/installation-31","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"macOS 上的 PyTorch 自带 Apple MPS 支持（需要 Apple 芯片和 macOS 14 或更新版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6061":{"id":"/docs/installation-32","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"没有可用的 GPU 时使用。转换和分离都能在 CPU 上运行，只是更慢；训练在 CPU 上会非常慢。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6062":{"id":"/docs/installation-33","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"DirectML 是备用方案，用于上面的 ROCm 和 XPU 构建不支持的 Windows AMD 和 Intel 显卡。先按“仅 CPU”安装 PyTorch，再在第三步安装带 `directml` 附加项的 RVC Next：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6063":{"id":"/docs/installation-34","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第二步安装-pytorch","content":"该附加项会安装 `torch-directml` 和 `onnxruntime-directml`。`torch-directml` 对 PyTorch 版本有它自己的要求，可能比上面的版本旧；按它的要求安装即可，只要不低于 2.7.1。这条路径是实验性的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6064":{"id":"/docs/installation-35","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第三步安装-rvc-next","content":"由于 PyTorch 已经装好，pip 会认为 `torch` 依赖已满足，不会再替换成别的构建。安装完成后，环境中会多出 `rvc-next` 命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6065":{"id":"/docs/installation-36","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第三步安装-rvc-next","content":"转换和实时变声页上的 **效果** 链（混响、压缩、延迟等）需要 pedalboard，它是可选附加项：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6066":{"id":"/docs/installation-37","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第三步安装-rvc-next","content":"转换页上的 **文字转语音** 输入需要 `tts` 附加项（edge-tts，使用微软的在线语音）：`python -m pip install \"rvc-next[tts]\"`。附加项可以组合：`\"rvc-next[effects,tts]\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6067":{"id":"/docs/installation-38","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#从源码安装","content":"如果你想使用最新的代码，或者参与开发，可以从源码安装：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6068":{"id":"/docs/installation-39","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#从源码安装","content":"源码中**不包含构建好的网页界面**（`rvc_next/webui/dist` 不在仓库里）。没有它时，`rvc-next webui` 只提供 API，日志中会出现 `No web UI build found`。构建网页界面需要 bun：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6069":{"id":"/docs/installation-40","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#从源码安装","content":"如果要自己打包 wheel，请使用 `python scripts/build_wheel.py`，它会先构建网页界面再打包；直接运行 `python -m build` 得到的包里没有网页界面。开发环境的完整搭建见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6070":{"id":"/docs/installation-41","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"**实时**页面通过 `sounddevice` 使用 PortAudio 访问声卡。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6071":{"id":"/docs/installation-42","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"无需额外安装。`sounddevice` 的 Windows 包自带 PortAudio（包括 ASIO 支持）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6072":{"id":"/docs/installation-43","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"无需额外安装。`sounddevice` 的 macOS 包自带 PortAudio。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6073":{"id":"/docs/installation-44","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"需要系统中的 PortAudio 库。Debian / Ubuntu 上：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6074":{"id":"/docs/installation-45","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"其他发行版请安装对应的 PortAudio 包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6075":{"id":"/docs/installation-46","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第四步可选实时变声所需的-portaudio","content":"只做文件转换、分离和训练时不需要 PortAudio。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6076":{"id":"/docs/installation-47","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"列出 RVC Next、Python 以及 torch、transformers、faiss-cpu、av、sounddevice、pymss 等主要组件的版本；显示 `not installed` 的组件说明安装不完整。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6077":{"id":"/docs/installation-48","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"`doctor` 做一次全面检查并给出建议：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6078":{"id":"/docs/installation-49","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"数据文件夹的位置；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6079":{"id":"/docs/installation-50","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"torch 版本与 CUDA 版本，自动选择的计算设备和精度，以及每个设备的显存和是否被采用；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6080":{"id":"/docs/installation-51","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"是否找到 `ffmpeg`（不是必需的，PyAV 无需它就能解码）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6081":{"id":"/docs/installation-52","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"音频设备是否可用（实时变声需要）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6082":{"id":"/docs/installation-53","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"每个资源（HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型等）的状态和校验结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6083":{"id":"/docs/installation-54","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#第五步验证安装","content":"刚安装时，`doctor` 会提示 HuBERT 和 RMVPE 尚未安装，并给出 `rvc-next assets download hubert` 这样的命令。这是正常的，下一页会处理它。两个命令都支持 `--json` 输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6084":{"id":"/docs/installation-55","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#下一步","content":"继续阅读首次启动：启动网页界面、下载模型并完成第一次转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6085":{"id":"/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["RVC Next 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start","locale":"zh-CN"},"6086":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（下文称“原版 RVC”）的一体化重写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6087":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"RVC Next 能做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"6088":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#适合谁","content":"适合谁","locale":"zh-CN"},"6089":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#文档的组织","content":"文档的组织","locale":"zh-CN"},"6090":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#快速开始的路线","content":"快速开始的路线","locale":"zh-CN"},"6091":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"RVC Next 是 Retrieval-based-Voice-Conversion-WebUI（下文称“原版 RVC”）的一体化重写。它把转换、实时变声、人声分离、训练和模型管理放进**一个应用**：一个本地服务器、一个网页界面和一个命令行工具 `rvc-next`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6092":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"本节带你从零开始：装好 RVC Next，启动网页界面，下载必需的模型，再用一个示例音色完成第一次转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6093":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"6094":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"界面中的位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"6095":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"用来做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"6096":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"6097":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-next-能做什么","content":"**转换**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6098":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#rvc-n