ter behavior everywhere","locale":"en"},"9601":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-78","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"HuBERT normalization","locale":"en"},"9602":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-79","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"Training feature extraction applies `layer_norm` when `do_normalize` is true; inference never does","locale":"en"},"9603":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-80","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"One shared function, `features/hubert.normalize_input`, for training and inference","locale":"en"},"9604":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-81","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"Real assets have `do_normalize: false`, so neither normalizes and results remain unchanged","locale":"en"},"9605":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-82","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"Offline formant shift","locale":"en"},"9606":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-83","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"Only available live","locale":"en"},"9607":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-84","page_id":"/en/docs/development-parity","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-parity#intentional-behavior-changes","content":"Offline uses the live method (pitch at `key − formant`, generate `ceil(n·2^(f/12))` frames with scaled NSF pitch, then resample back)","locale":"en"},"9608":{"id":"/en/docs/development-parity-85","page_id":"/en/docs/developmen