ost, port, strict=...)` **先绑定套接字**，端口被占用时向上尝试（`--strict-port` 时直接失败，退出码 3）；实际端口与请求的不同时给出警告。绑定而不是试连接，是为了消除\"检查\"与\"真正绑定\"之间的空隙，也能识别 Windows 上被系统保留的端口。"],[1955,"`bind_first_free_port(host, port, strict=…)` **自己绑定**监听套接字：从配置端口开始，遇到 `EADDRINUSE`/`EACCES`（以及 Windows 的对应码）就试下一个，最多 20 个、不超过 65535；`strict` 时只试一个；端口 0 交给操作系统挑。Windows 上设 `SO_EXCLUSIVEADDRUSE`（防止别的进程绑定同一地址端口），其他平台设 `SO_REUSEADDR`（`TIME_WAIT` 期间也能快速重启）。全部失败时退出（码 3）。"],[3211,"`block_frame`"],[9346,"`block_frame`"],[3212,"`block_ms`"],[9347,"`block_ms`"],[8979,"`build_index_for_voice()` (`index` job): build an index for an existing voice from an experiment's extracted features."],[2844,"`build_index_for_voice()`（`index` 任务）：用某个实验已提取的特征为一个已有音色构建索引。"],[8717,"`build_services()` calls `models.rescan()` last. With `start_background=True` (the server), it also cleans expired uploads (`audio.cleanup()`), starts idle unloading (`compute.start()`) and job scheduling (`jobs.start()`); the CLI starts none of these, instead running a job in the foreground with `jobs.run_now()`."],[8146,"`build_services()` in `core/context.py` constructs all services once in dependency order and returns a `Services` dataclass:"],[2582,"`build_services()` 最后调用 `models.rescan()`。`start_background=True`（服务器）还会清理过期上传（`audio.cleanup()`）、启动空闲卸载线程（`compute.start()`）和任务调度线程（`jobs.start()`）；命令行不启动它们，而是用 `jobs.run_now()` 在前台跑一个任务。"],[8200,"`build_services(start_background=True)`, stored on `app.state.services`, accessed by routes through `ServicesDep`"],[2065,"`build_services(start_background=True)`，挂在 `app.state.services` 上，路由通过 `ServicesDep` 取得"],[8088,"`build_services(start_background=True)`; take host, port, strict mode, and browser-opening behavior from CLI arguments, falling back to `server.*` settings (default `127.0.0.1:7868`)."],[1953,"`build_services(start_background=True)`；主机、端口、严格模式、是否打开浏览器取命令行参数，缺省时取 `server.*` 设置（默认 `127.0.0.1:7868`）。"],[3639,"`build`"],[9774,"`build`"],[10020,"`bun install --frozen-lockfile`, `bun run test`, `typecheck`,