e rvc-model entry in `catalog.json` carries `modelscope` (`licyks/rvc-model`) and `modelscope_revision` (`master`), which `GET /assets/repositories` returns in `Repository` too. Only rvc-model has a ModelScope copy: with ModelScope chosen, files come from that copy whichever repository is selected; files only on Hugging Face (the community base models' and Applio's content-feature models' upstream repositories) still come from huggingface.co."],[2270,"`downloads.source` 选**下载源**：`huggingface`（`https://huggingface.co`）、`hf-mirror`（`https://hf-mirror.com`）、`modelscope`（`https://www.modelscope.cn`）或 `custom`（`downloads.endpoint`）。`catalog.json` 中 rvc-model 的条目带有 `modelscope`（`licyks/rvc-model`）和 `modelscope_revision`（`master`），`GET /assets/repositories` 的 `Repository` 也返回这两个字段。只有 rvc-model 有 ModelScope 副本：选 ModelScope 时无论选的是哪个仓库，都从这个副本下载；只在 Hugging Face 上的文件（社区底模和 Applio 内容特征模型的上游仓库）仍从 huggingface.co 下载。"],[1437,"`downloads.verify_checksums`"],[7572,"`downloads.verify_checksums`"],[7430,"`downloads`: downloads"],[1295,"`downloads`：下载"],[9422,"`DriftCorrector` (`drift.py`) handles the fact that two device clocks never stay perfectly synchronised: the reader exponentially smooths ring-buffer fill; when it deviates from target by more than half a block, it removes or duplicates one sample every 10 ms (at the quietest point in each 10 ms segment) until within 1/8 block of target. Target fill is measured after the first second, because the relative phase of the two callbacks determines the stable fill level, which no constant can predict. Real clock drift is tens of ppm, a few samples per second, and is inaudible."],[3287,"`DriftCorrector`（`drift.py`）解决两个设备时钟永远不完全同步的问题：读端对环形缓冲的填充量做指数平滑；偏离目标超过半块时，每 10 ms 删除或复制一个采样（选在每段 10 ms 中最安静的位置），直到回到目标的 1/8 块以内。目标填充量在前 1 秒后取实测值，因为两个回调的相位决定了填充量稳定在哪里，任何常数都猜不准。真实时钟的漂移是几十 ppm，相当于每秒几个采样，听不出来。"],[8889,"`duplicate`: two indexes proposed for the same voice and key leave the lower-scoring one for the user to decide."],[2754,"`duplicate`：两个索引提议给同一音色同一键时，得分低的一个让给用户决定。"],[421,"`effects`"],[6556,"`effects`"],[8870,"`enc_p.emb_phone` width determines version, `enc_q.pre` input width and upsampling kernels determine rate, `dec.m_source` means pitch guidance (`engine/models/checkpoint.py:inspect_checkpoint`)"],[2735,"`enc_p.emb_phone` 宽度定版本，`enc_q.pre` 输入宽度与上采样核定采样率，`dec.m_source` 存在即有音高引导（`engine/models/checkpoint.py:inspect_checkpoint`）"],[9307,"`enc_q.pre` width"],[3172,"`enc_q.pre` 宽度"],[3086,"`engine.f0.METHODS`"],[9221,"`engine.f0.METHODS`"],[3855,"`engine/`"],[9990,"`engine/`"],[3410,"`engine/audio/denoise.py`"],[9545,"`engine/audio/denoise.py`"],[9639,"`engine/audio/sinc_resample.py`: `Resample`, `sinc_resample_kernel`, `apply_sinc_resample_kernel`"],[3504,"`engine/audio/sinc_resample.py`：`Resample`、`sinc_resample_kernel`、`apply_sinc_resample_kernel`"],[9643,"`engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`: `Wav2Mel`, convolution-only `CFNaiveMelPE`, decoders, `load_fcpe`"],[3508,"`engine/f0/fcpe_model.py`：`Wav2Mel`、纯卷积的 `CFNaiveMelPE`、解码器、`load_fcpe`"],[3408,"`engine/f0/rmvpe.py`"],[9543,"`engine/f0/rmvpe.py`"],[3412,"`engine/graph.py`"],[9547,"`engine/graph.py`"],[9235,"`engine/graph.py` copies the original's `tools/cuda_graph.py`: each “owner” object (`net_g`, HuBERT, RMVPE, resampler…) carries a `_GraphCache`, keyed by call-site namespace plus each input tensor's shape, strides, dtype, device and `requires_grad`. A new signature is warmed up three times on a side stream, then captured; replay copies inputs into static tensors, calls `replay()` and clones outputs. Signatures that fail capture are recorded in `failures` and use eager execution thereafter. The cache evicts by LRU, with capacity from `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE` (default 8). `get_cuda_graph_stats()` returns capture, replay, fallback and eviction counts."],[3100,"`engine/graph.py` 照搬原版 `tools/cuda_graph.py`：每个“所有者”对象（`net_g`、HuBERT、RMVPE、重采样器……）上挂一个 `_GraphCache`，按调用点命名空间加上每个输入张量的形状、步长、dtype、设备和 `requires_grad` 作键。第一次遇到新签名时在侧流上预热三次再捕获；之后回放时把输入复制进静态张量、`replay()`、克隆输出。捕获失败的签名记入 `failures`，以后直接走 eager。缓存按 LRU 淘汰，容量来自环境变量 `RVC_NEXT_CUDA_GRAPH_MAX_CACHE`（默认 8）。`get_cuda_graph_stats()` 返回捕获、回放、回退、淘汰计数。"],[3406,"`engine/models/{synthesizer,modules,attentions,commons,transforms}.py`"],[9541,"`engine/models/{synthesizer,modules,attentions,commons,transforms}.py`"],[3042,"`engine/runtime.py` 的 `Runtime` 持有设备、dtype、CUDA Graph 开关、分块配置和已加载模型的缓存。服务器进程里只有一个（由核心层的 `ComputeService` 构建），Live worker 子进程和每个训练、分离子进程各建自己的——所以它们的显存彼此独立。"],[3414,"`engine/train/{slicer,losses,mel}.py`"],[9549,"`engine/train/{slicer,losses,mel}.py`"],[3416,"`engine/train/dataset.py`"],[9551,"`engine/train/dataset.py`"],[1984,"`engine`"],[1985,"`engine`"],[8119,"`engine`"],[8120,"`engine`"],[8126,"`engine`, `protocol`, `workers`"],[1991,"`engine`、`protocol`、`workers`"],[9406,"`enumerate_raw()` is the only function importing `sounddevice`: it calls `query_hostapis()`, `query_devices()`, then probes support for 44.1/48/88.2/96 kHz with `check_input_settings`/`check_output_settings`. It runs in the short-lived `workers.devices` subprocess, so re-enumeration does not disturb active streams."],[3271,"`enumerate_raw()` 是唯一导入 `sounddevice` 的函数：`query_hostapis()`、`query_devices()`，并用 `check_input_settings`/`check_output_settings` 探测 44.1/48/88.2/96 kHz 是否支持。它在短命的 `workers.devices` 子进程里运行，所以重新枚举不会扰动正在运行的流。"],[416,"`env`"],[6551,"`env`"],[4043,"`ErrorNotice`"],[10178,"`ErrorNotice`"],[2018,"`events`"],[2513,"`events`"],[8153,"`events`"],[8648,"`events`"],[8887,"`evidence`: highest score ≥ 0.5 with a lead ≥ 0.25 over second place → proposal; `confident` only when the target is a voice in this import and score ≥ 0.8."],[2752,"`evidence`：最高分 ≥ 0.5 且领先第二名 ≥ 0.25 → 提议；只有对象是本次导入的音色且得分 ≥ 0.8 时才 `confident`。"],[2860,"`exact`"],[8995,"`exact`"],[10142,"`ExpansionPanel`, `JobCard`"],[4007,"`ExpansionPanel`、`JobCard`"],[8542,"`EXPECTED_TREE` in `tests/cli/test_cli.py` is a snapshot of this tree; `test_command_tree` compares each level. Adding or removing commands without updating it