h or `<experiment name>/<filename>`. Sample rate, version, pitch guidance and speakers are read first from `experiment.json` or original `config.json` beside the checkpoint (`_checkpoint_context`); the user supplies sample rate only if it cannot be read—the original required users to fill these in manually, producing broken models when incorrect."],[2711,"`extract`：从 G 检查点提取小模型。`checkpoint` 可以是绝对路径或 `<实验名>/<文件名>`。采样率、版本、音高引导与说话人优先从检查点所在文件夹的 `experiment.json` 或原版 `config.json` 读取（`_checkpoint_context`），读不到采样率时才要求用户给出——原版要用户手填这些，填错就得到坏模型。"],[1474,"`f0_method`"],[7609,"`f0_method`"],[3085,"`f0(method)`"],[9220,"`f0(method)`"],[3015,"`f0/`"],[9150,"`f0/`"],[9245,"`f0/base.py` defines the `F0Provider` protocol: `compute(x, p_len)` returns a Hz value every 10 ms (160 samples) for 16 kHz audio, with 0 for unvoiced frames. The original implements pitch shift, unvoiced interpolation and 256-level quantisation separately in the offline pipeline, live engine and training extraction; here each has one implementation:"],[3110,"`f0/base.py` 定义 `F0Provider` 协议：`compute(x, p_len)` 对 16 kHz 音频每 10 ms（160 个采样点）给出一个 Hz 值，清音为 0。原版把移调、清音插值和 256 级量化在离线管线、实时引擎和训练提取里各写了一遍，这里各只有一份："],[9277,"`f0/fcpe.py:FCPEInfer` handles device differences on top of this: on CUDA with CUDA Graph enabled, mel is computed outside the graph, with the network and decoding inside (decoder offset tensors are placed on the device in advance because graph capture forbids host-to-device copies); DirectML lacks the complex STFT used in the mel stage, and `gather` returns incorrect bins, so mel and decoding run on CPU and only the network runs on GPU."],[3142,"`f0/fcpe.py:FCPEInfer` 在此之上处理设备差异：CUDA 且 CUDA Graph 开启时，mel 在图外计算，网络和解码在图内（解码的偏移张量提前放在设备上，因为图捕获禁止主机到设备拷贝）；DirectML 缺少 mel 阶段用的复数 STFT，且 `gather` 返回错误的 bin，所以 mel 和解码在 CPU、只有网络在 GPU。"],[2810,"`f0`"],[2834,"`f0`"],[3343,"`f0`"],[8945,"`f0`"],[8969,"`f0`"],[9478,"`f0`"],[9151,"`F0Provider` interface and shared postprocessing; `pm`, `rmvpe` (including ONNX), `fcpe`,