r generating a root id. Scans read `assets/weights/*.pth`; on the first scan and explicit user rescans (only voices whose indexes remain suggestions, `suggested` true), `importers.suggest_index()` suggests indexes using the original's `get_index_path_from_model` scoring: search `assets/indices` and `logs` for `added` indexes containing the experiment name, favouring matching speakers, standard naming, earlier roots and newer files. Suggestions and subsequent user edits live in `legacy-voices.json` in the data directory. Inference never guesses indexes: the original rescored filenames on every model selection, writing the result into a text field the user may have edited."],[2707,"`paths.legacy_roots` 指向原版 RVC 安装。`add_legacy_root()` 要求目录下有 `assets/`，生成 root id 后立即扫描。扫描读取 `assets/weights/*.pth`，并在第一次扫描、以及用户显式重新扫描时（只针对索引仍是建议、`suggested` 为真的音色）用 `importers.suggest_index()`——原版 `get_index_path_from_model` 的打分：在 `assets/indices` 与 `logs` 下找名字含实验名的 `added` 索引，说话人匹配、标准命名、靠前的根目录、较新的文件优先——为每个音色建议索引。建议与用户之后的修改一起存在数据目录的 `legacy-voices.json`。推理时从不猜测索引：原版每次选模型都按文件名重新打分，结果落在一个用户可能改过的文本框里。"],[1368,"`paths.models_dir`"],[7503,"`paths.models_dir`"],[1376,"`paths.outputs_dir`"],[7511,"`paths.outputs_dir`"],[7428,"`paths`: folders"],[1293,"`paths`：文件夹"],[1468,"`pitch`"],[7603,"`pitch`"],[8891,"`plan()` recalculates on every request, always reflecting the current voice library. A plan is `confident` when: it has actionable contents; every non-`empty` index is `confident`; every YAML has a checkpoint; every D is paired with G. Primary/secondary stems for separation plans are inferred from `target_instrument`; the `vocals`/`other` pair defaults the secondary label to `instrumental`."],[2756,"`plan()` 每次被请求时重新计算，所以总是反映音色库的当前状态。计划 `confident` 的条件：有可执行的内容；每个非 `empty` 索引都 `confident`；每个 YAML 都有检查点；每个 D 都配上了 G。分离计划的主副音轨由 `target_instrument` 推断，`vocals`/`other` 组合的副音轨标签默认 `instrumental`。"],[3120,"`pm`"],[9255,"`pm`"],[5218,"`pm` / `rmvpe` / `fcpe` / `crepe` / `crepe-tiny` / `swift`"],[11353,"`pm` / `rmvpe` / `fcpe` / `crepe` / `crepe-tiny` / `swift`"],[7133,"`pm`, `rmvpe`, `fcpe`, `crepe`, `crepe-tiny` or `swift`"],[7611,"`pm`, `rmvpe`, `fcpe`, `crepe`, `crepe-tiny`, `swift`"],[998,"`pm`、`rmvpe`、`fcpe`、`crepe`、`crepe-tiny` 或 `swift`"],[1476,"`pm`、`rmvpe`、`fcpe`、`crepe`、`crepe-tiny`、`swift`"],[9256,"`PmProvider`: parselmouth `to_pitch_ac`, 10 ms time step, voicing threshold 0.6, 50–1100 Hz, zero-pad both ends to `p_len`"],[3121,"`PmProvider`：parselmouth `to_pitch_ac`，时间步 10 ms，浊音阈值 0.6，50–1100 Hz，两端补零到 `p_len`"],[35,"`port`"],[6170,"`port`"],[1820,"`POST \"\"` → `Job`"],[7955,"`POST \"\"` → `Job`"],[7925,"`POST /convert` and `POST /separate` reject `output_dir`/`overwrite`: writing to arbitrary directories and overwriting files are CLI-only capabilities for trusted local users."],[1790,"`POST /convert` 与 `POST /separate` 拒绝 `output_dir`/`overwrite`：写到任意目录、覆盖文件是命令行（受信任的本机用户）专属的能力。"],[8986,"`POST /live/meter` only extends a 15-second lease (`METER_LEASE`; `on: false` ends it) and returns at once: no request waits for the worker to start or a device to open. A thread of its own (`_meter_loop` / `_sync_meter`) opens the meter whenever the lease holds and Live is idle (stopped or `error`, no **Hear yourself**, no latency measurement): it starts the worker if needed, resolves the saved input against the cached list and sends `Meter(on, input, input_gain_db)`. It wakes on every state change, on a `live.devices` setting change (another input or gain: the worker reopens or only takes the gain) and on `devices_changed`. A `DeviceLost` while idle, or a worker that died, is retried after 1, 2, 5, then 10 s (`METER_RETRY`), at once when the device list changes. So the level shows before the first Start and comes back by itself after a session, a failure or an unplugged microphone. Every device panel shown in the web UI holds a claim (`useMeterClaim`) and the page renews the lease every 5 s while visible; a closed or hidden page lets the microphone go."],[2851,"`POST /live/meter` 只是把一份 15 秒的租约延长（`METER_LEASE`；`on: false` 立即结束）并马上返回：没有请求需要等 worker 启动或设备打开。另有一个线程（`_meter_loop` / `_sync_meter`）在租约有效且实时变声空闲（已停止或 `error`、未开 **监听自己**、不在测量延迟）时打开电平表：必要时启动 worker，用缓存的设备列表解析保存的输入，发送 `Meter(on, input, input_gain_db)`。每次状态变化、`live.devices` 设置变化（换了输入或增益：worker 重开流，或只更新增益）和 `devices_changed` 都会唤醒它。空闲时收到 `DeviceLost`、或 worker 意外退出，按 1、2、5、10 秒重试（`METER_RETRY`），设备列表变化时立即重试。因此第一次开始之前就有电平，会话结束、出错或麦克风重新插上后也会自动恢复。Web 界面里每个显示中的设备面板持有一个占用（`useMeterClaim`），页面可见时每 5 秒续约；页面关闭或隐藏后麦克风会被释放。"],[9384,"`prepare_voice()` calls `remove_weight_norm()` on the voice's `net_g`, matching the original's live loader (folding weight normalisation into weights for faster inference). This modifies the runtime's cached object in place, so `StreamEngine` is used only in the Live worker's own `Runtime`, never the server process's runtime."],[3249,"`prepare_voice()` 对音色的 `net_g` 调用 `remove_weight_norm()`，与原版实时加载器一致（权重归一化折叠进权重，推理更快）。这会就地改变运行时缓存里的对象，所以 `StreamEngine` 只在 Live worker 自己的 `Runtime` 里使用，从不使用服务器进程的运行时。"],[9583,"`PreProcess.slices()` collects tails inside the loop"],[3448,"`PreProcess.slices()` 在循环内收集尾部"],[451,"`preset list`"],[6586,"`preset list`"],[453,"`preset remove`"],[6588,"`preset remove`"],[452,"`preset save`"],[6587,"`preset save`"],[1899,"`presets_changed`"],[2912,"`presets_changed`"],[8034,"`presets_changed`"],[9047,"`presets_changed`"],[1809,"`presets`"],[2054,"`presets`"],[2561,"`presets`"],[2945,"`presets`"],[7944,"`presets`"],[8189,"`presets`"],[8696,"`presets`"],[9080,"`presets`"],[2055,"`PresetService`"],[2562,"`PresetService`"],[2914,"`PresetService`"],[8190,"`PresetService`"],[8697,"`PresetService`"],[9049,"`PresetService`"],[8900,"`PresetService` (`core/presets/`) stores `VoiceParamsModel` (and `StreamParamsModel` for live voice conversion presets). Every voice has exactly one default preset (named `Default`), created by `ensure_default()` from `convert.default_params` when it enters the library; deleting the default immediately recreates one. Selecting a voice anywhere loads its default preset, so the same voice sounds the same in Convert and Live. Presets with empty `model_id` are global; `resolve()` prioritises the voice's own presets when looking up by name. Making a preset default clears the other default flags for that voice in the same transaction."],[2765,"`PresetService`（`core/presets/`）存 `VoiceParamsModel`（以及实时变声预设的 `StreamParamsModel`）。每个音色有且只有一个默认预设（名为 `Default`），在音色入库时由 `ensure_default()` 用 `convert.default_params` 创建；删除默认预设会立刻再建一个。在任何界面选中一个音色都会载入它的默认预设，所以同一音色在转换和实时变声里听起来一样。`model_id` 为空的是全局预设；`resolve()` 按名称查找时音色自己的预设优先。设为默认时同一事务里清掉该音色其他预设的默认标记。"],[2245,"`pretrained-{v1,v2}-{32k,40k,48k}`"],[8380,"`pretrained-{v1,v2}-{32k,40k,48k}`"],[2247,"`pretrained[_v2]/[f0]{G,D}<rate>.pth`"],[8382,"`pretrained[_v2]/[f0]{G,D}<rate>.pth`"],[6386,"`pretrained/`, `pretrained_v2/` (e.g. `f0G40k.pth`, `f0D40k.pth`)"],[251,"`pretrained/`、`pretrained_v2/`（如 `f0G40k.pth`、`f0D40k.pth`）"],[8428,"`pretrained/v1/`, `pretrained/v2/`"],[2293,"`pretrained/v1/`、`pretrained/v2/`"],[2419,"`pretty_exceptions_enable=False`"],[8554,"`pretty_exceptions_enable=False`"],[3244,"`prewarm()`"],[9379,"`prewarm()`"],[9389,"`probe()` (duration, sample rate, channels, codec; counts frames for containers without duration), `decode()` (PyAV + libswresample decode, mix and resample in one pass, with `max_seconds` for previews), `encode()` (soundfile for wav/flac, PyAV transcoding for mp3/m4a; writes `.<name>.part` then renames), `to_int16()`. Falls back to `ffmpeg`/`ffprobe` commands (if on PATH) when PyAV fails. The original's `clean_path` quote/space stripping was removed—paths are already clean here, and any path accepted by the operating system works"],[3254,"`probe()`（时长、采样率、声道、编码；无时长的容器逐帧计数）、`decode()`（PyAV + libswresample 一次完成解码、混音、重采样，`max_seconds` 用于预览）、`encode()`（wav/flac 用 soundfile，mp3/m4a 经 PyAV 转码；先写 `.<name>.part` 再改名）、`to_int16()`。PyAV 失败时退回 `ffmpeg`/`ffprobe` 命令（若在 PATH 上）。原版 `clean_path` 去引号、去空格的处理被删掉——路径到这里已是干净的，任何操作系统接受的路径都可用"],[1480,"`protect`"],[5249,"`protect`"],[5352,"`protect`"],[7615,"`protect`"],[11384,"`protect`"],[11487,"`protect`"],[5248,"`protect` / `zero` / `original`"],[11383,"`protect` / `zero` / `original`"],[1987,"`protocol`"],[1988,"`protocol`"],[8122,"`protocol`"],[8123,"`protocol`"],[10783,"`PulseAudio (on PipeWire 1.x.x)` means PipeWire; `pulseaudio` means PulseAudio. If `pactl` is missing, install `pulseaudio-utils` (Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora) or `libpulse` (Arch); it works with both servers."],[7949,"`PUT uploads`, `GET files/{id}`, `files/{id}/content`, `files/{id}/peaks`, `files/{id}/analysis`, `GET browse`, `POST resolve-path`, `GET path-peaks`"],[1814,"`PUT uploads`、`GET files/{id}`、`files/{id}/content`、`files/{id}/peaks`、`files/{id}/analysis`、`GET browse`、`POST resolve-path`、`GET path-peaks`"],[2771,"`PUT` 原始请求体写入 `uploads/<id>/<name>`（先 `.part`），PyAV 探测后记入 `audio_files`"],[12187,"`py -3.11` is only an example; replace it with any installed version from 3.10 through 3.14. Run all subsequent commands in a terminal with this environment activated."],[6052,"`py -3.11` 只是示例，换成你已安装的 3.10～3.14 中任一版本即可。之后的所有命令都在激活了该环境的终端中执行。"],[3724,"`pydantic>=2.7,<3`"],[9859,"`pydantic>=2.7,<3`"],[253,"`pymss_weights/`"],[6388,"`pymss_weights/`"],[2251,"`pymss_weights/<checkpoint>.ckpt`"],[8386,"`pymss_weights/<checkpoint>.ckpt`"],[3718,"`pymss==2.1.7`"],[9853,"`pymss==2.1.7`"],[3769,"`pyproject.toml` 的 `[tool.pytest.ini_options]` 设置 `testpaths = [\"tests\"]`，并用 `addopts = \"-m 'not live and not golden and not assets'\"` 默认排除三个标记："],[3709,"`pyproject.toml` 的原则是：**下限**是代码需要或某个依赖强制的版本，**上限**停在下一个未经测试的大版本前；torch 例外，不设上限，因为它由用户按硬件先行安装。因为 RVC Next 运行在自己的环境里，上限不会妨碍别人；它防止的是某天 `pip install` 解析出一个从没测过的组合。项目在两端都测试过，测试套件均通过：Python 3.10 上 torch 2.7.1 且其余依赖都取下限，Python 3.12 至 3.14 上 torch 2.11 配 numpy 2.5、librosa 1.0、av 19，以及 Python 3.12 上的 torch 2.13 和 2.14（从构建好的 wheel 安装；下限一端对直接依赖使用 `uv pip install --resolution lowest-direct`）。开发环境（Python 3.11）通过完整检查。"],[9898,"`pytest`, excluding `live`, `golden`, `assets` markers"],[3763,"`pytest`，排除 `live`、`golden`、`assets` 标记"],[9788,"`python -m pytest` (excludes the `live`, `golden` and `assets` markers by default)"],[3653,"`python -m pytest`（默认排除 `live`、`golden`、`assets` 标记）"],[8074,"`python scripts/dev.py typegen` does three things:"],[1939,"`python scripts/dev.py typegen` 做三件事："],[7975,"`RAW_BODY` is added to the schema as `openapi_extra`, declaring `application/octet-stream`, so generated types know these endpoints accept binary data."],[1840,"`RAW_BODY` 作为 `openapi_extra` 写进 schema，声明 `application/octet-stream`，生成的类型因此知道这些端点收二进制。"],[8094,"`read_runtime_file()` checks whether `pid` is alive and treats stale files as absent. The job service also uses it at startup to determine whether another live server owns the data directory (see Core services). In development, `scripts/dev.py dev` starts the API with `--no-open --strict-port` and has Vite proxy to it through `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND` (see Web UI)."],[1959,"`read_runtime_file()` 会检查 `pid` 是否存活，过期的文件视为不存在。任务服务在启动时也借助它判断数据目录是否已被另一个存活的服务器占用（见核心服务）。开发模式下 `scripts/dev.py dev` 以 `--no-open --strict-port` 启动 API，并让 Vite 通过 `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND` 代理过去（见 Web UI）。"],[3831,"`real_assets_dir`"],[9966,"`real_assets_dir`"],[3520,"`realtime_gui.py`"],[9655,"`realtime_gui.py`"],[3238,"`reconfigure(StreamParams)`"],[9373,"`reconfigure(StreamParams)`"],[8080,"`Record` sets `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required=True`: fields with defaults always appear in **responses**, so the schema marks them required instead of generating `?` everywhere."],[1945,"`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required=True`：带默认值的字段在**响应**里总会出现，所以 schema 把它们标为必填，生成的类型不会处处是 `?`。"],[3314,"`ReleaseMemory`"],[9449,"`ReleaseMemory`"],[2206,"`Repository`"],[8341,"`Repository`"],[8794,"`require(ids, what)`: operations needing assets call this **before submitting a job**; missing assets raise `AssetMissingError` (409, exit code 7), with ids in `detail.assets` and bytes still needed in `detail.size`, letting the UI's `AssetGate` offer downloads in place. Jobs check again when running because assets may be deleted while queued."],[2659,"`require(ids, what)`：任何需要资源的操作在**提交任务前**调用，缺失时抛 `AssetMissingError`（409，退出码 7），`detail.assets` 列出资源 id，`detail.size` 给出还需下载的字节数，界面的 `AssetGate` 据此原地提供下载。任务运行时会再检查一次，因为排队期间资源可能被删除。"],[9391,"`resample()`: librosa's default (soxr) resampling, for the post-conversion “resample to” option, matching the original"],[3256,"`resample()`：librosa 默认（soxr）重采样，用于转换后的“重采样到”选项，与原版相同"],[9393,"`Resample`, `sinc_resample_kernel`, `apply_sinc_resample_kernel` ported from torchaudio 2.11, bit-identical (see Parity with the original)"],[9413,"`resolve_selection(selection, device_list, direction)` recovers saved selections in a new list, trying in order: same `device_id` → same physical key and driver → recommended driver for the same physical key → same name on any driver → system default. It returns `exact`, `matched`, `default_fallback` or `missing`, with an explanation for the last two. Core decides whether output fallback is allowed (`allow_output_fallback`), because sending converted audio to speakers instead of a virtual cable is an immediately noticeable error."],[3278,"`resolve_selection(selection, device_list, direction)` 在新列表里找回保存的选择，依次尝试：相同 `device_id` → 相同物理键且同驱动 → 相同物理键的推荐驱动 → 任意驱动上的相同名字 → 系统默认。返回状态 `exact`、`matched`、`default_fallback` 或 `missing`，后两者带一句说明。是否允许输出回退到默认设备是核心层的决定（`allow_output_fallback`），因为把转换后的声音送到扬声器而不是虚拟线缆，是用户最先注意到的错误。"],[4052,"`ResourceRow`"],[10187,"`ResourceRow`"],[4037,"`ResultsList` + `ABCompare`"],[10172,"`ResultsList` + `ABCompare`"],[9154,"`retrieval.py` (load once, top-8 blending), `inspect.py` (read only dimensions and vector count), `build.py` (index stage)"],[3019,"`retrieval.py`（加载一次、top-8 融合）、`inspect.py`（只读维度与向量数）、`build.py`（索引阶段）"],[10114,"`reveal.ts` (`revealDropdown`, `useRevealWhileOpen`): if an inline dropdown (voice picker, device menu) is hidden by the sticky `PageFooter`, scroll the container upward until it is visible, without passing the list's top. `PageFooter` marks itself with `data-page-footer`."],[3979,"`reveal.ts`（`revealDropdown`、`useRevealWhileOpen`）：在原地展开的列表（音色选择器、设备菜单）若被粘性的 `PageFooter` 遮住，就把滚动容器往上滚到露出为止，但不越过列表顶端。`PageFooter` 用 `data-page-footer` 标记自己。"],[8552,"`rich_markup_mode=None`, `rich_help_panel=None`"],[2417,"`rich_markup_mode=None`、`rich_help_panel=None`"],[9421,"`Ring` (`rings.py`) is a single-producer, single-consumer float32 ring buffer; the lock covers only index operations and two slice copies, so the audio callback waits for the processing thread for no longer than one copy. Writing to a full buffer counts as an overrun; reading an empty one as an underrun."],[3286,"`Ring`（`rings.py`）是单生产者单消费者的 float32 环形缓冲，锁只覆盖索引运算和两次切片拷贝，所以音频回调等待处理线程的时间不超过一次拷贝；写满算一次过载，读空算欠载。"],[1483,"`rms_mix_rate`"],[7618,"`rms_mix_rate`"],[2233,"`rmvpe-onnx`"],[8368,"`rmvpe-onnx`"],[8420,"`rmvpe.pt`, `rmvpe.onnx`"],[2285,"`rmvpe.pt`、`rmvpe.onnx`"],[2284,"`rmvpe/`"],[8419,"`rmvpe/`"],[2235,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`"],[8370,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`"],[2231,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`"],[8366,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`"],[6384,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt` (`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx` for DirectML)"],[249,"`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`（DirectML 用 `rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`）"],[1475,"`rmvpe`"],[2229,"`rmvpe`"],[3124,"`rmvpe`"],[5219,"`rmvpe`"],[7610,"`rmvpe`"],[8364,"`rmvpe`"],[9259,"`rmvpe`"],[11354,"`rmvpe`"],[9262,"`rmvpe` (`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`); `rmvpe-onnx` (`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`) on DirectML"],[3127,"`rmvpe`（`rmvpe/rmvpe.pt`）；DirectML 上 `rmvpe-onnx`（`rmvpe/rmvpe.onnx`）"],[9260,"`RmvpeProvider` → `f0/rmvpe.py:RMVPE` (copied), `infer_from_audio(x, thred=0.03)`"],[3125,"`RmvpeProvider` → `f0/rmvpe.py:RMVPE`（照搬），`infer_from_audio(x, thred=0.03)`"],[9275,"`RmvpeProvider` checks the appropriate file for the device and raises `MissingAssetError` with the correct asset id if missing, so the UI offers ONNX or PyTorch weights as appropriate. `RMVPE` uses half precision only on CUDA (already decided by the runtime's GPU rules)."],[3140,"`RmvpeProvider` 根据设备检查对应文件，缺失时抛出带正确资源 id 的 `MissingAssetError`，这样界面提示下载的是 ONNX 还是 PyTorch 权重。`RMVPE` 只在 CUDA 上用半精度（运行时已按 GPU 规则决定）。"],[8354,"`role` (`model`/`index`), `size`, `sha256`, `sources`"],[2219,"`role`（`model`/`index`）、`size`、`sha256`、`sources`"],[1833,"`routers/models.py` 中固定路径（`/catalog`、`/imports`、`/indexes`、`/base`、`/separation`、`/legacy-roots`…）全部写在 `/{voice_id}` 之前。FastAPI 按注册顺序匹配，新增固定路径时必须放在通配路由上面，否则会被当成一个音色 id。`outputs` 的 `POST /zip` 同理。"],[9786,"`ruff check --fix` plus `ruff format`, applying safe fixes and formatting"],[3651,"`ruff check --fix` 加 `ruff format`，应用安全修复并格式化"],[9894,"`ruff check` and `ruff format --check` (`rvc_next`, `tests`, `scripts`)"],[9784,"`ruff check` and `ruff format --check` on `rvc_next`, `tests` and `scripts`, without changing files"],[3759,"`ruff check` 与 `ruff format --check`（`rvc_next`、`tests`、`scripts`）"],[3649,"`ruff check` 和 `ruff format --check`，作用于 `rvc_next`、`tests`、`scripts`，不改文件"],[8931,"`run_files()` is shared by Separate, conversion's preliminary step and training's cleaning stage: all inputs, preset and model specs (built-ins resolved by `engine.separate.presets.resolve()`, imported ones from `SeparationLibrary.spec()`) go into one request, with one `workers.separate` subprocess handling all inputs. Worker `output` events collect stems by source and label, registering them as `stem` outputs when needed. `EXIT_RETRY = 75` means fp16 failed on DirectML; core retries once in fp32, retaining the original's `pymss_webui.py` approach."],[2796,"`run_files()` 是分离页面、转换前置步骤和训练清理阶段共用的入口：把所有输入、预设和模型规格（内置的由 `engine.separate.presets.resolve()` 解析，导入的由 `SeparationLibrary.spec()` 给出）放进一个请求，一个 `workers.separate` 子进程处理全部输入。worker 的 `output` 事件按来源与标签收集音轨，需要时登记为 `stem` 输出。退出码 `EXIT_RETRY = 75` 表示 DirectML 上 fp16 失败，核心层用 fp32 重跑一次——保留原版 `pymss_webui.py` 的做法。"],[8974,"`run()` submits selected stages as **one** `train` job (one step per stage, weighted by `STAGE_WEIGHT`, with `fit` taking the largest share). Only one run per experiment is allowed (`BusyError`); running experiments cannot be edited or deleted. Before submission, `_preflight()` checks: `slice` needs a dataset; `features` needs `hubert`; RMVPE F0 extraction needs `rmvpe`; `fit` needs the selected base model (`fit.base_model`, through `check_fits`) or the matching official `pretrained-<version>-<sample rate>`; `clean` needs its preset's assets."],[2839,"`run()` 把选中的阶段作为**一个** `train` 任务提交（每个阶段一个步骤，进度按 `STAGE_WEIGHT` 加权，`fit` 占大头）。同一实验同时只能有一个运行（`BusyError`）；运行中不能修改或删除实验。提交前 `_preflight()` 检查：`slice` 需要数据集；`features` 需要 `hubert`；RMVPE 提取 F0 需要 `rmvpe`；`fit` 需要所选底模（`fit.base_model`，经 `check_fits`）或对应的官方 `pretrained-<版本>-<采样率>`；`clean` 需要其预设的资源。"],[9595,"`Runtime.index()` caches by path and modification time"],[3460,"`Runtime.index()` 按路径和修改时间缓存"],[3006,"`runtime.py`"],[9141,"`runtime.py`"],[3836,"`Runtime(tiny_assets_dir, device=\"cpu\", precision=\"fp32\")`"],[9971,"`Runtime(tiny_assets_dir, device=\"cpu\", precision=\"fp32\")`"],[9177,"`Runtime` in `engine/runtime.py` holds the device, dtype, CUDA Graph switches, chunk configuration and loaded model caches. The server process has one (built by core's `ComputeService`); the Live worker and each training or separation subprocess build their own, so their GPU memory is independent."],[1317,"`RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[7452,"`RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[7440,"`RVC_NEXT_<GROUP>__<FIELD>` environment variables;"],[1313,"`RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR`"],[7448,"`RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR`"],[6648,"`RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR` or the data directory"],[513,"`RVC_NEXT_CONFIG_DIR` 或数据目录"],[1311,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`"],[7446,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR`"],[6155,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` or the system default"],[6645,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` or the system default location"],[20,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或系统默认位置"],[510,"`RVC_NEXT_DATA_DIR` 或系统默认位置"],[3432,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_CLIP`"],[3791,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_CLIP`"],[9567,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_CLIP`"],[9926,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_CLIP`"],[3426,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_ORIGINAL`"],[3787,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_ORIGINAL`"],[9561,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_ORIGINAL`"],[9922,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_ORIGINAL`"],[3430,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_VOICES`"],[3789,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_VOICES`"],[9565,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_VOICES`"],[9924,"`RVC_NEXT_GOLDEN_VOICES`"],[1315,"`RVC_NEXT_LOG_LEVEL`"],[7450,"`RVC_NEXT_LOG_LEVEL`"],[3428,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`"],[3785,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`"],[9563,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`"],[9920,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`"],[9778,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS` points to the same kind of directory for tests marked `assets` / `golden`; see Tests and checks."],[3643,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS` 是给标记为 `assets` / `golden` 的测试用的同类目录，见测试与检查。"],[9968,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`, skipping when unavailable"],[3833,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`，不可用时跳过"],[9913,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`; the `real_assets_dir` fixture in `conftest.py` reads it and skips if the directory lacks `hubert_base/config.json`"],[3778,"`RVC_NEXT_TEST_ASSETS`；`conftest.py` 的 `real_assets_dir` fixture 读取它，目录中没有 `hubert_base/config.json` 时跳过"],[7885,"`rvc_next.api` is the FastAPI layer: it parses HTTP requests into core `Record` models, calls one core method, and returns the result unchanged; server-to-browser push uses socket.io. It does not import `rvc_next.engine` (the layer rules in Architecture are enforced by `tests/test_architecture.py`) or contain business logic—even the largest router file, `routers/models.py`, is just a series of routes that call the core in one line."],[1750,"`rvc_next.api` 是 FastAPI 一端：把 HTTP 请求解析成核心层的 `Record` 模型，调用一个核心方法，再把结果原样返回；服务器到浏览器的推送走 socket.io。它不导入 `rvc_next.engine`（整体架构中的分层规则由 `tests/test_architecture.py` 守住），也不含业务逻辑——最大的路由文件 `routers/models.py` 也只是一串“一行调用核心”的路由。"],[10281,"`rvc_next.core`: jobs, GPU memory management, assets, voice library and imports, audio files, conversion, separation, training, live voice conversion, settings, events and database"],[4146,"`rvc_next.core`：任务、显存管理、资源、音色库与导入、音频文件、转换、分离、训练、实时变声、设置、事件、数据库"],[10279,"`rvc_next.engine`: runtime and GPU rules, HuBERT, F0, indexes, models and checkpoints, offline conversion, streaming engine, audio I/O, vocal separation and training stages"],[4144,"`rvc_next.engine`：运行时与 GPU 规则、HuBERT、F0、索引、模型与检查点、离线转换、流式引擎、音频 I/O、人声分离、训练阶段"],[8337,"`rvc_next/core/assets/catalog.json` is distributed as package data (`package-data` in `pyproject.toml`), read by `core/assets/service.py:load_catalog()`, and validated into records from `core/assets/models.py`. It has three top-level keys:"],[2202,"`rvc_next/core/assets/catalog.json` 作为包数据随包分发（`pyproject.toml` 的 `package-data`），由 `core/assets/service.py:load_catalog()` 读入并校验成 `core/assets/models.py` 里的记录。顶层有三个键："],[9131,"`rvc_next/engine/` contains all machine learning and digital signal processing code: device selection, model caches, HuBERT features, F0 extraction, retrieval indexes, synthesizer networks, offline conversion, streaming conversion, audio codecs, real-time audio devices, vocal separation and every training stage. It knows nothing about the application—it imports neither `rvc_next.core/api/cli/workers`, pydantic nor any Web/CLI framework (enforced by `tests/test_architecture.py`; see Architecture). Core, worker subprocesses and tests are simply its callers."],[2996,"`rvc_next/engine/` 是全部机器学习与数字信号处理代码：设备选择、模型缓存、HuBERT 特征、F0 提取、检索索引、合成器网络、离线转换、流式转换、音频编解码、实时音频设备、人声分离和训练的每个阶段。它不知道应用的存在——不导入 `rvc_next.core/api/cli/workers`，不导入 pydantic 或任何 Web/命令行框架（由 `tests/test_architecture.py` 守住，见整体架构）。核心层、worker 子进程和测试都只是它的调用者。"],[10003,"`rvc_next/webui` uses vitest (`happy-dom`) and `@vue/test-utils`, run with `bun run test`; `bun run typecheck` runs `vue-tsc`. `src/test/setup.ts` supplies the `attachInternals` missing from happy-dom (required by `@material/web`); `src/test/motion-zero.css` sets every motion duration to 0 for fast, deterministic motion tests."],[3868,"`rvc_next/webui` 用 vitest（`happy-dom` 环境）和 `@vue/test-utils`，`bun run test` 运行，`bun run typecheck` 做 `vue-tsc` 类型检查。`src/test/setup.ts` 补上 happy-dom 缺少的 `attachInternals`（`@material/web` 需要它），`src/test/motion-zero.css` 把所有动效时长设为 0，让动效测试快速且确定。"],[9504,"`rvc_next` logger output becomes `log` events; `SIGTERM` exits with 130 (`EXIT_CANCELLED`)."],[3369,"`rvc_next` 日志记录器的输出转成 `log` 事件；`SIGTERM` 以退出码 130（`EXIT_CANCELLED`）结束。"],[1427,"`rvc-model`"],[7562,"`rvc-model`"],[8395,"`rvc-model` (default)"],[6872,"`rvc-model` or `official` (saved to settings)"],[737,"`rvc-model` 或 `official`（保存到设置）"],[2260,"`rvc-model`（默认）"],[1426,"`rvc-model`/`official`"],[7561,"`rvc-model`/`official`"],[7817,"`rvc-next config set` writes directly to `settings.toml`. A running server picks up the change within about 1 second, and open Web UI sessions refresh accordingly. Subsequent saves from the Web UI merge with the file's current contents without overwriting command-line changes. A few settings (such as the port and listening address) still require a server restart."],[1682,"`rvc-next config set` 直接写 `settings.toml`。正在运行的服务器会在约 1 秒内读到改动，打开的 Web UI 也会随之刷新；之后在 Web UI 保存设置时，会在文件当前内容的基础上合并，不会冲掉命令行的改动。少数设置（如端口、监听地址）仍需重启服务器才会生效。"],[3525,"`rvc-next convert`"],[9660,"`rvc-next convert`"],[11549,"`rvc-next convert` starts from the voice's default preset. Use `--preset <name>` to select another preset, then override individual values with options such as `--pitch`."],[5414,"`rvc-next convert` 默认从音色的默认预设出发，`--preset <名称>` 改用其他预设，再用 `--pitch` 等选项单独覆盖。"],[7443,"`rvc-next env` lists the environment variables rvc-next reads, along with currently set `RVC_NEXT_*` variables:"],[1308,"`rvc-next env` 列出 rvc-next 读取的环境变量，以及当前已设置的 `RVC_NEXT_*` 变量："],[803,"`rvc-next model catalog` 中的音色 id"],[8087,"`rvc-next webui` (`cli/commands/webui.py`) runs in this order:"],[4192,"`rvc-next webui` 的常用选项："],[1952,"`rvc-next webui`（`cli/commands/webui.py`）的顺序："],[2023,"`rvc-next.db`"],[4224,"`rvc-next.db`"],[8158,"`rvc-next.db`"],[10359,"`rvc-next.db`"],[1675,"`rvc-next` 命令行与 Web UI 做的是同一套事情：转换、人声分离、训练、实时变声、模型与资源管理、预设、任务查询和设置。两者调用的是同一个核心服务（每个操作对应一个核心方法），所以命令行能做的事与界面一致，`--json` 的输出也与 API 返回的 JSON 完全相同。"],[2388,"`rvc-next` 命令行是核心层上的一层薄壳：每个命令解析参数、调用一个核心方法、把结果打印成表格或 JSON。本页讲它是怎样组织的，以及新增命令时要遵守的规则。每个命令的选项说明见命令参考，设置与环境变量见配置与环境变量。"],[6128,"`rvc-next` 的所有命令、配置文件和环境变量"],[8294,"`RvcNextError` (base class)"],[2159,"`RvcNextError`（基类）"],[3532,"`RVCRealtimeVST/`"],[9667,"`RVCRealtimeVST/`"],[9775,"`scripts/build_wheel.py` calls `python -m build`"],[3640,"`scripts/build_wheel.py` 调用 `python -m build`"],[3610,"`scripts/dev.py`"],[9745,"`scripts/dev.py`"],[10075,"`scripts/dev.py` checks `PATH` first, then `~/.bun/bin`"],[9779,"`scripts/dev.py` is a task runner using only the standard library. The project uses it instead of a Makefile because development and installation on Windows are as common as on Linux, and Windows has no `make`. Tool configuration lives in `pyproject.toml`; `dev.py` only invokes the tools as CI does. Running it without arguments lists all tasks."],[3940,"`scripts/dev.py` 先在 `PATH` 上找，再去 `~/.bun/bin` 找"],[3644,"`scripts/dev.py` 是只依赖标准库的任务运行器。不用 Makefile，是因为项目在 Windows 上开发和安装的机会与 Linux 一样多，而 Windows 上没有 `make`。工具的配置都在 `pyproject.toml` 里，`dev.py` 只负责按 CI 的方式调用它们。不带参数运行会列出全部任务。"],[9557,"`scripts/golden.py` adds the original checkout to `sys.path`, importing only `infer.hubert`, `infer.vc.pipeline`, and `infer.module.models` (no interfaces), and builds `Pipeline` with the original CPU chunking parameters (`x_pad/x_query/x_center/x_max = 1/6/38/41`); rvc-next uses `Runtime(device=\"cpu\", precision=\"fp32\")` and `OfflineConverter`. Each (voice, clip, F0 method) produces one line: RMS sample difference (on a −1..1 scale) and whether the output is bit-identical. Exceeding `TOLERANCE = 1e-4` gives exit code 1. Without `--f0`, only `pm` and `rmvpe` are compared."],[3422,"`scripts/golden.py` 把原版 checkout 放到 `sys.path` 上，只导入 `infer.hubert`、`infer.vc.pipeline` 和 `infer.module.models`（不加载任何界面），用原版的 CPU 分块参数（`x_pad/x_query/x_center/x_max = 1/6/38/41`）构造 `Pipeline`；rvc-next 一侧用 `Runtime(device=\"cpu\", precision=\"fp32\")` 和 `OfflineConverter`。每个 (音色, 片段, F0 方法) 输出一行：样本差的 RMS（−1..1 刻度）以及是否逐位相同。容差 `TOLERANCE = 1e-4`，超出则退出码 1。不给 `