ckend` 用 PortAudio（`latency=\"low\"`，WASAPI 经 `WasapiSettings`：选了独占就独占，否则共享模式加 `auto_convert`，由 Windows 转换声道数和采样率——PortAudio 自己只做单声道 ↔ 立体声的转换）；`enable_asio` 设置 `SD_ENABLE_ASIO=1`，选用 sounddevice 0.5.1 起在 Windows 上附带的 ASIO 版 PortAudio。`fake.py:FakeBackend` 模拟设备：每个流一个线程按设备自己的时钟（`1 + ppm·1e-6` 倍标称速率）调用回调，`lose(index)` 模拟拔出 USB 设备，`refuse` 让打开失败，输出被录下来供断言。测试和 worker 请求里的 `backend: \"fake\"` 都走它（`backend_from_request`）。`tone.py:chime()` 是“测试”按钮播放的提示音。"],[1436,"`source` 为 `custom` 时使用的地址"],[8085,"`SPAStaticFiles` sends `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable` for files under `assets/` (Vite filenames contain content hashes and can be cached permanently); other files (mainly `index.html`) get `no-cache`, so browsers fetch the new entry point after upgrades."],[1950,"`SPAStaticFiles` 对 `assets/` 下的文件发 `Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable`（Vite 产物文件名含内容哈希，可以永久缓存），其余文件（主要是 `index.html`）发 `no-cache`，保证升级后浏览器拿到新的入口。"],[1465,"`speaker_id`"],[7600,"`speaker_id`"],[4083,"`src/` 内的模块只经 `@/` 别名互相导入，没有相对路径"],[10210,"`src/i18n/index.ts` is a small implementation: nested message objects, `t(key, params)` (`{name}` placeholders), fallback to English, then to the key; `tOr(key, fallback)` handles keys built from server values (error codes, stage IDs), showing a readable fallback when no message exists. Languages are `en` and `zh-CN`; with `auto`, `detectLocale()` chooses by browser language (any `zh`/`zh-*` maps to `zh-CN`) and responds to `languagechange`."],[4075,"`src/i18n/index.ts` 是一个很小的实现：嵌套的消息对象、`t(key, params)`（`{name}` 占位）、缺失时回落英文、再回落键名；`tOr(key, fallback)` 用于由服务器值拼出的键（错误码、阶段 id），没有对应消息时显示可读的回退。语言有 `en` 与 `zh-CN` 两种，偏好为 `auto` 时由 `detectLocale()` 按浏览器语言决定（任何 `zh`/`zh-*` 都映射到 `zh-CN`），并响应 `languagechange`。"],[10209,"`src/layout.test.ts` checks these rules by reading styles from source files (with explicit file and selector lists). Add new name-bearing rows or section pages to the corresponding list."],[4086,"`src/theme/` 之外的样式与模板中没有十六进制颜色"],[10108,"`src/ui/` is the only place that imports `@material/web` and `@lucide/vue` (with additional test patches in `test/setup.ts`); views and feature components import only from `@/ui` (`ui/index.ts`). This layer isolates risk: `@material/web` no longer adds components, so if one fails in a browser, it can be replaced in `ui/` without changing application code. Icons are re-exported through `ui/icons.ts` and rendered with `<AppIcon :icon=\"icons.X\" />`."],[3973,"`src/ui/` 是唯一导入 `@material/web` 与 `@lucide/vue` 的地方（另有 `test/setup.ts` 为测试打补丁），视图和业务组件只从 `@/ui` 导入（`ui/index.ts`）。这一层的意义在于隔离风险：`@material/web` 已不再新增组件，若它在某个浏览器上出问题，可以在 `ui/` 里逐个替换，而应用代码不变。图标经 `ui/icons.ts` 重新导出，用 `<AppIcon :icon=\"icons.X\" />` 渲染。"],[8196,"`start_background` controls whether background threads start:"],[2061,"`start_background` 决定后台线程是否启动："],[6148,"`start()` runs the server on a background thread and returns the web UI's address; `run()` serves in the foreground until `Ctrl+C`. The object is also a context manager:"],[9017,"`start()` saves devices, stream parameters, `last_voice`, `last_params` to settings (the `live` group), so **Start** without arguments restores the last session; `rvc-next live run` reads the same values. Devices belong to the server machine, so they live in settings rather than browser client state."],[8004,"`start()` subscribes to the event bus. `LocalEventBus` calls handlers synchronously on the publisher thread, usually a job thread or a thread reading worker output, so the handler only does one thing: `loop.call_soon_threadsafe(queue.put_nowait, event)`, handing the event to the event loop. A background task `_pump()` then calls `emit` for each event; serialization failures for individual events are only logged."],[13,"`start()` 在后台线程里运行服务端，返回网页界面的地址；`run()` 则在前台运行，直到 `Ctrl+C`。对象也可以当作上下文管理器使用："],[2882,"`start()` 把设备、流参数、`last_voice`、`last_params` 写回设置（`live` 组），所以不带参数的 **Start** 恢复上一次会话，`rvc-next live run` 读的也是同样的值。设备属于服务器所在的机器，因此放在设置里而不是浏览器的客户端状态里。"],[1869,"`start()` 订阅事件总线。`LocalEventBus` 在发布者线程上同步调用处理函数，而发布者多半是任务线程或 worker 输出的读取线程，所以处理函数只做一件事：`loop.call_soon_threadsafe(queue.put_nowait, event)`，把事件交给事件循环。一个后台任务 `_pump()` 再逐个 `emit`，单个事件序列化失败只记日志。"],[3296,"`Start(config)`"],[9431,"`Start(config)`"],[8983,"`start`, `update_voice`, `update_stream`, `set_voice`, `set_devices` perform “read state → send message → write state” under `_control`, because switching a voice and resetting its speaker are two consecutive messages that must not interleave with another request."],[2848,"`start`、`update_voice`、`update_stream`、`set_voice`、`set_devices` 都在 `_control` 锁里执行「读状态 → 发消息 → 写回状态」，因为切换音色及其引起的说话人重置是两条紧挨着的消息，不能与另一个请求交错。"],[1916,"`state: LiveState`"],[8051,"`state: LiveState`"],[3318,"`State`"],[9453,"`State`"],[9454,"`state`, `error` (`{code, message, detail}`), `topology`, `sample_rate`, `meter`, `passthrough`, `cached` (models loaded in the worker runtime, for “Free GPU memory”), `voice_path`"],[3319,"`state`、`error`（`{code, message, detail}`）、`topology`、`sample_rate`、`meter`、`passthrough`、`cached`（worker 运行时里加载的模型，用于“释放显存”）、`voice_path`"],[1920,"`stats: LiveStats`"],[8055,"`stats: LiveStats`"],[3320,"`Stats`"],[9455,"`Stats`"],[6149,"`stop()` may be called more than once; it closes the server, the live voice changing process and the database, and frees the port. `import rvc_next` loads neither torch nor FastAPI; the server is loaded only when `RvcNextServer` is used."],[14,"`stop()` 可以重复调用，会关闭服务端、实时变声的子进程和数据库，并释放端口。`import rvc_next` 不会加载 torch 或 FastAPI，只有用到 `RvcNextServer` 时才加载服务端。"],[3298,"`Stop` / `Shutdown`"],[9433,"`Stop` / `Shutdown`"],[10238,"`stores/jobs.test.ts`, `stores/preferences.test.ts`, `audio/player.test.ts`, `api/baseUrl.test.ts`, `devProxy.test.ts`"],[4103,"`stores/jobs.test.ts`、`stores/preferences.test.ts`、`audio/player.test.ts`、`api/baseUrl.test.ts`、`devProxy.test.ts`"],[3027,"`stream/`"],[9162,"`stream/`"],[3207,"`stream/engine.py` 的 `StreamEngine` 是“一块进、一块出、没有 I/O”的实时转换器。数学来自原版 `infer/rtrvc.py`（`RVC.infer`）和 `realtime_gui.py` 的 `start_vc`、`audio_callback`；原版这套 DSP 链在 GUI 回调、`rtrvc` 和 VST worker 里有三份拷贝，这里合为一个类。`process()` 是同步的、只接受普通数组，所以它可以由 PortAudio 会话驱动、由测试拿 WAV 驱动，也可以在将来由 VST 适配器或浏览器传输驱动。"],[9385,"`stream/latency.py:estimate_latency_ms()` extends the original's display formula (output latency + block + crossfade + 10 ms, plus the input denoising term `min(crossfade, 40 ms)`): it also adds one block prefilled in the output ring buffer, one block of target ring-buffer fill for split streams, and input device latency. Measured inference time is reported separately in statistics (`infer_ms_p50/p95`)."],[3250,"`stream/latency.py:estimate_latency_ms()` 是原版显示公式（输出延迟 + 块 + 交叉淡化 + 10 ms，加上输入降噪项 `min(crossfade, 40 ms)`）的扩展：再加上输出环形缓冲预填充的一块、分离流时环形缓冲的目标填充一块，以及输入设备延迟。实测的推理耗时另外在统计里报告（`infer_ms_p50/p95`）。"],[9342,"`StreamEngine` in `stream/engine.py` is a live converter with “one block in, one block out, no I/O”. Its maths comes from the original's `infer/rtrvc.py` (`RVC.infer`) and `start_vc`, `audio_callback` in `realtime_gui.py`; the original has three copies of this DSP chain in the GUI callback, `rtrvc` and VST worker, now combined in one class. `process()` is synchronous and accepts only plain arrays, so it can be driven by a PortAudio session, tests using WAV files, or a future VST adapter or browser transport."],[9163,"`StreamParams`, `StreamEngine`, latency estimation"],[3028,"`StreamParams`、`StreamEngine`、延迟估算"],[4028,"`StreamParamsPanel`"],[10163,"`StreamParamsPanel`"],[37,"`strict_port`"],[6172,"`strict_port`"],[9296,"`summarize()` describes a small model or G checkpoint without constructing a network; `inspect_checkpoint()` identifies any `.pth` by content for import sessions, never raising for a readable file:"],[3161,"`summarize()` 不建网络就能描述一个小模型或 G 检查点；`inspect_checkpoint()` 则按内容识别任意 `.pth`，供导入会话使用，读得出来的文件从不抛异常："],[3136,"`swift`"],[9271,"`swift`"],[9272,"`SwiftProvider` → `f0/swift_model.py` (SwiftF0 0.3.0), Applio's subharmonic repair, 16 ms frames interpolated in log frequency to 10 ms, voiced at confidence ≥ 0.5"],[3137,"`SwiftProvider` → `f0/swift_model.py`（SwiftF0 0.3.0），Applio 的次谐波修复，16 ms 帧按对数频率插值到 10 ms，置信度 ≥ 0.5 为浊音"],[8502,"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`, `hubert_inputs.pth` (sample inputs for ONNX export), `logs/mute/*.spec.pt` (spectrogram caches generated by the training loader)"],[2367,"`Synthesizer_inputs.pth`、`hubert_inputs.pth`（导出 ONNX 用的样例输入）、`logs/mute/*.spec.pt`（训练加载器生成的频谱缓存）"],[3152,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid_nono`"],[9287,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid_nono`"],[3151,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid`"],[9286,"`SynthesizerTrnMs256NSFsid`"],[3155,"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid_nono`"],[9290,"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid_nono`"],[3154,"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid`"],[9289,"`SynthesizerTrnMs768NSFsid`"],[2700,"`temporary`"],[8835,"`temporary`"],[8560,"`test_debug_everywhere` covers all three positions."],[2425,"`test_debug_everywhere` 覆盖这三种位置。"],[9569,"`test_offline_golden.py`: runs `pm`, `rmvpe`, and `fcpe` for each voice through `scripts/golden.py`, with pitch shift 2 and speaker 1; all must be within 1e-4 **and bit-identical**. The original's FCPE depends on torchfcpe, so the test uses `importorskip(\"torchfcpe\")`—torchfcpe must be installed in the test environment for the original side; rvc-next itself does not depend on it."],[3434,"`test_offline_golden.py`：通过 `scripts/golden.py` 对每个音色跑 `pm`、`rmvpe`、`fcpe`，移调 2、说话人 1；要求全部在 1e-4 以内**且逐位相同**。原版的 FCPE 依赖 torchfcpe，所以测试 `importorskip(\"torchfcpe\")`——torchfcpe 要装在运行测试的环境里，供原版一侧使用，rvc-next 自己不依赖它。"],[9570,"`test_stream_golden.py`: the original `start_vc`/`audio_callback` live in the GUI's `__main__` block and cannot be imported, so the test has a GUI-free copy (`OriginalStream`) driving the original `rtrvc.RVC`; rvc-next uses `StreamEngine`. Compare each voice block by block (up to 12 blocks), with the same seed before each block. Three parameter sets cover 48k/40k, RMVPE/pm, pitch shifts, formant 1.0, input/output denoising, and thresholds. The original live code imports torchaudio, so the test uses `importorskip(\"torchaudio\")`."],[3435,"`test_stream_golden.py`：原版的 `start_vc`/`audio_callback` 写在 GUI 的 `__main__` 块里无法导入，测试里有一份去掉 GUI 的拷贝（`OriginalStream`），驱动原版的 `rtrvc.RVC`；rvc-next 一侧是 `StreamEngine`。对每个音色逐块（最多 12 块）比较，每块前用相同种子。三组参数覆盖 48k/40k、RMVPE/pm、移调、共振峰 1.0、输入输出降噪和门限。原版实时代码导入 torchaudio，所以测试 `importorskip(\"torchaudio\")`。"],[3652,"`test-py`"],[3762,"`test-py`"],[9787,"`test-py`"],[9897,"`test-py`"],[9814,"`test-py`, `test-web` plus `test-site`"],[3679,"`test-py`、`test-web` 加 `test-site`"],[3676,"`test-site`"],[9811,"`test-site`"],[3664,"`test-web`"],[3764,"`test-web`"],[9799,"`test-web`"],[9899,"`test-web`"],[10240,"`test/setup.ts` patches `HTMLElement` with `attachInternals`: happy-dom lacks `ElementInternals`, but `@material/web` form-associated elements (buttons, fields) call it during creation. Component tests mount with `@vue/test-utils`, mocking queries and stores as needed."],[4105,"`test/setup.ts` 为 `HTMLElement` 补上 `attachInternals`：happy-dom 没有 `ElementInternals`，而 `@material/web` 的表单关联元素（按钮、输入框）在创建时就会调用它。组件测试用 `@vue/test-utils` 挂载，查询与 store 按需模拟。"],[3678,"`test`"],[9813,"`test`"],[2407,"`tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE` 是这棵树的快照，`test_command_tree` 逐层比较。增删命令而不更新快照，测试就会失败，这是有意的：命令行是对外接口，改动它应当是显式的决定。"],[9959,"`tests/conftest.py` provides:"],[3824,"`tests/conftest.py` 提供："],[9646,"`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py`: mel and F0 are bit-identical to torchfcpe with both `argmax` and `local_argmax` decoding (unvoiced frames are NaN on both sides); bundled weights match those shipped with torchfcpe"],[3511,"`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py`：mel 与 F0 在 `argmax` 和 `local_argmax` 两种解码下与 torchfcpe 逐位相同（清音帧两边都是 NaN）；内置权重与 torchfcpe 附带的一致"],[3623,"`tests/engine/test_sinc_resample.py`、`tests/engine/test_fcpe_model.py` 里与原库逐位比较的用例；"],[9642,"`tests/engine/test_sinc_resample.py`: kernels and outputs satisfy `torch.equal` against torchaudio at rate pairs rvc-next actually uses (48000→16000, 44100→16000, 40000→48000, 471→400, 504→480, etc.); Kais