dding two silent sample rows per speaker. Silent samples are packaged (`engine/train/data/mute/`, same contents as the original's `mute.zip`) and copied to `<experiment>/mute/`, because the data loader caches `.spec.pt` alongside them."],[3360,"`train/filelist.py` 像原版 `run_train_model` 那样写 `filelist.txt`（`gt.wav|feature.npy|f0.npy|f0nsf.npy|speaker_id`，无音高时去掉两列，多说话人时追加 `|speaker_name`），按说话人的重复次数重复行，并为每个说话人加两行静音样本。静音样本随包分发（`engine/train/data/mute/`，内容与原版的 `mute.zip` 相同），复制到 `<实验>/mute/`，因为数据加载器会在旁边缓存 `.spec.pt`。"],[9500,"`train/fingerprint.py:of_paths(paths, extra)` hashes relative names, sizes and modification times of the given files and directories (recursively) with SHA-1, mixing in `extra` (settings determining output, such as sample rate and F0 method) as text; missing paths hash differently from empty folders. It reads metadata rather than contents, so even multi-GB datasets are instant. It has two users: the index stage uses it to decide whether to rebuild (see “Retrieval indexes” above); core records a fingerprint for each completed stage in `experiment.json`. “Run all” compares each stored fingerprint with a freshly computed one and reruns a stage whose fingerprint changed, together with every stage after it; settings edits and upstream reruns also mark stages stale explicitly (see Core services)."],[3365,"`train/fingerprint.py:of_paths(paths, extra)` 对给定文件和文件夹（递归）的相对名字、大小、修改时间做 SHA-1，`extra`（采样率、F0 方法等决定输出的设置）以文本混入；缺失的路径与空文件夹哈希不同。只看元数据而不读内容，所以对几 GB 的数据集也是瞬间完成。它有两个用户：索引阶段用它决定是否重建（见上文“检索索引”）；核心层在 `experiment.json` 里为每个完成的阶段记下指纹。“全部运行”会把存储的指纹与重新计算的指纹比较，不一致的阶段及其后各阶段都重跑；设置修改和上游重跑另外会显式标记过期（见核心服务）。"],[3352,"`train/loop.py:run(TrainRequest)`"],[9487,"`train/loop.py:run(TrainRequest)`"],[3340,"`train/preprocess.py:run(SliceRequest)`"],[9475,"`train/preprocess.py:run(SliceRequest)`"],[3447,"`train/preprocess.py` 里最后的 `norm_write(tmp_audio…)` 在 `for audio in self.slicer.slice(audio)` 循环之外，只写最后一段的尾部（`81eed5e` 引入的回归，`5d47da1` 时在循环内）"],[9590,"`train/train_index.py` skip