ys with `None` values are omitted when saving."],[2171,"`update()` 深度合并补丁、校验、原子写入（先写 `.toml.tmp` 再替换），然后通知监听者，长驻服务因此不用重启就能跟上设置变化。TOML 没有 null，保存时剔除值为 `None` 的键。"],[9024,"`update(patch)` deep-merges into the **file layer** (merge dictionaries, replace other values, `None` clears optional values), validates the file layer then effective values, writes atomically (`.toml.tmp` → `replace`), omits `None` before saving because TOML has no null, then calls listeners synchronously (`ComputeService` uses this to rebuild the runtime). `mutate(fn)` makes arbitrary edits to the file-layer dictionary and saves (used for legacy directory additions/removals). `set_value()` serves `config set`, allowing only existing keys (dictionary groups may add keys)."],[2889,"`update(patch)` 深合并进**文件层**（字典合并，其他值替换，`None` 清除可选值），先校验文件层、再校验生效值，原子写入（`.toml.tmp` → `replace`），TOML 没有 null 所以保存前去掉 `None`，最后同步调用监听器（`ComputeService` 借此重建运行时）。`mutate(fn)` 在文件层字典上做任意修改后保存（旧版目录的增删用它）。`set_value()` 供 `config set` 使用，只允许已有的键（字典型分组内可新增键）。"],[3236,"`update(VoiceParams)`"],[9371,"`update(VoiceParams)`"],[3302,"`UpdateStream(stream)`"],[9437,"`UpdateStream(stream)`"],[3300,"`UpdateVoice(params)`"],[9435,"`UpdateVoice(params)`"],[2770,"`upload`"],[8905,"`upload`"],[8407,"`urls()` lists every URL in the order tried: the chosen source first, then the other public ones (whichever of `huggingface`, `hf-mirror`, `modelscope` is not chosen); at each source the chosen repository first, then the others that host the file. A URL that answers 404/401/403/410, states another size (from `Content-Length` or `Content-Range`, before downloading), gives a wrong checksum, or stays unreachable after 4 retries gives way to the next, and the job log says “…; trying the next source”. When every URL fails, the job ends with `RvcNextError`, the last reasons in `detail.errors`."],[2272,"`urls()` 给出按顺序尝试的全部地址：先是所选的下载源，再是其余公共下载源（`huggingface`、`hf-mirror`、`modelscope` 中未选的那些）；在每个下载源上先试所选仓库，再试其他收录该文件的仓库。某个地址返回 404/401/403/410、声明的大小不对（下载前由 `Content-Length` 或 `Content-Range` 判断）、校验和不符，或重试 4 次后仍连不上，就换下一个地址，任务日志里写「…; trying the next source」。所有地址都失败时任务以 `RvcNextError` 结束，`detail.errors` 列出最后几次的原因。"],[1928,"`usage: ComputeUsage`"],[8063,"`usage: ComputeUsage`"],[10115,"`useSnackbar`: a global queue, showing one message at a time."],[3980,"`useSnackbar`：全局队列，一次显示一条。"],[9776,"`uv pip install --group build` (outside the `dev` group; needed only for packaging)"],[3641,"`uv pip install --group build`（不在 `dev` 组里，只有打包时需要）"],[8582,"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` serves on the socket just bound; on exit, delete `server.json` and close services."],[2447,"`uvicorn.Server(...).run(sockets=[sock])` 在刚才绑定的套接字上服务；退出时删除 `server.json` 并关闭服务。"],[7011,"`v1` or `v2`"],[7127,"`v1` or `v2`"],[876,"`v1` 或 `v2`"],[992,"`v1` 或 `v2`"],[1508,"`v1`/`v2`"],[7643,"`v1`/`v2`"],[1509,"`v2`"],[7644,"`v2`"],[8923,"`validate()` (before submission): speaker in range, assets present, separation preset available, `remix` requires `separate`."],[2788,"`validate()`（提交前）：说话人在范围内、资源齐全、分离预设可用、`remix` 必须配 `separate`。"],[2134,"`ValidationError`"],[8269,"`ValidationError`"],[712,"`VALUE`"],[6847,"`VALUE`"],[8460,"`verified` is `True` (all verified), `False` (a failure), or `None` (some files not yet verified). `is_installed()` also counts `corrupt` as installed—the user may have replaced files with another version, so the UI warns rather than blocks use."],[2325,"`verified` 为 `True`（全部校验通过）、`False`（有失败）或 `None`（有文件尚未校验）。`is_installed()` 把 `corrupt` 也算作已安装——文件可能只是被用户换成了别的版本，由界面提示而不是阻止使用。"],[415,"`version`"],[6550,"`version`"],[9025,"`view()` returns `SettingsView`: replaces `access_token` with `access_token_configured`, keeping the token on the server; also includes `resolved_paths`."],[2890,"`view()` 返回 `SettingsView`：`access_token` 换成 `access_token_configured`，令牌永不离开服务器；另附 `resolved_paths`。"],[10079,"`vite.config.ts` also declares tags starting with `md-` as custom elements, maps the `@` alias to `src/`, and inlines `@material/material-color-utilities` in tests (version 0.4.0 has an extensionless import that plain Node cannot resolve)."],[10078,"`vite.config.ts` proxies `/api`, `/openapi.json`, and `/ws` (WebSocket) to `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND` (default `http://127.0.0.1:7868`), so the browser sees only Vite's origin and needs no CORS. During development, the API process is often restarted after Python changes (it does not reload automatically; restart it manually), and the socket reconnects every few seconds. For backend-unavailable errors such as `ECONNREFUSED` and `ECONNRESET`, the proxy prints one throttled message (at most every 5 seconds) and returns 502 JSON (`code: \"api_unreachable\"`) for HTTP requests instead of leaving the browser waiting. Other errors are printed in full as usual. `isExpectedProxyError` is tested by `devProxy.test.ts`."],[3943,"`vite.config.ts` 把 `/api`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/ws`（WebSocket）代理到 `RVC_NEXT_BACKEND`（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:7868`），浏览器只面对 Vite 一个源，不需要 CORS。开发时 API 进程随 Python 改动频繁重启（它不会自动重载，需要手动重启），socket 每隔几秒重连一次；代理对 `ECONNREFUSED`、`ECONNRESET` 等“后端没起来”的错误只打印一行节流过的提示（最多每 5 秒一次），并给 HTTP 请求回一个 502 JSON（`code: \"api_unreachable\"`），而不是让浏览器一直等。其他错误照常完整打印。`isExpectedProxyError` 由 `devProxy.test.ts` 测试。"],[3944,"`vite.config.ts` 还把以 `md-` 开头的标签声明为自定义元素，设置 `@` 别名指向 `src/`，并在测试中内联 `@material/material-color-utilities`（它的 0.4.0 版有一处不带扩展名的导入，纯 Node 无法解析）。"],[9900,"`vitest run` and `vue-tsc --noEmit`"],[3765,"`vitest run` 与 `vue-tsc --noEmit`"],[5477,"`vocals-aggressive`"],[11612,"`vocals-aggressive`"],[5497,"`vocals-clean`"],[11632,"`vocals-clean`"],[1492,"`vocals`"],[5472,"`vocals`"],[5509,"`vocals`"],[7627,"`vocals`"],[11607,"`vocals`"],[11644,"`vocals`"],[11824,"`vocals` (Vocals)"],[11609,"`vocals`, `instrumental`"],[11614,"`vocals`, `instrumental`"],[11634,"`vocals`, `instrumental`, `reverb`"],[5474,"`vocals`、`instrumental`"],[5479,"`vocals`、`instrumental`"],[5499,"`vocals`、`instrumental`、`reverb`"],[5689,"`vocals`（Vocals）"],[8462,"`voice_catalog()` (`GET /models/catalog`, `rvc-next model catalog`) lists demo voices, marking those already downloaded into the library (`installed_voice_id`, matched through `catalog_id` in `voice.json`; DB migration 2 adds `voice_models.catalog_id` for this). `download_voices(ids, all_missing)` (`POST /models/catalog/download`, `rvc-next model download`) submits a `download` job with request `{\"voices\": [...]}`: download `.pth` and `.index` into a temporary directory under `uploads/`, check SHA-256 (always checked here, regardless of `verify_checksums`), then add them to the library with `catalog_id` as their source. Demo voices are ordinary library voices; deleting one makes it downloadable again in the catalog."],[2327,"`voice_catalog()`（`GET /models/catalog`，`rvc-next model catalog`）列出示例音色，并标出已经下载进音色库的那个（`installed_voice_id`，按音色 `voice.json` 里的 `catalog_id` 匹配，DB 迁移 2 为此添加了 `voice_models.catalog_id` 列）。`download_voices(ids, all_missing)`（`POST /models/catalog/download`，`rvc-next model download`）提交一个请求为 `{\"voices\": [...]}` 的 `download` 任务：把 `.pth` 和 `.index` 下载到 `uploads/` 下的临时目录，检查 SHA-256（这里总是检查，不受 `verify_checksums` 影响），再以 `catalog_id` 为来源加入音色库。示例音色就是普通的库音色，删除后目录里会重新显示为可下载。"],[1900,"`voice_id`"],[2913,"`voice_id`"],[8035,"`voice_id`"],[9048,"`voice_id`"],[9073,"`voice_models.catalog_id` (demo voice downloads)."],[2938,"`voice_models.catalog_id`（示例音色下载）。"],[2942,"`voice_models`"],[9077,"`voice_models`"],[9072,"`voice_models`, `presets`, `jobs`, `outputs`, `audio_files`, `client_state`;"],[2937,"`voice_models`、`presets`、`jobs`、`outputs`、`audio_files`、`client_state`；"],[2669,"`voice.json`"],[8804,"`voice.json`"],[8823,"`voice.json` records `name`, `description`, `tags`, `speakers` (user-named speakers), `source_files`, `index_sources` (original filenames at index import, for tracing renamed `.index` files), `imported_at`, and provenance fields (`catalog_id`, `merged_from`/`alpha`, `extracted_from`, `experiment`/`checkpoint`). `.pth` itself is never rewritten, so library voices remain directly usable in