n, separation, training, downloads, merging, extraction, export, and index building immediately return a `Job` snapshot"],[6430,"Conversion, the command line, and live voice conversion all support pm, rmvpe, fcpe, and also CREPE (full and tiny) and SwiftF0 (training still uses pm and rmvpe)"],[12119,"Convert › Separate first"],[7804,"Convert a folder"],[12145,"Convert audio files or an entire folder with a voice model, optionally separating vocals first and mixing the accompaniment back in."],[12233,"Convert audio files or an entire folder with a voice; optionally separate vocals first and add the accompaniment back after conversion to make a cover in one operation"],[6674,"Convert audio files or folders with a voice. Parameters start from the voice's default preset, with command-line options overriding the corresponding values."],[10486,"Convert every input in full"],[7299,"Convert live with the server's devices until ctrl+c, with one status line in the terminal."],[10484,"Convert only the first 15 seconds of each input. Preview jobs go ahead of other queued jobs, making them useful for trying parameters quickly. Results have a **preview** label and `.preview` in the filename"],[6761,"Convert only the first N seconds, `[1, 120]`"],[7859,"Convert the vocals of a whole song and add the accompaniment back:"],[12236,"Convert your voice live through the server computer's microphone and output device, with level meters, a test tone and automatic reconnection after device loss"],[12148,"Convert your voice live through the server computer's sound card; switch parameters and voices while running."],[10159,"Convert, Live"],[10162,"Convert, Live"],[10177,"Convert, Live, Separate, Train, voice details"],[10168,"Convert, Separate, voice detail try-out"],[10174,"Convert, Separate, voice detail try-out"],[10406,"Converting a song with accompaniment directly usually gives poor results. On the **Convert** page, expand **Optional steps** and enable **Separate first** and **Add accom