idth of `enc_q.pre.weight` (513 → 32k, 1025 → 40k/48k) and upsampling kernel sizes"],[9300,"Has `weight` and `config`"],[8863,"Has `weight` and `config` → voice (small model)"],[10863,"Hear yourself"],[6731,"Highest pitch `true_pitch` writes, `[1000, 2000]` Hz"],[7094,"Highest pitch `true_pitch` writes, `[1000, 2000]` Hz"],[7920,"History can be long"],[9834,"Home page sections; copy lives in `site/src/lib/site-copy.ts`, with Chinese and English versions"],[1848,"Host"],[7983,"Host"],[9436,"Hot update; changing F0 method first loads the new model in the control thread; missing assets keep the old method and report `asset_missing`"],[9119,"Hot updates"],[9438,"Hot-update threshold and denoising; block size and similar changes close streams, `reconfigure`, reopen streams, without reloading the voice"],[11123,"How indexes are paired automatically"],[10919,"How it records"],[10299,"How it was handled"],[11941,"How much consecutive pieces share"],[11586,"How to choose"],[12164,"How to install RVC Next: prepare an isolated Python environment, install PyTorch for your hardware, install RVC Next itself, then check the installation with rvc-next doctor."],[6453,"How to send the token"],[9741,"How to set up a development environment that passes all checks, what each scripts/dev.py task does, how to build the wheel and documentation site, and why pyproject.toml has its dependency constraints."],[2111,"HTTP"],[8246,"HTTP"],[8212,"HTTP and socket.io"],[2077,"HTTP 与 socket.io"],[246,"HuBERT"],[6381,"HuBERT"],[11285,"HuBERT (required for all conversion, Live and training), RMVPE, RMVPE (ONNX, for DirectML devices), FCPE, CREPE, CREPE tiny"],[8417,"HuBERT (transformers format)"],[9105,"HuBERT features"],[9601,"HuBERT normalization"],[9362,"HuBERT runs on the whole `context` (longer context stabilises features), but retrieval only handles new frames after `skip_head // 2`, and synthesis generates only new audio (`skip_head`/`return_length`), keeping latency manageable."],[3227,"HuBERT 对整个 `context` 运行（上下文越长，特征越稳），但检索只处理 `skip_head // 2` 之后的新帧，生成也只生成新的音频（`skip_head`/`return_length`），这是延迟可控的原因。"],[3466,"HuBERT 归一化"],[2970,"HuBERT 特征"],[7840,"HuBERT, a pitch model (RMVPE, FCPE, CREPE) or a base model is not installed; also suggests `rvc-next assets download <id>`"],[8217,"HuBERT, F0 models and recently used voices remain cached, so the second file starts immediately"],[9575,"HuBERT, RMVPE, and FCPE weight initialization (later overwritten by checkpoints) consumes the global RNG, while the original builds RMVPE/FCPE inside `Pipeline`. If one side seeds before building models and the other does the reverse, subsequent random sequences (such as the NSF noise source) diverge, and results cease to be bit-identical. Golden code therefore calls `runtime.hubert()` and `runtime.f0(method)` first; the original side also builds RMVPE/FCPE in advance and assigns them to `pipeline.model_rmvpe`/`model_fcpe`, then calls `torch.manual_seed()`. Keep this order in new golden cases."],[7518,"HuBERT, RMVPE, base models, and separation model weights; can point to an original RVC `assets` folder"],[6851,"HuBERT, RMVPE, base models, and separation model weights."],[8283,"HuBERT, RMVPE, FCPE or base model not installed; `detail.assets` lists asset ids used by the UI to offer downloads"],[2082,"HuBERT、F0 模型和最近用过的音色留在缓存里，第二个文件立刻开始"],[3440,"HuBERT、RMVPE 和 FCPE 的权重初始化（随后被检查点覆盖）会从全局随机数生成器取数，而原版在 `Pipeline` 内部才构建 RMVPE/FCPE。如果一边先播种再建模型、另一边相反，两边后续的随机序列就错开了（例如 NSF 的噪声源），结果不再逐位相同。所以 golden 代码先 `runtime.hubert()`、`runtime.f0(method)`，原版一侧也预先构建 RMVPE/FCPE 塞进 `pipeline.model_rmvpe`/`model_fcpe`，然后才 `torch.manual_seed()`。新增 golden 用例时保持这个顺序。"],[2148,"HuBERT、RMVPE、FCPE 或底模未安装；`detail.assets` 列出资源 id，界面据此提供下载"],[1383,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型权重；可以指向原版 RVC 的 `assets` 文件夹"],[5637,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模、分离模型等下载的文件"],[716,"HuBERT、RMVPE、底模和分离模型权重。"],[1705,"HuBERT、音高模型（RMVPE、FCPE、CREPE）或底模没有安装，会同时提示 `rvc-next assets download <id>`"],[2282,"HuBERT（transformers 格式）"],[5150,"HuBERT（所有转换、实时和训练都需要）、RMVPE、R