andling (`finish()`) for foreground jobs"],[10680,"Right-click **VBCABLE_Setup_x64.exe** (VBCABLE_Setup.exe on 32-bit Windows), choose **Run as administrator**, then click **Install Driver**."],[248,"RMVPE"],[6383,"RMVPE"],[11428,"RMVPE (about 173 MB)"],[11982,"RMVPE (best) / pm (fast) / FCPE / CREPE / CREPE tiny / SwiftF0"],[6728,"RMVPE above about 1040 Hz: `off`, `true_pitch` or `fold`; see Very high notes"],[7092,"RMVPE above about 1040 Hz: `off`, `true_pitch` or `fold`; see Very high notes"],[8371,"RMVPE on DirectML"],[8367,"RMVPE pitch (default method)"],[6331,"RMVPE uses its ONNX version on DirectML and needs the `rmvpe-onnx` asset: `rvc-next assets download rmvpe-onnx`. It is not in the `all` group; the UI and command line prompt you to download it if missing."],[11497,"RMVPE was trained on singing that ends near C6 (about 1040 Hz). Above that it reports the note an octave low, or an octave and a fifth low, with full confidence, and the converted voice sings it there. **Correct to the true pitch** runs RMVPE a second time on the audio played an octave lower, where it reads correctly, and uses that pass to put each frame back in its octave, keeping the first pass's finer contour where the two agree. Frames below 460 Hz are never changed, so speech and most singing come out exactly as before; pitch detection takes about three times as long."],[196,"RMVPE 在 DirectML 上使用 ONNX 版本，需要资源 `rmvpe-onnx`：`rvc-next assets download rmvpe-onnx`。它不在 `all` 分组里，缺少时界面和命令行会提示下载。"],[5362,"RMVPE 的训练数据大约到 C6（约 1040 Hz）为止。高于这个音时，它会非常确定地报出低一个八度（或低一个八度加五度）的音，转换出的声音也就唱在那里。**纠正为真实音高** 会把音频降低一个八度再跑一遍 RMVPE（在那里它能读对），用这一遍把每一帧放回正确的八度；两遍一致的地方保留第一遍更精细的音高曲线。低于 460 Hz 的帧从不改动，所以说话和大多数演唱的结果与原来完全相同；音高分析耗时约为三倍。"],[593,"RMVPE 约 1040 Hz 以上：`off`、`true_pitch` 或 `fold`，见极高音"],[957,"RMVPE 约 1040 Hz 以上：`off`、`true_pitch` 或 `fold`，见极高音"],[2232,"RMVPE 音高（默认方法）"],[11503,"RMVPE's result, as in the original."],[5847,"RMVPE（最佳）/ pm（快速）/ FCPE / CREPE / CREPE tiny / SwiftF0"],[5293,"RMVPE（约 173 MB）"],[10845,"Robotic, choppy or crackling"],[172,"ROCm 上的 AMD 显卡（仍是 `cuda:N`）和 Intel XPU 显卡不看计算能力：显存至少 4 GiB 就使用；ROCm 显卡以 fp16 运行，XPU 显卡在设备报告支持 fp16 时以 fp16 运行。"],[3055,"ROCm 版 torch 上（`is_rocm()`：`torch.version.hip`），AMD 显卡是 `cuda:N`，`cuda_profile` 跳过 SM 规则（此时的计算能力是 gfx 版本）：至少 4 GiB，fp16。Intel 显卡是 `xpu:N`（`xpu_profile`：至少 4 GiB，`has_fp16` 时 fp16）。一个 torch 构建只带其中一种，所以 `gpu_backend()`（`cuda` 或 `xpu`）和 `gpu_profiles()` 给出训练中整数 GPU 编号所指的设备；`visible_devices_env()` 对子进程隐藏其余设备（`CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`，HIP 也读取它；或 `ZE_AFFINITY_MASK`）。训练的 autocast 和 `GradScaler` 在 XPU 上用 `xpu`，DDP 用 `xccl` 而不是 `gloo`。`configure_cuda_graph` 在 ROCm 下从不开启 CUDA Graph。pymss 不支持 XPU，所以分离在 CPU 上加载、再移动网络，并保持 fp32。"],[6327,"ROCm: torch's ROCm build (Windows and Linux) presents AMD GPUs as CUDA devices, so they appear as `cuda:N` and everything that runs on CUDA runs on them, except CUDA Graph. Vocal separation uses the GPU directly."],[192,"ROCm：torch 的 ROCm 版（Windows 和 Linux）把 AMD 显卡当作 CUDA 设备，所以它们显示为 `cuda:N`，CUDA 上能运行的功能都能在上面运行，CUDA Graph 除外。人声分离直接使用显卡。"],[9075,"Role"],[9458,"Role, device id, reason, message"],[6547,"Root command"],[10080,"Route"],[7907,"Route signatures use core models directly; a few small API-only models (`AppMeta`, `ImportSession`, `ClearedJobs`…) are defined in the router file"],[7872,"Router overview"],[7910,"Routes that access disk or the database are synchronous"],[8242,"Routes validate when the request arrives (for example, missing RMVPE immediately returns 409 `asset_missing`, with a download offered in place in the UI), instead of letting a queued job fail later."],[10052,"Routing"],[7981,"Rule"],[10216,"Rule"],[10219,"Rule"],[10222,"Rule"],[10225,"Rule"],[7455,"Rules for overriding settings:"],[11222,"Rules for pairing indexes with voices:"],[10120,"Rules: components and views use tokens rather than literal colors, corner radii, font sizes, or durations (colors are enforced by `tokens.test.ts`); pair color roles (`on-primary` on `primary`); express hierarchy through surface tones first,