 import, legacy installations, rebuilding after database loss; import sessions and pairing rules; conversion outputs and provenance, previews, preflight checks; full training runs, export, stale markers; Live service (fake backend); GPU memory release and unloading after OOM"],[7423,"Settings sources and precedence"],[10344,"Settings, the database, voice library, training experiments, conversion results and downloaded models are all stored in a **data folder**:"],[6561,"Settings: `config`"],[6535,"Settings: the Web UI settings page."],[11241,"Several candidates; you must choose"],[8195,"Several cross-references (`models.presets`, `assets.models`, `models.imports`, `imports.base`, `imports.separation`, `training.base`, `separation.library`) are connected through attribute assignments after construction, avoiding cycles between constructors. `TrainingService` and `LiveService` are imported inside the function. Finally, `models.rescan()` synchronises the database's voice cache with disk."],[10112,"Several mechanisms span components:"],[8716,"Several services need each other (the voice library creates default presets, the asset service adds downloaded demo voices to the library, import sessions write base and separation models). Constructors cannot express cyclic dependencies, so `build_services()` connects these attributes after construction: `models.presets`, `assets.models`, `models.imports`, `imports.base`, `imports.separation`, `training.base`, `separation.library`. Follow this approach for new dependencies of this kind instead of passing services to each other in constructors."],[10153,"Shared components make every feature feel part of one application; use them as the review checklist for each screen (AGENTS.md §7)."],[8161,"Shared httpx client (tests can inject `transport`)"],[8659,"Shared httpx client (tests can inject `transport`)"],[9485,"Shares `extract_features` with inference"],[10876,"Sharing the GPU with other jobs"],[7801,"Shell completion"],[8547,"Shell