ST merge`, `POST extract`, legacy installations `/legacy-roots…`, `/{voice_id}/index` (upload, pair, or detach), `/{voice_id}/index/build`, `/{voice_id}/reveal`, `GET /{voice_id}/archive` (the voice as a zip)"],[11763,"Voice library, imported base models, separation models and unassigned indexes"],[9046,"Voice library, imports, inbox, base models, separation library"],[8032,"Voice library, imports, index inbox, base models, separation models"],[8679,"Voice library, legacy directories, merging and extraction"],[11139,"Voice library: import, browse and edit voices; unassigned indexes; original RVC installs"],[11181,"Voice model `.pth` (small model)"],[7252,"Voice name in the library"],[8535,"Voice parameter options (`ParamOptions`) shared by `convert`, `live run`, and `preset save`, plus `build_params()`"],[8699,"Voice parameter presets"],[11317,"Voice parameters"],[12125,"Voice parameters"],[11318,"Voice parameters determine the converted sound: pitch, formant, pitch method, index strength, consonant protection and loudness match, plus the speaker for multi-speaker voices. RVC Next uses the same parameter panel in Convert, Live and Default parameters in voice details, with identical names, ranges, defaults, help and order. The command line and API use the same parameters and ranges."],[10432,"Voice picker, **Voice parameters** and collapsed **Optional steps**;"],[7831,"Voice, job, experiment, or file does not exist. Note: Click also exits with 2 for invalid command-line arguments (unknown options or out-of-range values)"],[8253,"Voice, job, file or experiment does not exist"],[10693,"Voicemeeter (free, donationware, from VB-Audio) is a virtual mixer. Use it instead of VB-CABLE when the call or stream should get more than your voice, for example music or game sound mixed in, or when you want its equalizer and compressor on your voice. The steps use **Voicemeeter Banana**; notes for Standard and Potato follow."],[10738,"Voicemeeter adds its own buffering to rvc-next's 